window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3101,"title":"Chapter 3101 - 3099: The Tools Man Who Came to the Gate","paragraphs":["Chapter 3101: Chapter 3099: The Tools Man Who Came to the Gate","Gem Domain.","Once, this era was the most flourishing of all the realms in the myriad practitioners in the universe. The Gem Domain was abundant in spirit stones, energy gemstones, rune stones, and other natural treasures... On every planet within the Gem Domain, as long as people were willing to work hard at excavation, the rewards were bound to not disappoint.","And the spirit stones and gemstones in the Gem Domain seemed inexhaustible and never-ending. No matter how they were mined, it was impossible to deplete them, and their quality was extremely high.","In those years, every planet in the Gem Domain seemed to twinkle with the light of gemstones, which is why it was called the ‘Gem Domain’.","But in the middle period of the ancient era, the spiritual qi in the Gem Domain suddenly ran out, without any warning — some suspected that the Gem Domain had been tampered with by some big shot.","After the depletion of spiritual qi, the spirit stones, gemstones, and precious jades that were originally everywhere were quickly mined out... the entire Gem Domain lost its past luster and turned into wasteland.","The twinkling planets, drained and hollowed out, lost their shine.","Now, it has become one of the most desolate worlds in the myriad realms.","But now, due to the emergence of the ‘Heavenly Dao Immortal Tomb’, the desolate Gem Domain has once again become bustling.","In these three days, Immortals and Top Tribulation Immortals from the myriad realms have crossed space and planes to descend upon the Gem Domain, searching here for information on the Immortal Tombs of the Second and Third Heavenly Dao.","Besides Immortals and Top Tribulation Immortals, many cultivators have also come after hearing the news, thinking whether they could gain some opportunity during this grand event.","While the big shots are feasting on meat, with a bit of luck, they might leave some soup, which they don’t care for, but for the majority of cultivators, that soup might be a chance to go against the heaven.","The entire Gem Domain seems to have regained its past glory.","The trajectories of cultivators flying can be seen from time to time on each planet...","There are also immense Immortal Ships and space battleships shuttling through the space of the Gem Domain...","Some cultivators are calling friends and forming teams to act...","There are also sect big shots, who simply bring their disciples over to broaden their horizons...","“Master, where shall we go next?” In the vacuum, a Fairy Soft Feather wrapped in a sheet softly asked.","“I will set up a stall over at that so-called ‘Second Heavenly Dao Immortal Tomb’, and you start work at the location of the ‘Third Heavenly Dao grand tomb’... Such a big festival is a good opportunity for us to make a fortune,” the man also wrapped in a sheet opposite Fairy Soft Feather said in a deep voice.","It was the Almighty Merchant and his disciple Almighty Seller.","“This time, our main products are ‘Immortal Aura Exploration Pointer’, ‘Mask to Shield Immortal Poison Barrier’, and also the ‘small-black-room-breaking disposable flying sword’ that we got from Fellow Daoist White,” the Almighty Merchant and his disciple introduced.","The master and disciple pair is very clear that this ‘Tomb of the Second and Third Heavenly Dao’ is just a ruse.","After all, their heritage is related to the Sixth Heavenly Dao Virtuous Daoist, and they are very aware of the true structure of the ‘Immortal Tomb’.","However, this does not hinder the master and disciple from doing business.","“Prosperous business, Master,” the Almighty Seller nodded.","“Prosperous business... Also, watch out for Tyrannical Song, if you see Tyrannical Song coming, just hide far away,” the Almighty Merchant reminded.","His intuition told him that this ‘event’ might have something to do with Tyrannical Song. In time, Tyrannical Song might become a source of trouble; it’s certainly best to stay far away.","“Master, you are biased against Tyrannical Song,” the Almighty Seller waved her hand and said, “On the contrary, I feel that Mister Tyrannical Song is a very nice VIP quality customer.”","“Bullshit, that guy has no money,” the Almighty Merchant retorted.","“But Mr. White has money,” the Almighty Seller giggled, crossing through space and heading towards the location of the Third Heavenly Dao Immortal Tomb.","...","...","On the other side.","The Immortals from the myriad practitioners in the universe each used their Magical Techniques, exploring separately in the two Immortal Tombs.","To attract these Immortals, Daozi, Father Goudan, and Senior Three-Eyes really invested a lot while creating the ‘Immortal Tombs’.","In the two Immortal Tombs, there is Immortal Spirit Qi everywhere.","In every layer, there are flowing springs and mysterious lights flickering, exuding a faint aura of immortality.","To allow Immortals to stay in the grand tomb for as long as possible, Daozi worked overtime to create a batch of magical treasures related to ‘Heaven’s Will,’ which he placed in every corner of the tomb.","He aimed to ensure that these Immortals would gain something and not leave empty-handed.","The three-eyed young senior contributed several ‘Strong Corpse Bones,’ placing them in the tomb, some to create ‘Fake Tombs,’ others arranged as if they were ‘casualties.’","Father Goudan set up many Killing Formations within the tomb... Exploring the Tomb of Immortality is not a leisurely affair; one must risk their life upon entering.","To do it, do it best, make it most realistic.","Thus, the two grand tombs were filled with traps and Killing Formations that could trap Immortals, or even heavily injure or suppress them.","In the Third Heavenly Dao Tomb.","“Pfft...” An Immortal spat out a mouthful of blood, fleeing from a spirit qi-entwined immortal gate; his blood spilled as he escaped.","A single drop of his blood, potent enough to obliterate cities, was absorbed directly by the tomb when it fell, turning into a power that fueled the operation of the tomb.","Beside him, a wooden sword burned and turned into ashes.","“This is not the gateway to the main tomb; it’s likely left by a powerful tomb explorer who came before us. The destination of this immortal gate is a Chaotic Dead Land, filled with endless and ever-shifting Killing Formations. Had I not just obtained a ‘Return City Flying Sword,’ I might have been trapped to death within the immortal gate,” the Immortal whispered softly.","Similar scenes occurred frequently in various places within the two Heavenly Dao Tombs.","And while this wounded Immortal silently took his elixirs and tended to his injuries, within the shadows, a pair of eyes quietly locked onto him.","An illusory sun, utilizing special means, was hidden within the shadows.","Recently, the ‘Void Sun Guardians’ and ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls,’ brought along by the ‘Cultivator Chat System New Year Event,’ quietly arrived upon learning of the ‘Second and Third Heavenly Dao Tombs.’","Their targets were not only the Immortal Tombs but also these tomb explorers, Immortals, and top Tribulation Immortals.","Those who were seriously injured during their exploration of the Immortal Tomb were their prey.","——They planned to secretly slay a few top-notch Tribulation Immortals and Immortals to propagate their species.","The traps and Killing Formations of the Immortal Tomb had created excellent opportunities for them.","...","...","The Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls and Void Sun Guardians covertly observed the wounded Immortals and Tribulation Immortals.","Behind them, Daozi Big Shot held Scholarly Scripture with a smile on his face, watching these Void Suns that snuck in from the shadows.","“Should we deal with them?” Father Goudan asked lazily.","These annoying rats, how dare they actually come knocking of their own accord?","“No rush,” Daozi Big Shot said with a slight smile. “I was previously worried about how to make a shocking entrance for Tyrannical Song. These little rats are perfect props. I will make good use of them.”","Today was the day he would step down from his position in the Heavenly Dao.","Before stepping down, he would add to Tyrannical Song’s prestige one last time.","This was his final moment on the position of Heavenly Dao, cheering for Tyrannical Song.","“Do we need to coordinate any guidance?” the three-eyed young senior asked, playing with a pair of eyeballs.","“Hmm... It would be best to find a way to gather these injured Immortals together. This way, the Void Sun Guardians and Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls, which are targeting them from the shadows, will also converge. Best to activate some Killing Formations that suppress the power of the Immortals, so these wounded ones can’t exert their full strength. Otherwise, if they go berserk, it won’t be good if they steal Song Shuhang’s thunder,” Daozi Big Shot contemplated.","“Leave it to me,” Father Goudan jumped up and called out, “Dada Egg, come with me. I need the cooperation of your Time powers.”","Heavenly Emperor’s child: “...”","“Senior, thank you for your hard work. Also, please pay attention to the power of the Killing Formation. Don’t let the Immortals and Top-Tier Tribulation Immortals actually get wiped out by the Void Sun Guardians, needlessly increasing the strength of the Void Sun,” Daozi reminded.","“Leave that to me. I’ll secretly protect these injured Tribulation Immortals and Immortals,” said the projection of Senior White Two as it crossed through space, returning to its origin.","Song Shuhang and Senior White were already on their way to the ‘Gem Domain,’ and after Senior White Two took a look around, he returned to work behind the scenes.","“Thank you, Lord White,” Daozi said with a nod.","The final script unfolds.","...","...","More than ten minutes later.","Inside the space of the Third Heavenly Dao’s Tomb.","Those severely injured Immortals and Top-Tier Tribulation Immortals, having slightly recovered after taking elixirs, got up and continued delving deeper into the tomb’s space.","In the grand tomb, every nook and cranny could hide a deadly trap, but there might also be treasures greatly beneficial to Immortals.","For instance, fragments of magical treasures personally refined by the Heavenly Dao, stained with ‘Weak Immortal Information’ that Immortals could access, giving them a tiny glimpse into the realm of immortality.","Some even found refining waste materials maintained by the power of the Heavenly Dao—foundations for primordial treasures. If one could incorporate them into their life-bound magical treasure, the benefits would be boundless.","Moreover, the formations and Killing Formations spread throughout the tomb, once deciphered, could bring immense benefits.","Therefore, as long as it didn’t affect their core essence, even if they were injured, the crowd wouldn’t waste time. They would get up and explore the tomb as much as they could within the limited time.","Unknowingly...","These wounded Immortals and Tribulation Immortals were led into a ‘Paradise.’","A Paradise World within the Heavenly Dao Tomb.","Here, birds sang and flowers fragranced, with the gentle strains of a zither echoing in the void.","In the air, there were chains of order and principles from the Great Way of immortality.","The Immortals only felt their inner strength being repressed, unable to wield their powers freely, their bodies becoming heavy, and the healing of their wounds slowed down.","“Is this... the core of the Heavenly Dao Tomb?” The Immortals thought to themselves.","But before they could react, several figures slowly became visible around them.","They were ten Void Sun Guardians plus the Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls.","The new arrivals bore ill intent.","“It’s just about time,” murmured Senior White Two softly.","With a light tap of his finger, he activated a function.","The entire Paradise World soared.","An invisible sound wave spread throughout the entire Third Heavenly Dao Tomb.","All the Immortals in the tomb sensed something—there was a connection to this ‘Paradise World.’","[Is that the core of the Heavenly Dao Tomb? Did someone enter the core and trigger the alarm?]","Without any hesitation, everyone abandoned their current explorations and headed towards the ‘Paradise’ area.","Even those Immortals deep in the ‘Second Heavenly Dao Tomb’ projected their consciousness upon receiving messages from their comrades. They connected to the large tomb opposite to them and tried to connect to Paradise, keen to witness the developments.","...","...","In the Third Heavenly Dao Tomb, the Immortals and Top-Tier Tribulation Immortals desperately rushed towards the ‘Paradise World.’","But the various Killing Formations, protective barriers, and formations along the way hampered their speed.","They had to race against time while keeping in constant communication with the Paradise World, observing its developments.","In their conscious focus, the image of what was happening in the Paradise Space was reflected.","“Eh? Void Sun Guardians?”","“And Stellar Doomsday beings.”","“We’ve struck gold!”","The Immortal big shots were stirred—knowing that ‘Mister Tyrannical Song’s’ joint New Year’s event with the Heavenly Dao showed no signs of ending and seemed to persist indefinitely.","If they could capture a few Void Sun Guardians and Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls, they could exchange them through Song Shuhang’s ‘Cultivator Chat System’ for grand rewards. These gifts, purified and decoded by the Heavenly Dao for Immortals’ absorption, included ‘Weak Immortality Information, Law Comprehension,’ and more.","“There are others! There are some fellow friends within the Paradise Space.”","“Lucky fellows, not only did they stumble into Paradise Space, but they’ve also encountered ready-made Void Suns and Doomsday entities.”","“Wait... the condition of these fellow friends seems off.”","“They are wounded?”","“And it seems they’re repressed by the rules of Paradise Space. Might they be the first group that barged in and suffered restrictions from the Killing Formation as punishment?”","“Things look unfavorable for them... Moreover, the number of Constant Star Guardians and Void Sun Guardians, there are ten in total.”","Furthermore, one of the Void Sun Guardians was bigger than all the other Void Suns combined.","This Void Sun Guardian exerted an oppressive heaviness.","“This oppressiveness has a faint whiff of a Confucian Sage, likely an existence just below that of a Confucian Sage,” they surmised.","“In that case, it is at least on par with our demonic sect’s Demon Emperor Hezhi?”","An existence just below that of a Sage would be one who could handle ten others at their level.","...","...","Inside Paradise World.","Immortal Yue Ruhuo sighed and fixed his gaze on the largest Void Sun.","This Void Sun put pressure on him that was nearly comparable to Tyrannical Song’s steel manifestation from before...","Yue Ruhuo was one of the injured Immortals this time.","Once the Void Sun Guardians and the Stellar Doomsday Skulls appeared, they attacked without any useless chatter.","They too had discerned the existence of their ‘Paradise World’ being sensed by all the Immortals.","Time was of the essence for them.","They needed to take down these several severely wounded Immortals and Tribulation Immortals before others arrived.","Afterward, they intended to unveil the secrets within this ‘Paradise Space’ and then swiftly withdraw.","So, the moment they made their move, it was with fatally tempting killer moves.","From the massive Void Sun, surging killing intent spilled forth like an endless sea, pressing against Yue Ruhuo and the other Immortals.","The rest of the Void Suns swelled, transformed into actual colossal suns, and bore down to suppress them directly."]},{"number":3102,"title":"Chapter 3102 - 3100: Pretending to be Tyrannical Song until He Has No Room Left to Pretend","paragraphs":["Chapter 3102: Chapter 3100: Pretending to be Tyrannical Song until He Has No Room Left to Pretend","“Burning Star!”","“Star Burst Hell!”","“Residual Fire Apocalypse!”","At this moment, these were all techniques belonging to the ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull,’ each of which possessed a combat power close to or equivalent to that of an Immortal. Their attacks were all inclined towards methods of destroying stars.","Coupled with a small amount of ‘Stellar Destruction Virus,’ once these moves were fully unleashed, they could obliterate medium-sized stars.","The attack methods of the ‘Void Sun Guardians,’ on the other hand, were much simpler, shedding countless cutting light rays from their bodies... These rays carried the power of principles and were unstoppable by anything.","Especially the largest ‘Void Sun Guardian,’ which exploded with thick pillars of light... Simultaneously, a substance similar to the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ was released from its body, enhancing the attack power of both the Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull and the Void Sun Guardians.","If not for the suppression of the Paradise Space’s laws of the Heavenly Dao, ten Suns acting together could directly obliterate the planets in the Gem Domain!","Including Scholar Yue Ruhuo, the six injured Immortals all had unsightly expressions—faced with attacks of this caliber, they thought they might need to use their ultimate, life-saving techniques to block them.","And the life-saving techniques of Immortals... were very expensive!","Replenishing them would require a huge consumption of resources or immense efforts to fill the gap.","...","...","Outside the Third Heavenly Dao’s Tomb.","When ten ‘Void Sun Guardians’ and ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls’ exerted their power at the same time, the night sky above the planet in the Gem Domain projected the image of ten scorching suns.","A single sun projection could certainly not compare with an actual star, but ten suns in the sky brought terrifying heat, forcibly driving away the night of the Gem Domain Planet and turning night into day.","The heat of ten suns in a short period of time began to wring out the moisture of the planet.","Within a few moments, the planet’s surface started making a disturbing ‘sizzle~’ sound... That was the sound of the surface water being rapidly evaporated, the ground beginning to crack and split.","The ice layers of the planet, which originally had a lower temperature, started to melt at high speed.","The ‘Almighty Merchant,’ who was quietly trading at the entrance to the ‘Third Heavenly Dao’s grand tomb,’ silently raised her head, looking at the ten suns’ phenomena in the sky.","She smelled a major business opportunity.","The more chaotic it was, the better it suited her business.","“Moreover, even such Heaven and Earth Phenomena have appeared... This is sparing no effort. Those six injured Immortals, the top Tribulation Immortals, probably can’t handle it,” the Almighty Merchant said as she began to search through her inventory for special elixirs tailored for ‘sunlight-type injuries.’","Perhaps they might come in handy later.","...","...","Within the Paradise Space.","Terrifying energy was surging, with the power of Sunrise Flames everywhere.","Even the Paradise grassland protected by a special Killing Formation turned to ashes under the attack of ten suns.","In the center of the ten suns’ assault.","The six injured Immortals had already gathered together, cooperating with one another.","They immediately used their ultimate techniques.","Scholar Yue Ruhuo summoned a sword formation capable of both offense and defense. At the same time, he began to play his zither, enhancing the condition of the other bamboo-like Immortals and suppressing their injuries.","To his left, a garment as thin as a cicada’s wings was offered up... This was a personal belonging of an immortal fairy, yet it could transform into a miniature fairyland for a short time, defending against the outside world.","To his right, a tall and mighty Immortal revealed his true form, that of a giant bear endowed with the power of the stars. His path to immortality seemed to be related to ‘star power’.","This giant bear Immortal clasped his bear paws together, and behind him emerged a projection of a sky full of stars, with the power of the stars accumulating around him to form three hundred armed star giant bears.","These giant bears carried illusory shields, each one appearing to be a star domain, blocking and isolating external attacks.","Another Immortal was purely offensive. He swung two divine weapons at the forefront, spewing blood while displaying exquisite swordsmanship, meeting attack with attack.","Another Immortal threw a vast amount of seeds, using them to start constructing the prototype of a secret realm on the spot, from which pure power continuously surged out, reinforcing the condition of his own side’s Immortals.","Out of the six severely injured Immortals, five had already employed magical techniques.","The last Immortal seemed to be too heavily injured; his face was devoid of color, and his ‘vitality’ had faded to an almost imperceptible level. He simply threw out two puppets, symbolically placing them at the forefront.","Across from them, when the first wave of attacks from the ten suns ended... the Immortal who was swinging his sword while vomiting blood had to retreat. The divine weapons in his hands were severely damaged by the ‘Cutting Light’ of the virtual sun.","The puppets were the first to be sliced into fragments and destroyed...","Scholar Yue Ruhuo’s sword formation was broken, and even the swords that formed the array could not be retrieved...","The fairyland of the immortal fairy was blown open by the Stellar Doomsday Demon’s explosion, forcibly...","In terms of frontal defense, only the three hundred star giant bears transformed by the giant bear Immortal were still desperately holding on. But the number of the star giant bears was sharply declining...","And the ten suns across from them did not give them a chance to reinforce their defenses.","Their attacks did not pause. Before the first wave had even ended, the second wave of bombardment was already upon them.","“Hold on for one more wave... I have friends already on their way,” Scholar Yue Ruhuo said calmly, analyzing the situation.","The advantage of the Cultivator Chat System was revealed at this moment.","At the first sign of the attack, Scholar Yue Ruhuo had already sent out rescue signals to all the friends he knew. His friends were already crossing space at the fastest speed to rush towards the Pure Land Space.","Among them, even the steel clone of Big Shot Tyrannical Song gave him a definite reply, stating that both it and the main body were on their way!","In fact, not just Scholar Yue Ruhuo, but the other Immortals were also calling their friends.","“Tyrannical Song is also arriving soon, hold on,” Scholar Yue Ruhuo said, painfully taking out a turtle shell – a treasure he had once acquired from the Almighty Merchant.","But due to severe damage and being irrepairable, every use meant one less opportunity.","“Tyrannical Song?” At this moment, the pale-faced Immortal behind him suddenly spoke up, his voice sounding like cold machinery.","A moment later, this Immortal shook his body.","“Since Tyrannical Song is going to appear, it can’t continue like this. Originally, what is here is just a puppet clone of mine; if broken, then so be it...” Saying this, the pale-faced Immortal reached into his chest and directly pulled out a core.","Then, he inserted his hand into the vacuum and opened a special space similar to Song Shuhang’s ‘main world,’ from which he took out an even bigger core and installed it into his body.","“Fellow daoists, have a rest for a while. From now on, leave it to me,” said the puppet Immortal, his voice transitioning from a mechanical tone to that of a charming man.","The other injured Immortals nearby looked at this puppet man in confusion.","“Are you... from the Mo family?” At this moment, Scholar Yue Ruhuo recognized him.","This man was a Mo family genius who had stepped onto the immortal path through ‘Puppet Dao.’","He was not the founder of the puppet technique, but he had surpassed the Mo family’s founder, stepping onto the path to immortality through Puppet Dao.","This Mo family genius had attained immortality during the late era of the Confucian Saints, before the Heavenly Emperor’s proving his Dao, between two invincible Immortals.","“`","There was an invincible Confucian Sage in times past, and then came the Heavenly Emperor, who reigned supreme for a myriad of generations, making this Mo family genius appear very low-key.","After the age of the Heavenly City ended, he rarely showed his face.","However, in the myriad practitioners in the universe, his footsteps are everywhere, with evidence of his research into ‘puppets’. Many cultivators have found remains of the puppets he battled within the depths of secret realms, reaping great benefits from them.","No wonder I felt that his face was bloodless before, and that his resistance wasn’t all that determined... The one here is just a puppet that can be replaced at any time.","“Fellow friend of the Mo family, do you also know Tyrannical Song?” Scholar Yue Ruhuo asked aloud.","“We have crossed paths indirectly once,” said the Mo family’s Immortal, undergoing a transformation after a new nucleus was installed.","A faint radiance enveloped the puppet body, and the original puppet actually began developing flesh and blood, evolving a special Puppet Dao. In a short time, it transformed into a genuine fleshly body.","After the transformation completed, the Mo family Immortal took a step forward, moving past the defensive line formed by the Star Giant Bears, and faced the destruction assault of the ten suns directly.","An apocalyptic flame, rays imbued with the principles of cutting, and a pillar of light from the virtual giant sun that pierced through everything, all focused fire on him.","“Before challenging Tyrannical Song... it’s not your turn,” the Mo family Immortal said with a slight smile... Beneath that smile hid his pride.","In his youth, he witnessed the might of the Confucian Sage without challenging him, only watching from a distance the battles between the Confucian Sage and various Immortals, gaining a deep understanding of the Confucian Sage’s strength at the time.","Later, when the ancient Heavenly City was established, he met the Heavenly Emperor once but did not challenge him, only engaging in a dialogue on the Dao.","After the discussion, he left a ‘puppetized manifestation’ in the ancient Heavenly City for the Heavenly Emperor to command.","Having witnessed the prowess of the Sage and personally engaged in discourse with the Heavenly Emperor, he knew very well the preeminent realm they occupied, one which was already half a step beyond ‘the limits of the Immortals’.","And now...","“I have finally reached the end,” he said.","The realm he was in now had already surpassed ‘the limits of the Immortals’.","For instance, the joint attack of the ten suns, though terrifying, seemed to him... nothing more than that.","The Mo family Immortal raised his hand, and a plain white cloak ‘grew’ out of his back.","With a gesture, he lifted the cloak, sweeping toward those apocalyptic flames, rays, and pillars of light.","The next moment, all attacks from the ten suns were swept away by him!","It was like brushing away a feeble breeze; he casually swept away all the attacks that could heavily injure a regular Immortal with ease.","Behind him, Scholar Yue Ruhuo and the other five Immortals’ pupils slightly contracted.","With just one strike, they could feel the gap between themselves and the Mo family genius.","The Star Giant Bear Immortal was particularly silent for a long time.","After a while, it said, “I feel as though I’m facing the Confucian Sage once more.”","This was another figure who had been hammered by the Confucian Sage in the past—because the hammering by the Confucian Sage was so traumatic, resulting in psychological shadows, it developed a complete three hundred Star Giant Bear Invincible Defense Formations.","The spectacle had stunned the ten suns on the opposite side, causing their continuous bombardment to pause for a split second.","For the Mo family genius, that split second was enough to do a lot.","The plain white cloak shifted its shape, turning into a giant bow in the hands of the Mo family Immortal—his cloak seemed to share a marvelous contrast with Song Shuhang’s ‘fat ball’.","Drawing the bow, fitting an arrow to it, he shot lightly.","There were no special effects added, just a very pure arrow.","Once the arrow was released, it locked onto causality, striking a ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull’ that was the weakest of all, with only the strength of a ‘weak Immortal’.","After being hit, the enemy didn’t even have a chance to scream.","In an instant, the light and heat from the Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull cooled down, turning into a rigid boulder that fell from the sky.","As it died, one of the ten suns in the night sky of the Gem Domain Planet also fell and crumbled into nothingness.","But before the remaining nine suns could react, the Mo family Immortal had already shot out nine consecutive arrows.","In a series of nine shots.","Three ‘weak Immortal’ level Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls and Void Sun Guardians were directly shot and shattered to pieces.","The six suns with the strength equivalent to Immortals were gravely injured by one arrow, unable to maintain their Giant Sun form, falling to the ground, unable to move.","This was not like shooting the sun.","It was like shooting a little brother with each arrow.","This show of strength was akin to that of the Confucian Sage of yore; it was simply an overwhelming triumph.","In a blink of an eye, what used to be a heavenly body spanning across the planet’s night sky had now been reduced to just one final giant virtual sun. The other nine, dead or critically injured, had fallen from the sky.","The Mo family Immortal lightly plucked the bowstring, making a “humming” sound.","“Only you are left,” he said, facing the large virtual sun with a tender smile, softly speaking, “After dealing with you, it will be time for me to officially meet Tyrannical Song.”","In the myriad realms, he now had only one opponent... Tyrannical Song.","These ten suns, before facing Tyrannical Song, served well to warm him up + elevate his state.","Across from him, the giant virtual sun remained silent, its warmth becoming even more intense.","[How powerful.] Scholar Yue Ruhuo exclaimed.","At the same time, that was the thought of the other fellow daoists beside him.","And it was also the inner thought of everyone whose ‘consciousness’ was locked onto the cultivators in the Paradise Space.","Such awe-inspiring strength from this Mo family genius!","Even the Sage in person might only be capable of this extent.","And by the sound of it, this Mo family genius intends to challenge Tyrannical Song.","Between Tyrannical Song and this Mo family genius, who is greater?","Thump, thump—the Mo family Immortal’s longbow transformed once more, splitting into three: armor, a cloak, and a long spear.","With the spear in hand, he gradually approached the final Void Sun.","Across from him.","The largest Void Sun suddenly inhaled, absorbing all the grievously injured ‘Void Sun Guardians and Stellar Doomsday Demon Skulls’ on the ground.","The strength of the giant virtual sun stepped up another level, its aura becoming even more terrifying and powerful.","But the light and heat from it became more subdued.","Finally, a charred greatsword materialized in front of it.","Blade to blade.","“`"]},{"number":3103,"title":"Chapter 3103 - 3101: Couldn’t Stop the Car, Died Upon Impact!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3103: Chapter 3101: Couldn’t Stop the Car, Died Upon Impact!","In the eyes of Scholar Yue Ruhuo and several other injured Immortals, the massive Void Sun and the genius of the Mo family both seemed excessively powerful.","Not only them, but the Immortals who were hurrying towards the ‘Paradise Space’ from a distance also felt as though they were there, finding it hard to keep their composure after sensing this scene.","“These two guys should both be at the pinnacle of ordinary Immortals,” said an especially seasoned Immortal big shot who couldn’t help but liken them, “If it were the past when the Heavenly Dao was contested in a battle where the myriad practitioners in the universe fought for supremacy between Eastern China and the West, these two beings could each become the strongest sovereign of the East and the West respectively.”","“I feel like you’re subtly mocking that Demon Emperor from the demonic sect...” interjected a Daoist priest with full marks in history, not able to stop himself.","——Legend had it that, a long time ago, Demon Emperor Hezhi of the demonic sect and the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon who later proved his Dao, were the strongest in Eastern China and the West respectively.","But upon clashing with that ‘Wielder of the Will’, Demon Emperor Hezhi was quickly pressed to the ground and rubbed there.","“Generally speaking, in each era, there would only be one entity at a realm ‘invincible in the universe’ like the Confucian Sage. Now, setting Tyrannical Song aside for the moment. Among these two big shots before us, who could become the second Sage?” said a woman entirely covered by a Witch Robe, speaking in a captivating low female voice.","“Who truly is the Sage... after a collision, we’ll be able to tell!” declared an Immortal dressed like a clown, moving in a weirdly comical manner yet at a quick pace, able to closely follow the figure of the Demoness.","“It’s starting!” At that moment, Scholar Yue Ruhuo activated some sort of eye technique, fixating intently on the confronting Void Sun and the Mo family genius.","With a spear in hand and a relaxed demeanor, the genius of the Mo family walked step by step towards the Void Sun.","Then, he swung his spear—his posture dashing and each step exuded ‘charisma’.","If he were to take down the massive Void Sun, this scene would spread throughout the myriad practitioners in the universe via the channels of all the attending Immortals and Tribulation Transcenders.","By contrast, the massive Void Sun seemed rather restrained; its Residual Fire Sword was tightly locked onto the Mo family’s genius Immortal, adjusting its angle with each step he took.","“Stars of illusion, by the name of Sky merely illusions. Your life, I will take,” the Mo family genius swept across with his spear.","And in that instant, the massive Void Sun erupted with a ‘sunlight’-like flood of Cutting Light, filling every inch of space.","Simultaneously, its Residual Fire Sword swung opportunistically, intercepting the inevitable path of the ‘spear’.","“A dying struggle,” the corner of the Mo family genius’s mouth curled into a smile.","Without any discernible action from him, all the Cutting Light shooting towards him annihilated... failing to reach his body.","The space around him was like a ‘black hole’, devouring and distorting even the light, unable to escape.","Immediately following...","When~ the spear of the Mo family Immortal collided with the Residual Fire Sword.","The spear wasn’t swung particularly fast, so it being blocked came as no surprise.","But the Residual Fire Sword could only resist for a moment; upon contact with the spear, it began to crumble apart, directly smashed to pieces by the spear.","The illusionary giant Sun attempted to retreat and dodge the thrust, but it seemed to be stuck within an invisible force field generated by the Mo family Immortal, which firmly adhered to its form.","“You can’t escape... This is, a Guaranteed Hit!” asserted the Mo family Immortal leisurely as he lightly thrust his spear.","Domination!","It was just like the previous clash between Demon Emperor Hezhi and the Third Heavenly Dao; both were once unbeatable sovereigns of their respective domains before the encounter.","But after clashing, one would press the other to the ground and rub.","[Wielder of the Will.] This term instantly surfaced in the minds of all the watching Immortals.","There was no longer any need for doubt.","The genius of the Mo family right before their eyes thoroughly dominated the illusionary giant Sun with his bold approach. With his qualifications plainly evident, he truly stood at the level of the Confucian Sage, a Wielder of the Will.","If it had been during the time of the 2nd to 7th Heavenly Daos, this Mo family genius would undoubtedly have proved to be Immortal.","But... this era also had Tyrannical Song.","Just like the Confucian Sage of the Eighth Session and the mysterious Eighth Heavenly Dao—destined to be the invincible Saint of the current age, yet ultimately failed to prove his Dao.","Between the Mo family’s genius Immortal and Tyrannical Song, who is the Sage? Who will be the one to laugh last at the end of their Dao proving journey?","From the current situation, it seems there is a deeper connection between Tyrannical Song and the Confucian Sage... furthermore, according to reliable gossip, Tyrannical Song is the reincarnation of the Confucian Sage!","If this is true, then in this session, will the reincarnation of the Confucian Sage, Tyrannical Song, face yet another cycle without proving to be Immortal?","...","...","Inside Paradise Space.","The spear fell.","This spear, unavoidable, pinpointed and struck the illusory giant sun.","Hit, silent and breathless, there were no astonishing sound effects.","But immediately after, a hollow void suddenly appeared at the center of the enormous illusory sun.","The terrifying aura that the giant sun had been exuding dissipated in an instant.","The light and heat that had been condensed on its surface also burst forth from the hollow.","“Ah△~~” From within the body of the illusory giant sun, a bizarre cry was emitted, a sound of pain.","In the starry night sky outside the Gem Domain, the last projection of the giant sun also fell from the sky.","“Is it over?” Scholar Yue Ruhuo closed his eyes, the final burst of light from the Void Sun was too dazzling, even with his eye technique activated, he couldn’t bear it.","However...","Is the gap really that big?","The gap between Immortals can actually reach this extent.","Compared with the genius of the Mo family, the ‘Tyrannical Song steel manifestation’ that suffered successive defeats on Mars at the hands of several Immortals wasn’t worth mentioning at all.","Perhaps, only the Tyrannical Song himself, who ended the ‘Heavenly Emperor’ and conquered the Netherworld Realm as a mortal, could battle with this immortal member of the Mo family.","Whoosh~","Following the scream, the body of the illusory giant sun collapsed.","“Eh?” The genius of the Mo family retracted the spear and immediately swung his cloak.","The cape enveloped the area where the illusory giant sun was collapsing, sealing off that space!","Because, as the form of the Void Sun Guardian crumbled away, something resembling a virus erupted from its core.","This virus... carried the aura of immortality.","The Mo family genius dared not underestimate this virus, taking action to seal it off to prevent it from spreading.","And just as the Mo family genius was suppressing the virus... the previously collapsing Void Sun suddenly reignited from the ashes.","The body of the Void Sun shrunk by a thousandfold.","But it was still alive.","After reigniting from the ashes, it didn’t continue to desperately fight the genius from the Mo family; instead, it turned and fled from the ‘Paradise Space’.","It wanted to bring the intelligence out from this ‘Tomb of the Third Heavenly Dao’!","“Don’t let it escape!”","“Be careful!”","Just as Scholar Yue Ruhuo and other big shots were shouting, the locked ‘Paradise World’ space was forcibly opened by someone!","The pupils of the Immortals tightened once more.","This was an Immortal Rule Level spatial sealing array!","Immediately after, a figure emerged from the gap in the space like a car with failed brakes.","Boom~","The figure, unable to brake, hit the Void Sun Guardian mercilessly.","With one hit, the Void Sun Guardian was smashed into pieces, completely annihilated!","“Tyrannic... Tyrannical Song,” the Fairy called out.",".",".","At the end of the book recommendation, Holy Paladin’s friend Young Master Hai has started a new book: The new book “Evolving from the Crow.” I wanted to wait until he was listed before boosting him, but I don’t know if I can wait until then. In any case, if I make it until then, I’ll boost him once more!"]},{"number":3104,"title":"Chapter 3104 - 3102: Long Divine Connection, First Meeting","paragraphs":["Chapter 3104: Chapter 3102: Long Divine Connection, First Meeting","This Fairy had an awareness of details far superior to other Immortals.","Thus, she was the first to recognize Tyrannical Song’s identity.","Moreover, this immortal Fairy also noticed many details—for instance, at this moment Tyrannical Song was enveloped in terrifying “information.” This information seemed to be related to eternity.","That was also why the Fairy couldn’t help but blurt out “Tyr.. Tyrannical Song.”","Otherwise, given the Fairy’s cultivation as an Immortal, she definitely would not have trembled when saying “Tyrannical Song.”","When the Fairy exposed Tyrannical Song’s identity, the distant Tyrannical Song spoke simultaneously, “Senior White, the brakes have failed, and it seems we have hit something.”","“Hit what?” the voice of Senior White came from behind a space rift.","Then, Senior White stepped out from the space.","“Senior White, be careful!” Tyrannical Song exclaimed.","No sooner had he spoken than Senior White stepped into the void... and in an supremely elegant pose, fell to the ground.","Boom~~","The ground of the Paradise World shook.","The ground, which had been reinforced by an aura of eternity, actually got smashed into a huge pit.","The culprit, Senior White, lay elegantly at the center of the crater.","Scholar Yue Ruhuo: “???”","Star Giant Bear Immortal: “...”","The other Immortals were equally dumbfounded.","“As expected of Senior White, even his falling posture is so handsome.” Only that Immortal Fairy softly said.","“Senior White, are you alright?” Song Shuhang hovered above the huge pit, his feet treading on void.","——Just a moment ago, he had instinctively wanted to steady Senior White. But perhaps because he and Senior White had previously swallowed each other’s ‘existence,’ when he tried to help Senior White, he also slipped and almost fell.","“Ground Leveling Spell.” In the pit, Senior White silently formed a seal.","The earth seemed to come alive, automatically starting to fill the pit—only this time, in filling the pit, the Ground Leveling Spell also buried Senior White himself.","Song Shuhang: “???”","Burying myself?","What is Senior White doing now?","He knelt down and gently tapped the ground: “Senior White, come on out.”","But.","Senior White below the pit did not respond.","Song Shuhang: “...”","He tried using the Cultivator Chat System to send a message to Senior White.","But Senior White did not reply.","“Could it be that he’s closed up?” Song Shuhang scratched his head.","Pavilion Master Chu’s Dumb Hair: “...”","In front of so many people, doesn’t our Senior White care about his dignity?","Additionally...","“Don’t you feel that the gazes around us are quite glaring?” Pavilion Master Chu’s Dumb Hair reminded.","Actually, without Pavilion Master Chu’s reminder, Song Shuhang had already keenly sensed that the gazes of those present were all converging on him.","Not only that, but many immortal big shots from afar were also locking onto the ‘Paradise World,’ paying attention to the developments inside the Paradise Space.","“Cough.” Song Shuhang stood up, first fixing the Dumb Hair on the top of his head then adjusting The White Dragon’s scarf around him.","Then he adjusted his own bodily state, trying to make ‘Sub-immortal Mode’ enter into a low-profile mode.","Behind him, fatty Song transformed from a cloak into a windbreaker.","——Although there was no wind, fatty Song energetically fluttered about on his own, creating an ‘auto pilot’ effect.","The main reason was that fatty Song noticed that the Mo Family Immortal opposite them was wearing a cloak.","To highlight the unique prestige of his own master, fatty Song considerately switched from the cloak to windbreaker mode.","The one and only Tyrannical Song absolutely must not be caught wearing the same outfit as anyone else!","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.” Fellow Daoist Yue Ruhuo, who had had interactions with Song Shuhang, took a few steps forward and bowed to Song Shuhang.","“Fellow Daoist Yue Ruhuo, we meet again.” Song Shuhang slightly smiled, then asked, “What about the ‘Void Sun Guardians’ and the ‘Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull’ you mentioned earlier?”","These guys were treasures.","With fat ball Song’s processing, they could be refined into pure ‘Immortality Material’, which could be considered an Immortal level tonic.","“The last huge Void Sun was just killed by your collision,” said Yue Ruhuo. “The other nine Great Suns were dealt with by this fellow Daoist from the Mo family.”","“Killed by collision?” Song Shuhang’s heart ached.","That was money!","This collision must have cost a huge amount of money.","Thus, car accidents, if uninsured, can be very costly.","After the heartache, he turned to face the immortal from the Mo family.","The immortal from the Mo family, while suppressing the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus,’ looked towards Song Shuhang.","Their gazes met.","“You finally arrived, Tyrannical Song,” murmured the immortal from the Mo family softly.","“Hmm.” Song Shuhang nodded slightly, his expression betraying a hint of surprise as he sized up this genius from the Mo family.","This was the first time they formally met.","However, they had had indirect contact through the puppet maiden a few times before.","The ‘nucleus’ of the once puppet maiden was a treasure of this Mo family immortal, which was later reclaimed by him.","Nevertheless, there were no conflicts between them.","Now, as they formally met, Song Shuhang realized that the other’s level had reached that of a Saint and Heavenly Emperor—he, being a ‘minor Will of the Heavens’, found that he could roughly discern the other’s level.","Soon, he guessed, the other would condense his unique ‘characters,’ or perhaps... he might have already done so.","“Unexpectedly, fellow Daoist has already reached this level,” Song Shuhang spoke out: “We have known each other in spirit for a long time, yet this is our first real meeting. Let’s formally introduce ourselves, I am Tyrannical Song.”","It was a terrifying thing, habit; by now, Song Shuhang could effortlessly introduce himself with the name ‘Tyrannical Song,’ without so much as a change in expression.","“Mo family, Tian Zhi,” said the immortal from the Mo family.","Whish–","As he spoke, perhaps because his attention had shifted entirely to Song Shuhang, the previously suppressed virus suddenly erupted! It even burst through the suppression of the windbreaker!","This virus was extremely overbearing.","And very aggressive.","Once free of suppression, it crazily replicated and spread!","“Not good,” Yue Ruhuo shouted, signaling the severely injured immortals behind him to retreat.","At the same time, Tian Zhi from the Mo family extended his hand, integrating the spearhead into the windbreaker to bolster its effectiveness.","“Stellar Destruction Virus?” Song Shuhang recognized it immediately.","Next, he pointed his finger, “Emperor Destroying Pillar!”","Boom!","An imposing Emperor Pillar descended from the sky, directly targeting the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’.","This ‘Emperor Destroying Pillar’ was a premium item among the Overlord God Pillars.","It was a blend of the power of the ‘Heavenly Emperor’ and the force of the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus,’ mutually intertwined and balanced.","Besides the power of the Heavenly Emperor, this Emperor Pillar also had the effect of swallowing a certain portion of the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’.","As long as the amount was not too large, it could swallow it in one gulp, enhancing itself.","The Stellar Destruction Virus in front had just erupted and hadn’t truly expanded yet.","Most of the virus was cleanly swallowed by the pillar thrust by Song Shuhang.","The remaining viruses seemed to have been triggered and scattered towards Song Shuhang.","Facing these terrifying viruses, Song Shuhang didn’t move a step.","All the viruses, as they approached within a meter of Song Shuhang’s body, melted away.","Meanwhile, the sub-immortal brilliance on Tyrannical Song slightly shimmered."]},{"number":3105,"title":"Chapter 3105 - 3103: I want to know the gap between myself and Mister Tyrannical Song!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3105: Chapter 3103: I want to know the gap between myself and Mister Tyrannical Song!","This was reliable “immortal information” driving away the weaker “immortal information.”","—Any immortal object that had not reached the “Sub-immortal” level could not harm Song Shuhang in the slightest now.","Scholar Yue Ruhuo and the other injured Immortals all widened their eyes, staring at Tyrannical Song.","At this moment, Tyrannical Song was like a powerful magnet, firmly capturing the attention of everyone present, making them reluctant to look away.","This was the terrifying allure of “immortality” to the Immortals.","Even knowing the danger of “gazing directly at immortality,” once Immortals came into contact with “immortal information,” they still couldn’t help but pay attention to it, like moths to a flame!","[This faint radiance, seemingly so feeble, yet feels so blinding... is it Immortal Radiance?]","[Even the virus that even Mo family genius Immortal Tian Zhi avoids, cannot affect Tyrannical Song in the slightest?]","[Moreover, the virus had not even approached Tyrannical Song before it was forcibly dispersed.]","[And that one which broke through Mo family’s Tian Zhi’s cloak, suppressing and sealing the virus, was also casually annihilated in a single strike by Tyrannical Song!]","[Looking at it this way, does it seem that Tyrannical Song is perhaps stronger than Mo family’s Tian Zhi?]","Many thoughts surfaced in the minds of Scholar Yue Ruhuo and others, as well as those who were using divine sense from afar to lock onto the Immortals and top Law Tribulation Immortals in the “Paradise Space.”","“It is immortality!” The perceptive Immortal Fairy couldn’t help but exclaim.","She pinpointed the reality everyone had already guessed but instinctively did not want to accept—this world always has some experiences that feel so harsh beyond reality that people do not want to accept them.","All the Immortals, seeing the faint yet extremely blinding radiance on Tyrannical Song, had already guessed that it was genuine Immortal Radiance.","But... a being who had not yet proved his “Immortal Heavenly Dao” had transformed his entire body into an ‘immortal appearance’ and was openly emitting Immortal Radiance. How could this be done?","This was a truth everyone’s heart resisted!","[Looking at how the radiance covers him, Tyrannical Song’s entire body... at least his skin, has reached immortality?]","[After conquering the Netherworld with a mortal body, and forming ‘Netherworld Song Ruler,’ it seemed Tyrannical Song indeed reached out towards the ultimate ‘Heaven’s Will.’ Just as everyone had guessed initially, is he trying to seize the authority of Heaven’s Will with a mortal body?] Countless thoughts emerged in the minds of the Immortals.","“This is not immortality, after all, I am not any Heaven’s Will,” Tyrannical Song extended his hand to recall the ‘Emperor Destroying Pillar’ and slightly smiled at the Immortal lady: “This is just a crude imitation of ‘immortality.'”","It was Sub-immortal.","[Not true immortality?] Tyrannical Song’s answer made all the Immortals present feel slightly better.","“Mister Tyrannical Song, have you ever come into contact with this virus before?” Mo family’s Tian Zhi no longer let his cloak flutter, he struggled to divert his gaze away from Song Shuhang, and asked aloud.","“Yes, I’ve dealt with these guys a few times... That’s why I tinkered with this New Year event in the ‘Cultivator Chat System’ to strike at these guys,” Song Shuhang nodded and said.","While speaking, the faint ‘Immortal Radiance’ on Song Shuhang’s body once again entered a low-key mode, ensuring it did not cause the observing Immortals to sink into it.","Yet, the influence of the Sub-immortal persisted, and all the Immortals continued to stare fixedly at Tyrannical Song, like people eyeing a succulent piece of meat after a pork price surge.","“So that’s how it is.” Mo family’s Tian Zhi nodded his head.","This was his first encounter with this type of virus, while Tyrannical Song seemed to have dealt with it multiple times.","Therefore, it was understandable that Tyrannical Song had targeted means against this virus right from his first move.","Mo family’s Tian Zhi felt a surge of combat intent.","Tyrannical Song had arrived.","He had been waiting for this scene for a long time.","As if he sensed the battle intent emanating from Mo family Tian Zhi’s Big Shot, the other Immortals hastily retreated, clearing an area.","“Just now, Mister Tyrannical Song, you mentioned... you said I had also reached this level. So indeed, you are at this level as well, aren’t you?” After adjusting his mentality, Mo family Tian Zhi raised his head again to face Tyrannical Song, struggling to shield himself from the disturbances and effects of the ‘immortal information.’","What other Immortals couldn’t do, he could barely manage.","Moreover, although his words were phrased as a question, his tone was very assertive.","He had already been certain before he came that Tyrannical Song must also be at this level.","What he wanted to know was actually when Tyrannical Song had entered this level!","“Hmm... probably,” came the reply from Tyrannical Song, which was somewhat unexpected for Mo family Tian Zhi.","[Probably? What kind of answer is that?] Mo family Tian Zhi looked at Song Shuhang with confusion.","Song Shuhang, with a slight smile, said, “Fellow Daoist Tian Zhi, you have just come into contact with this level, haven’t you? Did you experience anything special when you entered this level?”","Opposite him, Mo family Tian Zhi furrowed his brows, lost in thought.","He had subsequently taken the ‘Confucianism Sage’, and later the ‘Heavenly Emperor’, as proof, comparing himself to them... and finally confirmed that he had indeed entered that level.","Could it be that Tyrannical Song had done the same?","“Actually, following my own pace, at this stage, I should still lack one component to reach this level,” said Song Shuhang calmly—however, his calmness appeared profoundly mysterious to those around him.","Initially, or rather, as per his initial speculation a month ago, he should have matched the peak level of a Confucian Sage after completing the ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’.","But his speculations and script couldn’t keep up with the changes.","After undergoing three changes of the ‘immortal path’ and mooching off the undying information structure ‘Sub-immortal Body’ of 2-8 Daozi, he had at this point... exceeded the range of mortals and belonged to the minor Heavenly Dao level.","Thus, he was a competitor who had skipped levels.","And his ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ also turned out completely different from what he had initially envisioned.","It had become unimaginably powerful.","Fused with generations of Heavenly Dao information, supplemented by Lady Kunna, and further enriched by vast experiences from Immortals Communicating about the ‘Immortal Dao Core’... when Daoist Senior delivers the last cheat, completing the final 1% of the Cultivation Chat Immortal Path, this Immortal Path will be unmatched in both the ancient and modern times.","Even the ‘Ancient Heavenly City Path’ of the Heavenly Emperor couldn’t compare to it...","“Does that mean, Mister Tyrannical Song, that you could become even stronger? Without proving ‘Heavenly Dao’?” Mo family Tian Zhi discerned the underlying meaning in Song Shuhang’s words—the missing component meant that Tyrannical Song could still become stronger by one component!","This was truly terrifying!","Opposite him, Tyrannical Song nodded enigmatically.","“Hiss–” Everyone present took a sharp intake of breath.","The battle intent in Mo family Tian Zhi’s eyes cooled slightly.","A moment later.","He spoke again: “Then Mister Tyrannical Song, is there still a gap between me now, and not just me, but also between me and the former Confucian Sage?”","Since Tyrannical Song was the reincarnation of a Confucian Sage.","So his question was quite apt."]},{"number":3106,"title":"Chapter 3106 - 3104: The Strongest Strike, Gathering the Power of the Myriad Practitioners in the Universe!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3106: Chapter 3104: The Strongest Strike, Gathering the Power of the Myriad Practitioners in the Universe!","“Do you want to test the gap between yourself and a Confucian Sage?” Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up when he heard this question.","If the Mo family’s Tian Zhi fellow friend wanted to test the might of other ‘Sage Level’ powers, Song Shuhang was powerless to help.","But if the other party wanted to experience the ‘Confucian Sage’ mode, he had quite the experience.","After all, Song Shuhang had once used the Ruler of Shadows’ magical treasure to summon the obsession of a Confucian Sage to possess him, and he had fought against Fat Ball’s manifestation in the guise of a Sage.","He was somewhat familiar with the attack modes of a Sage.","“Indeed... is there still a gap?” Mo family’s Tian Zhi fellow friend murmured.","He had just touched upon this realm, and there certainly was some gap between him and the Confucian Sages of the past who had dominated the myriad practitioners in the universe.","“If you want to try... I could simulate the state of a Sage and give you some experience.” Song Shuhang stroked his chin as he spoke.","Now, with his body of a ‘Mini Heavenly Dao’, simulating some might of a Confucian Sage wasn’t a big issue—even if there were flaws, using the thick data of ‘Heavenly Dao’ accumulated over generations, he could patch up the shortcomings.","Moreover, he now possessed a pair of ‘Scholarly Sage’s Eyes,’ which had become the core of his ‘External Energy System modeled on the Dragon Network.’","With these eyes, he could fully allow the other party to experience the methods of a Sage.","Mo family’s Tian Zhi reacted calmly, “Please enlighten me, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.”","Upon this, Song Shuhang had a thought, and the ‘Sage Eye Golden Core’ emerged within his external system.","Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia appeared, placing their hands over Song Shuhang’s eyes... Subsequently, in front of everyone, Tyrannical Song’s pair of lustrous sage eyes were ‘plucked’ out.","At the same time, the likewise sub-immortalized ‘Sage Eyes Golden Cores’ appeared in Song Shuhang’s eye sockets, instantly transitioning from golden core to eyeballs.","And the ‘plucked’ lustrous sage eyes now took the place of Sage Eye Golden Cores in the external system.","—In fact, after sub-immortalization, Tyrannical Song’s eyeballs could no longer be plucked out.","The actions of the virtuous lamia and Fairy Creation were merely a cover for Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang willingly switched the positions of the lustrous eyes and Sage Eye Golden Cores with his own intent. Both were now part of his ‘body objects.’","For Song Shuhang, changing the position of his eyeballs was as simple as ‘blinking.’","“Are you prepared?” Tyrannical Song’s eyes brightened, and he tried to suppress his ‘Sub-immortal Energy,’ striving to restore the realm of Confucian Sages in his mind.","Immortals observing the ‘Paradise World’ felt a jolt of panic.","“Hoo—” On the other side, Mo family’s Tian Zhi fellow friend summoned the ‘spearhead’ again, which separated from his cloak.","Silver spear, shining armor, cloak—Tian Zhi exuded the style of an upright Immortal.","“Please enlighten me, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.” Tian Zhi repeated his request.","Smack—","The next moment, two rays suddenly struck him.","The speed of those rays was so fast that it surpassed everyone’s reaction—like time was paused when the rays shot out and struck, then time resumed flowing.","Mo family’s Tian Zhi had not even reacted when he was already hit by the two rays.","“It’s the Pregnant... it’s the Expert’s Appraisal!” The Immortals present, being profound scholars, recognized these rays instantly.","Moreover, it was a double dose!","Even a stone hit by a single Pregnant Gaze would be forced to experience ‘the greatness of motherhood.’","The beginning was so intense, this was very much like Tyrannical Song, but definitely not like a Sage.","The Confucian Sages of old would not start by educating others on the greatness of motherhood!","Occasionally, Immortals who had experienced the Sage’s ‘Expert’s Appraisal’ had brought it upon themselves by displeasing the Sage.","After being hit, Mo family’s Tian Zhi only felt a faint reaction in his abdomen... thankfully, this reaction was fleeting.","First, his body was that of a puppet.","Secondly, the opposing Tyrannical Song was deliberately suppressing the release of ‘Sub-immortal Energy,’ striving to let the other experience the power at a ‘Sage Level,’ so these two Pregnant Gazes were not at full power.","“Being immune to the Expert’s Appraisal indicates that you have truly touched that realm,” Tyrannical Song slowly said from the other side.","Without having reached this realm, one would tremble under the Sage Level ‘Expert’s Appraisal.’","In the meantime, a spatial gate appeared next to Mo family’s Tian Zhi.","It was opened by Tyrannical Song.","Even in this ‘Immortal Information Blockade’ plus ‘a powerful Killing Formation suppressing’ Paradise Space, Tyrannical Song could still open spatial passages at will!","The spatial gate moved like a shadow, closely following Mo family’s Tian Zhi.","On the other side of the spatial gate, Tyrannical Song swung his fists, frantically punching into the gate, unleashing a barrage of punches.","Boom boom boom boom boom~","From the other side of the spatial gate, Tyrannical Song’s iron fists smashed towards Mo family’s Tian Zhi.","[This move truly has the flavor of a Sage!] Most of the Immortals present had been hammered by this move before, so upon seeing this scene, the flavor of a Sage emerged in their minds, and they simultaneously felt a phantom pain in their bodies.","Whoosh~ Fellow Daoist Mo Family Tian Zhi was not panicked; his windbreaker unfolded, enveloping him.","Although he had never directly challenged a Scholarly Sage, he had watched from afar the battles between a Sage and other Immortals on multiple occasions.","Boom boom boom boom~","Tyrannical Song’s iron fists continuously bombarded the windbreaker, and each first punch left a fist imprint on it, with the force even penetrating the windbreaker and directly hitting Mo family’s Tian Zhi.","Song Shuhang, although he was trying his best to suppress himself and simulate the fist strength of the Scholarly Sage from his memories—his body had already achieved a Sub-immortal status.","His fists, even when deliberately suppressed, were still a ‘Sub-immortal Level’ deadly weapon.","With each punch that landed, it carried an inherent bonus of additional damage.","Moans continued to emanate from inside the windbreaker of Fellow Daoist Mo Family Tian Zhi; even in his puppetized state, he couldn’t avoid the pain inflicted by Tyrannical Song’s punches.","This pain affected directly the soul, causing a feeling of powerlessness.","After a furious volley of punches, the barrage ended, and Tyrannical Song closed the spatial gate.","In the Void.","Mo Family Tian Zhi’s windbreaker dispersed, revealing a body covered with wounds.","Although these wounds started to heal quickly.","But injured meant injured!","“Even at this level, the gap between me and a Sage still exists,” stated Fellow Daoist Mo Family Tian Zhi softly.","The hallmark of a Sage, ‘Knowledge’s Iron Fist,’ when fully deployed, brought him substantial injury.","He looked thoughtfully at Tyrannical Song across from him.","A moment later.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, how big is the gap between you and me?” Mo Family Tian Zhi grasped his spear: “I wish to test it.”","He began to gather all his power.","Behind him, phantoms of the myriad realms emerged.","In each plane of the myriad worlds, a ‘puppet’ was receiving power and transferring it to Tian Zhi at this moment.","“Gathering all my power in one strike, please instruct me, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” Mo Family Tian Zhi raised his spear.","But this time, he wasn’t using it in a spear-thrusting stance.","Instead, he raised it high like a javelin.","The attack, gathering the power of countless puppets in the myriad worlds, had the other Immortals shuddering just by sensing the strike.","Most Immortals envisioned themselves in Tyrannical Song’s place.","If they were to face this strike... they might die!","How will Tyrannical Song confront this strike?","Everyone’s eyes turned back to Tyrannical Song.","[No movement?]","Facing this strike that concentrated the power of myriad worlds, capable of destroying any Immortal, Tyrannical Song showed no response.","He did not put up a defense, use any magical treasures, nor did he activate the ‘windbreaker’ on his body!","Mo Family Tian Zhi’s eyes also narrowed.","But the arrow had to be shot once the bow was drawn.","Boom~","The spear was thrown, shooting towards Tyrannical Song."]},{"number":3107,"title":"Chapter 3107 - 3105: I, Tyrannical Song, Seek Eternity. Who Dares Not Accept?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3107: Chapter 3105: I, Tyrannical Song, Seek Eternity. Who Dares Not Accept?","This strike gathered the power of all the puppets set up within the “myriad practitioners in the universe” by Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family; it was his truly full-powered strike!","The bright armor and cape on his body had already merged into the spearhead, pushing his life-bound magical treasure in its “Gun Form” to the ultimate limit.","This strike drained all his strength, and it was further reinforced by an explosive secret technique.","At the same time, this strike also attracted the attention of all the Immortals.","The Immortals watched the tip of the spear... eagerly anticipating its collision with Tyrannical Song.","—Previously, Tyrannical Song had displayed the power of a “Sage of Confucianism.” But what level had he reached now—had he surpassed his previous life as the “Sage of Confucianism”?","Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family, who had personally admitted that he had already “reached the realm of the Sage,” how much damage could his strongest strike bring to Tyrannical Song?","Boom—","The speed of this throw was so fast that even when the Immortals concentrated all their efforts, they could only barely see an afterimage.","Midway, the spear already turned scarlet from the powerful energy infused into it.","Moreover, coincidentally... the “Killing Formation” and “Law of Eternity Locking” effects in Paradise World began to collapse and disintegrate just as Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family made his move.","With the suppression of the Killing Formation’s principles no longer present, Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family’s strike would unleash 100% of its potential!","The lethality of this spear was completely liberated!","And ultimately, the spear locked onto the head of Tyrannical Song, stabbing toward his head, aiming for the position of Tyrannical Song’s right eye!","But facing this strike that was about to pierce through his head, Tyrannical Song still showed no reaction!","[?]","[Why isn’t he defending? Does Tyrannical Song intend to take this spear with his face?]","[Or perhaps, has the power of this spear suppressed Tyrannical Song, rendering him unable to move?]","Amidst doubts, speculations, and surprises from the Immortals, the spear tip harshly stabbed onto... the pupil of Tyrannical Song’s right eye!","Directly onto the eyeball!","During this, Tyrannical Song did not even twitch an eyelid!","A true man faces imminent danger without even fluttering his eyelids—it’s a loss if he does!","[!]","A spear directly bursting an eyeball... Does Tyrannical Song no longer need his eye?","All the Immortals widened their eyes, unbelieving.","Even if Tyrannical Song had merely “blinked,” they would not be as shocked as they were now.","However, their shock was just beginning!","Crack, crack... hiss...","A short while later, a series of irritating, twisted sounds arose from the location of Tyrannical Song’s right eye!","Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family’s spear, which had gathered all his strength and released all its lethal power, stabbed onto Tyrannical Song’s pupil, the sharp spearhead against the eyeball.","But this spear, which could have pierced through dozens, even hundreds of Immortals stacked together, stubbornly halted.","The spear tip against the eyeball could not advance even half a fragment further!","[!!!]","Had this spear not even managed to break through the most fragile outer layer of Tyrannical Song’s pupil?","Furthermore, because of the tremendous force, Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family’s spear tip began to distort.","Soon, this distortion extended to the entire spear shaft—not piercing through Tyrannical Song’s eyeball, the reaction force affected the entire divine weapon of the Immortal.","This divine weapon of the Immortal, which had accompanied Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family for most of his life, suffered tremendous damage!","The Immortals across myriad realms: [!!!]","At that moment, apart from words like “Holy shit, damn it,” the Immortals could not think of any other words in their minds!","The injured was not Tyrannical Song’s eyeballs, but Mister Tian Zhi’s spear!","Immortals across the myriad realms felt their worldview had been severely damaged.","On the other side, Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family was the one most impacted by this.","The spear he had thrown was his life-bound magical treasure.","At the moment of impact, he received some feedback information from the spear.","The body of the spear had been severely damaged.","If it were just physical damage, it might still be easy to solve—Tian Zhi’s spear and ‘fat ball’ had similar functions, able to transform its form and mend more easily.","But its real damage came from the collision with ‘Sub-immortal,’ when ‘Sub-immortal information’ rebounded internally.","This part of the damage would take a long time to slowly mend.","Moreover, this was still under the condition that Tyrannical Song did not harbor ‘Killing Intent’; otherwise, if Tyrannical Song had counterattacked harboring such emotions at the moment the spearhead struck the eyeball, the Sub-immortal Body would have actively retaliated... bringing more severe and irreparable permanent damage to this ‘divine weapon of the Immortal’!","The entire ‘Paradise World’ fell into a silence as deep as death.","Spectating cultivators like Scholar Yue Ruhuo didn’t even dare to move.","Clang~","At that moment, the spear that had struck Tyrannical Song’s eyeball, under great impact, transformed into a lump of metal and fell, landing by Tyrannical Song’s feet.","The power of that spear, capable of killing dozens of Immortals, had vanished entirely within Tyrannical Song’s eyeball.","[Is it over?]","[Am I really not dreaming?] Because the scene before him was too unreal.","[Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family, who had been recognized by Tyrannical Song himself as having reached the level once held by a Confucian Sage... But his spear couldn’t even penetrate the outer layer of Tyrannical Song’s eyeball? If not for the terrifying power of Tian Zhi’s spear felt from afar, some might even doubt Mister Tian Zhi’s strength.]","[Even if Tyrannical Song had blocked the spear with his eyelid, I feel like I could accept that...] Blocking this spear with bare eyes is already beyond what the Immortals can psychologically endure.","Because this represents an immense, insurmountable disparity!","A disparity of despair!","Saints of Confucianism and the Heavenly Emperor, that level of ascension, has always been recognized by all Immortals as ‘the strongest under the Will of Heavens’, standing at the peak among the Immortals.","But Mister Tian Zhi’s full-powered strike... could not even penetrate the membrane of Tyrannical Song’s eyeball.","This outcome made the Immortals feel a suffocating pressure.","All eyes quietly fell on Tyrannical Song.","What level was Big Shot Tyrannical Song at now?","“Is it Immortality, not just some crude imitation of immortality?” Mister Tian Zhi said slowly: “I thought that Tyrannical Song, you had made your entire skin undergo what you call ‘imitation immortality’, so I chose to avoid your body and aim for the most vulnerable spot, your eye socket.”","But unexpectedly, the part of Tyrannical Song that underwent ‘Immortalization’ wasn’t just his skin.","Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family gestured and the lump of metal was retrieved by him.","Is this reality’s cruelty?","If there were individuals like Tian Zhi, then why must there also be a being like Tyrannical Song born?","However, on the other side, Tyrannical Song did not respond to him, maintaining his unfathomable demeanor.","Could this be the vast gap between me and Mister Tyrannical Song?","However, just as he was about to turn and leave...","“Eh?” Tyrannical Song opposite him let out a puzzled sound.","Then, Tyrannical Song lightly shook his head.","He seemed to have come to his senses, looking refreshed and clear-headed.","“I’m sorry, I just entered a state of enlightenment and got a bit distracted,” he said, revealing a warm smile.","This smile emanated from the heart, carrying a strangely infectious quality.","Such a smile... was what Song Shuhang, after traversing time for immortality and encountering the ‘Future Child’ period’s ‘Song Shuhang,’ had been influenced by.","However, this smile proved to be quite useful.","It could stabilize people’s hearts in the shortest time, dispel their inner unease, and make one perceive Tyrannical Song as dependable.","After regaining focus, Tyrannical Song looked towards Mo family Tian Zhi and spoke, “Tian Zhi fellow daoist, I’m ready. Make your move!”","— Just a moment ago, Song Shuhang might have been influenced by ‘Senior White,’ who had buried himself, and entered a marvelous state of enlightenment. This enlightenment pertained to the understanding of the ‘primordial soul.’","Now, he had undergone sub-immortalization from his fleshly body to his mental energy. Next, he would just wait to receive the cheat from Daoist Senior, enhancing his ‘Calculation Ability.’","While enhancing his ‘Calculation Ability,’ he and Senior White should be able to seize the opportunity to bring a wave of reinforcement to the primordial soul!","At that time, his primordial soul, body, and strength would all reach perfection.","His ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ would also be complete.","Truly evolving into ‘Ultimate Tyrannical Song.’","‘Make your move~’","‘Make your move~’","Tyrannical Song’s voice echoed in everyone’s ears.","Mo family Tian Zhi: “...”","Scholar Yue Ruhuo: “...”","The other onlookers who were immortals: “...”","They didn’t know what to say anymore.","There was nothing more to say.","Mr. Mo family Tian Zhi’s recent devastating attack, the one that had gathered all his strength, turned out to have been aimed at the distracted Tyrannical Song.","Even though Mr. Tian Zhi had reached the realm of ‘Confucian Sage’, with an indestructibly strong mind and will, at this moment, he felt like crying.","A huge sense of grievance surged like a tsunami, violently striking his minds!","It wasn’t that he wasn’t excellent enough. There were probably only a handful in the myriad realms throughout history like him who had reached the level of ‘Confucian Sage’.","He was already one of the ten most outstanding individuals in the myriad realms of all time.","But then, he met Tyrannical Song.","“I have already made my spear attack,” Mr. Mo family Tian Zhi finally managed to stabilize his mental state and replied to Tyrannical Song in as calm a tone as possible.","Song Shuhang: “???”","Damn, how long was I distracted?","You’ve already completed your spear attack?","He subconsciously reached for his waist—based on previous experiences, the opponent’s spear might likely have been aimed there.","“Stop feeling around, mind your image,” Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair dazedly patted his head and transmitted, “His spear attack just now was aimed at your eyeballs, don’t assume everyone’s targeting your waist.”","“The main body is indeed the strongest!” Song fat ball transmitted with a prideful tone.","“This poor guy, facing his spear attack, I too felt like I was facing ‘death.’ However, that spear couldn’t even pierce the membrane of your eyeballs,” The White Dragon transmitted in a sighing tone.","“He might become withdrawn, having already touched the realm of sage. Given time... in the future, he might, like a Sage, suppress an era, being invincible among men. But today’s spear attack will definitely leave a huge shadow in his heart,” Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword added in a group transmission, “Also, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, you’ve lost the bet.”","“Damn it, I thought he would go for Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s waist, but he went for the eyeballs instead,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet transmitted unwillingly.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Just in the moment I was distracted, so much had transpired.","And the fact that it didn’t even pierce the membrane of my eyeballs is a bit disappointing.","“Should I make a slight gesture, perhaps gently touching my own eye socket, pretending to be in great pain, so as not to overly distress Fellow Daoist Tian Zhi?”","Song Shuhang had no major conflict with the other party, who had been considerate of Tyrannical Song’s dignity when collecting the puppet maiden’s nucleus, and was not of malicious character.","With this thought, Song Shuhang reached out to press his left eye socket, from which ‘tears’ began to fall.","“So it is, so it is, Fellow Daoist Tian Zhi, you have already shot... No wonder my eye hurts so badly.” Song Shuhang whispered, “Your shot has reached the peak of this world.”","Across from him, Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family’s expression grew even stranger — appearing more aggrieved, yet at the same time, somewhat moved by Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song’s kindness.","The surrounding Immortals, and those who had been ‘watching remotely’: “...”","Scholar Yue Ruhuo couldn’t help but quietly transmit a message to Song Shuhang, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, the shot that Tian Zhi Fellow Daoist struck earlier was on your right eye.”","Song Shuhang, covering his left eye, stiffened slightly.","Awkward.","At this point, switching his hand to his right eye socket would be too late and would only deepen the ‘awkward’ atmosphere.","Moreover, everyone had already noticed this point, so continuing to pretend would be pointless.","Hence, while pretending to ‘wipe tears’, Song Shuhang quietly lowered his hand.","“The stroke Fellow Daoist Tian Zhi just performed was truly perfect.” He squeezed out another line of flattery: “I’ve seen the Heavenly Emperor strike with all her might, and your strike already possesses her grace.”","In the shadows, the black-skinned one: “...”","Senior Song, you are going to offend Heavenly Emperor’s sister this way, meaning that she also cannot penetrate your eyelids!","“Thank you for your praise, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.” Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family could only grit his teeth and take the precarious ‘step down’ offered by Tyrannical Song.","He couldn’t let Tyrannical Song continue speaking; even if the step was unstable, he had to descend first.","“Let’s exchange pointers again when there’s a chance,” Song Shuhang smiled and said, then turning to the other Immortals, “The same goes for all fellow daoists, feel free to seek me out for discussions anytime.”","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, how strong are you now?” After a long silence, Fellow Daoist Yue Ruhuo, representing most of the Immortals, voiced the question.","“About this question...” Song Shuhang stroked his chin—how was he to inform everyone about his current strength? Or how much of his abilities should he reveal to be appropriate?","As Song Shuhang pondered, Daoist Senior’s voice echoed in his ears.","[Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, that’s enough... Prepare yourself, I’m about to step down.]","Song Shuhang was stunned: “Now?”","He had just arrived.","[Yes, right now. The stage is set, all actors are present, and you and Fellow Daoist White, the main performers, have already made a perfect entrance. Next, I will commence the announcement to the myriad practitioners in the universe. And you and Fellow Daoist White, are to ascend to the seat of immortality!]","I will step down, and you will take over my throne of the Immortal King, ascending to the Will of the Heavens!","Now in the myriad realms, no one will dare to emerge, to hinder your attaining the Will of the Heavens.","Go for it, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song...","All I can do now is this much.","...","...","A moment later.","All cultivators across the myriad realms felt a stirring in their hearts.","This familiar sensation...","There’s an issue with the Will of the Heavens!","The Will of the Heavens, is stepping down!","“???” Everyone, baffled.","Wasn’t the ‘Ninth’ Will of the Heavens just appointed?"]},{"number":3108,"title":"Chapter 3108 - 3106: The current Will of the Heavens turns out to be Tyrannical Song perfecting the setup of the ’immortal path’!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3108: Chapter 3106: The current Will of the Heavens turns out to be Tyrannical Song perfecting the setup of the ‘immortal path’!","Senior Daozi’s tenure as the 8.5th Heavenly Dao was something that only a few, including Song Shuhang, knew about.","After all, it was extremely high-level intelligence.","Practitioners in the universe all believed that Daozi was the “Ninth Heavenly Dao.”","When Daozi proved his dao and became immortal, he followed all the procedures—the Eighth Heavenly Dao “Ball’s Heavenly Dao” retired, then Daozi proved his dao and became immortal, and the news was announced to all under heaven.","But now, the Ninth Heavenly Dao was about to retire?","He had just proved his dao last month!","This news, like a depth bomb, suddenly woke up all the practitioners in the universe.","Facing this atomic bomb-level news, ordinary practitioners in the universe began to doubt their life choices at this moment.","“What kind of joke is this?” Immortals across the universe wore complicated expressions—shocked, disbelieving, unable to comprehend, stupefied, feeling as if they were dreaming.","“Could my senses be wrong? It hasn’t even been a month since the Ninth Heavenly Dao took office, has it?” —There’s too much unbelievable news to handle today! It started with Tyrannical Song’s eyeballs meeting destruction, and now the current Heavenly Dao resigning shortly after taking office, am I dreaming?","“Even the most capricious Heavenly Dao couldn’t possibly resign just within a month.”","“What is going on in the mind of the Ninth Heavenly Dao?”","“What exactly does ‘eternity’, which we desperately want to achieve, mean to them?”—Is the unattainable always agitating, and the favored always fearless?","The more elusive it is, the more one wants it. But once obtained, is it no longer cherished?","“Who knows someone from the Confucian school? Ask them what exactly is happening, why would Daozi, the Confucian Senior, who just proved his dao and obtained immortality, need to immediately retire?”","“The people from Confucianism are all in the Virtuous Golden Lotus world, uncontactable right now.”","“Use Tyrannical Song’s ‘Cultivator Chat System’ to contact them!”","“Tyrannical Song, right, ask Tyrannical Song! Tyrannical Song knows the Ninth Heavenly Dao. Moreover, Tyrannical Song is likely the reincarnation of a Confucian Sage, and the Ninth Heavenly Dao ‘Daozi’ is his senior disciple. He must know the inside story!”","Mo family’s Tian Zhi, Scholar Yue Ruhuo, and the other immortals present all turned their gazes towards Song Shuhang.","Then, everyone realized that, in the face of the ‘atomic bomb-level’ news of the Ninth Heavenly Dao’s resignation, Tyrannical Song was quite calm.","There was not a hint of surprise on Tyrannical Song’s face, it seemed as if he had known about “the Ninth Heavenly Dao’s resignation” a long time ago!","Indeed, Tyrannical Song knew the inside story!","Could it be that this matter was pre-arranged by Tyrannical Song and the current Heavenly Dao a long time ago?","Wait!","If this train of thought is followed, it’s terrifyingly profound!","If this scene had been arranged long ago by Tyrannical Song and the current Heavenly Dao ‘Daozi’, a lot of things could be explained.","For instance... the ascension of the Ninth Heavenly Dao was quite mysteriously abrupt!","The current Heavenly Dao ‘Confucian Daozi’, prior to proving his dao, kept a very low profile, incredibly discreet. In fact, many immortals didn’t even know that ‘Daozi’ had reached the immortal path, becoming an immortal.","Unlike the Confucian Sage of the past, he did not conquer practitioners in the universe but seemed to meet certain conditions and directly skipped the preliminaries to prove his dao and become immortal.","—Originally, when the ascension ceremony of the Ninth Heavenly Dao began, the practitioners in the universe thought that ‘Tyrannical Song’ was going to become immortal.","Thinking back carefully now, could it be that originally the one who should have proved ‘immortality’ was Tyrannical Song, but he gave up the opportunity and let Daozi prove his dao and become immortal?","Did Big Shot Tyrannical Song single-handedly elevate “Daozi” to the seat of the Ninth Heavenly Dao?","And then under certain conditions, or after certain matters were completed, did he arrange for Daozi to resign from the Heavenly Dao at an appropriate time?","If we infer this way, everything makes sense!","However, why didn’t Big Shot Tyrannical Song prove his Dao himself and instead pushed “Daozi” into the position? What was he aiming to achieve?","What is it that couldn’t be resolved by proving his own Dao?","Instead, why did he need someone else to prove the Heavenly Dao first and accomplish it for him?","As all the Immortals pondered, Heavenly Dao “Daozi” cleanly and neatly began his resignation!","He truly resigned, without dawdling at all!","Not even a hint of “reluctance” could be seen!","The Immortals from myriad practitioners in the universe put themselves in his shoes—if it were them, they certainly wouldn’t willingly leave the Ninth Heavenly Dao seat without thoroughly researching the “immortal information.”","Even a part of the Immortals harbored the thought that once they assumed the seat of the Immortal Heavenly Dao, they would never abandon it.","Even if above the “Heavenly Dao,” there were more enticing levels to ascend, these Immortals would not be swayed! Being quietly a handsome Heavenly Dao was enough for them.","Yet Daozi, having not even fulfilled a month of his term, announced his resignation so abruptly.","If this wasn’t prearranged, nobody would believe it!","Just as “Daozi” began his resignation, a great light shone from the “Heavenly Dao Dimension,” enveloping Song Shuhang within it.","— This was Daoist Senior Daozi acting according to the prearranged plan, to transfer the “Heavenly Dao Level Computational External Device” through the channel set by Fat Ball Heavenly Dao to Song Shuhang right as he resigned.","When this great light fell upon Song Shuhang, the radiance of the Great Way and frightful Heavenly Dao data surged over.","All the Immortals who witnessed this scene felt pain in their eyes, and their consciousnesses were struck by a tsunami, suffering immensely.","Even the likes of Scholar Tian Zhi, a fellow friend from the Mo family, could only endure it for a short while.","Some of the less advanced Immortals had blood dropping from their eyes, and their eyeballs were injured, even cracking—likely needing a long time to recuperate and repair.","[What is this thing?]","[Indeed, the Ninth Heavenly Dao transferred something to Big Shot Tyrannical Song during its “resignation” through the process of resignation!]","[It’s confirmed now, the Ninth Heavenly Dao was pushed into place by Big Shot Tyrannical Song, he is a tool Heavenly Dao, aiming to bring something that only the “Heavenly Dao” could possess to Big Shot Tyrannical Song after proving his pseudo-immortal body, and this material must be obtained by Big Shot Tyrannical Song before proving his pseudo-immortal body!]","The Immortals of myriad practitioners in the universe were now convinced of their earlier speculation!","Big Shot Tyrannical Song is definitely the reincarnation of a Confucian Sage!","If not, how could Daozi follow Big Shot Tyrannical Song’s arrangements so meticulously and diligently?","[What’s conquering the Netherworld Realm as a mortal? What’s condensing an Immortal Body as a mortal? The truly terrifying aspect of Big Shot Tyrannical Song is that he’s scheming against the Heavenly Dao... Even the Heavenly Dao is just a tool in his hands!]","[I seriously suspect that even the earlier Eighth Heavenly Dao must have been clearly arranged by Big Shot Tyrannical Song behind the scenes!]","The thoughts of myriad practitioners in the universe’s cultivators surfaced one after another.","They began to feel faintly that they were about to witness the birth of “history’s most terrifying man”!","“Wait... These data and information, could it be Calculation Ability? Did Daozi hand over Heavenly Dao-level Calculation Ability to Big Shot Tyrannical Song?” Scholar Tian Zhi of the Mo family finally realized the truth, expressing his disbelief!"]},{"number":3109,"title":"Chapter 3109 - 3107: Tyrannical Song Insists on Saying NO to the Strongest Rule","paragraphs":["Chapter 3109: Chapter 3107: Tyrannical Song Insists on Saying NO to the Strongest Rule","Fellow Daoist Tian Zhi of the Mo family had the strongest strength and the highest vision and persevered for the longest.","Moreover, his immortal path was that of puppets, and he was naturally very adept at “calculation.”","When his calculation power was fully unleashed, he could control billions of puppets simultaneously, displaying entirely different behaviors and even continuously simulating different lives.","Speaking of “calculation ability,” Tian Zhi of the Mo family ranked among the top Immortals throughout the ages.","Therefore, upon seeing the “cheat” transmitted to Tyrannical Song by the pillar of light, he was the first to discern the truth!","Of course... the reason he could perceive it so quickly and was somewhat “immune” to the shock of the immortal information was that he had secretive help.","Behind the scenes, a group of people wanted to use the mouthpiece of this most prominent ‘Mo family genius Immortal’ to release some shocking news that was not a secret, to confirm everyone’s suspicion that ‘Heavenly Dao is Tyrannical Song’s tool.’","It’s not horrifying to brag about oneself, but what’s truly terrifying is when the bragging is technically skilled and even stronger in power.","“Heavenly Dao Level Computational Ability?” Fellow Daoists like Scholar Yue Ruhuo at the scene felt their jaws numb with shock.","“This thing can be passed on to others?” asked the Star Bear Immortal, puzzled.","“Others cannot withstand it, but the current Tyrannical Song certainly has no problems... don’t forget, Tyrannical Song’s entire body is immortal,” reminded the immortal daoist.","“His fleshly body and even his eyeballs had already become ‘immortalized,’ and now he has obtained ‘Heavenly Dao Level Computational Ability’... The current Tyrannical Song, is he already the Heavenly Dao?” said the constantly bleeding dual-blade swordsman, wiping the blood from the corner of his mouth.","“Perhaps just as we speculated, Tyrannical Song intends to wield the authority of the Heavenly Dao with a ‘mortal body,’ just as he conquered the Netherworld Realm. Now, with a mortal body, he aims to conquer the Heavenly Dao. Without proving by the ‘Dao,’ he possesses all eternal attributes of the ‘Heavenly Dao,'” Scholar Yue Ruhuo slowly said.","This man is too terrifying.","Throughout history, no one has managed to achieve what this man has to this extent. Even the successive Heavenly Daos have never been like Tyrannical Song.","Indeed, let alone achieving his level, the cultivators and Heavenly Daos of past generations haven’t even thought about it.","No one ever imagined the possibility of ‘conquering the Heavenly Dao with a mortal body.’","If it were not for every Immortal having firm mind and willpower, even an ‘Inner Demon’ might have been provoked.","As Scholar Yue Ruhuo and others communicated, more and more Immortals and Top Tribulation Immortals arrived in the Paradise World.","But all Immortals and Tribulation Immortals did not dare to approach Tyrannical Song too closely and only watched from a distance.","Whoosh~~","After a large number of Immortals from the myriad realms had arrived, the ‘pillar of light’ covering Song Shuhang dissipated.","The ‘Heavenly Dao Calculation External Device’ crafted by Daozi was successfully loaded.","The cheat was activated!","Song Shuhang felt his brain’s calculation ability rapidly increasing.","At this moment, he felt his calculation ability had reached the extent that he could “instantly answer all questions from cultivators across the myriad realms” — assuming his knowledge was sufficient!","But this was just the beginning of the cheat’s activation!","The cheat not only upgraded his software but also improved his hardware capabilities, enhancing both simultaneously.","Song Shuhang could feel his primordial soul, stored in fragmented parts in the ‘Tribulation Transcender Void Node,’ also beginning to be reinforced.","Senior White’s primordial soul was also being reinforced, alongside him.","This reinforcement also made their plan to[prove their Dao as two different individuals simultaneously]more stable and complete.","Fleshly body, power, primordial soul, all sub-immortalized, along with the ‘undying fat whale golden core’ secured at the core, the current Song Shuhang could be said to have become a perfect organism.","Apart from not having ‘Heavenly Dao Authority,’ he was almost indistinguishable from the Heavenly Dao.","In this state, even if the myriad realms were obliterated, he could survive tenaciously, struggling into the start of a new era just like the Black Dragon World.","Moreover, with the main world bound to him, he could also enclose people he cared about plus the majority of Earth’s population into it, preserving them sealed away.","“Much better than I had imagined... at least, I have a way out,” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Of course, this way out is only for desperate situations.","Song Shuhang was not willing to put himself in such dire circumstances.","What he sought was to prove his Dao with Senior White and then transcend, thereafter resolving the regrets of the past and the calamities of the future in one breath!","“This miracle, piled up by everyone from the past, present, and future, will be continued by Senior White and me,” Song Shuhang clenched his fists.","He was well aware that he and Senior White were currently at the turning point of this ‘miracle’.","What he had to do was to not let this hard-won ‘miracle’ break apart but to make it continue onwards and become an undying legend!","Only this way, he wouldn’t let down the past and the future.","Song Shuhang slowly opened his eyes.","In his eyes, there was no hint of confusion, for he was clear about what he had to do next, what his goal was.","As Song Shuhang opened his eyes, in the vacuum of myriad practitioners in the universe, the illusory symphony of the Heavenly Dao’s complete retirement resounded—it was the bugle announcing the abdication.","At the same time, it also signaled the start of the ‘new Heavenly Dao contention’. Amidst this illusory symphony, immortals from myriad worlds could battle to seize the next tenure of Heavenly Dao, the victor glimpsing the secrets of the Great Way’s eternity.","In the past, all immortals would be moved at such a time.","Even those with no intention of competing for the Heavenly Dao would not miss such a grand event.","But this time, the hearts of immortals from myriad worlds were serene, undisturbed.","All eyes were on Tyrannical Song, silently waiting for Tyrannical Song to speak.","Tyrannical Song was now a ‘Heavenly Dao walking among mortals’. It was uncertain whether he still had any desire for the ‘Heavenly Dao seat’.","If Tyrannical Song had no intention of competing for the Heavenly Dao, that would truly mark the beginning of the ‘Heavenly Dao contention’.","If Tyrannical Song desired this Heavenly Dao seat, then nobody from myriad worlds would object—Tian Zhi’s shot hadn’t even pierced the outer membrane of Tyrannical Song’s eyeball. Had it been another immortal, they probably couldn’t even slice off a single hair from Tyrannical Song!","In the vacuum, that ethereal symphony marking the Heavenly Dao’s resignation ended.","Tyrannical Song finally spoke.","“Senior White, come out~ It’s our time next!” Song Shuhang squatted on the ground and gently tapped the surface.","The next moment, a spatial passage opened on the ground.","The handsome White stepped out of the spatial gate, patting his spotless clothes, first carefully checking the foot he put forward.","After ensuring it was firmly placed, he stepped forward with his second foot.","“Proving the Dao now?” Senior White asked.","“That’s right, now,” Song Shuhang nodded, raising his right hand towards Senior White.","Senior White stretched out his hand and lightly high-fived Song Shuhang.","Mo family Tian Zhi: “!!!”","From the exchange between Tyrannical Song and Senior White, he heard a shocking piece of news.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, you and Fellow Daoist White... are proving the Dao together?” Mo family Tian Zhi once again played the role of a ‘narrator’.","Such a thing was possible?","Initially, it seemed that Tyrannical Song intended to conquer the Heavenly Dao with a mortal body, but now it appears that Tyrannical Song is clearly planning to grind the dignity of the ‘Heavenly Dao seat’ into the ground.","According to the rules, there can be at most one person for each Heavenly Dao.","But Tyrannical Song insists on saying NO to this supreme rule."]},{"number":3110,"title":"Chapter 3110 - 3108: A Domination Secret Method, a Gift for the Beloved Tyrannical Song Contestant!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3110: Chapter 3108: A Domination Secret Method, a Gift for the Beloved Tyrannical Song Contestant!","This man was born to “break rules”.","His beginning mere actions included rubbing the rules of the Profound Sage Speech on the ground over and over again.","Afterward, he continuously broke the rules of the main world, the Netherworld Realm, and eternity.","Now, he would challenge the ultimate dignity of the realm of rules—the laws of the Heavenly Dao.","From today onwards, perhaps no rule in the myriad practitioners in the universe could bind this man—the only thing that could was himself.","The era that followed would be the era of Tyrannical Song.","A supreme immortal of the Mo family provided a non-diegetic commentary in his heart.","...","...","At the same time.","In an endless darkness.","A qualified figure pulling the strings, a Dark Giant suffering from all-nighters due to various reasons, was once again involuntarily awakened, and slowly three question marks emerged in his mind.","Sleep deprivation plus severe morning grumpiness made it irritable.","Buzz × 10!","What’s going on, why did I forcibly wake up again!","A moment later...","“The Will of the Heavens has abdicated?”","Another question mark rose in the mind of the figure pulling the strings.","What the hell?","According to the intelligence it had received... hadn’t the Will just assumed the position not long ago?","And yet, not long before, it had sensed the dominance of the current Wielder of the Will.","With the state of the current Wielder of the Will, it felt like there wouldn’t be any problems for billions of years.","Even, if nothing unexpected occurred, the current Wielder of the Will appeared to be the type to stay in the Heavenly Dao seat forever!","——This was the determination issued to the myriad practitioners in the universe by the implicit Will not so long ago.","Because of this, after rescuing the ‘Black Sun’, it assigned the task to the Immortal Daoist Body it “dominated” and then, as it couldn’t resist the urge to sleep, its background self gradually fell into deep slumber.","Its slumber state was a kind of “price”.","It was the heavy price paid for “freeing” itself from the Heavenly Dao seat back then.","Recharging for tens of millions of years, being active for a hundred years, and then, power-saving mode could sustain it a little longer against sleepiness.","This root problem was incurable and beyond healing.","Additionally, it’s worth mentioning that initially, its “awake time” could be longer, and the time it could be active after a full charge was more abundant than now. But later, because it angered a woman, under her various schemes, its active time after charging was at least halved.","Originally, it planned this time to have a good sleep to gather energy before coming out to make a big move, to push forward its grand plan.","But now... not even a month had passed, and the Heavenly Dao had abdicated?","Such an operation was crazy.","“What is going on with the thought processes of the recent Wielders of the Will?” It felt its state was awful.","Forced to wake up from an all-nighter, it had barely held up its exhaustion to complete the preparation work at hand, and it had barely returned to the cozy quilt ready to doze off for a while, but as soon as it fell asleep, it was forcibly awakened again.","This state was too miserable for words.","“Fortunately, I’ve finished storing energy for my ‘Domineering Secret Method’, and next, I can close my eyes and rest a bit longer... waiting for the upcoming ‘contestation for the Heavenly Dao’, hoping to fully rejuvenate before the next Wielder of the Will assumes a higher position.” The figure pulling the strings muttered to itself.","Its current state was very ominous.","It had to snatch every second to refresh itself before the contention for the Heavenly Dao concluded, to adjust its own condition.","Saying so, the Dark Giant once again closed its eyes, hastening to adjust its state.","But just as it had entered “adjustment mode,” something akin to an “alarm clock” function next to it emitted a jarring noise, jolting it from its “resting” state.","Dark Giant: “?”","At this moment, the weight of the question mark in its mind surpassed that of all previous question marks combined.","What happened again?","Wait a moment, let me wake up.","The first alarm clock’s sound marked the occasion of the “Heavenly Dao successor” being chosen.","The second, even more startling alarm clock, heralded that “someone was about to prove their Dao and achieve immortality,” a call for immediate action!","“Buzz what? Did my time just jump?” The Dark Giant’s emotions were in turmoil!","The mortal method of “let me sleep for five more minutes” actually worked on him as well?","Had the time passed by hundreds or even thousands of years while he just dozed off?","No... that’s not right.","There was no issue with the passage of time.","That means.","As soon as the “Heavenly Dao had stepped down,” someone immediately took over seamlessly and proved his immortality!","What’s going on here?","Where were all the immortals in the myriad practitioners in the universe?","Were they just for show?","No one stepped forward to prevent this newcomer from taking the Heavenly Dao seat?","They just watched as the target proved his Dao?","Is everyone’s desire for “eternity” really that low?","Even if it were Tyrannical Song trying to prove his Dao, immortals couldn’t possibly sit idly by, right?","I’m starting to understand this world less and less.","And what about... my Black Sun and Immortal Daoist manifestation? Why haven’t they reacted?","But no matter what, no matter how many doubts he had inside, he had to act.","Even if his own state was terrible, unendurable, with the other party about to start proving his Dao for immortality, if he didn’t act now, he would miss the chance.","So the Dark Giant struggled, using his will to resist the drowsiness surging up and with his tenacious will, he squeezed out of the endless dark, descending upon the main world.","He was the being who had failed time and time again, but was able to stand up over and over; a mere drowsiness, with will power, he could overcome!","After stealthily arriving, the Dark Giant faintly sensed the main world’s rejection of him.","“I don’t have much time, I must make it quick,” the Dark Giant thought to himself.","After infiltrating the main world, just like before, he utilized the Stealth Secret Method developed during his time as the Wielder of the Will, carefully concealing his figure, and then through spatial movement, he snuck into the location of the “new Heavenly Dao’s proof of Dao.”","When he quietly reached the destination, he noticed that the majority of immortals from the myriad practitioners in the universe had actually gathered in this tiny Gem Domain.","Next, he saw the candidate about to prove his Dao.","As expected, it was that “Tyrannical Song.”","But to his surprise... Tyrannical Song wasn’t alone in proving his Dao; by his side was another all too familiar scoundrel.","The beautiful White.","A big question mark emerged in the Dark Giant’s mind once again.","?","From the current scene, were these two about to prove their Dao together?","How could this be achieved?","More importantly...","If two were to prove their Dao together, whom should his “Domination Secret Method” be used on?","Should it be used on that scoundrel White? Or Tyrannical Song?","After hesitating for a moment, the Dark Giant quickly made a decision.","Is that even a question?","Of course, he’d choose Tyrannical Song!","Having been tricked by the handsome White so many times, he had no reason to chew on this tough bone.","So, without further thought—in fact, the situation didn’t allow for it.","He manipulated the secret techniques, sending a “Domination Secret Method” towards Tyrannical Song."]},{"number":3111,"title":"Chapter 3111 - 3109: What to Do When There’s Never Enough Time at Critical Moments?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3111: Chapter 3109: What to Do When There’s Never Enough Time at Critical Moments?","“What If”:","If the Dark Giant’s drowsiness wasn’t so profound, and his consciousness could be more alert to discover properly...","If the Dark Giant’s time wasn’t so urgent, giving him more time to ponder in detail...","Then, he would have noticed that there were quite a few issues with this instance of ‘Tyrannical Song + White proving their Dao’!","—Why, when the Heavenly Dao was about to step down, were all the immortals from the myriad practitioners in the universe gathered together?","—With so many immortals present, why did not a single one step forward to stop Tyrannical Song? No one could delay Tyrannical Song even for a moment. He was allowed to start proving his Dao the instant the Heavenly Dao abdicated?","—Moreover, having so many immortals converge in one place seemed like prep work for Tyrannical Song to ‘cut through the chaos with a swift stroke,’ stunning the audience in one breath, and rapidly proving his Dao!","Had he not been so drowsy, he would have noticed these issues at first glance!","Furthermore, if he had a little more time, he would have seen that at this moment, Tyrannical Song, from inside out, had transformed into a ‘Sub-immortal’ state, becoming a perfect being!","This condition was obviously very problematic!","Theoretically, even if the current Heavenly Dao helped Tyrannical Song with all its might, it would be impossible to enable him to achieve this ‘Full Body Semi-Immortal’ mode—this was, in fact, a minor restriction from the Heavenly Dao Authority.","Otherwise, each Heavenly Dao in office could create a ‘mini-immortal’ friend, and the world would have been in chaos long ago!","This state was not something that a single Heavenly Dao could achieve.","But Tyrannical Song had indeed gathered information from the second to eighth Heavenly Daos, as well as immortal information from an 8.5th Heavenly Dao!","This was simply an impossible miracle to accomplish!","Not every Heavenly Dao knew each other, and there were even feuds between some Heavenly Daos.","The idea of getting the Heavenly Daos of all eras to cooperate on creating such a ‘Sub-immortal being’ was utterly fanciful!","Yet Tyrannical Song had done just that!","Unfortunately...","Reality is harsh, it isn’t a composition, and there’s no “What If”.","Therefore, the Dark Giant, pushed to the limit by drowsiness and time, simply didn’t have the time to ponder more.","The little ‘thinking time’ he had was spent choosing between Tyrannical Song and the beautiful but tricky White.","An already prepared ‘Domination Secret Method’ fell silently upon Song Shuhang’s person.","It went smoothly.","The Dark Giant inwardly breathed a sigh of relief.","As with the states in which it had cast the ‘Domination Secret Method’ before, even an existence on the verge of proving his Dao couldn’t possibly notice its secret techniques.","After that, whether it would be both Tyrannical Song and the beautiful but tricky White proving their Dao together or just Tyrannical Song alone wouldn’t be a problem!","And even if Tyrannical Song were to fail at proving his Dao, and the beautiful but tricky White succeeded instead... its ‘Domination Secret Method,’ improved in the last Heavenly Dao era, could also transfer to the one proving his Dao, albeit with somewhat diminished effects.","[This time, there will no longer be any question...] As he thought this, waves of sleepiness bombarded the Dark Giant’s consciousness, and his mental processing began to slow.","[bly.] The Dark Giant muttered in his heart.","But just as this thought finally formed in his mind...an anomaly occurred on the opposite side!","Senior White and Song Shuhang, who were undergoing the ‘Dao-proving process,’ maintained their clapping posture.","Suddenly, Song Shuhang’s mouth curved up, revealing an evil smile.","For his honest, kindly good guy face to reveal such an evil smile was really not a small feat.","But he managed it!","With Song Shuhang’s smile, Senior White understood what was happening.","“Has the secret technique arrived?” Senior White asked.","“It has, I’ve waited quite a while for it,” Song Shuhang replied with a nod.","“Then I’ll help you form the handprints, inscribe the formations, and you’ll cooperate by casting,” Senior White extended his other hand, beginning to form the handprints for the ‘Reverse Dominating Secret Technique.’","—At this time, what Senior White held in one hand was Song Shuhang’s ‘primordial spirit projection,’ so as long as the two cooperated, Senior White could form the handprints on behalf of Song Shuhang.","Two beautiful runes condensed from the tips of White’s fingers, landing on Song Shuhang’s body.","Song Shuhang cooperated and began absorbing the ancient power of the Domination Secret Method from the Dark Giant, which had been refined and improved by the Seniors over tens of millions of years!","Although he couldn’t see where the Dark Giant was hiding, he was... thankful for the Domination Secret Method and the tens of millions of years of power that the Dark Giant had generously donated.","Once I and Senior White successfully complete ‘proving the Dao of two different individuals at the same time,’ you will have your share of the credit!","The Dark Giant hiding in the shadows was taken aback momentarily.","Its mind, which was running slowly due to intense drowsiness, was once again rudely awakened by the external stimulus—it was like a fatigued driver who had finally reached the destination after a long drive, only to let down his guard and crash the car into the wall of his own home, flipping over and waking up in an instant!","“My secret technique, is it being swallowed?”","“Wait... Tyrannical Song’s state?”","“No, I can’t let Tyrannical Song continue like this.”","The startled Dark Giant, although its thinking had become clearer, still didn’t have ‘time’ to ponder further.","Time is something that you never seem to value until it becomes crucial. And when that time comes, it becomes stingy, unwilling to give you even a moment more.","That’s the case with the Dark Giant, it’s short on time.","But now, its only choice is... to disrupt Tyrannical Song.","And the only way it can do that is with a single plan.","It must bring the Black Sun and the Immortal Daoist Body over and confront Tyrannical Song head-on.","Unless it wants to give up on Tyrannical Song’s era, it has no other choice.","This is a blatant plot.","And just in time, the Black Sun and the Immortal Daoist have also leaped across space!","The Black Sun is also in despair.","Ever since part of its ‘existence’ was swallowed by Tyrannical Song and White, its thinking has become clearer, its actions more cautious, and it prepares multiple contingency plans.","When it sensed that its sent ‘Void Sun Guardians, Stellar Doomsday Demon Skull’ died inside the Heavenly Dao Tomb, it knew something unexpected had happened there.","With caution, it prepared several plans to carefully probe the situation of the Gem Domain’s ‘Heavenly Dao Tomb.’","But while it was formulating its plans... it suddenly sensed that the Heavenly Dao had abdicated.","So, the cautious sun changed its policy and prepared new plans, facing the earth-shaking event of the ‘Heavenly Dao abdication,’ which shocked the myriad practitioners in the universe.","But while it was preparing new plans... it suddenly sensed someone was about to ‘prove immortality.’","Plans, it seems, can never keep up with changes.","Thus, the Black Sun reluctantly gathered a few magical treasures, armed itself with the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus,’ and together with the ‘Immortal Daoist’ body, rushed to the site of the Dao proving.","Upon arrival, it indeed saw Tyrannical Song and White.","Everything was as it had expected.","[Attack, attack Tyrannical Song with all your might, disrupt its casting] At that moment, a voice materialized in its mind.","It was the long-missed command from the ‘Heavenly Dao True Body.’","Moreover, this time it was a forced command.","It didn’t even give the sun time to think.","Its body moved, revealing its true form, and it spread out the ‘Immortal Sand,’ involuntarily blasting towards Tyrannical Song.","Following close behind, the Immortal Daoist is swinging that pot-sized fist, seemingly about to join it in confronting Tyrannical Song... but the position of the Daoist isn’t quite right.","The Daoist and it formed a straight line.","It’s like a line of spear-wielding soldiers, with Soldier A thrusting his spear towards the enemy.","Soldier B also thrust his spear.","But if not handled properly, Soldier B’s spear could very well mercilessly stab into Soldier A."]},{"number":3112,"title":"Chapter 3112 - 3110: The Fist of the Enemy Makes Me Stronger—Cultivation Chat Immortal Path, Begin!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3112: Chapter 3110: The Fist of the Enemy Makes Me Stronger—Cultivation Chat Immortal Path, Begin!","The attack from the Dark Sun arrived first at Song Shuhang and Senior White.","Immortal sand scattered and covered the sky, enveloping Song Shuhang’s figure.","Then, an endless barrage of sand, like raindrops, shot towards Song Shuhang and White’s location!","In this urgent moment, the Dark Sun didn’t even have time to unleash any large-scale skills or powerful lethal moves. Its task at this time was to interrupt Song Shuhang’s state.","Thus, it employed the most primitive yet most effective method of attack, calling forth all the immortal sand and launching an attack on Song Shuhang with the ‘immortal’ attribute.","Each grain of this immortal sand, a fragment of the Fourth Heavenly Dao, could easily destroy a solar system when bursting forth.","And at this moment, all the sand was focused fire on Tyrannical Song!","Even with Song Shuhang having condensed a ‘Sub-immortal Body’, facing such a bombardment, he would be in great pain!","Because the ‘immortality’ information grade of the other party was stronger than his, above him!","The powerful ‘immortal’ force would suppress the weaker ‘Sub-immortal’ state.","But...","The onslaught from the Dark Sun had only just begun when suddenly, a loud roar from the Immortal Daoist Body came from behind!","“Ah la ah la~ Ah la la la~” The Immortal Daoist Body roared and bellowed like a beast.","At the same time, his pair of iron fists pounded forward frantically!","He was indeed aiming his attacks at Tyrannical Song and White.","But the soldier A Dark Sun in front of him impeded his line of attack.","So the Dark Sun, with a confused look, was the first to suffer from this crazy barrage of punches!","The attack speed of the Immortal Daoist was several times faster than that of the Dark Sun... so his fists, though launched later, struck first. Before the Dark Sun’s assault reached Tyrannical Song and White, the fists of the Immortal Daoist had already slammed into the Dark Sun!","An unforgiving stabbing from an ally!","Boom boom boom~ Bang bang bang~","Violence! This sight was pure violence, fist to flesh, sending one’s blood racing with excitement!","In this moment, everyone could feel a momentum from the ‘Immortal Daoist’s’ fists—no one could stop him from striking Tyrannical Song!","Whoever stood before his fists would be smashed to pieces!","True grit, unyielding to the end!","Amidst the beastly roars of the Immortal Daoist, the sand particles transformed by the Dark Sun were punched tens of thousands of times and were forcibly exploded!","These tens of thousands of punches if converted into words, would be at least sixty pages worth!","After being pounded for a full sixty pages, the sand controlled by the Dark Sun was completely scattered, flung into every corner of ‘Paradise Space’!","The Dark Sun felt excruciating pain all over, with giant question marks popping up in its mind.","Was I hit?","Who hit me?","Why hit me?","All these changes happened in the blink of an eye.","Not only was the Dark Sun puzzled, but even Song Shuhang had a dumbfounded look on his face.","The Dark Giant of the Fourth Heavenly Dao hiding in the shadows closed his eyes in pain, his heart aching.","He had not anticipated that before the attack on Tyrannical Song, his own ‘Dark Sun Avatar’ and ‘Domination Immortal Daoist’ would end up fighting each other.","But fortunately... after the Immortal Daoist had exploded the ‘Dark Sun’, the attack did not stop.","“Ah la la la~” He continued to roar like a beast, his unmatched iron fists relentlessly smashing towards Tyrannical Song’s location.","Because of the speed of his fists, to the many Immortals watching, it was as if millions of punches were being thrown at Tyrannical Song in one breath!","Not even the Buddhist lost technique ‘Thousand-Handed Guanyin Fist’ could compare to one ten-thousandth of this!","Boom~~","The moment his fists made contact with Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Song was blown apart!","The exploding Song Shuhang turned into a ball of fire that rose up into the air.","And within that burst of flames, one could faintly see the figure of a flaming adult Sixteen.","Mister Tyrannical Song’s death-evading secret technique — Flame Substitute Technique!","This time, the blasted flaming Sixteen shivered uncontrollably, not daring to utter another word.","She had never imagined that, after disappearing for two months, the ‘enemy’ Mister Tyrannical Song faced had suddenly reached the ‘Immortal Existence’ level — the pinnacle!","She was just a pathetic monster with the ability to ‘invade the body of a cultivator’, and from her birth to now, she had never seen such an enormous scene.","The moment the Immortal Fist burst upon her and blew her apart, she almost felt like she was truly about to experience a ‘cruel death’, with even her existence mark being erased by the power of eternity.","But luckily, her ‘Life Line’ now resided in Mister Tyrannical Song.","After being blown up, as long as Mister Tyrannical Song performed the ‘Flame Substitute Technique’ again, she could come out.","[But I don’t want to come out at all, I was wrong, isn’t that enough?] At this moment, the flaming adult Sixteen was truly frightened — Mister Tyrannical Song, when you confront ‘immortals’ and defy the ‘Heavenly Dao’ in these ‘Big Boss level events’, can you please not drag me, a minor monster, into it?","“Ah la la la~” After blowing up the Flame Substitute, the Immortal Daoist did not stop.","His eyes blood-red, he locked onto Mister Tyrannical Song’s position again and charged like a wild ox!","This time, Song Shuhang did not use the Flame Substituting Technique or similar means to evade.","“Come on! Hit me!” Song Shuhang activated his four great body refining techniques.","The ‘Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique’ that had been deduced to the ultimate.","The mutated and further mutated ‘Mutated Steel Hand Technique’.","The ‘Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha’ strengthened by a Sage from Confucianism.","The ‘Liquid Golden Body’ with the added blessing of the fat ball.","This was the first time he had fully activated his defensive cultivation techniques since condensing the Sub-immortal State.","A rustling sound echoed.","The entire ‘Paradise Space’ above was instantly filled with innumerable monkeys.","A huge number that was impossible to count, even overlapping each other due to insufficient space in the ‘Paradise’, the army of Holy Apes manifested before everyone.","The Great Holy Ape, gifted by Senior White two, guarded the center.","The Holy Apes had bodies like the ‘fat ball’ with pitch-black liquid metal coating them, true dragons wrapped around their necks, and Confucian classics spread out in their hands.","“Hit me, come on and try to hit me!”","“If you don’t kill me, I’m going to kill you!”","“Today I have a wish, either I die by your hands, or I kill all of you!”","“English online translation: Hit_me!”","Thousands of Holy Apes spoke at the same time, taunting the Immortal Daoist.","And that wasn’t the end of it.","“Saber intent armor!”","“Big bone shards of Song Shuhang!”","“Empress made of light of virtue•Heavenly Court Projection Defense!”","Taking advantage of the brief ‘time’ gained by the ‘Flame Sixteen Replacement’, Song Shuhang set up layers upon layers of despair-inducing defense in one breath.","So many defenses, which all had the ‘Sub-immortal’ attribute boost.","If an Immortal Level existence tried to launch an attack, it might take years just to break through these defenses!","And it wasn’t until that moment.","Mr. Tian Zhi from the Mo family, Scholar Yue Ruhuo, Star Bear, and a few other Immortals finally reacted to the sudden events!","The changes that had just happened were too quick, so quick that even Immortals couldn’t keep up.","[Is this sand transformed from the Dark Sun, carrying the aura of eternity on it? Is it true immortality? Stronger than the eternity on Mister Tyrannical Song?]","[And who is this Immortal Daoist who keeps roaring like a beast?]","[Why are they attacking Mister Tyrannical Song?]","[Are they trying to interrupt Tyrannical Song’s process of ‘Proving pseudo-immortality’?]","[Could it be the shadowy figures behind the scenes manipulating ‘Heavenly Dao’, or even influencing ‘Heavenly Dao’?]","The waters of the myriad practitioners in the universe, how profound!","Those at the pinnacle of status among the Immortals seem to still have so much they do not understand!","“Those who can possess immortality, apart from Tyrannical Song’s kind of ‘pseudo-immortality’, are only the former Heavenly Dao.” Mister Tian Zhi from the Mo family began bleeding from his eyes from ‘directly gazing upon immortality’.","As expected, those ‘retired’ Heavenly Daos haven’t disappeared. Those Heavenly Dao still exist, hidden in the world in ways unknown to people.","And this time, Tyrannical Song’s ‘proving his Dao’ seems to have hurt the interests of a ‘past Heavenly Dao’, did the other party directly show their hand and take action against Tyrannical Song?","“The aura emanating from the Immortal Daoist and that of the fragments of the Dark Sun are different, are they two distinct ‘Heavenly Daos’?” Scholar Yue Ruhuo by now could no longer bear the strain, his body kneeling on the ground, his eyes seeming to split open.","Two Heavenly Daos, working together to deal with Tyrannical Song.","It was truly a dire situation within a dire situation.","Tyrannical Song, could he hold on?","This miraculous man, could he break out of this desperate situation?","“How laughable that I actually harbored the delusion of proving the Ninth Heavenly Dao.” Mister Tian Zhi from the Mo family covered his eyes in pain—if this time it wasn’t Tyrannical Song who was proving his Dao, but him instead... faced with a sudden attack from two ‘true immortals’, he probably would have been blasted to extinction on the spot.","Don’t lose, Tyrannical Song!","You are the man who defeated me, stand firm and upright against the attack, prove your immortality, and sweep all these guys into the trash heap of history!","Mister Tian Zhi’s consciousness began to blur, but he still struggled to maintain his intent—even if his eyeballs exploded, he wanted to see the end!","He wanted to witness Tyrannical Song prove his immortality with his own eyes!","Aside from Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family, among the other Immortals, a large number have already fallen into a state of blurred consciousness, falling to the ground one by one.","The release of immortal information by two different immortals at the same time, the effect was way more than just double.","At the entrance of the Heavenly Dao Tomb.","The Almighty Merchant clutched the sheet tightly, his consciousness firmly locked on the ‘Immortal Daoist’.","“Hold on, Tyrannical Song,” he murmured softly.","In such a situation, he actually had to place his hopes on someone he had blacklisted, and the emotions in the Almighty Merchant’s heart were incredibly complicated.","But now, all he could hope for was that Tyrannical Song could hold on—the ‘Virtuous Seed’ he had given to Tyrannical Song would surely sprout one day!","...","...","“Ah-la-ah-la~ Ah-la-la~” The Immortal Daoist paused slightly, the next moment he swung his fist again, stirring the wind with his punches, and began to bombard the position where Song Shuhang was located like mad!","His punches covered a wide area.","The previously blown away Dark Sun tried to fly back but found no opportunity to get involved. The sand it controlled, if it got even a little closer, would be blown away by the ‘Ah-la-la’ fists of the Immortal Daoist!","If it weren’t for the fact that the Immortal Daoist’s punches were so solid, without any holding back, the Dark Sun would have suspected that this guy was an undercover, specifically targeting it.","Bang, bang, bang~","The ‘Heavenly Court Projection Defense’ held up by the virtuous lamia was shattered, and after shattering, all the light of virtue was added to Song Shuhang’s body, enhancing his state.","Immediately following, half of the body made of ‘Slow-Witted Song’s Big Bone Shards’ was also forcefully exploded—the entire process happened almost without any time difference.","As the Immortals watched intently, they saw the ‘projection of the Heavenly City’ and ‘Slow-Witted Song’s Big Bone Shards’ being wiped out almost simultaneously!","Too frightening, this is the fist of a true ‘Immortal’.","Without defense of the same level, there is simply no way to withstand a single blow!","Then, Song Shuhang’s ‘saber intent armor’ also couldn’t hold up.","After Song Shuhang’s ‘energy’ transformed into ‘Sub-immortal Power’, the saber intent armor also strengthened to the same level.","But it still couldn’t withstand a few punches and was blown to pieces.","The Immortals who still retained consciousness, upon seeing this scene, felt a chill in their hearts.","Even the terrifying Tyrannical Song, when facing true immortality, was retreating step by step, apparently without a chance of victory.","[Hurry up, hurry up and prove your immortality!] Mister Tian Zhi clenched his fists hard.","“Stop trying to ‘ascend together,’ even if it’s just one of us who needs to ascend to get through this wave!” someone among the Immortals thought anxiously.","Boom, boom, boom~","The Immortal Daoist’s fists crazily smashed down.","All of Song Shuhang’s other defenses were also shattered in one breath.","In the end, only his body tempering technique and a sub-immortal fleshly body remained.","“Senior White, take good care of yourself,” Song Shuhang said in a deep voice.","He transferred Sixteen, Pavilion Master Chu’s dumb hair, the white dragon sister’s scarf, Scarlet Heaven Sword, and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet to Senior White first.","Even the fat ball cloak belonging to Song Shuhang was transferred.","At the same time, his body hugely expanded, becoming a small giant.","With the body tempering technique fully operational, his muscles bulged all over.","After turning into a small giant, Song Shuhang protected Senior White and all the seniors.","“You’re not going to dodge?” Pavilion Master Chu’s dumb hair asked with some concern.","“As long as the enemy’s fist can’t kill me in one hit, it will only make me stronger!” Song Shuhang revealed a reliably charming smile, “Trust me.”","His words were not only for Senior White and Pavilion Master Chu, but also for sending his conviction to the end of time.","Trust me, rely on me!","“Ah la, ah la, ah la~” The fists of the Immortal Daoist finally mercilessly struck Song Shuhang’s back.","A true clash between immortality and sub-immortality!","Boom~","The collision of fist and body rang out like a large bell.","This sound was like the sound of the Great Way—no, it was even higher level than that. This was the collision of Great Way against Great Way!","After officially contacting Song Shuhang, the Immortal Daoist’s fist quietly underwent some changes.","Rather than concentrating, the fist dispersed and hammered every corner of Song Shuhang’s body.","If one observed closely, they could see the Immortal Daoist’s fist landing on the ‘junctions’ of each of the ‘2-8.5’ Heavenly Dao immortal information within Song Shuhang’s body.","These places were the weak points in Song Shuhang’s ‘Sub-immortal Body’!","Even without consciousness, the Immortal Daoist’s body could still find the ‘weak points’ and execute a deathly hit within a short time.","The black sun who had been knocked away felt somewhat satisfied after seeing this scene.","One moment, two moments, three moments...","‘Sub-immortal’ blood was forced out from Song Shuhang’s body, and his sub-immortal body was marked with fist imprints.","“Is this an Immortal’s fist?” At this moment, Song Shuhang turned around.","It hurt so much!","If this continued, wouldn’t his body be pounded into a lump?","“It hurts, but it’s not that painful. It’s not enough, I have endured pain that is perhaps a hundred times worse than this.” After turning around, Song Shuhang started to counterattack!","❮Basic Buddhist Fist Technique❯—Meteor Punch!","Fist against fist, brutality against brutality, strength against strength!","Not only that.","“Self-corpse!” Song Shuhang mentally called out.","The silent projection of his self-corpse appeared behind him.","“Saint’s secret technique, the Immortal Path, transfer!” The Sage Eye Golden Core in his cheat lit up.","Parts of the ‘light of virtue and karmic ties’ from Song Shuhang’s Immortal Path were sacrificed and some fragments of the Immortal Path were transferred to his self-corpse.","Because the time was ripe.","“Cultivation Chat Immortal Path 100%!”","“Activate!”"]},{"number":3113,"title":"Chapter 3113 - 3111: The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s VIP-Level Backup Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3113: Chapter 3111: The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s VIP-Level Backup Plan","As Song Shuhang shouted, a tsunami-like sound emitted from the path to immortality that enveloped him.","The light of virtue and the rules of karmic immortality burned intensely...","The Sage’s “Confucian Classic” was summoned, appearing behind Song Shuhang.","The Confucian Saint Eye Golden Core began to transform—since the Saint Eye Golden Core had already transformed into a sub-immortal, and with the ‘Immortal Fat Whale Whale Pill’ silently supporting it from behind, this time the Golden Core did not melt but slightly shrank in size, only to quickly regain its plumpness!","Immediately afterward, the ‘Immortal’s Full Moon’ above Song Shuhang’s head began to dim.","Some of the immortals who were powerful enough to remain conscious, enduring the severe pain in their eyes as they continued to watch the battle, were puzzled by this scene.","What is Tyrant Song doing?","“Is he switching his path to immortality?” someone suddenly realized.","This wasn’t the first time Tyrant Song had done this.","Previously, he had performed the ‘changing the path to immortality as if changing clothes’ trick in front of the myriad practitioners in the universe, utilizing the leftover momentum of the ‘Profound Sage Speech’.","Facing the direct bombardment of two ‘immortal-level great foes’ at this critical juncture, Tyrant Song was actually starting to change his path to immortality again!","The immortals still awake were stunned by Tyrant Song’s audacious move.","[The path to immortality of virtue and karma still can’t satisfy Tyrant Song?]","[Is switching to a new path to immortality at this time like handicapping oneself? After all, a brand new path to immortality surely can’t be as handy as the old one, right?]","While pondering, the Tyrant Song in front of them had already completed the ritual while fiercely brawling with the ‘Immortal Daoist.’","This time, he transferred the inheritance right of the ‘Confucian Saint’s Talent’ into the “Confucian Classic.”","Once Daoist Senior utilized his backup move and completed his resurrection, he could inherit the ‘innate ability’ of the Confucian Saint.","Daoist Senior had helped him a lot, so Song Shuhang chose to let the ‘Confucian Saint’s Talent’ return to Confucianism and be given to Daoist Senior.","—This was the way Song Shuhang interacted with Confucianism.","Song Shuhang always felt that Confucianism had greatly helped him, so within his capabilities, he always tried to support Confucianism as much as possible.","On the other hand, Confucianism felt that Tyrant Song’s kindness to them was immense, believing in repaying even the smallest favor heavily; they also always went out of their way to assist Tyrant Song.","After securing the inheritance right of the saint’s talent, his self-corpse, carrying the fragments of ‘virtue and karma’s path to immortality,’ directly used a ‘disposable flying sword’ to send himself into the small black room of the Heavenly Dao.","From then, all three of Song Shuhang’s corpses entered the world of the small black room.","But at this time, Song Shuhang hadn’t forgotten his ‘three corpses.’","After becoming ‘sub-immortal’ throughout his body, he developed a slight immunity to the effects of the Heavenly Dao’s small black room.","Moreover, the final step of cultivating the immortal path still required communicating with the ‘three great immortality method fragments’ on his three corpses, using these three great fragments to complete the connection between Song Shuhang and the ‘myriad realms’!","The ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ is not a solitary path to immortality.","This is an extremely regulated path to immortality that connects everyone together!","“While he sacrifices his path to immortality, while he is weak, kill him!” the Black Sun shouted loudly.","This time, it didn’t use ‘Immortal Sand’ to approach Tyrant Song, but from a distance, it condensed a destruction-level halo, extended its palm, and pushed it toward Tyrant Song.","This halo contained the ‘Fourth Heavenly Dao Immortal Power,’ which could cut through anything that wasn’t truly ‘immortal’—even Tyrant Song’s ‘sub-immortal’ state was no exception!","But before its halo could strike, the ‘Immortal’s Full Moon’ above Song Shuhang’s head brightened once again.","And... it became brighter than before!","Even though it was only the full moon, it now emitted a brilliance like the rising sun, with the moon itself evolving towards the sun!","This phenomenon indicated one thing—Tyrant Song’s new path to immortality no longer belonged to the ‘paths to immortality.’","This was an entirely transcendent path beyond the ‘path to immortality’ level!","The ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ loading progression 100%!","Loading complete!","Boom~","At this moment, a ‘resonant sound’ simultaneously arose in every realm and plane of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","This was the world, resounding to herald the birth of Ultimate Tyrannical Song!","This resonant sound was perceptible to every cultivator in the myriad practitioners in the universe.","“It’s Shuhang.”","“It’s Senior Brother Song.”","“Senior Song.”","“Ah Song.”","“It’s the host of the junior sister, foolish foolish, dumby dumby Song!”","The seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, juniors like Shi Zhu and Guoguo, members of the Confucianist sect, members of the Spirit River Su Clan, and many others, all felt something stirring within them.","Even ordinary people who had come into contact with Song Shuhang found themselves moved.","“The world is resonating for Shuhang?” Gao Moumou and several roommates voiced their confusion.","Moreover, some of Song Shuhang’s classmates and teachers mysteriously began to recall the name ‘Song Shuhang’, and his image appeared before them.","“Strange, why am I suddenly thinking of Shuhang?” his former classmates and teachers wondered to themselves.","Some of Shuhang’s relatives and family members also found themselves unconsciously recalling how Shuhang looked from his childhood to adulthood.","At this moment, they all shared a peculiar feeling.","The world was dancing for Shuhang!","The individual named ‘Song Shuhang’ had become the center of the world at this moment!","...","...","In Paradise Space.","The resonating effect of the world was even more terrifying.","‘Time and space’ around Song Shuhang seemed to twist and distort.","Time around Tyrannical Song appeared to slow down!","All attacks and space spells targeting Song Shuhang were slowed down by the twisted time.","This effect resembled the ‘transformation time’ often seen in movies or animation.","The myriad practitioners in the universe cooperated with Tyrannical Song, twisting time, to create a Divinity Platform for his ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path 100%’!","—This terrifying ‘Cultivation Chat Path to Immortality’ had just been perfected, and it immediately began to affect everything around Song Shuhang!","Tyrannical Literature flew behind Song Shuhang.","Countless threads spread out from behind Song Shuhang, reaching into the myriad practitioners in the universe and the Netherworld Realm.","Afterward, the phantoms of the universe in the myriad practitioners in the universe materialized behind Song Shuhang.","One universe after another operated behind Song Shuhang.","Then, the phantoms of powerful beings flashed behind Song Shuhang, stepping out from the Myriad Realms Universe.","A one-eyed mysterious existence, a one-legged striped dragon, a pitch-black sun, a Fairy who became reincarnation itself, a Daoist of virtue, White holding a white horse, Senior White, a chubby metallic ball, Daozi of the Confucian sect, Lady Kunna whose hair seemed to be thinning, a Confucian Sage, the Heavenly Emperor’s child...","When these phantoms appeared, the ‘holy apes’ under the leadership of the Holy Ape forcefully squeezed together, managing to create space for these powerful phantoms to show themselves!","A series of ‘showing their divinity’ phantoms then took the stage, and only then did the feeling of ‘time distortion’ start to gradually recede.","Song Shuhang’s body paused for a moment.","Directly in front of him.","The roaring of the Immortal Daoist did not cease, and his fists continued to pound against Song Shuhang’s body—however, this time, his fists no longer tore through Tyrannical Song’s ‘Sub-immortal’ body.","Now, every punch that landed seemed to be refining the ‘connection points’ when they hit the ‘2-8.5 Heavenly Dao’ immortal information ‘connection points’, making these connections seem as though they were being tempered.","Under the influence of the 100% Cultivation Chat Path to Immortality, the existing ‘connection points’ perfectly merged into one!","Across from him, the corners of the Immortal Daoist’s mouth quickly twitched into a faint smile.","This smile vanished in a flash—neither the Dark Sun nor the Fourth Heavenly Dao behind the scenes noticed it.","After that smile, the roars of the Immortal Daoist grew even louder.","His punches intensified!","Boom, boom, boom—","Each punch seemed like it could hammer out Tyrannical Song’s kidneys.","With each heavy punch, thunderous noises erupted from Song Shuhang’s body.","But... with each punch, Tyrannical Song grew stronger and more formidable!","Hum—","As the Immortal Daoist bombarded him relentlessly, the “Light Wheel” that the Dark Sun had slashed from afar finally reached Song Shuhang after the “time distortion” ended.","The force of the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s immortal severing hadn’t touched him yet, but the sharp intent alone caused Song Shuhang’s “Sub-immortal” skin to tingle painfully!","Just then, the “Sub-immortal Power” within Song Shuhang reacted directly against the power of the Fourth Heavenly Dao!","The Sub-immortal Power within Song Shuhang was reinforced by the Immortal Power of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy and possessed the information of the Fifth Heavenly Dao.","At that moment, stimulated by the power of the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s immortal force, the “Sub-immortal Power” within Song Shuhang burst out frenziedly.","Reincarnation and the power of Time surged continuously within Song Shuhang.","The just-ended state of “distorted time and space” underwent another change.","In that instant.","In Song Shuhang’s eyes, time seemed to stop!","The Immortal Daoist constantly punching him and the “Fourth Heavenly Dao Immortal Light Wheel” about to slash him all came to a near halt.","[Is this some kind of secret technique effect from the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy?]","In this frozen time, the only ones who could move were him and Sixteen!","Song Shuhang turned and looked at Sixteen.","Their eyes met, and without words, they understood each other’s intentions.","Sixteen stepped out from beside Senior White and placed her delicate hand on Song Shuhang’s large one.","Her body transformed into a supreme godly weapon.","However... this was just the beginning.","“Lend me your power, Reincarnation Blade Ancestor,” Sixteen silently prayed in her heart.","Her form changed, and in an instant, she transformed into the “Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade.”","Bang—","The burst of Sub-immortal Power in Song Shuhang ended, and the effect of ‘time stop’ dispersed.","The Immortal Daoist hammered out the last two punches, hitting Song Shuhang in the waist and smashing him some distance away...","This distance, however, just opened up the space between Song Shuhang and the “Fourth Heavenly Dao Immortal Halo.”","“It’s you!” The voice of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy resounded.","She clearly recognized the aura of the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s immortal power on the opposite side.","“Tyrannical Song, hold me tight... I’ll perform a saber technique for you!” The voice of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy echoed in Song Shuhang’s mind.","Song Shuhang gripped the Reincarnation Blade Fairy with one hand, silently channeling his power to collaborate with the Fairy.","At the same time, the brilliance of the “Saber-Nurturing Technique” in the palm of his hand flashed past, instantly entering a state of ‘human-saber fusion’ with the Reincarnation Blade Fairy, allowing for a more seamless cooperation.","The scabbard of the Reincarnation Blade sprang open, landing in Song Shuhang’s other hand.","Simultaneously, her blade swung, evolving into a very bizarre saber technique...","When this strike was made, the body of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy twisted into a circle, transforming into a cycle of reincarnation and meeting the opposing ‘Immortal Halo’ head-on.","As soon as the Reincarnation Blade touched the Immortal Cutting Halo, the latter entered a cycle of reincarnation, looping continuously.","A moment later.","The Immortal Halo broke free from the cycle of reincarnation... and counterattacked towards the distant Black Sun!","This strike was highly targeted.","It was clearly developed by the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy during her tenure, specifically to target the Fourth Heavenly Dao.","This blade does not ferry across worlds; it simply opens a VIP passage within ‘reincarnation’ solely for the Fourth Heavenly Dao.","Anything related to the ‘Immortal Power of the Fourth Heavenly Dao’ would be swept into this cycle of reincarnation, take a round in the VIP reincarnation passage, and be reformed!","The opposing Black Sun, under intense pressure, quickly condensed several smaller ‘Immortal Halos’ and slashed towards the rebellious ‘Great Halo’.","“Is this also one of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s contingencies?” Song Shuhang thought.","“This is just one of tens of thousands of contingencies of my true form... Next step, Shuhang, summon the Reincarnation Seal. We’ve finally caught this guy; the VIP reincarnation passage has long been prepared for him,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy responded with a thought.","Song Shuhang clutched the ‘Reincarnation Blade•Ah Sixteen’ tightly.","In the next instant, he activated the ‘human-saber fusion’ mode with greater force.","A dazzling radiance enveloped Song Shuhang and the ‘Reincarnation Blade’ in his hand.","After the halo faded...","Song Shuhang and Reincarnation Blade•Ah Sixteen vanished, replaced by a gigantic seal.","“Senior White!” Song Shuhang called out.","Without needing Song Shuhang’s reminder, the mentally synchronized Senior White had already stepped forward, placing his hand on the ‘Reincarnation Seal’ and pushing hard.","The enormous Reincarnation Seal, breaking through the limits of space, instantly appeared above the Black Sun’s head, stamping down ferociously.","Just as the Black Sun had neutralized its own ‘Great Halo,’ it looked up to see the Reincarnation Seal.","Within the vast Reincarnation Seal, a beautiful fairy slowly opened her eyes.","After the fairy opened her eyes, she emerged from the seal.","She transformed into a gigantic phantom and personally handled the seal.","With the immortal power of the Fifth Heavenly Dao, she pressed down on the ‘Reincarnation Seal,’ forcefully smashing it.","Boom~~","The entire ‘Paradise World’ was directly obliterated!","The space, reinforced by Daozi during his tenure, finally could not withstand and shattered into fragments.","All the ‘Immortal Sand’ of the Black Sun was suppressed by the ‘Reincarnation Seal,’ unable to move.","The power of the Reincarnation Seal was furiously activated.","This immortal sand, grain by grain, was transported into the VIP passage opened by the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy, entering an infinite cycle of reincarnation.","If the immortal sand cannot be destroyed, then let it cycle through reincarnation endlessly.","As for when it might be released?","That would depend on the mood of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy!","The ‘Fourth Heavenly Dao’ Dark Giant, hiding in the shadows and witnessing this scene, finally could not sit still anymore.","If all the immortal sand were forced into the VIP reincarnation passage, it would have a tremendous impact on him.","But just as he was about to intervene...","The process of ‘proving his Dao’ by the Heavenly Dao completed!","Senior White’s form began to ascend.","The Reincarnation Seal also began to rise, forcing Song Shuhang to free himself from the ‘Reincarnation Seal’..."]},{"number":3114,"title":"Chapter 3114 - 3112: Is This the Last Defiance of the Laws of the Heavenly Dao?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3114: Chapter 3112: Is This the Last Defiance of the Laws of the Heavenly Dao?","Yes, it was too fast!","Tyrannical Song and that handsome scoundrel should have jointly proven their Dao... Logically, proving the Dao should take even longer.","But it didn’t!","Even under normal circumstances when the Heavenly Dao begins to prove the Dao, and until the proving process completes, it requires a certain amount of time.","In the past, the Fourth Heavenly Dao ‘Dark Giant’ suffered in this respect—the handsome scoundrel, halfway through the lengthy ‘proving process,’ suddenly quit and then passed the ‘Heavenly Dao seat’ to Daoist Priest Virtue.","But now, Tyrannical Song and the handsome scoundrel, proving the Dao together, not only did not extend the time of the ‘proving process,’ but significantly shortened the proving time.","From start to finish, it took roughly only about one-third of the normal Heavenly Dao ‘proving process’ time!","At this moment, the Fourth Heavenly Dao ‘Dark Giant’ felt the world’s profound malice towards it.","Its gaze, unwillingly, fell upon Tyrannical Song and the handsome scoundrel, who had both ‘completed proving the Dao.’","...","At this time, Song Shuhang’s body detached from that ‘Reincarnation Seal’ state.","A portion of the ‘immortal sand’ was sent into the VIP reincarnation channel opened by the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy—unfortunately, because Song Shuhang’s proving process concluded early, the Reincarnation Seal’s ‘VIP cycle Soul Ferrying’ skill was interrupted, so the immortal sand of the Dark Sun, along with some remnants, still existed in the world.","After being pulled out of the Reincarnation Seal, Song Shuhang immediately transferred Sixteen to the main world to keep her away from any potential threats.","Along with the pendants on him and the pendants that had been transferred to Senior White and the others previously, all were moved to the main world.","—Now it was time to enter the ‘Heavenly Dao Rules Core’ process, and he could no longer carry the pendants on him.","Even his life-bound magical treasure could only remain in the dantian during this phase.","Senior White’s Meteor Sword was likewise retracted into the space of the dantian.","Next, Song Shuhang and Senior White began to ascend.","This scene was projected to myriad practitioners in the universe.","It let all cultivators in Myriad Realms + Netherworld Realm know that a new Heavenly Dao had been born!","...","The Fourth Heavenly Dao ‘Dark Giant’ felt unwillingness, but the other party had already completed the ‘proving process’ and was in a mode of ‘about to wield the Will,’ making them no longer susceptible to external interference.","It could only stare at Tyrannical Song, unable to intervene anymore.","After staring at Tyrannical Song for a while... its sleepy, tired brain suddenly had a flash of insight.","It guessed the main reason Tyrannical Song and the handsome scoundrel were so quick.","—It was due to the peculiar ‘Sub-immortal’ state on Tyrannical Song’s body, filled with ‘Heavenly Dao-level information.’","Because his body had already prematurely entered ‘sub-immortalization,’ that is, during the ‘Immortal’ segment, he had actually completed much of the time needed by the ‘proving process.’","That’s why his proving time was so short.","As for the handsome scoundrel next to him, there’s even less to discuss; that fellow is full of tricks.","According to the Fourth Heavenly Dao ‘Dark Giant’s’ memory, this was the third time the handsome scoundrel participated in the ‘proving’ segment.","The speed of proving from that guy, even if twice faster, wouldn’t surprise the Dark Giant at all.","[But luckily...]The only consolation for the Dark Giant was that Tyrannical Song had not completely deciphered his ‘Domination Secret Method.’ The effects of the Domination Secret Method were still settling inside him.","Although the results might be slightly poor, the secret method’s energy was still present.","As long as the secret method took effect, it could buy him time.","Just as it was thus pondering, it suddenly saw Tyrannical Song, ascending, starting a new maneuver—he began forming two formation runes.","Although they were just simple two runes, the spell that they composed was extremely familiar to the ‘Dark Giant.’","It was the Domination Secret Method!","In the ‘Dark Giant’s’ sleepiness-filled brain, a huge question mark popped up.","It wasn’t mistaken, nor hallucinating... it was its Domination Secret Method!","And it was a simplified and improved version!","Why did Tyrannical Song know its Domination Secret Method?","“My Domination Secret Method, when exactly was it leaked?”","On careful thought, from beginning to end, Tyrannical Song seemed to have been guarded against his ‘Domination Secret Method.’","Moreover, he could ‘reverse’ the effects of his Domination Secret Method.","Obviously from the beginning, he might have known of its existence and had been guarding against it.","“Every time I executed the ‘Domination Secret Method,’ I was never detected, and amongst all the predecessors of the Heavenly Dao, no one had ever discovered my Domination Secret Method.”","“I had never had any contact with Tyrannical Song before... wait, a reincarnation of the Confucian Sage?”","Could this guy really be the Confucian Saint?","The very culprit who, during the last battle of the Heavenly Dao, caused him countless sleepless millenniums, ultimately leading to severe sleep deprivation?","If that’s really the case, it might indeed make sense.","But now, what exactly was Tyrannical Song trying to do suddenly using ‘Domination Secret Method’?","Whom did he intend to use it on?","He wasn’t planning to use it on me, was he?","The Dark Giant of the Fourth Heavenly Dao felt a pang of anxiety.","At this moment, Tyrannical Song stretched out his hand and pointed... and the target of the casting was that beautiful good-for-nothing!","“???”","The somewhat befuddled brain of the Dark Giant couldn’t figure out this possibility no matter how hard he thought.","Tyrannical Song actually used the ‘Domination Secret Method,’ cultivated over millions of years, on the beautiful good-for-nothing who was proving his Dao together with him?","What kind of bewildering maneuver was this? It was enough to make one pull their hair out.","And, the beautiful good-for-nothing on the other side didn’t resist and accepted the effects of the ‘Domination Secret Method’ entirely.","But at the same time, he also began operating the ‘reverse Domination Secret Method’ within him.","A moment later.","The beautiful good-for-nothing turned around and reapplied the ‘Domination Secret Method’ on Tyrannical Song.","However, the ‘Domination Secret Method’ energy inside him only consumed half, and the other half remained with him.","As a result, with the ‘Domination Secret Method’ as a connection, the ‘link’ between Tyrannical Song and that beautiful good-for-nothing became even more robust, unbreakable.","Although the two individuals remained ‘distinct entities,’ through various methods they were bundled together, becoming a buy-one-get-one ‘same existence.’","“Buzz!” The Dark Giant finally understood.","Having understood, he felt like someone had stabbed him in the heart, the discomfort unbearable.","The energy of the ‘Domination Secret Method’ that he had painstakingly accumulated over millions of years was just used by these two individuals, making all his millennia of effort others’ wedding garments?","You perform face-to-face NTR on my ‘Domination Secret Method’s power, have you considered my feelings?","Am I just a tool?","“But, it’s not completely over yet!”","“You think you can prove your Dao, but there’s one last hurdle ahead.”","“You are two different entities trying to prove your Dao simultaneously, which is different from all past Heavenly Daos.”","“Even if the ‘proving Dao process’ is completed, but at the last step of accepting the ‘Heavenly Dao Authority’ and ‘Immortal Incarnation,’ if the laws of the Heavenly Dao sense that you are two distinct entities, a rejection is bound to occur.”","“Without passing the last test, you might not succeed!”","“Perhaps, both of you could meet a cruel death!”","The Dark Giant glared fiercely at Tyrannical Song and the beautiful good-for-nothing, who were in the midst of ascension.","In this brief period, he had no mood to cause more troubles.","Whether Tyrannical Song and the beautiful good-for-nothing could overcome the last hurdle was what he and all beings in the myriad realms needed to focus on.","Moreover, as a being who once was a ‘Heavenly Dao’ and had even attempted transcendence, he saw deeper into the act of ‘two individuals proving their Dao together’ carried out by Tyrannical Song and the beautiful good-for-nothing.","“Could they be aiming for transcendence?” Within the depths of the Dark Giant’s heart, such a thought surged.","The more it thought about it, the more it felt this was a possibility.","The authority of the Heavenly Dao was like a rope, firmly tying each generation of the Heavenly Dao, preventing it from transcending, trapping it within the “myriad practitioners in the universe,” unable to fully surpass time, unable to eliminate the obsession and karma of the past.","But what if there were two Heavenly Daos online at the same time?","Could it be that one of them could take over all the ropes, and then let the other Heavenly Dao become a free bird, breaking away from the ropes and the cage?","In the mind of the Dark Giant, two images mysteriously emerged.","One was Tyrannical Song with a smile, extending his right hand—on his right hand, there was a handsome troublemaker with wings on his back, like a bird yet like a butterfly, achieving true great freedom, soaring high.","The other was that handsome troublemaker, making a decision at the last moment. He slightly bent down, untied the rope tied to Tyrannical Song’s feet, tied the rope to himself, and then opened the cage, sending Tyrannical Song away.","[Could it be, I was wrong?]","[Could it be, this is the correct posture for transcendence?]","No, it’s still too early to say!","Whether Tyrannical Song and that handsome troublemaker could withstand the final test, no one could say for sure.","After a brief thought, the Dark Giant, bracing against his fatigue, stretched out his hand and summoned back the remaining “Immortal Sand”!","“The Domination Secret Method was used by the opposition, and moreover, they have become vigilant towards the Domination Secret Method. Although the ‘Domination Secret Method’ still has many loopholes that might be exploited by me... it’s not wise to place too much hope on this.”","“So, what I can do now is to make a final gambit.”","“If you are indeed aiming for ‘transcendence’, then let’s see who can transcend first.”","Whether you transcend before me, or I transcend before you.","Without dominating and remotely influencing the Heavenly Dao, forcefully initiating my transcendence plan is very risky.","But considering that the opposition might be aiming for ‘transcendence’, he couldn’t keep waiting.","What if the opposition transcends and enters a higher dimension, where time and space are no longer ‘restrictions’ for them, who knows what they could achieve?","That would be a level that no one had ever reached before, and even going back to the past and targeting the past him is not impossible.","Perhaps he has the ‘Immortal’ enhancement, and the opposition might not be able to do anything to him. But if the opposition ‘transcends’, that would mean that he, will have no more chances.","So, no matter how great the risks, there is no turning back.","This generation’s Tyrannical Song and handsome troublemaker, from beginning to end, did not give him a chance to choose.","Luckily... at least now, he has an ‘Immortal Daoist’ body in his hands, which can suppress some of the risks associated with the ‘Transcendence Plan’.","However, in using the ‘Immortal Daoist body,’ he still needed to be wary of its condition.","The Domination Secret Method had been cracked, so the state of the Immortal Daoist could not be fully trusted. When using it, he must be careful!","After making up his mind, the Dark Giant left behind a grain of ‘Immortal Sand’ to continue to witness the outcome of Tyrannical Song and the handsome troublemaker.","At the same time, he took the Immortal Daoist and directly vanished without a trace.","What followed was a race.","He, at all costs, was going to make this ‘myriad practitioners in the universe’ become the past—and it must be an irreversible past.","Not like before, when the Immortal Daoist slashed the karma and started the entirety of the myriad practitioners in the universe anew!","Better still, would be to complete all this before Tyrannical Song and the handsome troublemaker transcended.","And then see who transcends first.","...","...","At the end of their ascent.","Song Shuhang and Senior White stood side by side.","As the Dark Giant speculated, Song Shuhang and Senior White were facing their final test.","Normally, to prove immortality through the Heavenly Dao, after completing the ‘proving process,’ it’s supposed to be the stage where one enters the ‘Heavenly Dao Rules Core,’ receives the Heavenly Dao Authority, and forges an immortal body—a step that can be completed lying down.","But Song Shuhang and Senior White were different, they were two separate individuals, proving their Dao simultaneously.","Throughout the ages, this had never happened before!","The laws of the Heavenly Dao may cause repulsion between two entities.","“We have done all we could,” Senior White said, glancing at Song Shuhang.","The two had theoretically completed all the prerequisites for ‘two distinct individuals achieving Dao simultaneously’ through ‘Primordial Spirit Cutting’ + ‘Confucianism Saint’s Innate Secret Technique’ + ‘Domination Secret Method’.","What could be done had been pushed to the limit!","“Hmm,” Song Shuhang nodded.","The final step of whether he and Senior White could ‘transcend’ was approaching.","After striving for so long... this was the moment they had been waiting for.","If successful, the past and the future, whether it be grievances, resentments, or obsessive fixations, would be resolved through either him or Senior White.","If they failed... then at least one of them between him and Senior White must achieve an immortal proofing.","Then, they must suppress ‘Dark Sun’ and the hidden ‘Dark Giant’ of the Fourth Heavenly Dao tightly, preventing it from causing trouble during the Ninth Heavenly Dao reincarnation period!","But...","“We will not fail,” Song Shuhang declared confidently, and failure was not an option.","After succeeding, the next step would be transcendence!","“Time passes so quickly, yet it seems so slow,” Senior White said, no longer suppressing his menacing charm.","At this moment, he was completely relaxed.","The sensation of the world seeming to turn into black and white, with only Senior White in color, descended once again.","But this time... Song Shuhang did not turn into black and white.","Because by now, he had grown enough to stand shoulder to shoulder with Senior White.","“Are you ready?” Senior White asked.","“I have been ready,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Boom~~”","In the perception of Song Shuhang and Senior White, the world shook.","A dimension that only the ‘Heavenly Dao’ could step into opened its gates to them.","And deep within this Heavenly Principle Dimension, the core secret door of the ‘Heavenly Dao Rules’ was also slowly opening!","This phase was something Song Shuhang had once experienced through ‘Daoist Senior,’ although only as a dreamland skill, which felt like looking at flowers through fog, very vague.","This time, he and Senior White were personally experiencing this process!","Both of them took a step forward simultaneously—the distance of the step was exact, taken and landed at the same time.","It was as if they were one entity.","The next moment, Song Shuhang felt himself ‘crossing a dimension.’","This was the huge dimensional gap between the Heavenly Dao and the mundane world.","The Heavenly Dao and those below it were already on two different levels.","Song Shuhang and Senior White took their second step together, fully entering the ‘Heavenly Principle Dimension.’","Once both bodies had completely entered... the expected ‘repulsion’ indeed occurred.","In one Heavenly Dao, one immortal.","The simultaneous entry and Dao achievement of two entities were bound to bring about repulsion.","This repulsion was utterly distinct from what Song Shuhang had imagined.","Too weak, too helpless!","The force of that repulsion, acting on Song Shuhang’s ‘Sub-immortal Body,’ was like a child using the strength needed to nurse, trying to push away a robust adult man.","Is this the final stubbornness of the Heavenly Dao rules?"]},{"number":3115,"title":"Chapter 3115 - 3113: ’My Roommate is the Will of the Heavens","paragraphs":["Chapter 3115: Chapter 3113: ‘My Roommate is the Will of the Heavens","This degree of repulsion couldn’t make Song Shuhang retreat even half a step.","It was too weak!","“It really is a bit... unexpected,” Song Shuhang gently brushed his clothing with his hand.","Throughout the process, not even his hairstyle had changed.","This slight repulsion felt like the laws of the Heavenly Dao lightly pounding on his chest with small fists.","Not only was it not uncomfortable, but it also felt somewhat pleasant?","If it was just this degree of repulsion, then the difficulty of him and Senior White attaining enlightenment as ‘two distinct entities at the same time’ seemed not so great?","It was about the same as the feeling during the 8.5 Ren Daozi’s enlightenment that he remembered.","“It’s because of my full body being semi-immortal,” Senior White, fully awakened, reminded him.","If what was here just now was the ‘Heavenly Dao’ proceeding in the normal course,","the moment they were repelled by this Heavenly Dao-level information, without officially coming into contact with the ‘Heavenly Dao Rules Core’ and condensing an immortal body, they would be directly forced out of the ‘Heavenly Dao Dimension.’","Even their cultivation foundation would be damaged, and their cultivation level directly demoted to that of a mortal!","The repelling power of Heavenly Dao-level rules was no joke; it was genuinely strong.","But, it had met Song Shuhang at this moment.","A full 360-degrees, from inside to outside, completely semi-immortal!","Moreover, the ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ that Shuhang had last set foot on had also already broken through the level of an Immortal!","An unprecedented body plus an unprecedentedly powerful path to immortality had created this ultimate Song Shuhang.","So ultimate that even the repulsion of the Heavenly Dao rules couldn’t move him.","This was the weight of a major player!","In the end, the Heavenly Dao rules could only turn stubbornness into grievance.","...","And Senior White himself had a similar situation.","Behind him, an ‘Immortal Galaxy’ flickered now and then, easily neutralizing the repulsion of the Heavenly Dao rules.","And after Senior White entered the ‘Heavenly Dao Dimension,’ this ‘Immortal Galaxy’ even plundered the power of the ‘Heavenly Dao Dimension,’ replenishing itself and growing stronger.","It was simply brutally humiliating the Heavenly Dao rules.","“Because of our special nature, we feel that the ‘Heavenly Dao repulsion’ is weak. But in reality, its repulsion is not weak,” Senior White spoke while casually dispelling the continuously incoming ‘Heavenly Dao rules repulsion’ with a gentle swipe.","Imitating Senior White, Song Shuhang dispersed the repulsion pushing against him with a palm strike and said, “So that’s how it is, it was because of us.”","You are strong, but we are stronger!","—If the Heavenly Dao rules had sentient consciousness, they would definitely have been crying bitterly by now!","These two guys were too oppressive.","Completely grinding the ‘Heavenly Dao rules’ into the ground.","...","“Let’s go, since we can handle the repulsion, let’s head directly to the ‘Heavenly Dao Rules’ core, to receive the Heavenly Dao information and authority... We need to hurry,” Senior White said, slightly quickening his pace.","Song Shuhang, intuitively synchronized with Senior White, maintained the same rhythm and pace as Senior White as they stepped forward together.","“Hurry for what, is something about to happen?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Just an intuition,” Senior White nodded: “I feel that during our process of proving our immortality, the Fourth Heavenly Dao lurking behind the scenes might make a move. If we delay... it might cause a bit of trouble.”","Although Senior White referred to it as ‘a bit of trouble,’ the trouble that the looming Dark Giant could trigger must be massive enough to instinctively make Senior White accelerate their pace.","Song Shuhang dared not take it lightly.","Regarding the Fourth Heavenly Dao, he always used the worst-case scenario for his calculations, fearing that he might underestimate the level of disaster of the opponent.","Anyway, regarding the Fourth Heavenly Dao, assume the worst when predicting its actions, and you cannot go wrong.","Senior White and Song Shuhang sped up in sync, rushing toward the channel leading to the core area.","In the meantime, Song Shuhang also tried to record all the action scenes of himself and Senior White after they “entered the Heavenly Dao Dimension.”","These scenes, which contained “Heavenly Dao information,” could not be directly shown to ordinary people.","But once he and Senior White proved their Dao and held authority over Heavenly Dao, they could pixelate or blur some areas of these scenes, downgrading them so that Immortals or Tribulation Transcenders could watch them.","By then, they could show them to the various senior pendants, allowing them to also experience the process of “proving the immortal Heavenly Dao” and learn something from it.","When one attains Dao, even chickens and dogs ascend to heaven—as long as the enlightened one is willing, those connected to him will definitely benefit.","After nearly half an hour...","Song Shuhang and Senior White finally arrived at the entrance to the channel leading to the “Heavenly Dao Rules Core Area.”","Mainly because in the “Heavenly Dao Dimension,” the current state of him and Senior White prevented them from using their spatial powers, forcing them to rely solely on their legs to move around.","Moreover, the journey from the ‘Heavenly Dao Dimension entrance’ to the ‘Heavenly Dao Rules Core Area’ is a process that all Heavenly Daos who proved their immortal status had to go through.","Its name is “Heavenly Dao Patrols All Worlds.”","During this process, Song Shuhang and Senior White experienced what it was like to “step into a different world with each step.”","With each step, they left footprints in one realm corresponding to the myriad practitioners in the universe, leaving behind their own “Heavenly Dao Marks”—including Song Shuhang’s “Overlord World” and the “Dream Realm” overseen by Senior White.","In the end, Song Shuhang and Senior White took a step in the Heavenly Dao Dimension with their fleshly bodies, and their consciousness passed through that “Throne World,” where they left their final footprints, ending the process.","The “Throne World” was precisely that special world into which Song Shuhang’s consciousness, bound to the “bone of eternity,” had been brought by the Sage’s urn.","There, in the Heavenly Dao, marks the last footprint before proving its Dao and ascending the throne.","It is the final stop in the Heavenly Dao’s journey of patrolling the myriad worlds.","After the last step was taken, even the practitioners and ordinary mortals or beings of the myriad worlds felt something instinctively.","Ordinary beings couldn’t help but look up at the sky.","Even those that had never cultivated felt an intuition—at that moment, it seemed that the previously masterless firmament had found its new ruler atop the vacant throne.","From today onwards, two supremely powerful and exalted beings reign from the celestial throne, becoming the sovereigns of the world!","Those ordinary beings who didn’t know Song Shuhang or Senior White didn’t react much; they just looked up at the sky when their instinct kicked in.","But as soon as the intuition ended, they quickly lowered their heads, everyone going about their own business.","However, ordinary people who knew Senior White and Song Shuhang were plunged into intense shock.","On Earth.","Gao Moumou took his fingers off the keyboard and couldn’t help pulling out his phone, posting in the dorm group, “@Tubo @Yang De, Tubo, Yang De, did you guys just feel something special—that Shuhang seemed to have become the ruler of the world? I had this sensation once before not long ago. I felt the world seemed to tremble for Shuhang, but this time the feeling was even stronger!”","Gao Moumou, for a moment, even doubted if he was becoming obsessed after writing novels for too long?","But he considered the recent changes in the world.","And Shuhang’s mysterious behaviors, which is why he posted in the dorm group.","“So it’s not just me who felt this?” Yang De, pushing up his glasses, replied, “Just now for a moment, I felt as if Shuhang’s face appeared in the sky, smiling at me. And beside Shuhang, there was also that very beautiful senior.”","“Not just us, even my grandfather suddenly asked about Shuhang just now. He also felt something,” Tubo chimed in, as he had just returned to his grandfather’s house when this event occurred.","After the three roommates finished their discussion, they fell into a brief silence.","After a while, Tubo couldn’t help saying, “Gao Moumou, do you think Shuhang could really become the owner of the world? Like in the novels, either ascending to fairyland or even something more awesome, becoming a universe-level big shot?”","Gao Moumou replied, “Logically speaking, Shuhang and us are all just teenagers around eighteen or nineteen years old. It seems a bit far-fetched for someone our age to become the master of the universe.”","“Flying Goddess, what do you think?” Tubo tagged Flying Goddess in the group again.","But this time, Flying Goddess didn’t reply to them—because at this moment, the ‘Home Maintenance Expert’ Flying Goddess, the small tree monster, was kneeling down, watching.","[The Tyrannical Song, who only started cultivating last year, has now, with my master, proven the immortal Heavenly Dao?]","[Initially, his cultivation level was even lower than mine, yet he soared up so swiftly.]","[A year, huh? Proving his Dao in just one year, even Gao Moumou wouldn’t dare to write his novels like this!]","In the roommate group chat.","“Why not, give Shuhang a call and see?” Yang De suddenly suggested.","Tubo swallowed his saliva, “Do you think Shuhang would answer?”","“He probably would, knowing his character,” Yang De responded.","Gao Moumou nodded, “Then... should we give it a try?”","“Who’s going to call?” Tubo asked.","“I’ll do it.” Gao Moumou swiped open his phone, finding the contact labeled ‘Roommate•Squirrel’.","After hesitating for a long while, he gently pressed the call button.","Soon... the call was connected!","It actually got through?","“Hello, Shuhang?” Gao Moumou asked.","“It’s me,” came Shuhang’s familiar, gentle voice from the other end of the phone.","“You...” Gao Moumou began, but he didn’t know how to ask.","[Have you become the ruler of the world?]","[Have you conquered the universe?]","[Have you become a god?]","He felt that these questions all seemed very bizarre.","“Yes... you’re not wrong. Right now, I am about to become the ruler of the myriad practitioners in the universe,” Shuhang’s voice replied.","Without Gao Moumou having to ask, the current Shuhang could already read Gao Moumou’s doubts across the vast distances.","Even, the communication between Gao Moumou and Shuhang now wasn’t happening through phone functionality, but through the omnipresent ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ laws, which connected Gao Moumou to Shuhang!","“Myriad practitioners in the universe?” Gao Moumou asked unconsciously.","“If I were to describe it, it’s a term that encompasses both the great and small universes by the myriad, which can be referred to as the Heavenly Dao,” Shuhang gently replied.","Gao Moumou: “...”","You thought my roommate had become the ruler of the universe? Nope, my roommate has become the ruler of over ten thousand universes!","The impact was too strong, causing Gao Moumou’s brain to almost crash.","Moreover, even through the phone, he could feel that Shuhang’s voice was filled with infinite power and dignity.","Although Shuhang was trying hard to speak in a gentle tone, that sense of dignity was still unmistakable.","“Don’t panic, I am still me. We’ll see each other later,” Shuhang’s voice sounded.","—This is why Shuhang is so highly regarded by all the seniors.","No matter his stage of cultivation, no matter his rank, Shuhang remained that same Shuhang.","Gao Moumou felt an inexplicable sense of calm.","The call ended.","In the roommate group chat.","“Gao Moumou, how did it go?” Tubo asked.","“I’ve decided, my next book will be titled ‘My Roommate is the Heavenly Dao,’ a personal memoir. And I must add: This story is not fictional, purely based on true events,” Gao Moumou replied.","Yang De didn’t know how to respond and could only type a series of ellipses.","“If you write it like that, wouldn’t it make the protagonist ‘me’ seem very weak?” Tubo suddenly asked.","Gao Moumou: “...”","He silently closed his eyes.","Shuhang said ‘see you later.’","When exactly is ‘later’?","...","...","At the Heavenly Dao Dimension entrance, core rule area.","Shuhang and Senior White glanced at each other, then stepped together into the gateway.","With that step.","They were about to receive the Heavenly Dao core information, Heavenly Dao authority, and condense the Immortal Body!","Whooosh—","As soon as they stepped in, an immense wave of ‘Heavenly Dao Information’ flooded towards them, overwhelming both Shuhang and Senior White.","Meanwhile, the ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ on Shuhang’s body was activated and lit up.","The Cultivation Chat Immortal Path and the Heavenly Dao Information made contact. The information turned into light spots, falling onto both Shuhang and Senior White.","However... Senior White’s body did not activate a corresponding ‘Dao of Longevity.’","Up until now, Senior White only possessed the ’embryonic form of the Dao of Longevity’ and had never completed it.","He deliberately did not complete the Dao of Longevity to prevent this very situation—if just now, both he and Shuhang had activated completely different ‘Daos of Longevity,’ it would have caused confusion within the ‘Heavenly Dao Information.’","But now, since Senior White’s Dao is only an embryonic form, such chaotic conflict will not arise.","Furthermore, ‘only condensing the Dao of Longevity’s embryonic form and proving immortality’ was also ‘White’s’ routine.","In the past, Wielder of the Will White, during the struggle for the Heavenly Dao, was at this stage.","At this time, Senior White was the same.","This state was the most suitable for him.","After the Heavenly Dao Information continued to fall, it condensed the ‘most primal’ eternal attribute for Senior White.","This was the most suitable eternity for Senior White.","In contrast, Shuhang’s ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ condensed an ‘all-encompassing’ eternal attribute!","One was primal chaos, which could evolve into any form of eternity.","One was all-encompassing, covering various different eternities.","Opposite yet synchronized.","“It’s going smoothly,” Shuhang thought with a sigh of relief in his heart: “Next step, is to combine the eternal attribute with Heavenly Dao authority to forge the immortal body!”","The Heavenly Dao seemed to have given up resisting, letting him and Senior White do as they pleased.","“Not yet... Coming up is the final stubborn moment of the Heavenly Dao. It is also the last chance for the Heavenly Dao rules,” Senior White warned.","Once he and Shuhang forged immortality, then nothing could affect him and Shuhang anymore.","So, this was the Heavenly Dao’s last chance.","Sure enough, just as Senior White finished speaking, eight figures emerged one by one from the ‘Heavenly Dao core rule’ area in front of them.","Senior Three Eyes, Senior Striped Dragon, Dark Giant, Reincarnation Fairy, Daoist Priest Virtue, White, Fat Ball, and Daoist Senior...","The ‘marks’ of the past generations of the Heavenly Dao stepped out from the core rules.","Still, there was no sign of the ‘First Heavenly Dao.’","The First Heavenly Dao had erased himself so thoroughly that even the ‘Heavenly Dao core area’ didn’t retain any marks or records of him!","“A group fight?” Shuhang’s scalp went numb.","It was always him ganging up on others; now facing a 2-8.5 Heavenly Dao gang-up, he felt somewhat unprepared."]},{"number":3116,"title":"Chapter 3116 - 3114: My Strongest Ability is the Cultivation Chat Path • The Technique of Seeking Help from the Experts!","paragraphs":["\"How you treat others, one day, someone will treat you the same way... I never thought this would happen to me,\" Song Shuhang said.","In the past, every time he and a group of pendant seniors ganged up on someone, it felt thrilling.","Now, he was being aggressively spectated by the marks of previous Heavenly Daos.","He, Tyrannical Song, couldn’t stand this kind of grievance.","So...","While the 8 Heavenly Dao marks were still being shaped by the ’Heavenly Dao rules’ and hadn’t officially taken action yet...","Song Shuhang extended his finger and with a ’snap’ took a selfie of himself, Senior White, and the emerging marks of the previous Heavenly Daos, and posted it on his social circle.","Modern people have a common problem, no matter what happens, even if they are severely injured in a car accident, they have to take a selfie first and post it to their social circle — but at this moment, Song Shuhang wasn’t going to do something pointless.","Especially facing the aggressive spectating of marks from previous Heavenly Daos, reality didn’t permit him to indulge in leisure.","He posted to his social circle with a specific purpose — to trigger the greatest function of his ’Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’!","Before posting in the social circle, he used the ’Cultivation Chat System’ to blur the ’immortal information’ in the photo. Lady Kunna from the Dragon Network was further handling this ’social circle’ post function in the background.","[Ding~ Tyrannical Song has posted a new social circle message, this message is only visible to a limited number of members.]","Song Shuhang had the access of ’server-wide announcement,’ but since he didn’t intend to simply use the social circle for posting, he set it to friends-only access.","[Shocking, I, Mister Song, and Senior White are in the process of inheriting the Heavenly Dao, and the past Heavenly Daos are giving me troubles. Right now, I am being aggressively watched by the marks of the past Heavenly Daos and am about to be ganged up on by a mix of eight. What should I do? Online waiting, it’s urgent.]","This message by Song Shuhang was visible only to his group of ’pendant seniors’ and the seniors from the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’, as well as a few good fellow friends.","The main purpose was to get a few of the ’Ruler of the Netherworld’ and the ’Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’ to take a look and see if they could offer any advice.","—This was where the most terrifying aspect of Tyrannical Song’s ’Cultivation Chat Path’ lay.","You think you are ganging up on me, Tyrannical Song?","But you don’t know how many big boss-level figures are standing behind me!","With one message, I have a bunch of seniors strategizing for me!","These seniors and big bosses are my wings~","As long as they are here, there’s nothing in the myriad realms that can trouble me!","...","After the social circle message was posted.","Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade Fairy left a puzzled comment, \"What’s going on? I don’t recall encountering such a situation when my main body proved its Dao.\"","Senior White Two speculated, \"It’s because of Shuhang and the current White proving their Dao together, it’s probably the last bit of stubbornness from the Heavenly Dao rules. This situation isn’t unexpected.\"","Then, Daoist Senior, who was currently undergoing the resurrection process and now only had a wisp of constantly fading ’intention’ left, introduced, \"These should be the marks of the Heavenly Dao — they are the marks left in the Heavenly Dao rules by the previous Heavenly Daos at the moment of contact with ’Heavenly Dao core source information, congealing immortality.’\"","They are records from the moment the Heavenly Gods were first born.","They possess the Dao traces and the power of Heavenly Dao rules.","Under the materialization of the Heavenly Dao rules power, they should be able to exert a part of the power of the previous Heavenly Daos.","But, after all, marks are just marks, not the real Heavenly Dao’s presence. Their combat relies mostly on instinct, and there are many aspects that can be exploited.","Moreover, the power of Heavenly Dao immortality should also be relatively green.","—Daoist Senior’s ’resurrection process’ still has a long way to go. Normally, as a Heavenly Dao, his retirement and resurrection would take tens of thousands of years to round off the process.","However, Daoist Senior was concerned about the situation of the ’myriad realms’, and wanted to understand the current situation of the realms, so before he retired, he made use of Fat Ball’s ’channel’ and tried to retain a wisp of consciousness in the ’Confucian Classic’.","This strand of consciousness possessed all the memories of Daozi Heavenly Dao and could provide Song Shuhang with consultation.","However, having relinquished his position in the Heavenly Dao and no longer supported by the power of the Heavenly Dao, this strand of consciousness would gradually dissipate over time.","Daozi had never intended for this consciousness to ’exist eternally’.","He just wanted to personally witness Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist White proving their Dao and becoming immortal.","Then, he could truly rest assured and go on to resurrect.","Before that, he could exert his remaining heat to provide Song Shuhang with support in terms of data information.","Daozi was the strongest tool-man!","\"Do it, Song Goudan, don’t be scared, kill that eyeball monster!\" Father Goudan said somberly.","\"Do it, kill that eyeball.\" This time, the three-eyed young senior unexpectedly stood on the same side as Father Goudan.","Song Shuhang: \"...\"","What I’m facing is not just a single ’Heavenly Dao Mark’ from Senior Three-Eyes. If it were just one mark, I would have been reckless already—it’s not like facing the actual ’Heavenly Dao’. Against just one ’Heavenly Dao Mark’, he could still afford to be reckless.","But there are a total of 8 such ’Heavenly Dao Marks’!","\"Reveal your weaknesses a bit; that’s what Shuhang and I need right now,\" Senior White spoke then.","He and Shuhang weren’t trying to show off on the friend circle, sending this message; their primary purpose was to gather intelligence!","\"Splendid, Mister Song, you and Senior White have a fine idea, but unfortunately, I don’t know the weakness of the Heavenly Dao ball... Shall I go ask Song Fat Ball?\" the Heavenly Emperor’s son replied.","\"Even though the hopes aren’t high, it’s worth a try. Additionally, more content can be appraised from the sleeping ’Qiu Youyou’, who is now a companion magic device for Song Youyou,\" Song Shuhang replied.","\"Got it~\" the Heavenly Emperor’s son replied.","Afterward, Senior White Two was the first to say, \"The mark of Heavenly Dao White should be left for the modern White to deal with. The best way to handle Heavenly Dao White is to use White.\"","\"Leave it to me,\" Senior White replied.","Senior White Two added, \"Moreover, the virtuous Daoist nearby, modern White, you take him along as well, pull him away. The seat of Heavenly Dao came from Heavenly Dao White, and his Heavenly Dao mark also contains remnants of Heavenly Dao White’s data. Taking two in one go shouldn’t be a problem.\"","\"Hmm, I’ll try... anyway, leave it to me with peace of mind,\" Senior White replied reliably.","That is to say, out of the 8 Heavenly Dao marks, Senior White could take away two.","That leaves 6.","Father Goudan regretfully said, \"It’s a pity they are only Heavenly Dao marks; otherwise... I could have drawn my Heavenly Dao along to deal with the infatuation. Three-Eyed Boy, what’s your Heavenly Dao’s weakness?\"","After a moment of thought, the three-eyed young senior said, \"Shuhang, use your ’Sage Eye Golden Core’ cheat system to deal with my Heavenly Dao. Don’t go all out, just keep him hanging... Facing such a precious ’Sage Eye Golden Core’, my corresponding Heavenly Dao mark will definitely not go all out and will try to avoid damaging the ’Sage Eye Golden Core.’ That way, you can stall him, and once you and Fellow Daoist White have dealt with the other Heavenly Dao marks, you can join forces to finish it.\"","As long as it’s not a living ’Heavenly Dao’, these ’rulers of the Netherworld Realm’ can use their instincts to provide some very useful suggestions, designing their own Heavenly Dao marks.","\"Received, I’ll let the ’Sage Eye Golden Core System’ act freely to stall Heavenly Dao Senior Three-Eyes,\" Song Shuhang nodded.","The help given by the Confucian Sage was really tremendous, able to hold up the Heavenly Dao marks at the last moment.","\"Father Goudan, what about you?\" the three-eyed young senior said, I’ve said my piece, now it’s your turn.","\"Shuhang, try summoning the ’Nine Transformations Phoenix Saber’... It’s a Dao artifact and is bound to you. At this time, it should be able to appear in the Heavenly Dao dimension space. If it can be summoned, then the Heavenly Dao corresponding to me should be no problem,\" Father Goudan advised.","In this ’Heavenly Dao Core Area’, the reason life-bound magical treasures cannot be summoned is because they are not at a high enough level to immediately withstand the shock of ’Immortal Level’ information.","But the Nine Transformations Phoenix Saber itself is already a Dao artifact and doesn’t have this concern.","That leaves 4 Heavenly Dao marks!","Daozi’s strand of consciousness said, \"Shuhang, at the start of the battle, first use the teacher’s eyes on my Heavenly Dao mark to see if it can be subdued. If not... then separate the two Sage Eye Golden Cores, one to deal with the Second Heavenly Dao Mark and one to stall my Heavenly Dao Mark. Faced with the teacher’s eyes, my Heavenly Dao mark will definitely not dare make a major movement.\"","The Sage to the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders, was both a master and a father, and the term \"master-father\" holds significant weight.","\"No problem, this is my specialty,\" Song Shuhang nodded and replied.","Thus, the Sage could also drag the Daozi Heavenly Dao Seal along with the two.","Only the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy Seal, Dark Heavenly Dao Seal, and Fat Ball’s seal remained.","At this moment, Reincarnation Blade Fairy finally suggested, \"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, I just communicated with the Reincarnation Seal, and it suggests that your ’clone’ is the key. Your clone had been nurtured within the ’Reincarnation Seal’ before — release him, and he can pull our Heavenly Dao seals. If lucky, your clone might pull her as well, aiding you in capturing the Fourth Heavenly Dao Seal. Also, Sixteen’s scabbard might be useful, though we cannot guarantee the results.\"","\"My clone had once replaced Lady Onion and stayed a while in the Reincarnation Seal, which is really good news,\" Song Shuhang felt heartened.","Thus, the only adversary he currently faced was the ’Heavenly Dao fat ball’!","Meanwhile, information on the ’Heavenly Dao fat ball’s weaknesses was being gathered by Dark Song and the Heavenly Emperor’s son.","After all, the Heavenly Dao fat ball was an old adversary.","Song Shuhang was familiar with its attack methods through the past experiences with Fat Ball.","This was considered the best kind of opponent.","Song Shuhang clenched his fists together.","Across from him, eight Heavenly Dao marks under the effect of the ’Heavenly Dao rules’ completed their construction and opened their eyes simultaneously.","Suddenly, an immense pressure descended, pressing down on Song Shuhang and Senior White.","Senior White stepped back... and then, the Heavenly Dao White Seal and the Virtuous Daoist Seal, like being drawn by a magnet, voluntarily followed Senior White and left.","\"Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, come!\"","\"Song Two clone, appear!\"","\"Sage Eye Golden Core system, activate!\"","Song Shuhang immediately sprang into action.","The Song Two clone was summoned — it had experienced nurturing in the ’Reincarnation Seal,’ so it could exist within this ’Heavenly Dao dimension.’","Upon appearing, it first confronted the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy Seal, and both sides produced a kind of resonance.","The Song Two clone was responsible for pulling the ’Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy Seal,’ ideally to drag the Reincarnation Fairy Seal along and head towards the Fourth Heavenly Dao.","If that failed... Song Shuhang would have to face both Fat Ball and the Dark Giant simultaneously.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber affectionately rubbed against Song Shuhang, charging toward Heavenly Dao Father Goudan.","\"Expert’s Appraisal!\" the Confucian Saint Eye Golden Core was activated, locking onto the Three-Eyed Heavenly Dao Seal and Daozi’s Seal.","Two Gaze of Maternal Love settled respectively on Daozi’s Seal and the Three-Eyed Seal, holding them in place.","Finally.","Only the Fat Ball Heavenly Dao and the temporarily unbound Dark Giant advanced toward Song Shuhang!","Boom~","The core area of the Heavenly Dao Rules transformed into a boundless starry sky, constructing a battlefield for the Heavenly Dao battle.","The Fat Ball Heavenly Dao Seal directly transformed into a battle fortress, colossal and overwhelming, the familiar cannon barrels locking onto Shuhang, numerous and large.","The Dark Giant Seal was even more exaggerated; its form dispersed, transforming into thousands of stars.","Each star emitted an ancient aura from the primordial times... Then, those thousands of stars transformed into meteors, trailing long tails of fire, smashing toward Song Shuhang with an apocalyptic force.","Although these stars were only the size of the moon, the light they emitted was more blinding than the sun.","But this was all just superficial... The most terrifying aspect was the eternal power contained within them.","For Song Shuhang, who was still at the Sub-immortal level, these star attacks were capable of causing harm.","Facing the simultaneously roaring and menacing Fat Ball and Dark Giant...","Song Shuhang did not panic.","Having experienced great trials and tribulations, he was not easily shaken anymore.","His eyes bore a calm that was terrifying.","Then, he reached out and grabbed a saber scabbard.","A thousand tiny hands formed from Sub-immortal level hair grasped the scabbard.","\"Not long ago, I realized something... There is still love in this world,\" Song Shuhang said, seemingly out of nowhere.","The next moment.","A vast amount of cheap love transformed into a light brighter than the ’stars,’ and in an instant, a billion ’Saber-Nurturing Techniques’ fell upon the scabbard.","The scabbard was almost stripped bare.","Across from him, the array of menacing stars surprisingly braked sharply, stiffening for a few breaths.","The Fat Ball Seal, originally synchronized in attack, arrived first instead.","Millions of barrages and beams of attack light roared towards Song Shuhang.","\"Universe Hiding Sleeve!\" Song Shuhang swung his arm.","His sleeve transformed into a giant robe, sweeping all of Fat Ball’s attacks inside in one breath.","Boom~","But as soon as they were collected, the Universe Hiding Sleeve exploded, turning Song Shuhang’s right arm into blackened char.","Pits were blasted into the Sub-immortal arm.","But soon, it regained its elasticity.","\"The damage is about what I estimated; a Sub-immortal body can hold it,\" Song Shuhang said softly.","As long as he could hold on, then next, he could demonstrate to the ’Fat Ball Heavenly Dao Seal’ his strongest ability from the ’Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ — the Enhanced Version.","\"Karma Blade•Cultivation Chat Enhanced Version,\" Song Shuhang’s right hand mimed gripping, and a projection emerged from Sixteen’s scabbard.","It was the shadow of a saber.","Song Shuhang drew the saber.","The ’Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ operated at full power!","The karmic debts of myriad creatures across the universe began loading!","The virtuous lamia materialized, constructing defenses for Song Shuhang while enhancing the ’Virtuous Network’ signal.","In the main world.","Song Shuhang’s Kindness Corpse, Evil Corpse, and Self-Corpse broke out of the ’small black room’ and stepped into the main world.","In the Netherworld Realm, Dark Song opened her eyes, gathering the karmas of the Netherworld Realm.","Ultimate Tyrannical Song, at this moment, fully unleashed his power!"]},{"number":3117,"title":"Chapter 3117 - 3115: It’s already over, you’re already dead! (Happy 2020!)","paragraphs":["Cultivation Chat Immortal Path, 200% power!","A massive oppressive force exploded from Song Shuhang as he assumed the sword-drawing stance!","From the scabbard, the Illusion Blade began to unsheathe.","As this sword-drawing action took place, the starry sky beneath everyone’s feet, formed by the ’laws of the Heavenly Dao,’ actually began to fade!","The picturesque starry sky washed away its colors, turning into a stark white, becoming a pure white space.","Even the marks of the Dark Giant, the fat ball of the Heavenly Dao, and the marks of the past Heavenly Dao were affected, their bodies beginning to turn white.","In this nearly pure white space, only Song Shuhang retained his original colors.","And the oppressive force emanating from him seemed to materialize, turning into a black aura that dominated the entire area!","In a brief moment, the whole ’Heavenly Dao Rules Space’ was filled with Tyrannical Song’s materialized oppressive force, turning the pure white space back to pitch black!","From a starry sky fading to pure white, then from pure white dyed with Tyrannical Song’s black—through this process, the entire starry world was dominated by Tyrannical Song!","This is the power of the ’Cultivation Chat Immortal Path,’ painstakingly condensed by Song Shuhang and the senior powerhouses supporting him.","An unprecedented path to immortality, power unprecedented!","The Illusion Blade in Tyrannical Song’s hands finally unsheathed—a moment that seemed like an instant but, under the effect of Song Shuhang’s materialized oppressive force, felt like a century!","The moment the blade was drawn, what was originally an illusionary blade edge condensed into reality, transforming into the ’Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade’—this was the effect of the Karma Blade \"Flower Rule.\"","The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy and the Reincarnation Blade Fairy were also among the ones from whom Song Shuhang drew karma.","Their power, through Sixteen’s saber scabbard, temporarily materialized this illusionary projection blade into a true Dao artifact blade.","Not just the Reincarnation Blade Fairy and the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy, but also Father Goudan, Senior Three-Eyed, Senior White two, the Immortal Daoist, and many other seniors, creatures of the main world, demons of the Netherworld Realm—all karmic links were gathered, transformed into this single strike in Tyrannical Song’s hand.","All the power plus Song Shuhang’s immortal power left a deep blue trail as the blade moved.","Slash!","The ’Karma Blade•Cultivation Chat Immortal Version’ swept toward the mark of the Heavenly Dao fat ball.","Faced with this oppressive threat, the Heavenly Dao fat ball mark, in an instant, unleashed incalculable firepower.","The brilliant and dazzling firepower covered the skies, its special effect +100.","In comparison, Song Shuhang’s ’Karma Blade’ seemed pitifully small.","Yet, this seemingly tiny blade light, when slashing through that endless firepower, cut through it as easily as if slicing through vegetables, effortlessly splitting all the firepower.","The blade light locked onto the Heavenly Dao fat ball mark.","Power of karma, power of virtue, power of reincarnation were all layered locking... making it impossible for the Heavenly Dao fat ball mark to evade.","No matter how it tried to dodge, no matter how it tried to defend, this strike, the moment it was made, had already determined the outcome.","It could only resist forcefully!","Shriek–","The nearly ten thousand layers of defenses on the Heavenly Dao fat ball were all split open by this strike!","Immediately afterward, its body, as vast as the stars, was mercilessly cut in two by the blade light.","And from this clean cut as the source, the massive body of the Heavenly Dao fat ball began to collapse.","Even its powerful ’self-healing ability’ was suppressed.","The speed of self-healing couldn’t keep up with the rate of bodily collapse.","Moments later, the mark of the Heavenly Dao fat ball was destroyed into fragments.","Marks of the Heavenly Dao, possessing indestructible Dao traces and attack powers nearly of the Heavenly Dao itself... but they themselves are not indestructible and eternal.","After all, if the marks were indestructible, then Song Shuhang and Senior White wouldn’t need to challenge it; they could just surrender directly.","\"Is it over?\" asked the Reincarnation Blade Fairy, who, with the ’power of karma’ condensed into a physical form, spoke out.","As the vessel for this strike, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy experienced the power of this strike from a ’first-hand’ perspective.","But as soon as the Reincarnation Blade Fairy finished speaking,","across from her, the shattered fragments of the Heavenly Dao fat ball’s seal began to resurrect and condensed into a smaller version of the fat ball!","Aside from being somewhat smaller in size, the Heavenly Dao fat ball’s seal had once again regained its bouncing ability.","This formidable regenerative ability, clearly lacking an ’Immortal Physique,’ yet nearly indestructible, was truly the nightmare of all cultivators!","\"It still isn’t dead?\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy was a bit surprised. This Heavenly Dao fat ball had some tricks up its sleeve!","However, after collapsing once, the body of the Heavenly Dao fat ball had significantly reduced in size.","So, its ’resurrection’ definitely had a limit.","\"Then let’s strike it one more time!\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy prepared herself, attempting to once again wield the ’Karma Blade’ with Song Shuhang.","But Song Shuhang, holding the saber hilt, slowly sheathed his saber.","\"It’s already over,\" Song Shuhang said softly, \"It’s already dead.\"","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy was puzzled: \"???\"","Whoosh—next to the Heavenly Dao fat ball, another ’blade light’ suddenly appeared.","This blade light, as if transcending karma and space, slashed from the past to the future!","The blade fell.","The hardly resurrected ’Heavenly Dao fat ball’s seal’ was once again cleaved in two and shattered at the cut inflicted by the blade.","\"Is this... the strike you just delivered?\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy asked.","As she spoke, the mark of the Heavenly Dao fat ball revived once more, transforming into an even smaller Heavenly Dao fat ball’s seal.","But as soon as its form was restored, the ’blade light’ appeared once again, slashing at it.","No matter how many times it recovered... the outcome was always the same!","After Song Shuhang executed that note of the ’Karma Blade•Cultivation Chat Version’ and in the moment he struck, that strike had already completely annihilated the ’Heavenly Dao fat ball’s seal’ before him.","From the time the blade was drawn to the future, the ’Heavenly Dao fat ball’s seal’ had already perished under that single strike!","The moment Song Shuhang sheathed his saber, the Heavenly Dao fat ball’s seal was finished.","The scenes of the ’Heavenly Dao fat ball’s seal’ continuously resurrecting and being slaughtered before their eyes... were, in fact, just ’projections of events that had already transpired’.","The real ’Heavenly Dao fat ball’s seal’ had already died in the ’past’ a few moments ago.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy quickly grasped the causality of the scene before her eyes and understood.","\"Your path to immortality... is really terrifying. This enormous computing ability is not something a non-proven person can achieve. You are still a step away from proving your Dao,\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said.","\"I have a Heavenly Axiom-level calculation cheat,\" Song Shuhang coolly replied.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy: \"!!!\"","You cheater!","\"Next, the Dark Heavenly Dao Seal,\" Song Shuhang turned around and looked toward the Dark Heavenly Dao giant that had transformed into thousands of stars.","At the same time, he glanced at the Song Two he had dispatched to seduce the ’Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy Mark.’","Song Two, successful halfway!","The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy Mark wasn’t enticed to join his ranks.","But because of the resonance with Song Two, the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy Mark had become a bit more ’flexible.’","This bit of flexibility was just enough for her to lock her ’Hate Value’ onto the Fourth Heavenly Dao.","Her gaze fixed onto the Fourth Heavenly Dao Seal became sharp.",".",".","Reluctantly, 2019 finally abandoned me and sent me into the embrace of 2020. In the new year, I hope all fellow friends and fairies will also find the warmth they seek within the embrace of 2020."]},{"number":3118,"title":"Chapter 3118 - 3116: Let them hit, let them scold, who made us allies?","paragraphs":["```","The 2-8.5 Heavenly Dao Mark released by the laws of the Heavenly Dao was originally the last resistance to obstruct Tyrannical Song and Senior White.","It was the Heavenly Dao’s final act of defiance against ’two different entities achieving immortality at the same time’.","Unexpectedly, the Song Two on Tyrannical Song’s body could resonate with the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy Mark.","Moreover, it even succeeded in having the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy place the ’First Hatred’ on the Fourth Heavenly Dao Seal!","If the laws of the Heavenly Dao were sentient, they would have been infuriated by now.","It was bad enough that two people were proving their Dao together, but there was also an item on them that could ’activate’ the Fifth Heavenly Dao Mark.","In fact, it was Song Shuhang’s good luck.","Because the moment the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy felt the deepest ’resentment’ towards the Fourth Heavenly Dao... was precisely when she had just proved her pseudo-immortal body!","In that moment, she sensed the trickery the Fourth Heavenly Dao had played on her, and her heart was filled with annoyance.","And the ’Heavenly Dao Mark’ released by the Heavenly Dao was exactly from the moment the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy proved her pseudo-immortal status.","Therefore, when Song Two slightly activated it, the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy immediately ranked Song Shuhang’s ’Hate Value’ as second.","The ’First Hatred’ firmly fell upon the Dark Heavenly Dao Seal!","Song Shuhang sheathed his sword.","The ’star space’ which had initially faded into a Blank Nickname, once again slowly regained color.","The process of regaining color felt somewhat ’weak’.","It was as if it were asking Shuhang: Big guy, are you done? If you’re done, I’m coming back~","Once Song Shuhang’s aura and saber intent were withdrawn, the Fourth Heavenly Dao Seal that had manifested thousands of stars began to pulsate once more, ready to crash down upon Song Shuhang.","But in the face of this barrage of thousands of stars, Tyrannical Song was not the least bit perturbed.","In fact, he even had the time to activate the ’communication video-recording feature’ and record this scene!","He was very calm...","Not because he underestimated the attack power of the Dark Heavenly Dao.","But because, behind the Fourth Heavenly Dao Seal, the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy Mark made a move!","And what’s interesting is, the Fourth Heavenly Dao Seal under the effect of the ’laws of the Heavenly Dao’ should be in an ’ally’ state with the Reincarnation Heavenly Dao Fairy, and it wouldn’t strike at an ’ally’ nor would it guard against an ’ally’s’ attack.","It considered the Reincarnation Fairy an ally, but the Reincarnation Fairy had already quietly switched it to an ’enemy’ status.","You cannot attack me, yet I can mercilessly stab you in the back!","The Heavenly Dao Fairy leaped up directly, and her body transformed into a giant blade that could Create of Heaven and Earth—this was the true Star-cutting Saber, a full 12345 kilometers in length!","What are forty-meter great sabers or five-hundred-meter machetes in the face of the giant blade transformed by the Heavenly Dao Fairy? They’re laughably weak!","When Song Shuhang witnessed this, his eyes lit up.","—Because, he could tell that the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s strike wasn’t any sort of ’innate ability,’ but rather a saber technique!","Under the effect of Heavenly Dao Level Computational Ability + the resonating empowerment from Song Two and the Heavenly Dao Fairy, Song Shuhang began to attempt to analyze this saber technique.","Becoming the blade with one’s body, transforming into the Star-cutting Saber!","Song Shuhang’s innate skill for saber techniques was truly of a Super Rule Level, all thanks to the exchange for the innate inability to use sword techniques!","Under his analysis, he actually managed to obtain some understanding of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s technique.","Slash!","The 12345-kilometer-long Giant Blade transformed by the Fifth Heavenly Dao Reincarnation Fairy cut horizontally, slashed vertically, and performed Tornado Slashes!","A blade this size, larger than the diameter of Earth, its sweeping saber qi and intent were enough to slice a planet the size of Earth like a watermelon, smashing it to pieces.","And among the thousands of stars formed by the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, the average size was only that of the moon.","Facing the terrifying slash from the giant blade, and especially in the ’ally unguarded’ mode, they were sliced up like fruits in a game!","Out of the thousands of stars, only a few managed to break through the assault of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s 12345-kilometer blade and hurtle towards Song Shuhang.","```","\"Are you ready to strike? I’ll coordinate with you!\" asked Dao Artifact•Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","\"No rush, I want to try a skill first,\" Song Shuhang replied.","Several question marks appeared in Reincarnation Blade Fairy’s mind.","Then, she saw Song Shuhang leap into the air, his form rapidly expanding... until he transformed into a giant blade that was 10,000 kilometers long!","Isn’t this the saber technique of my true self?","When did you learn it?","Don’t tell me, you saw the saber technique used by my true self’s mark and copied it just like that?","Your saber techniques innate skill is so amazing, does your master know?","\"Slash!!\" Song Shuhang, controlling the giant blade he’d become, launched an attack at the stars of the ’Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’.","The blade fell!","That star was cleaved in two.","However, the giant blade that Song Shuhang had transformed into also collapsed...","Indeed, mere imitation was not enough, the essence of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s saber technique, was something Song Shuhang hadn’t mastered.","The giant blade he had transformed into was a mere shell, possessing at most a fraction of the fairy’s power.","\"It’s a pity, I’ve only learned the form, not the essence,\" Song Shuhang said.","Reincarnation Blade Fairy: \"...\"","After a moment of silence.","She sighed, \"Do you want to learn it?\"","\"Yes, it’s rare to find a saber technique that suits me,\" replied Song Shuhang.","\"I’ll teach you,\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy said. \"I’ll pass the fist scripture formula to you, and once you’ve proven your Dao and become pseudo-immortal, remember to occasionally bring Sixteen back to Spirit River Su Clan’s Ancestor Star to see me.\"","And don’t forget to maintain the Saber-Nurturing Technique for me. Even though it’s a Dao artifact, Dao artifacts need to be maintained too.","Truly appealing.","\"Thank you, Fairy. No problem,\" Song Shuhang said.","\"I’ll just pass you the formula; how much you understand is up to you,\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy stated.","\"That’s enough,\" Song Shuhang slightly smiles—with a bit of confidence in his own innate skill for saber techniques.","So, after a few minutes.","In the vacuum, two giant blades—each longer than the diameter of Earth—swung ruthlessly, slicing through the stars formed by the ’Dark Heavenly Dao Seal’ of the Dark Giant, like ’cutting fruit.’","The Dark Heavenly Dao Seal, meanwhile, clung stubbornly to Song Shuhang, ignoring the attacks of its ’ally,’ the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy.","Thousands of stars were being cleaved incessantly—however, the Dark Heavenly Dao Seal could always manipulate its ’body’ to form more and larger stars!","Unless all the ’stars’ were extinguished in one breath, it could keep producing more.","\"This way of cutting seems to be ineffective. We need more help... or perhaps, we should use the ’karmic saber technique’ once more,\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy said gravely as she assessed the situation.","While she was speaking, from behind the stars formed by the Dark Heavenly Dao Seal, a huge fist erupted from a ’spatial gate,’ wildly pounding the stars!","This classic method of attack was characteristic of the Confucian system.","Turning to look, Song Shuhang saw that the left eye socket of ’Heavenly Dao • Daozi Seal’ had been scooped out... and replaced with a ’Sage Eye Golden Core.’","Thus, the Daozi’s Mark, with its new eye, didn’t hesitate to attack its own ’ally,’ the Fourth Heavenly Dao Seal!","This was a betrayal between two allies!","Meanwhile, the Dark Heavenly Dao Seal, completely disregarding the betrayal of its ally, was solely focused on bombarding Tyrannical Song with incessant attacks!","\"Poor guy,\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy said softly.","But the more pitiful the Dark Heavenly Dao Seal was, the more pleasure she derived!"]},{"number":3119,"title":"Chapter 3119 - 3117: Tyrannical Song, the Ruthless Man!","paragraphs":["Attacking my teammates, protecting my enemies.","The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy and Daozi’s Mark brought this sentence to its ultimate expression!","Both ignored the real target ’Tyrannical Song’ and ferociously confronted the Fourth Heavenly Dao Seal.","Song Shuhang looked up at the ’Sage Eye Golden Core’ in the eye socket of Daozi’s Mark—sure enough, eyeball-plucking is the signature move of top powerhouses!","Although he let the ’Sage Eye Golden Core’ act on its own to delay Daoist Senior’s Mark, he did not let it enter Daozi’s ’Heavenly Dao Mark’ orb.","Moreover, since ’Heavenly Dao Mark’ is a materialized pure energy, Shuhang simply had no way to force the ’Sage Eye Golden Core’ into it unless it wished so.","It sounds unbelievable, but in fact, it was Daozi’s Heavenly Dao Mark itself that installed the ’Sage Eye Golden Core’ into its eye socket!","Daozi’s Mark might have sensed the aura of its teacher within the ’Sage Eye Golden Core’ and then instinctively plucked out its own eyeball to fit in the ’Sage Eye Golden Core’—all to protect its teacher’s possession.","Fortunately, these ’Heavenly Dao Marks’ are not eternal bodies; otherwise, Daozi’s Mark would not even be able to pluck its eyeball out.","Upon acquiring its teacher the Saint’s eyes, Daozi’s Mark was slightly ’activated’ and immediately turned traitor!","To Daoist Senior, the teacher is more important than the Heavenly Dao.","The Fourth Heavenly Dao Seal became Daozi’s ’First Hatred’ target, opening a spatial passage and bombarding it with a flurry of knowledge-charged punches!","In the vacuum, the stars manifested by the Fourth Heavenly Dao kept exploding and being severed.","This is too hard...","What should have been an 8 vs. 2 situation had turned into a one-on-three against the ’Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao Mark’.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy in Tyrannical Song’s hands let out a chicken-like joyous laugh.","Although it was just a ’Heavenly Dao Mark,’ seeing anything related to the ’Fourth Heavenly Dao’ being blasted made her uncontrollably happy.","\"Yes, slash it! Explode it!\"","\"Tyrannical Song uses Tornado Charge Tornado Slash!\"","\"Follow it up with Cross Abandonment Star Explosion Slash!\"","\"Connect it with the Invincible Zigzag Holy Light Slash!\"","\"And finish it with Heavenly Saber Burying the Starry Sea!\"","Song Shuhang: \"...\"","Reincarnation Blade Sister, I don’t know any of those moves you’re talking about. Especially that Su Clan’s closely guarded secret, ’Heavenly Saber Burying the Starry Sea’—I really want to learn it, it sounds so cool.","Boom~ Clang~","With the addition of Daoist Senior’s ’mark,’ the stars formed by the Fourth Heavenly Dao Seal were being destroyed at a much faster pace.","The Fourth Heavenly Dao Seal started to get overwhelmed with defense, attacking less and guarding more, spending more time on ’increasing the number of stars.’","It was like a relentless ’monster-spawner,’ frantically generating massive stars.","And these stars were exploding and being sliced one after another.","\"The efficiency has improved quite a bit... But if the attack efficiency could increase a bit more, that would be even better. That way, this guy won’t have time to attack, only to defend, passively taking hits,\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy was in a great mood.","Even after the power of karma from the ’karmic saber technique’ ended, she was reluctant to break off the connection and actively provided power, maintaining the existence of the ’Illusion Blade’ as a spectator.","Just as the Reincarnation Blade Fairy finished speaking, suddenly, in the distance, a gigantic phoenix spread its wings and soared high, its flames illuminating the starry sky.","The body of the phoenix expanded boundlessly, eventually growing to match the size of starry forms.","And at the tail of this Fire Phoenix stood a one-legged handsome man.","He held a fire phoenix as large as a star in his hand, his facial expression seemed a bit dazed, but under the guidance of the fire phoenix, he joined the ranks of the ’fruit-cutting game.’","After a long cry, the fire phoenix folded its wings and hurled forward like a drill.","Boom—every collision shattered a ’star’ directly into pieces!","\"It’s the mark of Heavenly Dao Father Goudan!\" Song Shuhang exclaimed.","Reincarnation Blade Fairy: \"???\"","\"It’s the seal of the Third Heavenly Dao, the true master of my primordial treasure, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber. Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, well done, I’ll serve you with a billion techniques from the Saber-Nurturing Technique when we get back—\" Song Shuhang laughed heartily.","The Heavenly Dao Goudan’s father’s mark didn’t betray him—it simply acted on instinct, grabbing the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber that seemed to be closely related to it.","Then, like a dog owner holding a husky on a leash, he was dragged by the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, passively shattering those stars.","\"Now, it’s a one-against-four situation, you one, we four!\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy called out joyfully to the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao—although she knew the other party was just a mark, it wouldn’t respond, it had no consciousness.","But she just wanted to shout, to express her joyful heart.","With the entry of Heavenly Dao Father Goudan’s mark and Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’s mark completely lost the opportunity to ’attack.’","It not only had to defend but also had to use all its energy to ’increase the number of stars,’ turning into a monster-spawning machine without any feelings!","Apart from ruthlessly spawning monsters to maintain the continuously blasted stars, it couldn’t do anything else.","\"Tsk tsk, it has finally reached its limit,\" the Reincarnation Blade commented: \"Now, apart from spawning ’stars,’ the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s mark can’t do anything. At this time, just a little external interference is needed to break its limit, shatter the balance, and have it completely disintegrate.\"","Hearing this, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but glance at the ’three-eyed young man’s Heavenly Dao mark’ in the distance.","Apart from the ’Heavenly Dao White Seal and Immortal Daoist’s Heavenly Dao mark’ taken away by Senior White, only the three-eyed young man’s mark was left.","However... the three-eyed young man’s mark showed no signs of betrayal.","It was just patiently dealing with the ’Sage Eye Golden Core.’","Even without consciousness, the three-eyed young man’s mark still treated the ’Sage Eye Golden Core’ with caution, controlling the power of its techniques to not harm the Sage Eye Golden Core.\"","If so, with just one ’Sage Eye Golden Core,’ it could firmly restrain the three-eyed young man’s Heavenly Dao mark and hold it back.","\"It seems that pinning hopes on the three-eyed young man’s Heavenly Dao mark is pointless,\" Song Shuhang said. \"Perhaps, we could look forward to a change from Senior White’s side?\"","\"Shuhang, did you call me?\" Senior White’s voice happened to sound in Song Shuhang’s ear at that moment.","Then, Senior White’s figure appeared next to Song Shuhang in a few strides from a distance.","\"Have you dealt with the Heavenly Dao White Seal and Daoist Priest Virtue’s mark?\" Song Shuhang asked, puzzled.","\"Yes,\" Senior White nodded. \"I have a set of Combined Magical Treasure refined by the Heavenly Dao White on me, it was his prepared ’contingency plan.’ Semi-transcendent as he was, it seems he saw a lot of things. And then, his mark and Daoist Priest Virtue’s mark were both handled.\"","\"Now, shall we join forces to take down the ’Dark Heavenly Dao’ mark first?\" Senior White asked.","\"No, I suggest we backstab the Heavenly Dao marks of the other Seniors first. Otherwise, if the ’Dark Heavenly Dao mark’ disappears, the other Heavenly Dao marks will turn their hands against us,\" Song Shuhang intelligently said.","Reincarnation Blade Fairy: \"...\"","Ruthless man!",".",".","I have updated another chapter, are you surprised?","After all, it’s the new year; even a lazy person like me should make an effort and show the fellow Daoists and fairies some spirit.","Here’s the third update, once again wishing everyone, in the year 2020, that you may get whatever you want, that your thoughts come through, may your academic pursuits be successful, and your career be fulfilling!"]},{"number":3120,"title":"Chapter 3120 - 3118: You Can Exchange for a Plane with the Tyrannical Song That’s Handed Out Every Minute!","paragraphs":["Don’t be fooled by the seemingly advantageous situation, where a group of Heavenly Dao Marks is ganging up on the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao Mark alongside Song Shuhang.","But this is only because the ’Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao Mark’ has become the ’First Hatred’ target of the other Heavenly Dao Marks, temporarily surpassing Song Shuhang, the ’Second Hatred’ target.","The relationship between Song Shuhang and the other Heavenly Dao Marks hasn’t shifted from ’hostile’ to ’allied’.","Even the Daozi’s Mark, which had integrated the ’Sage Eye Golden Core,’ at best, has only become ’neutral.’","Therefore... now is not the time to directly take out the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao Mark.","Once the Fourth Heavenly Dao Mark is destroyed, and we lose this ’hatred target,’ the rest of the Heavenly Dao Marks will once again fix their ’hatred target’ on Song Shuhang!","\"That makes sense,\" Senior White instantly understood Song Shuhang’s point.","\"Although it feels a bit ruthless, it indeed is the most correct choice,\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy comprehended, \"Since that’s the case, while the various ’Heavenly Dao Marks’ are stabbing the Fourth Heavenly Dao Mark in the back, let’s backstab them first!\"","Backstabbing the enemy who is backstabbing another enemy!","A backstab of a backstab.","\"So, which Heavenly Dao Mark shall we pick as our first target?\" Song Shuhang asked.","Currently, the fat ball Heavenly Dao, Heavenly Dao White, and Daoist Priest Virtue’s Heavenly Dao Marks had been dealt with.","The ones left to backstab are the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy Mark, Heavenly Dao Goudan Father’s Mark, Daozi’s Mark, and the spectating Three-Eyed Youth’s Heavenly Dao Mark.","\"How about we start with the weakest in attack power? Retain those Heavenly Dao Marks with strong attack power so that we can maximize their attack power to suppress the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s stars?\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy suggested.","\"Then, let’s take out the three-eyed Heavenly Dao Mark first!\" Song Shuhang’s eyes, filled with ill intent, looked toward the second Heavenly Dao Mark that was idly playing with the ’Sage Eye Golden Core.’","The Second Heavenly Dao had not participated in the act of ’suppressing the Dark Heavenly Dao Stars’ and, being unsociable, was isolated from the rest.","Since it could not contribute to the suppression of the Fourth Heavenly Dao Stars, it might as well be blasted away first!","\"Agreed,\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said—as long as her family’s Heavenly Dao Mark isn’t the first one to be blasted away, that’s fine.","Better yet, if her family’s Heavenly Dao Mark could remain after the ’Dark Heavenly Dao Mark’ is taken out.","That way, she would feel a little better.","\"I also think it’s feasible,\" Senior White agreed, nodding his head.","Since Senior White has also chosen to agree, it means that this choice is more than 90% likely to be the ’best option,’ with the remaining 10% being a ’decent choice.’","\"Goudan’s Father and Senior Three Eyes have no objections either. They agree that we should blast away the three-eyed youth’s mark first. After speculation, Daoist Senior also feels this plan is most appropriate,\" Song Shuhang added.","In order to keep the ’Field Support Team’ seniors informed and ready to offer advice, Song Shuhang had been using the ’path to immortality’ to photograph the battle situation and post it to his circle of friends, limiting viewing permissions to the support team.","This way, though they were on the sidelines, each powerful expert could keep abreast of the situation at all times and promptly provide Song Shuhang with the most useful advice.","Tyrannical Song was never fighting alone!","\"Well then, let’s discuss the plan to take out the three-eyed Heavenly Dao Mark. My Reinforced ’Karmic Saber Technique’ should still be usable for about two more times... As for the three corpses in the main world, each one can currently take on a part of karma for me,\" Song Shuhang spoke out. \"If we don’t consider the ’karma’s’ impact on the final stage of proving his pseudo-immortal body, then my main body can still strike one more time as the carrier.\"","\"Alright, we can use those two strikes later,\" Senior White decided. \"This time, let’s use my method again. But, Shuhang, you need to cooperate with me.\"","The method Senior White mentioned was the ’Combined Magical Treasure’ left by the Wielder of the Will White, a successor of near-transcendence. It was the contingency plan of the Wielder of the Will White, who was one step away from transcendence.","Previously, it was with this set of ’Combined Magical Treasures’ that Senior White, using the Heavenly Dao White Seal, blasted away the Daoist Priest Virtue’s Mark.","\"How should I cooperate?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"I need your Sub-immortal State, and the 10000 kilometers Giant Blade form you’re currently using can also come in handy,\" Senior White brought out the ’Combined Magical Treasure.’","This magical treasure set, refined by the nearly transcendent Wielder of the Will White himself, could withstand the pressure from the Heavenly Principle Dimension.","Then, Senior White gently clapped his hands.","The Combined Magical Treasure started assembling and transforming.","The scene was cool.","Shortly, the Combined Magical Treasure transformed into a ’cannon’ shape.","However, this cannon didn’t just have one barrel, but rather, like a Gatling Gun, it had many barrels grouped together in a terrifying stance.","When Song Shuhang saw this contraption, he subconsciously felt a chill in his heart.","—Even when facing the countless barrels of the battle fortress form of Fat Ball Heavenly Dao, Song Shuhang had never felt such a chill.","This chilling feeling stemmed from an ’inhumane’ intuition.","His Heavenly Axiom-level intuition told him that the ’Gatling Gun’ Senior White had invoked might be very ’expensive’ in terms of ’people’.","\"Come on, Shuhang, first transform into your human form,\" Senior White waved over to Shuhang rapidly—the frequency of his waving was quite high.","At this point in the battle, even without Song Shuhang, the other Heavenly Dao Marks could still firmly suppress the ’Dark Heavenly Dao Stars,’ keeping them in a state of ’exhausted defense’ without the strength to counterattack.","So Song Shuhang could completely step away for a moment.","\"Senior White, is this thing going to be expensive in terms of people?\" Song Shuhang, now in human form, asked cautiously.","\"A bit expensive... If it were an ordinary Tribulation Transcender or Immortal, they probably couldn’t last even one shot. The mark of Wielder of the Will White, since it doesn’t have the ’eternal’ attribute, only turned into about a hundred shots. But you’re different, you’re just right,\" Senior White reassured him.","Song Shuhang was, after all, a Full Body Semi-Immortal plus his path to immortality had been ’strengthened in the sub-ascension-to-Heaven’s-Will phase.’","At the Sub-immortal Level, he was almost indestructible.","You could say that at this moment, Song Shuhang was indeed much more effective than a ’Heavenly Dao Mark.’","Moreover, he was at a level where he could be recycled and reused.","Song Shuhang: \"...\"","At this moment, he suddenly thought of Soft Feather—if it were Soft Feather’s personality, she might, out of curiosity, be very happy to try out this ’magical treasure,’ right?","\"Come quick, don’t waste time,\" Senior White enthusiastically waved over to Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang gritted his teeth, closed his eyes, and offered no resistance.","A moment later...","The members of Song Shuhang’s ’online field support team’ saw from Tyrannical Song’s social media update a face of despair.","And Tyrannical Song, stuffed into a strange magical treasure.","It resembled a ’Gatling Gun,’ and Song Shuhang’s body had been loaded into the ’ammunition slot.’","Senior White two: \"???\"","Father Goudan: \"???\"","Three-eyed young senior: \"???\"","Daozi: \"???\"","For a moment, the members of the support team sent out a neat row of question marks.","What’s he trying to do?","\"From today onwards, please call me Song Shuhang•A Thousand Shots Per Minute, each minute’s Tyrannical Song is worth the equivalent value of a ’Myriad Realms Plane,’\" Song Shuhang added in another comment."]},{"number":3121,"title":"Chapter 3121 - 3119: As a Senior, I Can’t Let You Bear the Hardships Alone!","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang’s method of calculation was actually quite modest.","Now, he could be described as ’a small Heavenly Way walking among mortals.’ If it really was about the value of a thousand Tyrannical Songs combined, it definitely wouldn’t be something that could be exchanged for with just one ’plane of the myriad worlds.’","\"Lock confirmed,\" Senior White announced, and began charging the Combined Magical Treasure.","The multi-barrel of the magical treasure was already locked onto the Three-Eyed Heavenly Dao Seal.","\"Senior White...I want to ask, was the Heavenly Dao White Seal also installed like this before?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Yes, and he climbed in on his own, very actively,\" Senior White replied.","Song Shuhang let out a long sigh, \"If that’s the case, I do feel somewhat relieved in my heart.\"","After all, even Heavenly Dao White had been launched before.","This way, he could be considered to have received the high-level treatment of possessing the Heavenly Dao White Seal.","Somehow, he felt much more at ease in his heart.","\"After this finishes, you’ll have to tell me about the experience... next time, it will be my turn,\" Senior White pondered before reminding aloud.","Song Shuhang: \"???\"","No, I refuse.","The idea of stuffing Senior White into the cannon and firing him out sounded pretty good.","But what if it triggered a rebound of his bizarre luck?","I, Tyrannical Song, still want to live past 2020!","So...","\"There’s no need for that trouble, Senior White. Leave such trivial matters to me. I am a man with a body of Semi-Immortal, so there’s no need to worry about my consumption,\" Song Shuhang said righteously.","His strong will to live moved the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","\"No, we still have several ’Heavenly Dao Marks’ to deal with, so it’s better for us to take turns. Besides, it’s not only you who’s proving your Dao... this time, we’re two separate entities proving the Dao together,\" Senior White earnestly answered, \"As a senior, I can’t let you bear all the difficulties alone.\"","A senior should act like one.","If possible, Senior White hoped he could shoulder more of the hardships.","Taking care of juniors was also a fine tradition among the fellow friends of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy, upon hearing this, was moved again—indeed worthy of two different entities capable of proving their Dao simultaneously, Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White considered each other and assisted mutually.","This was probably the foundation of their ability to ’prove the Dao as different individuals at the same time.’","Just as the Reincarnation Blade Fairy was secretly touched, Song Shuhang suddenly asked, \"Senior White... actually, you just want to be launched for fun, right?\"","Senior White’s slender hands stiffened.","Was he hit the nail on the head?","Reincarnation Blade Fairy: \"???\"","\"Launch!\" Senior White pressed the launch button of the ’Combined Magical Treasure’—Time, indeed, has the power to change people’s character. He remembered at the beginning, even when Shuhang discovered that he had broken a household appliance, he wouldn’t expose it blatantly but would choose to ignore it out of kindness. But, not so much has passed, and ever since he became Tyrannical Song, Song Shuhang’s attribute of speaking his mind was magnified and became incurable.","As Senior White gave the command, Song Shuhang felt as if all his strength was being drained...","This draining was to the extent of being ’completely squeezed dry.’","Subsequently, the energy equivalent of one ’Tyrannical Song’ unit was transformed into more than ten ’shells’—compared to the Heavenly Dao White Seal, the conversion rate of one ’Tyrannical Song’ dropped by tenfold.","This was mainly because this mode of the Combined Magical Treasure was a fallback created by Heavenly Dao White, originally set to launch the ’Heavenly Dao White Seal.’","Stuffing Song Shuhang into it was somewhat ’off-spec.’","The reason it accepted him was mainly due to the compensation that had taken place between Song Shuhang and Senior White, utilizing the innate skill of a Confucian Sage.","He barely passed the certification of the magical treasure.","The price was a slightly reduced conversion rate.","Fortunately, the power of each shell was also enhanced by seven to eight times, so the loss wasn’t too much.","After being drained of energy in an instant... thanks to the power of the \"undying fat whale golden core\" and the sub-immortal physique, plus the constant replenishment from \"Cultivation Chat Path,\"","As soon as he was drained, Song Shuhang’s mental energy would quickly recover.","Then it would be drained again, and then restored.","And so the cycle continued.","Da-Da-Da-Da-Da~","From the Gatling magical treasure’s barrels, the compassionate Tyrannical Song bullets were fired continuously.","Each bullet contained the power of Tyrannical Song’s \"Cultivation Chat Path plus sub-immortal level\" strike, and even after each bullet was fired, it would also come with a layer of \"Body Transformation Blade,\" adding a layer of giant blade light damage.","Opposite, the Second Heavenly Dao Seal that had been playing with the \"Sage Eye Golden Core\" suddenly paused.","Then it did something that made Song Shuhang incredulous.","The Second Heavenly Dao Seal actually turned around and shielded the \"Sage Eye Golden Core,\" protecting it!","This scene was truly touching.","In comparison, Song Shuhang felt like he had become the villain, persecuting the righteous.","The emotionally touched Tyrannical Song instantly captured this scene and sent it to the members of his \"Field Support Team.\"","He had just managed to send the picture.","Hundreds of \"Tyrannical Song shells\" mercilessly rained down on the body of the Second Heavenly Dao Seal.","Da-Da-Da~","The sound of cannon fire was deafening, and the fatally tempting Tyrannical Song bullets fell relentlessly on the Second Heavenly Dao Seal.","After a full minute of firing...","The Second Heavenly Dao Seal was crushed to pieces, leaving nothing behind.","In the vacuum, only the perfectly preserved \"Sage Eye Golden Core\" remained in its place, seemingly accusing Tyrannical Song of cruelty to the world!","Although the Sage Eye Golden Core was originally Tyrannical Song’s and there was no need to worry about it being damaged.","When the firing ended, the Gatling cannon’s loading mouth bounced back slightly, pushing Song Shuhang out.","\"How does it feel, Shuhang?\" Senior White asked with a gentle smile, reaching out to pull Song Shuhang up.","\"I always feel like I’ve done something against my conscience, like I’ve become a heartless villain,\" Song Shuhang thoughtfully replied.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy interjected, \"You were already heartless when you chose to backstab these Heavenly Dao Seals.\"","\"Now is not the time to think too much,\" Senior White said, pulling Song Shuhang out and then quickly lying down in the \"loading mouth\" himself, \"It’s my turn. As a senior... it’s my turn to take on the difficulties. Who’s next, who should we eliminate first?\"","Song Shuhang pondered for a moment: \"Hmm, Daoist Senior’s mark is currently in the best condition, and even without the Fourth Heavenly Dao attracting hate, it won’t attack us proactively. So, let’s remove Goudan’s Father’s Mark first.\"","\"Then let’s lock onto it,\" Senior White agreed.","\"Actually, I’ve been wanting to ask, isn’t the Third Heavenly Dao a dragon? Why is it Goudan?\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy asked.","\"No, I’m the dog, no... to be precise, it’s Cheng Lin who is Goudan. It is Goudan’s father,\" Song Shuhang replied.","Then, he said to Senior White, \"Senior White, I actually have a bold idea... why don’t we load several more ’ammunition sources’ into it and blow up all the Heavenly Dao Marks in front of us in one go? The Reincarnation Blade Fairy can take over controlling the magical treasure for us.\"","Since all the Heavenly Dao Marks were clustered together anyway, wouldn’t it be perfect to wipe them all out in one fell swoop?"]},{"number":3122,"title":"Chapter 3122 - 3120: Zhu Sheng’s Peak","paragraphs":["\"But the source of ammunition isn’t enough, is it?\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy voiced her doubt.","Presently, among the 2-8.5 Heavenly Dao Marks, four had been dealt with.","The black Fourth Heavenly Dao Mark remained, surrounded and under attack.","The Heavenly Dao Goudan’s father’s mark from Tyrannical Song’s family.","The mark of her own origin, the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy.","And the Daozi’s Mark that turned the ’Heavenly Dao’s Calculation Ability’ into a cheat given to Tyrannical Song.","Even if Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist White were fed into the magical treasure, turning them into an ammunition source, to take care of the four opposing Heavenly Dao Marks in one go would still fall short.","To cover and strike, at least three ’ammunition sources’ were needed.","If one were to take extra caution for assurance—having four sources of ammunition would guarantee enough firepower to eliminate the remaining Heavenly Dao Marks in a rapid series of ’tuts’.","\"if Fellow Senior White and I aren’t enough, then we’ll have to find external help,\" Song Shuhang stroked his chin, pondering, \"Could the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy provide an ’immortal power’ level of Heavenly Dao Mark from outside the field?\"","\"Why not dream a more splendid dream, like having my true self descend upon the Heavenly Principle Dimension to eliminate all the Heavenly Dao Marks for you?\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy’s secret sound transmission replied.","This secret sound transmission at its end...","Bore a disdainful ( ̄_, ̄) expression.","This was evidently an upgraded version of ’secret sound transmission,’ even including the ability to convey emotions!","Through this, it could be seen how boring it usually was for the Reincarnation Blade Fairy to be alone in the ’Reincarnation Palace.’","\"Eh, that idea is stunningly vicious,\" said Song Shuhang.","\"Beautiful dreams are useless though,\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy replied piercingly.","Previously, with the Karmic Saber and the ’Cultivation Chat Immortal Path,’ Song Shuhang had managed to gather ’a single strike’s’ power through the myriad realms’ diversion channels.","To have the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy directly transmit ’a Heavenly Dao Mark’s’ power through a single channel would likely take a hundred and eighty years to complete, or even longer.","By then, all the daylilies would have long gone cold.","\"What a pity, having such a powerful ally yet unable to enter the fray,\" Song Shuhang lamented.","Since external assistance was not an option, he’d have to slightly advance his own power.","Song Shuhang’s gaze turned towards the location of the ’Sage Eye Golden Core,’ where the Heavenly Dao Three-Eyed Youth’s Mark had been destroyed.","\"The Sage Eye Golden Core? But in the end, the Confucian Sage never proved his Dao and can’t replace an ’ammunition source,’\" said Senior White, flipping over and speaking from inside the magazine.","\"No, what I’m looking at is something else,\" Song Shuhang waved his hand, \"This technique, I haven’t used in a while... mainly because I haven’t encountered a suitable target. But today’s target really pleases me, perfect for my spell casting!\"","Upon hearing this, Reincarnation Blade Fairy grew curious and asked Song Shuhang, \"You have quite a variety of techniques? Ever since the beginning, there always seems to be a secret technique that comes in handy. Just how many secret techniques do you have?\"","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky: \"...\"","His queer reaction made Reincarnation Blade Fairy pause in confusion: \"???\"","\"I know a bit, just a bit,\" Song Shuhang replied.","Having said that, he didn’t give Reincarnation Blade Fairy a chance to continue asking. He directly performed a spell: \"Come forth, with my present ’intent’ and ’energy’ as the foundation, Overlord God Pillar!\"","This was a pillar technique, a true transmission from the Demon Emperor ’Senior Hezhi.’","Paraphrasing a line from Senior Hezhi: Wherever the Overlord God Pillar is planted, that is Tyrannical Song’s domain!","And today.","The birth of the Overlord God Pillar was about to reach a new peak!","For what Tyrannical Song intended to condense was the residual power of the Heavenly Dao Mark—using the ’Imprint Energy’ of Senior Three Eyes of the Heavenly Dao to forge an unprecedented ’Heavenly Dao Pillar.’","\"If successful, this would undoubtedly become part of the lineup of ’the strongest pillars’ in the myriad practitioners in the universe.\"","\"From the original ’Profound Sage Pillar,’ to the later ’Pillar of Longevity,’ to the special ’heavenly tribulation pillar’.\"","\"Today, Tyrannical Song finally extended his demonic claws toward the ’Heavenly Dao’.\"","\"It was an inevitable development.\"","\"From the day Tyrannical Song learned the ’Overlord God Pillar’, it was destined that this day would come sooner or later. After all, given Tyrannical Song’s capacity for causing trouble, confronting the Heavenly Dao head-on was only a matter of time.\"","\"Whoooosh~\"","\"As Song Shuhang began casting,\"","\"centered around the residue energy of the Three-Eyed Heavenly Dao Seal and the imprint fragments, a whirlwind arose, forming a tornado.\"","\"And at the center of this tornado, a terrifying ’pillar’ began to condense!\"","\"At the same time, the ’undying fat whale golden core + Sub-immortal power’ within Song Shuhang’s body was continuously extracted and poured into this new Overlord God Pillar.\"","\"Just like when he had been loaded into the ’Gatlin Cannon Barrel’ before, he was drained dry time and again, repeating this cycle nine times.\"","\"After nine times, the pillar was completely formed.\"","\"This pillar radiated a spiritual pressure and Dao Trace of a level resembling that of a Heavenly Dao Mark... as well as the power of the three-eyed young senior’s mark.\"","\"This was a pillar that touched the heavens.\"","\"A normal Overlord God Pillar formed from the power of an Immortal would be roughly 40 to 100 meters in length.\"","\"But this Overlord God Pillar, transformed from the mark of Senior Three-Eyed, seemed endless at a glance!\"","\"All over the pillar, various ’weather’ patterns appeared.\"","\"There were clear skies, overcast days, thunderstorms, heavy snow... and each cloud pattern of the weather held three pupils hidden within, as if spying on the world.\"","\"Through his senses, Song Shuhang could ’see’ that at the very top of the pillar, there was a statue of a three-eyed young man resembling almost exactly the Senior Nine Hells Three Eyes, and even beside this statue, there was an ’eyeball butler’!\"","\"’Eh?’ Song Shuhang wondered as he looked at the statue of the eyeball butler.\"","\"Why would the eyeball butler also appear in the ’Heavenly Dao statues’?\"","\"Could it be... that it and the Three-Eyed Youth are actually the same entity?\"","\"But the way Senior Three-Eyed of the Netherworld Realm treated the eyeball butler didn’t seem like it was part of his own ’body’.\"","\"The eyeball butler was even thinking about every which way to jump ship!\"","\"This is getting interesting,\" Song Shuhang thought to himself.","\"He then reached out and prompted the pillar to shrink down to the size of a ’long staff’ and hover in front of him: ’From today onwards, you are the latest in my series of Overlord God Pillars—Heavenly Dao Pillar•Three-Eyed Pillar!’\"","\"On this day, another new series was added to the Overlord God Pillars!\"","\"’A cruel and terrifying secret technique!’ Reincarnation Blade Fairy swallowed nervously.\"","\"The secret techniques Tyrannical Song had were both enigmatic and ruthless.\"","\"The enemies who died by Tyrannical Song’s hand, if they did not destroy their bodies before death, would be posthumously whipped and then transformed into ’pillars’, to be used by Tyrannical Song for life.\"","\"It was almost comparable to a Necromancer from the Western body-tempering systems.\"","\"’It’s done, Senior White, do you think this ’Heavenly Dao Pillar’ can be of use?’ Song Shuhang handed the ’Heavenly Dao Pillar•Three-Eyed Pillar’ to Senior White.\"","\"Senior White took the ’Heavenly Dao Pillar’ and inserted it into the magazine of the ’Thirty-Three Beasts Combined Magical Artifact•Gatling Gun’.\"","\"A moment later,\"","\"It’s feasible!\" Senior White nodded, \"However, the energy of a single Heavenly Dao Pillar is lower than that of a ’Heavenly Dao Mark’. We’re going to need more ’Heavenly Dao Pillars’ to make it work.\"","\"With that, Senior White reached out, taking out two treasure chests.\""]},{"number":3123,"title":"Chapter 3123 - 3121: Some things still need to be shared with an intimate friend","paragraphs":["The material of the treasure chest was made of solidified \"virtue power,\" and the items sealing the box were two strands of long hair.","\"Originally, I wanted to keep them, as they might be used to forge primordial treasures in the future... Now, they come in handy,\" Senior White handed over the two treasure chests to Song Shuhang.","\"Heavenly Dao Seal Fragments?\" Song Shuhang understood intuitively.","It was carefully packed by Senior White, and there were two of them, which exactly matched the number of \"Heavenly Dao White Seal\" and \"Virtuous Daoist Seal\" previously taken by Senior White.","\"That’s right,\" Senior White nodded.","[Such a coincidence?]Reincarnation Blade Fairy looked up at the sky.","It was worthy of two existences that were so in tune they could ’prove their Dao simultaneously as two separate entities.’","One would defeat the enemy and then refine it into an ’Overlord God Pillar’.","The other thought about refining the enemy into a ’primordial treasure’ after defeating it.","Both were ruthless people.","Moreover, because of this understanding, the fragments of the two ’Heavenly Dao Seals’ collected by Fellow Daoist White and the remaining energy were just right for Song Shuhang’s use, a coincidental match~","It felt like, in the dark, things like luck were taking care of Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White.","It was good that these two guys weren’t enemies.","It was good that my Spirit River Su Clan had a friendly relationship with these two guys.","After feeling fortunate, Reincarnation Blade Fairy coughed lightly and said, \"I also have something here that I can give to you, Tyrannical Song.\"","Song Shuhang turned around, his eyes lighting up as he asked, \"Reincarnation Blade Fairy, do you want to contribute your power so I can make it into a ’Dao Artifact Pillar’?\"","A Dao Artifact Pillar would be great too, and although it wasn’t as powerful as a Heavenly Dao Pillar, it was still very powerful, and Song Shuhang wouldn’t refuse.","\"Ptui!\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy spat at Tyrannical Song with the fiercest tone—I’m alive and well, why would I let you make me into a pillar?","After fiercely spitting at Tyrannical Song, Reincarnation Blade Fairy slightly unsheathed herself and brought out some ’Heavenly Dao Seal Fragments’ from Sixteen’s scabbard.","These were the imprint of the ’Heavenly Dao Fat Ball’ that Song Shuhang had killed with a single strike.","\"After you exploded the seal of the Heavenly Dao ball, I saw these Heavenly Dao Seal Fragments and thought that perhaps they could be used to upgrade Sixteen’s scabbard, so I kept them... Now, I’ll let you use them first, but don’t forget to open the Eye-Opening for Sixteen’s scabbard more in the future,\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy said.","\"Thank you, Fairy,\" Song Shuhang accepted the ’Heavenly Dao Fat Ball Imprint Fragments,’ smiling broadly. \"With this, we can produce four more ’Heavenly Dao Pillars’ on our side! Enough to take away the remaining Heavenly Dao imprints.\"","\"Right, and after one wave takes them away, we can condense four more ’Heavenly Dao Pillars’ and gather a complete set,\" Senior White reminded.","It was regrettable that the First Heavenly Dao had erased all his own intelligence data, making it impossible to get his Heavenly Dao Seal.","Otherwise, adding the First Heavenly Dao later would truly complete a full set of ’Heavenly Dao Pillars,’ making it perfectly complete.","\"So... I’m starting now!\" Song Shuhang took a deep breath and adjusted his state.","Even though he was in the ’Heavenly Principle Dimension,’ the sub-immortal power that was consumed could gradually be replenished by drawing energy from the ’Heavenly Principle Dimension.’","But the feeling of being drained each time, that ’near-death’ sensation, was not a pleasant experience.","Moreover, refining a ’Heavenly Dao Pillar’ required at least nine cycles.","That’s roughly the equivalent of experiencing the feeling of death nine times.","However, for the Heavenly Dao Pillar, it was all worth it!","After adjusting his state, Song Shuhang, with a resolution to face death, bravely began the refining of three Heavenly Dao Seal fragments and their energies.","For a moment, the scene was filled with wild winds, thunder and lightning, a burning sky, and tsunamis... The quality of these special effects was worth at least three hundred million!","...","...","When the three Overlord God Pillars•Heavenly Dao Pillars were refined, Song Shuhang was nearly exhausted.","This exhaustion was not only physical but also a mental fatigue.","\"I feel like I’m back to the high school days of studying all night for the college entrance examination,\" Song Shuhang said, not wanting to move even a finger: \"Senior White, next, please test whether these three Heavenly Dao Pillars can be used.\"","\"You’ve worked hard, Shuhang,\" Senior White touched lightly, and the three shrunken ’Heavenly Dao Pillars’ descended, filling into the magical treasure magazine, for testing.","After a brief moment,","\"It can be done, with the four pillars plus you and me, that should be enough,\" Senior White confirmed.","Heavenly Dao Pillar•Ball Pillar.","Heavenly Dao Pillar•White Pillar.","Heavenly Dao Pillar•Human Pillar.","Plus the previously mentioned Heavenly Dao Pillar•Eye Pillar.","All four pillars were assembled.","Four times the peak of pillar power!","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but take a photo, which he sent through the ’Cultivator Chat System’ to Demon Emperor Hezhi.","—In this world, the man who understands ’pillars’ best is the Demon Emperor Hezhi. In this domain, wielding the \"Demon God Pillar\" skill and the \"Overlord God Pillar\" ability, he and Song Shuhang could be considered ’intimate friends’.","If it were the Demon Emperor Hezhi, he would definitely be able to recognize the terror of these four pillars in the photo at a glance.","The \"Demon God Pillar\" could be greatly developed in his hands, the Demon Emperor Hezhi must be feeling quite complex about it, right?","Unfortunately, there was no time to spy on the Demon Emperor Hezhi’s expression when he received the photo.","\"Have you rested well?\" Senior White asked.","\"I’ve recovered a bit... By the way, Senior White, for safety reasons, I should also use the other Overlord God Pillars I have,\" Song Shuhang struggled to sit up, offering up his ’Pillar of Longevity’.","Pillar of Longevity: Kun King Pillar, Overlord God Pillar, Virtual Sun Pillar.","The virtuous lamia transformed into the ’Pillow of Leather’.","Followed by the Heavenly Emperor’s Child + Stellar Destruction Virus’s ’Emperor Destroying Pillar’.","And then the ’Stardragon Pillar’—empowered by Dao Artifact Long-Eyed Planet Power + Lady Long Luo Power—this pillar, if brought to the Black Dragon World, undoubtedly wouldn’t be weaker than a ’Heavenly Dao Pillar’.","Using the Stardragon Pillar, Pillow of Leather, and Emperor Destroying Pillar as the main, and Kun King Pillar, Overlord God Pillar, and Virtual Sun Pillar as auxiliary, the combined effect should also match one and a half ’Heavenly Dao Pillars’.","As each Heavenly Dao Pillar, Dao Artifact Pillar, and Pillar of Longevity were loaded into the Gatling Gun, Song Shuhang considered thoughtfully.","[Perhaps, this is the true way to unlock my ’Overlord God Pillar’!]","My Overlord God Pillars, hammering people one by one, is too inefficient and frankly a waste.","Just like the ’Combined Magical Treasure,’ I should also be able to assemble my Overlord God Pillars into Senior White’s ’Gatling Gun’ mode.","Then, I’ll load in the Overlord God Pillars, firing Heavenly Dao Pillars, Pillars of Longevity, heavenly tribulation pillars... who could withstand that?","Even the active Dark Giant of the current main world’s Fourth Heavenly Dao would have to retreat in the face of such an attack!","\"With so many pillars, even in their reduced form, they’re still massive... Along with you and Fellow Daoist White, can the magical treasure accommodate them?\" asked the Reincarnation Blade Fairy at that moment.","She would be responsible for operating the magical treasure on behalf of Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist White in a while.","\"Don’t worry... the ’ammo chamber’ of the magical treasure actually contains vastness within tininess, it may look small, but its internal space is huge!\" Senior White patted the magical treasure.","Not to mention fitting him and Shuhang, even if they added ten more people, it wouldn’t feel cramped.","\"Alright, then let’s blow up all the ’Heavenly Dao Marks’ in one breath,\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy transformed into her human form.","Just the thought of personally blowing up the four Heavenly Dao Marks later made her a bit excited.","Although she was a Dao artifact, she had never done something so thrilling in her lifetime.","Especially since one of her own Heavenly Dao Marks would also be blown up by her.","True•I’ll be blowing up myself!","Blocked word function got me frustrated, the last character of the upper paragraph and the first character of the lower paragraph when combined becomes a blocked word, so it got blocked!","Milk-feeding section: Young Master Phoenix Slayer’s new book \"My Ferocious Beast is Super Cute\" is uploaded. His new book’s first chapter title in this chapter says•The First Throne, I’m taking it〜"]},{"number":3124,"title":"Chapter 3124 - 3122: The Time for Proving the Dao Has Arrived","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang shrank the \"Overlord God Pillars\" one by one and handed them to Senior White.","Senior White, after taking the \"Overlord God Pillars,\" then loaded them into the ammunition space.","After all the \"Overlord God Pillars\" were loaded, Song Shuhang turned his head to look at the illusory Reincarnation Blade Fairy and said, \"Fairy, can you hold on?\"","\"Of course I can, how could I possibly drop offline at such a thrilling moment?\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy replied confidently. \"However, if you could speed things up a bit, it would be safer.\"","She hoped to see the four Heavenly Dao Marks blasted apart before her mental energy was completely depleted, instead of just after firing, running out of energy.","\"Roger that, the next part... is up to you, Fairy,\" Song Shuhang said, then with a handsome diving pose, he leaped high into the air towards the ammunition space.","But just as his body reached its highest point, a pair of slender arms suddenly stretched out and gently held him.","Song Shuhang: \"???\"","It was the virtuous lamia...","The virtuous lamia suddenly appeared, grabbing Song Shuhang and then diving in a perfect scoring dive into the ammunition space.","With both Fairy Creation and black-skinned Soft Feather absent today, she had to take on the positive energy roles of three people.","When Shuhang began to show his handsome side, she had to triple her effort to make Shuhang even more handsome.","Whoosh~","As she fell into the ammunition space, the light of virtue from the virtuous lamia also depicted the imagery of ’entering water’.","The light of virtue spread out, making a sound like splashing water.","Reincarnation Blade Fairy was stunned for a moment, but she quickly reacted. She stretched out her hand and pushed Song Shuhang, Senior White, the virtuous lamia + all the \"Overlord God Pillars\" into the Gatling Gun magical treasure.","Then, mimicking Senior White’s previous operation, she aimed the cannon at the faraway fiercely contested four Great Heavenly Dao Marks and locked onto them.","The confrontation between the four Great Heavenly Dao Marks had reached a white-hot stage.","The Heavenly Dao Marks fought from one end of the starry sky to the other, engraving the stars with Dao Traces, constantly blowing up stars, eroding laws, and almost bursting the starry sky.","The laws of the Heavenly Dao, when manifesting the eight Great Heavenly Dao Marks, definitely didn’t anticipate a moment when the Heavenly Dao Marks would turn on each other.","Its last bit of defiance shivered at the cunning ploys of Tyrannical Song and White.","\"Good, locked on successfully, ammunition sufficient, next...four Heavenly Dao Marks in one breath!\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy felt a long-missing sense of ’nervousness.’","Just as she locked onto all four Great Heavenly Dao Marks, suddenly, the battling Daozi’s Mark, the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s Mark, and Goudan’s Father’s Mark all turned their heads and looked in her direction.","The Heavenly Dao Marks, even if just acting on instinct, still had sharp senses toward danger—previously, when the Three-Eyed Heavenly Dao Seal was locked on by firepower, it also reacted immediately.","However, its reaction was to protect the ’Sage Eye Golden Core’ with its body.","If not for protecting the ’Sage Eye Golden Core’, the bombardment fired by Senior White using Song Shuhang as ammunition would not have succeeded in easily blowing up the Three-Eyed Heavenly Dao Seal.","Now, as the four Great Heavenly Dao Marks were locked on, they too sensed the crisis, and subconsciously looked towards the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy only felt four heavy pressures bearing down on her.","Disaster!","If the four Great Heavenly Dao attacked her at the same time...","Just as this thought flashed through her mind, among the four Great Heavenly Dao Marks, Daozi’s Mark suddenly exploded, his spatial gate opening two more doors, encompassing both Goudan’s Father’s Mark and the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s Mark.","He was attempting to entangle the other two Great Heavenly Dao Marks to create an opportunity for the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","Even as a Heavenly Dao Mark, Daoist Senior was still the strongest tool in the Heavenly Dao!","As Daozi Senior took action decisively, an anomaly almost simultaneously occurred on the side of Goudan’s Father’s Mark—it suddenly transformed into a real dragon, fully powering up to release the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, letting it break away from the battle.","Following that, its dragon body moved, enveloping the other three major Heavenly Dao Marks.","The case with the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy was even more straightforward—since the Reincarnation Blade Fairy was her primordial treasure, originating from the same root as her. She also chose to shield the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","\"Turning the one qi into the three pure ones, one strike turning into three blades.\" The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s blades flickered, and with one split into three, she chopped towards the three major Heavenly Dao Marks.","Not to mention the Dark Heaven, which had always been the target of the three great Heavenly Dao Marks’ attacks, and was too tired to defend itself, passively enduring strikes without any chance to counterattack.","The four major Heavenly Dao Marks, attacking each other, entangling each other, dragging each other down, no one giving the others a chance to \"escape.\"","Seeing this, the Reincarnation Blade Fairy did not hesitate to trigger the attack of the ’Combined Magical Treasure.’","Da da da—Boom boom boom—Dong dong dong—Awoo awoo awoo—","For a moment, various sounds erupted at the \"mouth of the cannon\"... the sounds emitted by different types of ammunition were also distinct.","The voices from the Heavenly Dao Pillar, Tyrannical Song, and Senior White, each had their unique traits.","The Gatling gun’s muzzle burst into a palpitating blue light.","An endless barrage of ammunition poured onto the four great Heavenly Dao Marks...","When there was originally only Tyrannical Song’s ’magazine’, the number of rounds fired from the muzzle was about one in a thousand.","But with so many ammunition sources loaded, the quantity of ammunition poured out started at at least thirty thousand rounds a minute.","The Reincarnation Blade Fairy felt her adrenaline surge.","This sensation was addictive!","Holding this artifact, firing unrivaled firepower, tearing apart any target, such thrill accelerated the heartbeat of the Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","She felt herself getting hooked on this feeling.","Da da da da da—","After nearly two minutes of relentless bombing, the merciless Tyrannical Song bullet, White bullet, and Overlord God Pillar bullet, conducted a saturation coverage strike on the battle area of the four great Heavenly Dao Marks.","The magical cannon stopped rotating, the gunfire died down, and smoke rose from the muzzle.","\"Is it over?\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said, feeling somewhat reluctant.","If possible, she truly wished to experience this thrill a few more times!","Her form gradually started to fade.","As she was about to dissipate, her gaze turned towards the area of the four great Heavenly Dao Marks.","\"All annihilated, it’s done,\" declared the Reincarnation Blade Fairy, satisfied.","The four great Heavenly Dao Marks had all turned into fragments, and her corresponding Fifth Heavenly Dao Mark was no exception.","\"Mission complete, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, remember to call me next time there’s such an opportunity,\" the Reincarnation Blade Fairy said with reluctance.","Her form dissipated.","The Combined Magical Treasure also reached its limit, automatically disassembled, and turned into thirty-three artifact spirit fairies, supporting Song Shuhang and Senior White.","Under the era-changing firepower, the last stubbornness of the Heavenly Dao was mercilessly shredded.","From this moment, in the Myriad Realms, no power or principle could prevent Song Shuhang and Senior White from proving their Dao together!","\"Senior White, the time to prove the Dao has arrived,\" Song Shuhang struggled to sit up, showing a brilliant smile."]},{"number":3125,"title":"Chapter 3125 - 3123 Senior White: Don’t you have any guard against me at all?","paragraphs":["Having been drained once before, Song Shuhang developed an immunity to \"becoming a power source,\" so his recovery was much faster than last time.","—This ability was probably an upgraded version of his \"pain endurance.\"","Senior White opened his eyes and smiled, \"Ah, finally... we’ve reached this step. From now on, nothing can obstruct our path to enlightenment.\"","He spoke a cool line, but Senior White was so weak that he couldn’t even move a finger and could only lie there, resting for a while.","Unlike Song Shuhang, he didn’t have the \"undying fat whale golden core\" or a body that was fully semi-immortal, nor did he possess the bug-level innate skill of \"pain endurance.\"","\"Are you happy?\" Song Shuhang asked.","He wasn’t asking if Senior White was \"happy about proving his Dao,\" but rather if he \"enjoyed the process.\"","\"Mm, it was somewhat interesting. But I doubt I’ll experience it a second time,\" Senior White replied, using the back of his hand to shield his eyes from the blinding light spreading from the immortal root source.","\"Me neither,\" Song Shuhang nodded in agreement.","The sensation of becoming a power source, with even the marrow feeling like it was being drained, was more troubling than the sprint to the college entrance exams back in the day.","With that, Song Shuhang’s gaze fell upon the fragments of the four great Heavenly Dao Seal lying not so far away.","The virtuous lamia received the signal, emerging behind Song Shuhang with a delighted expression.","Then, with graceful movements, she floated over, gathering the freshly shattered fragments of the four great Heavenly Dao Seal and the residual energy, for Song Shuhang to use shortly in condensing the \"Heavenly Dao Pillar.\"","Moments later,","Taking advantage of Senior White’s rest, Song Shuhang clenched his teeth and once again drained himself, in one breath condensing the remaining four Heavenly Dao Seal fragments into \"Heavenly Dao Pillars.\"","Heavenly Dao Pillar•Black Pillar.","Heavenly Dao Pillar•Dragon Column.","Heavenly Dao Pillar•Dao Pillar.","And the pillar formed by the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy.","\"What was the name of the Fifth Heavenly Immortal again?\" Song Shuhang pondered as he looked at the last pillar.","It seemed he had never managed to ask for the fairy’s celestial name.","This was quite impolite.","Next time he went to the Su Clan’s Ancestor Star, he would ask the Reincarnation Fairy.","For now, for the sake of symmetry in naming... perhaps call it Heavenly Dao Pillar•Reincarnation Pillar?","After collecting all eight Heavenly Dao Pillars, Song Shuhang turned towards Senior White, \"Are you rested? Senior White?\"","\"Almost,\" Senior White sat up.","Song Shuhang stepped forward, reaching out to help Senior White up.","Not far away, the virtuous lamia, who was swimming joyously in the Heavenly Dao starry sky, saw this and leisurely flew back, perching behind Song Shuhang, on top of his head.","—Becoming Song Shuhang’s \"Virtuous Manifestation\" was also an accident.","The \"karmic\" connection between Fairy @#%× and Song Shuhang originated from Cheng Lin.","After becoming Song Shuhang’s \"body of virtue,\" she never imagined that in just a brief year, Song Shuhang would advance by leaps and bounds, proving his Dao to immortality.","She wouldn’t have even dared to entertain such a thought, and the previous her would not have even conceived such a notion.","Yet, incredibly, it had become a reality.","During the subsequent process of enlightenment, she might even benefit more than Song Shuhang’s \"Three Corpses Avatar.\"","Manifestations and clones, during the original body’s proof of the Dao, were only indirect beneficiaries.","Some manifestations and clones would even be reclaimed during the \"Heavenly Dao enlightenment\" phase, merging back with the original body and returning to wholeness.","But she was different, as a \"body of virtue,\" she was a part of the original body itself.","Similar to the magnificent manifestation of light of virtue of the undying Daoist Priest Virtue, Fairy @#%× would also be bathed in immortal light when the time came.","To tell the truth, even as Song Shuhang and Senior White formally stepped into the \"Heavenly Dao Rules Core Area\" to undertake the final step of proving their Dao, the virtuous lamia still felt as if she were dreaming.","As if all of this had an unrealistic, dreamlike quality.","...","...","Heavenly Dao Rules Core Area.","After the last defiance was shattered, the Heavenly Dao rules ceased to resist Song Shuhang and Senior White, opening up completely to the two of them.","Song Shuhang and Senior White, maintaining 100% synchronization, stepped into the core of the Heavenly Dao’s rules at the same moment.","The next moment, the authority of the Heavenly Dao, its rules, and immortal information enveloped Song Shuhang and Senior White.","For the first time, the right to inherit the Heavenly Dao’s authority was simultaneously assumed by two different entities.","\"Is this the Heavenly Dao’s authority?\" Song Shuhang reached out his palm, looking at his body that began to evolve from ’sub-immortality’ to full ’immortality’.","The information enveloping his body was the ’cause’ of all things in the world, the ’source’ of all phenomena, and the ’ultimate’ of all knowledge.","Authority and knowledge that were close to ’omniscience and omnipotence’.","The reason it was said to be close to omniscience and omnipotence was only because it was lacking the knowledge and ability of ’detachment’.","From the moment they inherited the authority of the Heavenly Dao, Song Shuhang and Senior White became the source of all and mastered the ultimate knowledge of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","\"However, even at the final step, is the Heavenly Dao’s rules still expressing its dissatisfaction?\" Song Shuhang suddenly laughed.","He and Senior White had begun to ’immortalize’.","But the immortal information they received from the ’Heavenly Dao Core’ and their ’portion’ of the Heavenly Dao’s rules was only about 1.5 portions.","\"It’s probably already at its limit,\" Senior White said aloud.","His intuition told him that the material and information the Heavenly Dao could provide for someone to forge an ’immortal’ state were limited. Moreover, Daozi had recently proved his Dao through Fat Ball’s backup plan to become the 8.5 Heavenly Dao and had obtained immortality once.","The 1.5 portions of immortality that the Heavenly Dao Core could provide now might just be its current limit... The remainder might require tens of thousands or even hundreds of millions of years to replenish.","If it had been any other two ’different individuals’ proving their Dao, the lack of 0.5 portions of immortality probably would have prevented them from proving their Dao perfectly.","But neither Senior White nor Song Shuhang... needed a full two portions of immortality.","Song Shuhang originally had the ’undying fat whale golden core’ + ’sub-immortal’ state.","And Senior White also had a complete ’immortal galaxy’.","So, even with just 1.5 portions of ’immortality,’ it was more than enough to allow both to achieve immortality, even with plenty to spare!","Inheriting the ’Heavenly Dao Authority’.","Receiving ’ultimate knowledge’.","Condensing the ’immortal body’.","The entire process was orderly and methodical.","The next step...","Was for the two of them to step out of the ’Heavenly Dao Origin’ and declare to the myriad practitioners in the universe the incident of ’two Heavenly Dao simultaneously proving their position,’ and to take over the ruling authority of the entire universe.","\"By the way, Shuhang.\" Before stepping out of the Heavenly Dao Origin world, Senior White spoke to Song Shuhang, \"After proving the Dao, have you thought about the next step, ’detachment’?\"","\"Mhm,\" Song Shuhang nodded.","\"Based on our current progress, after two different individuals have proven the Dao... one Heavenly Dao must stay behind to take over the complete Heavenly Dao authority, while the other completes detachment,\" Senior White said seriously. \"That means, among you and me, only one can achieve transcendence and eternity.\"","Song Shuhang nodded again; he had deduced this as well.","\"Then... have you ever considered that all my actions have been aimed at transcending immortality, to achieve detachment?\" Senior White suddenly asked. \"Haven’t you been the slightest bit cautious against me?\"","\"Senior White, stop joking around. You and I are attuned in heart and mind. You know my thoughts better than anyone,\" Song Shuhang said. \"For me, if Senior White can detach, it would also make up for the regret left behind by the master of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion, Pavilion Master Chu, and deal with the problems of the Future Subworld. The obsessions of the past, the karmic ties of the present, and the hopes for the future are all borne by us. Therefore, it makes no difference who detaches.\"","The only regret might be that no matter who ’detaches,’ it’s uncertain if they could continue to linger in this universe.","Whether there will be a time to meet again in the future.","This was the only concern in Song Shuhang’s heart regarding the ’detachment’ plan.","\"Although I am quite clear about it, I just wanted to ask,\" Senior White stretched and revealed a satisfied smile."]},{"number":3126,"title":"Chapter 3126 - 3124: You Might Not Believe It, But I Once Beat Up Tyrannical Song!","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang himself didn’t have much longing for the seat of the Heavenly Dao.","If possible, maintaining the realm of an ’Immortal’ was the most ideal state for him... and the ’Sub-immortal State’ was even more perfect.","After all, once Sub-immortal... not even the descending Heavenly Dao coming to hammer him would be able to bring him down.","Song Shuhang’s character was not satisfied with the ordinary; compared to a mundane life, an exciting one attracted him more. Hence, when he first came into contact with the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ and learned that its members were real cultivators who could turn rivers upside down and fly on swords, he instantly made up his mind to engage with the world of ’cultivation.’","But on the other hand, he didn’t have any obsession with becoming truly ’ultimate, detached.’","[To become one of the strongest beings, it would be best if no one could lay a finger on me.]","[I don’t easily provoke others, but I must have the power to deter anyone from offending me, ensuring that if someone tries to cross me, I can immediately retaliate and crush them on the spot.]","This was Song Shuhang’s mindset.","Now, the reason he desperately pursued immortality and strived for ’transcendent’ eternity was not just for himself alone.","He bore the wills of the past, present, and future.","Therefore, between him and Senior White, there had to be one to transcend and resolve the obsessions of the past, present, and future.","But as to who specifically would transcend, it made no difference to Song Shuhang.","Since Senior White was obsessed with ’transcendence,’ Song Shuhang was more than willing to become the hand that would unlock the ’Heavenly Dao Prison’ imprisoning Senior White—releasing Senior White to gain true freedom, not bound by any worldly rules, and to dance freely beyond them.","And for himself, remaining an immortal forever also sounded quite delightful.","If he ever grew tired of that, he would discuss with the seniors to see if there was a way to free himself from the ’Heavenly Dao seat,’ then return to the mundane world as a ’Sub-immortal’ little Heavenly Dao whom even the Heavenly Dao itself couldn’t hammer—a truly beautiful scenario.","\"Alright, let’s go... Leave the source of the Heavenly Dao, and then declare to the myriad practitioners in the universe that we have successfully proved our Dao, and synchronize with the ’Netherworld World Origin’ to give birth to a ruler of the Netherworld,\" Senior White waved to Song Shuhang, cheerfully said.","\"By the way, can I give birth to another ruler of the Netherworld?\" Song Shuhang followed Senior White and asked curiously.","After all, in the current Netherworld, there was already one Song Dark.","If another Song Dark two were to appear, how would the two Song Darks get along? Would it feel strange to coexist? After all, both were his rulers of the Netherworld, different from Fat Ball and Senior White two.","\"Who knows? But it feels like it would be very interesting... Netherworld already has one White from the Netherworld and Netherworld Song; one more wouldn’t be a problem. In any case, everyone should be able to coexist peacefully, right?\" Senior White was not troubled by this and instead found it rather interesting.","Once Song Shuhang joined him, the two once again adjusted their synchronization rate and stepped out of the ’Heavenly Dao Origin,’ emerging from the Heavenly Principle Dimension into the main world.","At this moment, the myriad practitioners in the universe welcomed the era of two co-rulers for the first time!","This was a historic moment.","Unprecedented, and it’s likely very difficult for future generations to achieve!","The Myriad Realms once again trembled, paving the way for the arrival of the two sovereigns.","...","Among the myriad practitioners in the universe.","[Here it comes, finally! It’s been a long wait!] The Immortals who had been ready for a while had been waiting for this moment.","Since Tyrannical Song had withstood the might of the former Immortal Existence and forcefully entered the body proving process, the Immortals had been looking forward to this moment.","[You must succeed!] The last wisp of intent from Daoist Senior lingered nervously.","—Even though he had been watching the live broadcast of Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White from the ’Cultivator Chat System,’ he couldn’t rest easy until the very last moment.","[Will it be two people proving their Dao together, or just one?] The projected clone of Senior White two also watched the void.","[Don’t lose, Tyrannical Song. You must successfully prove your Dao and then relegate the former Immortal Existence to the dustbin of history!] The commentator from the Mo family clenched his fists and muttered internally—You’re the man who defeated me; if you fall at the last moment of proving the Dao, I’ll look down on you!","Inside the ’Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group,’ the screen was flooded with countless messages.","—Everyone was anticipating the final outcome.","...","Some looked forward to it, while others despaired.","On a minor asteroid in the Cang Yan Realm of the myriad practitioners in the universe, Demon Emperor Hezhi rubbed his face, unable to speak.","He glanced at the ’Heavenly Dao Pillar photo’ Tyrannical Song had sent him not long ago and then at the figure of the new Heavenly Dao slowly emerging in the vacuum. Despair filled his heart.","Just a few months ago, he was thinking of taking revenge on Tyrannical Song once his injuries healed.","Now, to take revenge with a hammer?","The other party had even taken a step further by proving his Dao and becoming the Heavenly Dao.","From hereon, there probably would be no place for him in the vast myriad realms. Before, he could still escape into the ’Black Dragon World,’ a unique place that didn’t belong to the \"myriad realms.\"","But now, if he entered the Black Dragon World, he would die even faster.","As Demon Emperor Hezhi felt miserable, the ’Cultivator Chat System’s system announcement function sent him a bright red notification: [Look, Tyrannical Song has proven his Dao.]","This was adding insult to injury.","Demon Emperor Hezhi reached out to dismiss the announcement: \"...\"","But a new system announcement popped up again: [Make sure to recover quickly, little brother Hezhi. Once your injuries are healed, I will suggest to Tyrannical Song to add a ’Hezhi tribulation’ every thousand years, specifically for you—a VIP service.]","Demon Emperor Hezhi closed his eyes, ignoring the bright red announcement.","[Alternatively, you can come to the Black Dragon World and apologize to me. As long as your apology moves me, I can consider sparing you.] Lady Kunna almost snickered as she swiftly sent a ’system announcement’ to Demon Emperor Hezhi.","The once powerful Hezhi, who had nearly driven her to collapse and snatched away her control of the ’Dragon Network,’ had finally fallen to this day.","The resentment in Lady Kunna’s heart finally felt almost vented at this moment.","Then, she unfollowed Demon Emperor Hezhi.","Because Demon Emperor Hezhi could no longer bring her any more pleasure... Her true joy now came from the continuous upgrades of the ’Cultivator Chat System.’","Each wave of upgrades, every new feature, and each user’s positive feedback made her overjoyed.","Next up, her goal was to integrate the ’Black Dragon World’ into the ’Cultivator Chat System.’","Before it was not possible, but now that Tyrannical Song had proven his Dao and the ’Cultivator Chat System’ had the backing of the Heavenly Dao, the barriers between the Black Dragon World and the main world were no longer a problem.","\"After the Black Dragon World successfully integrates into the ’Cultivator Chat System,’ should I learn a small hair-growing technique? Or get a hair transplant?\" Lady Kunna touched her forehead, feeling that her hairline seemed to have receded slightly.","...","Aside from cultivators who embraced this with anticipation and fear, a very small group of cultivators in the myriad realms had very complicated feelings.","These feelings were quite nostalgic.","For example, in the vicinity of the moon.","There was a red-haired Fifth Stage Golden Core expert looking up at the sky with his fellow friend.","\"You might not believe it if I tell you... A few months ago, while I was chasing the ’Soul Devouring Demonic Gourd’ in the starry skies near the moon, I encountered Tyrannical Song. At that time, I even chased and almost killed him all over the starry sky, nearly making him fall to the ground. Had it not been for summoning his senior, Venerable Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, I might have actually taken him down. Now, Tyrannical Song has become the Heavenly Dao,\" the red-haired Fifth Stage expert said with nostalgia.","His fellow friend looked at him as if he were insane, subconsciously distancing himself.","—Had his old friend lost his mind?","Actually fantasizing about attacking Tyrannical Song?","One should not boast like that!","Moreover, don’t you know that Mister Tyrannical Song has already proven his Dao and become an immortal?","Blowing your own trumpet at the time of his ascension, aren’t you afraid of attracting heavenly tribulation, to be struck to death by its might?","Even if the Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song spares you, the laws of the Heavenly Dao might remember you... When you face your own tribulation, the might of their heavenly tribulation will surely rise by several levels!","Are you weary of living?","\"Don’t say any more, if you keep this up, I’ll have no choice but to sever ties with you,\" his fellow friend warned. He certainly didn’t want to inexplicably face a larger future heavenly tribulation simply because of his friend’s wild fantasies.","\"I knew it, you definitely wouldn’t believe me,\" the red-haired Spiritual Emperor lamented.","——Even I have trouble believing it myself!","If he hadn’t remembered that the Venerable Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue had taken his \"Blade Dragging Technique\" and \"Flame Substituting Technique\", sparing his life as the price, he might have thought he was dreaming.","...","Like the red-haired Spiritual Emperor, Uncle Zheng De, the sect master of the Immortal Farming Sect, was similarly feeling nostalgic.","At that moment, Uncle Zheng De and several of his Immortal Farming Sect disciples were observing the scene of the \"Will of the Heavens making an entrance.\"","\"You might not believe this, but I once firmly punched the face of the Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song and knocked him out cold on the spot, unable to rise again... The incident even made the news in the Jiangnan District,\" Uncle Zheng De said, stroking his chin with a wistful expression.","In other words, I was once someone who had triumphed over the Will of the Heavens face to face!","Damn, that’s enough to boast about for a lifetime.","Should I record this glorious event in the ’Immortal Farming Sect’ archives?","And along with that, I should also collect that piece of news from the Jiangnan District from back then—the news about how he met Tyrannical Song and punched him unconscious.","In the future, when the disciples of the Immortal Farming Sect look at the records, they will surely be shocked by his feat!","After all, each Heavenly Dao in its youth fought above their level as easily as breathing, nearly always undefeated!","Beating a young Heavenly Dao at the age of eighteen is definitely something to boast about for a lifetime!","Some disciples of the Immortal Farming Sect looked at Uncle Zheng De with disbelief in their eyes.","But the several elder mentors of the Immortal Farming Sect standing by similarly looked wistful and nodded slightly, saying, \"This is true. However, overall, our Immortal Farming Sect has a fairly good relationship with the Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song. So, you don’t have to worry about punishment from him. On the contrary, we may even benefit from this.\"","Cultivating a good relationship with Tyrannical Song is really the most correct and wisest choice for the Immortal Farming Sect.","...","In the world at the bottom of the sea.","The king of the sea urchin warriors, the Sea King, silently touched the Tribulation Immortal Armor on his body.","\"I’m truly freaking clever,\" the Sea King said with palpitations.","Luckily, I decisively chose to give up hatred and settled with Tyrannical Song through the channel of the ’Almighty Merchant.’","Otherwise, facing Tyrannical Song who had proven his Dao and ascended to the Will of the Heavens, I and the sea urchin warriors would definitely face extinction!","...","\"Ugh, finally a true Immortal. With this, my burden has finally lessened,\" the giant turtle of disaster mumbled as she looked at the sky.","However, even though it was a good thing that Tyrannical Song was finally thoroughly Immortal and wouldn’t drop parts of the ’aura of eternity’, why did she feel so stifled?","Was it because she could no longer bite Tyrannical Song?","...","...","Finally, amidst the anticipation and various emotions of myriad practitioners in the universe, Song Shuhang and Senior White’s figures were simultaneously projected across the myriad realms.","\"It’s two individuals, achieving immortality at the same time!\" Senior White’s projection let out a breath of relief as if a huge burden had finally been lifted off his shoulders.","\"At last, I am content,\" the last strand of Daozi’s consciousness could finally rest easy.","From now on, the world is in your hands, Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White!","\"Success, it’s a success!\" Soft Feather cheered and typed a message in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","She didn’t know why she suddenly felt so thrilled.","In her heart, an unstoppable joy bubbled up, and she couldn’t contain her happiness.","But... even though she was cheering, tears uncontrollably started to flow from her eyes.","\"Eh? Why am I crying?\" Soft Feather reached for her face, confused as she wiped away her tears.","She was truly happy.","She was truly celebrating for Senior Song and Senior White.","But for some reason, she just started crying.","It wasn’t a cry of sadness, but rather tears of happiness.","The tears from her eyes simply wouldn’t stop.","Soft Feather bent her long legs, rested her arms on her knees, buried her face in her arms, and broke down in tears.","The more she cried, the happier she felt.","Hearing his daughter’s cries, Profound Sage Spirit Butterfly immediately became anxious.","\"What’s wrong, Soft Feather?\" Senior Spirit Butterfly hurriedly asked.","\"I don’t know, but I’m just so happy, and then I cried,\" Soft Feather looked up, her face wet with tears.","\"Is it Song Shuhang?\" Senior Spirit Butterfly clenched his fists.","For a moment, Senior Spirit Butterfly considered flying up to the sky, pressing down the Will of the Heavens, and giving it a good hammering.","Don’t think you’re great just because you’ve proven the Heavenly Dao.","Even if you’re the Heavenly Dao, I, Spirit Butterfly, am not afraid of you!","*******","While all beings were paying attention to Tyrannical Song and White’s immortal ascension, the Dark Giant of the Fourth Heavenly Dao was no exception.","It, too, was silently diverting its attention to the changes of the ’Heavenly Dao.’","[So they really succeeded? Two different individuals achieving immortality at the same time, and they even managed to take the final step?]","[And so quickly...]","The process of Tyrannical Song and the beautiful scammer’s ascension seemed to be attached with an ’acceleration’ effect.","This pressing acceleration finally forced it into a corner with no escape.","From beginning to end, it seemed to have no other choice.","[I have no other way out; the next step of two different individuals achieving immortality at the same time could be detachment. Once detached, my future is completely sealed.]","[So, I must make one last stand.]","[All preparations are ready...]","Beside it, the Immortal Daoist had been fortified with the ’Domination Secret Method’ to prevent it from backfiring at the last moment.","After making all the necessary preparations, the Fourth Heavenly Dao seized the last opportunity.","\"Next... to return to the Heavenly Dao seat!\" The Dark Giant made the most painful decision—it was so grievously costly that it wouldn’t have chosen it unless left with no other choice.","When it abdicated, it had left a way to temporarily activate its ’immortality,’ elevating itself to its limit, enough to return to the Heavenly Dao seat.","But the price... was that it would lose a portion of its internal consciousness within its ’Body of Eternity.’ That part of its immortal body would become a ’Blank Nickname,’ losing all control.","It would essentially be a state of paralysis!"]},{"number":3127,"title":"Chapter 3127 - 3125: Whether You Come or Not, the Nine Consecutive Championships are Always Here!","paragraphs":["Moreover, as he elevated himself to his ultimate state and returned to the seat of Heavenly Dao, a perpetual consumption of his essence ensued—this continuous drain was the most torturous.","If he lingered too long in the seat of Heavenly Dao, his entire consciousness would be sacrificed and become blank. By then, even if he detached himself, it would be meaningless. A soulless, detached, blank entity was still meaningless.","Once the decision was made, there was no turning back.","The cost was indeed too heavy!","If he were not pushed into a corner with no escape, the Fourth Dark Giant would never choose such a path.","Therefore, every moment he had left was incredibly precious.","Once he returned to the seat of Heavenly Dao, he would need to instantly complete all the necessary arrangements, not wasting a single moment.","In addition to this... after he arranged everything through the \"Heavenly Dao Authority,\" he would need the Immortal Daoist to hold off Tyrannical Song and the beautiful troublemaker, preventing them from interfering.","The earlier incident with Daoist Priest Virtue restarting the myriad practitioners in the universe was a lesson to be learned—he needed to be cautious to prevent anyone from having the opportunity to \"sever karmic ties,\" lest his efforts come to naught.","The Fourth Dark Heaven made thorough preparations.","In the vacuum...","After Tyrannical Song and Senior White revealed their divinity, they finally entered the phase of \"condensing the ruler of the Netherworld.\"","\"Now is the time.\" The Fourth Dark Giant seized the opportunity!","During the phase of condensing the ruler of the Netherworld, the wills of Tyrannical Song and the beautiful troublemaker would be drawn into the ’Netherworld Realm,’ using their own bodies as templates to condense the ruler of the Netherworld.","This moment was also the most suitable for him to make his move.","...","The Fourth Dark Giant, enduring his fatigue and drowsiness, stepped back into the main world... in his hand, he held the weakened \"Black Sun.\"","At this moment, the Black Sun resembled a night pearl about to dim, seemingly on the verge of extinguishing.","Previously, when Song Shuhang and Sixteen evolved into the \"Reincarnation Seal,\" the seal smashed down, pulling a significant amount of the Black Sun’s \"immortal sand\" into the \"VIP Reincarnation Channel,\" trapping it in an endless cycle of reincarnation.","To escape from the cycle, they were at the mercy of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy.","\"Activate, execute the ’Heavenly Dao Authority’ ability as the ruler of the Netherworld,\" said the Fourth Dark Heaven, holding the \"Black Sun,\" injecting eternal energy into it and forcefully controlling its operation.","The Black Sun was the product of the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s previous seizing and refining of the ruler of the Netherworld, thus retaining attributes of the ruler of the Netherworld within itself.","Every ruler of the Netherworld had a one-time privilege to enter the main world and \"act in place of the Heaven.\"","However, the Fourth Dark Heaven had already consumed this one-time \"Heavenly Dao Authority\" during the ancient era.","Logically, he had no more privilege to \"act in place of the Heaven.\"","Yet at this moment, under the forceful impetus of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, the \"Dark Dark\" part within the Black Sun once again touched the unreachable \"laws of the Heavenly Dao\"—during this process, the part that belonged to \"Dark Dark\" emitted a terrifyingly hoarse scream.","This was the grievous cry of the unwilling soul of \"Dark Dark\".","The Heavenly Dao is a big bully!","\"Dark Dark\" was not only refined and seized, but clearly, before it had even been refined, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, while still in office, had already made modifications to \"Dark Dark\"!","It was due to this that the \"Dark Dark\" part could activate the \"act in place of the Heaven\" function a second time.","Throughout history, nearly every Heavenly Dao had intervened with their own ruler of the Netherworld—it was like a curse.","As the \"act in place of the Heaven\" function activated, the grieving cries of \"Dark Dark\" became even more terrifying.","Not only that, but within the immortal sands of the Black Sun avatar, the part belonging to \"Dark Dark\" began to disintegrate.","This disintegration, even the immortal sands could not stop.","The special attribute of the ruler of the Netherworld, fading away and being stripped from the Black Sun... this was a permanent loss of the ruler of the Netherworld, unable to be restored.","This was the cost, the price of \"Dark Dark\" making contact a second time with the \"act in place of the Heaven\" function.","\"There is utterly no way back now,\" the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao said coldly,","unaffected by the chilling screams of Dark Song.","The ruler of the Netherworld is the \"Dao Mark,\" and the Dark Heaven knew this all too well.","Now, it had personally offered its own \"Dao Mark\" as a sacrifice.","Burn the boats!","As Dark Song’s screams of agony subsided, the function \"Acting on behalf of Heaven\" was finally activated!","\"Quicker, even quicker,\" the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao rapidly cast its spells.","On the body of the Dark Sun Avatar, the part that belonged to the original ruler of the Netherworld seeped out from the Immortal Sand, turning into a black-red blood-like substance.","This was the part of the deceased ruler of the Netherworld’s body.","It was also the raw material for the next spell that the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, the Dark Giant, was about to cast.","In the blink of an eye, this black-red liquid transformed into a blood pond.","And having lost the part that was Dark Song, the Immortal Sand could no longer maintain the form of the Dark Sun Avatar.","The Dark Sun Avatar perished!","The Dark Giant of the Fourth Heavenly Dao gathered that part of the \"Immortal Sand\" into his body and then placed his hand above the blood pond.","The blood pond turned into a formation.","And the authority of \"Acting on behalf of Heaven,\" gained after the sacrifice of Dark Song, merged into this pool of black blood.","The Dark Giant did not hesitate; he jumped into the blood pond.","The blood pond formation, imbued with the authority of \"Acting on behalf of Heaven,\" clung to the body of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao!","Like a blood transfusion, the pattern of the blood pond formation climbed onto his body and surged into him.","The aura of the Dark Giant’s body began to rise dramatically.","Instantly, it ascended to an ultimate peak.","His body once again manifested the \"Heavenly Dao Radiance,\" emitting a dazzling light.","Endless spiritual pressure spread out.","Under this boundless pressure, the stars in the vicinity of the Dark Giant’s body could not withstand the strain and exploded one by one!","These innocent stars too were desperate.","Living meekly in the universe for billions of years, and suddenly, unexpectedly, they were obliterated.","But this endless pressure was just the beginning.","As the Dark Giant took deep breaths, his spiritual pressure enveloped the entire universe... and then, the myriad practitioners in the universe!","Most practitioners in the universe felt their bodies go weak, almost collapsing to the ground.","Even some sentient beings with keen senses were affected by this pressure!","Even the \"stars\" in all the universes of the myriad practitioners in the universe sensed this pressure and trembled slightly—after all, there was a time during the Sixth Heavenly Dao when all the stars in the myriad realms were destroyed.","The catastrophe of that time was reversed and cut off by reversing karmic causality.","But in the universes of the myriad realms, there might still be some residual impression left.","This was genuine Heavenly Dao pressure!","Suppressing the myriad realms, holding the rules of the Heavenly Dao, and a perfect, flawless eternity, possessing an almost omnipotent power in these myriad realms!","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, reclaiming its position in the face of a desperate situation.","\"Heavenly Dao Presence? Is this the Third Heavenly Dao?\" Practitioners throughout the myriad realms were shocked.","\"[Tyrannical Song turned out to be not two but three entities proving eternity simultaneously?]\"","\"[This feeling of being able to obliterate the universe with a mere flick of a finger, does the third Heavenly Dao possess a tendency for destruction of all things?]\"","Practitioners from the myriad realms sensed the aura of the third Heavenly Dao, and for some reason, a strong sense of unease began to surge within them.","It was as if the true ’apocalypse’ was about to arrive.","An era was about to end.","This Heavenly Dao, it came to destroy the world!","\"Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Song!\" Someone involuntarily began calling out the Sage Name of the Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song.","Only a Heavenly Dao can contend with another Heavenly Dao.","This third Heavenly Dao, filled with an aura of destruction, felt different from ’Tyrannical Song.’","Therefore, they could rely on Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song!","\"It’s done.\" The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao gently clenched its fist, savoring the return of the power that had once ruled over all.","However, it did not have time to reminisce.","Every minute and second for it now was incredibly precious.","It stepped forward, one foot stepping into the ’Heavenly Principle Dimension.’","At the same time, it extended a hand towards the body of the ’Immortal Daoist,’ casting a reinforcement spell: \"Domination Secret Method Reinforcement!\"","\"Delay Tyrannical Song and that White.\" The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao issued its final command.","Then it vanished into the Heavenly Principle Dimension, adeptly taking over the ’Heavenly Dao Authority,’ beginning to operate it.","Meanwhile, the [Constant Star Destruction Virus•Revised] prepared during the proving of the Heavenly Dao by Tyrannical Song and White was summoned.","This was an updated version of the ’Stellar Destruction Virus,’ each carrying immortal information, and it also contained quite a bit of its ’Immortal Sand.’","But this alone did not satisfy the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","\"Reinforce!\" It activated the Heavenly Dao Authority, performing a Heavenly Axiom-level enhancement on the ’Constant Star Destruction Virus•Revised,’ locking their status securely.","This way, even if Tyrannical Song and White activated the Heavenly Dao Authority, they could not instantly erase this latest version of the virus.","And with just a bit of buffer time, these viruses could send the entire myriad realms to their doom.","\"Next step, go, to each ’star,’ sending this useless world to its end.\" The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao hurriedly used its Heavenly Dao Authority, issuing the next command.","Assisted by the Heavenly Dao Authority, just one command could precisely send the virus into every star of the myriad realms and detonate them immediately.","However...","After the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao issued the command, the ’Stellar Destruction Viruses’ did not respond and were not transported away.","Someone was secretly hindering him!","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao swiftly turned around.","Then, it saw that nine-linked man, who had appeared in the Heavenly Principle Dimension unknowingly.","He was sitting at a high table, hands crossed and propped under his chin, his profound gaze firmly fixed on him.","\"Why aren’t you in the Netherworld?\" The psychological fortitude of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao was terrifying; even now, it maintained its composure.","But inside, it was still very puzzled—he had clearly seen Tyrannical Song and that White enter the Netherworld Realm, condensing the ’Netherworld Ruler.’","Why was the Tyrannical Song now here?","\"I’ve been here waiting for you all along,\" Tyrannical Song slowly said.","His voice was gentle, reliable, and magnetic.","\"It’s impossible, no one knew that I could enter the Heavenly Principle Dimension, and you could not have foreseen this,\" the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao sternly said—during its speech, it secretly manipulated the Heavenly Dao Authority to try and move these modified viruses.","Compared to Tyrannical Song, it had more experience!","It had rich experience with the Heavenly Dao, a deeper understanding of the Heavenly Dao Authority, and knew how to make the most of it with clever operations that the new Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song simply could not achieve.","So, with equal authority operations, it was sure to outperform the Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song.","Tyrannical Song could not stop it for long, and it would cost at most about three pieces of ’Immortal Sand’ being nullified.","\"Whether you came or not, I was always here,\" Tyrannical Song’s gaze deepened, as if seeing through all the mysteries and hearts of the world: \"The flawless plan you pride yourself on had been seen through by us from the beginning.\"","Tyrannical Song remained expressionless.","Those who knew him would understand that the expressionless Tyrannical Song trying to act cool was definitely bluffing!","He kept a poker face to prevent others from reading his facial expressions while bluffing.","—In fact, Song Shuhang and Senior White did have their guards up against the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, but they really hadn’t expected the other party to return to the Heavenly Dao seat through some means!","Such clever operations were indeed beyond Song Shuhang’s expectations.","But unfortunately, no matter how cunning the other party was, they could not match his Tyrannical Song.","At the beginning, Song Shuhang and Senior White went together to the Netherworld to ’condense the Netherworld Ruler’... but the imagined ’Dark Song two’ did not appear.","Because there was already one Dark Song.","Moreover, the ’Netherworld Origin’ energy was only enough to condense one ’Netherworld Ruler’ at a time.","Thus, Song Shuhang, having cleverly outmaneuvered himself to the point of breaking his legs, chose to return to the ’Heavenly Principle Dimension’—he wanted to seek out the traces of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao to see if he could prepare against the opponent.","An intriguing turn of events followed.","When Song Shuhang was preparing to find the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, the latter unexpectedly delivered himself—appearing openly and above board as a returned Heavenly Dao identity.","This was an encounter governed by fate.","\"You’ve seen through me from the beginning?\" Opposite him, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’s expression grew serious.","Meanwhile, the operation of its Heavenly Dao Authority underneath reached its limits and soared dramatically!","This battle of attack and defense was already in its favor!","Tyrannical Song was still too inexperienced and was about to be unable to hold on.","Just as it was about to muster all its strength and conquer Tyrannical Song... across from it, Tyrannical Song slowly took out a huge pillar.","\"Humba!\" The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao instinctively cried out upon seeing this pillar.","Because... this huge pillar was filled with its essence and flavor.","Even on the pillar’s tip was a statue of its conceptual shape.","\"Allow me to introduce my treasure—its name is Overlord Pillar, part of the Heavenly Dao Pillar series, the ’Black Pillar’\" Song Shuhang flashed a reliable smile.","At the same time, a set of ’Combined Magical Treasure’ began to transform beside him.","This was the set of magical treasures refined by Heavenly Dao White.","The treasure quickly transformed into the form of a ’Gatling Gun.’","In front of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, Song Shuhang started loading the ’Heavenly Dao Pillars’ into the Gatling gun.","\"It’s no use,\" said the opponent, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, in a deep voice.","At this moment, it was flawlessly immortal, the ultimate incarnation of the ’Heavenly Dao in office.’","No techniques could harm it now!","Even if by another Heavenly Dao like Tyrannical Song, it was impervious!"]},{"number":3128,"title":"Chapter 3128 - 3126: The Divine Said: Let There Be Light! (1st Update)","paragraphs":["No external means can harm the Flawless Heavenly Dao.","In this mode, even if It wished to damage itself, It wouldn’t be able to!","Unable to be harmed, unable to be expelled, unable to be sealed, unable to be cursed... every method you can think of is meaningless to the ’Flawless Heavenly Dao.’","Some humanoid Heavenly Daos can’t even ’cut their own hair.’","So, even though Tyrannical Song’s ’Heavenly Dao Pillar’ made the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao feel inconceivable;","Even though Tyrannical Song kept pulling out ’Heavenly Dao Pillars of past eras,’ causing the Dark Heavenly Dao to be greatly shocked;","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao didn’t panic in the face of Tyrannical Song’s targeted assault.","It remained extremely calm, its mind and willpower still wholly focused on the ’Heavenly Dao Authority Struggle’ with Tyrannical Song—aiming to take him down using its Heavenly Dao Authority Operation experiences, which were a million times richer than Tyrannical Song’s.","Time was of the essence for It.","One Tyrannical Song, It could still barely cope with.","But this time, It was facing the unprecedented occurrence of ’two different entities, proving their Dao simultaneously.’","On the other side, there was also a good-looking but tricky guy gathering the ’ruler of the Netherworld’ in the Netherworld Realm, who might finish at any moment and return.","Once that good-looking but tricky person returned from the Netherworld Realm, facing a two-on-one scenario, things would become unfavorable for It... The Dark Heavenly Dao didn’t blindly believe that It could handle a two-against-one battle even in the aspect of ’Heavenly Dao Authority Operation.’","Therefore, the cool, collected Dark Heavenly Dao exerted all its Calculation Ability, erupting with its own operations.","\"Boom~\" On the other side, Song Shuhang didn’t hesitate to press the ’Thirty-Three Beast Gatling Gun’ fire button.","The Eye Pillar, Dragon Pillar, Black Pillar, Scallion Pillar, Human Pillar, White Pillar, Sphere Pillar, Path Pillar + Dragon Lattice Lady Pillar—nine ’Heavenly Axiom-level’ Overlord God Pillars furiously blasted at the Dark Heavenly Dao.","The Flawless Heavenly Dao indeed cannot be harmed by any external forces, but that doesn’t mean It’s unaffected by any external ’non-damaging’ phenomena—take emotions, for example.","The Heavenly Dao itself, due to personality reasons, might dislike certain things.","If the Heavenly Dao really detests a particular kind of music, then playing that kind of music loudly in front of It would certainly provoke the Heavenly Dao’s loathing emotions.","Although the Heavenly Dao could block out such music with just a thought, or even eradicate the ’source of music,’","It’s undeniable that at the moment the music plays, the Heavenly Dao’s ’emotions’ are indeed affected—unless It becomes an emotionless Heavenly Dao machine, like the Sphere Heavenly Dao did later on.","However, the nine ’Heavenly Axiom-level’ Overlord God Pillars fired fiercely by Tyrannical Song, while they couldn’t harm the indestructible essence of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao,","The ancient Heavenly Dao Information and Dao Trace on the Overlord God Pillars still slightly touched the state of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’s during the violent impacts!","The ’Heavenly Dao Pillars’ slammed vehemently against the Dark Heavenly Dao’s Immortal Body, and as indestructibility clashed with the immortal information, the sound of the Great Way collision resounded, with the Dao Trace of both intertwining.","Even if the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao had prepared mentally, Its struggle with Song Shuhang over ’Heavenly Dao management’ operations was still influenced.","This influence... as long as the barrage continued, would persist indefinitely.","Unless the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao becomes distracted and deals with Tyrannical Song’s ’barrage.’","\"Little tricks, useless!\" Facing Tyrannical Song’s bombardment and the subtle influence of the ’Heavenly Dao Pillars,’ the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao wasn’t annoyed.","Whilst Tyrannical Song was bombarding It with ’Heavenly Dao Pillars,’ he inevitably had to divide a portion of his attention.","Comparatively, the Overlord’s own distraction had a slightly bigger impact than the ’Heavenly Dao Pillars’ impact on it.","Although It was influenced by the ’Heavenly Dao Pillars,’ in the struggle for ’Heavenly Dao Authority’ operations, It actually advanced a step further, pushing Tyrannical Song to his limit.","\"Indeed, just with the ’Heavenly Dao Pillars’ of this caliber, the effect is indeed limited,\" Song Shuhang acknowledged.","But I’m no longer the ’minor Heavenly Dao’ Tyrannical Song from a few hours ago.","I am now the genuine ’incumbent Heavenly Dao,’ sharing an officially confirmed official Heavenly Dao with Senior White.","A real Heavenly Dao possesses nearly ’omnipotent’ means.","The confrontation between Heavenly Daos is not only a fight over the operation of Heavenly Dao Authority but also a contest of inventive thinking.","The Heavenly Path of Tyrannical Song said, \"The ’Heavenly Dao Pillar’ must be embedded with my intent and traces of Tyrannical Song, and increase the designated targeted effect, causing a ’forceful ejection’ effect on the specified target.\"","The inviolable rule followed.","A single statement... even just a thought.","But as long as it was the will of Tyrannical Song, under the nearly omnipotent power of the ’laws of the Heavenly Dao’, all of this became reality.","Boom ~","The subsequent bombardment of nine ’Overlord God Pillars’, each one was endowed with the Heavenly Dao intent + Dao Trace of Song Shuhang.","These Overlord God Pillars continued to bomb the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","And then... the body of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao was sent flying out.","No damage was caused, not even the Heavenly Dao Pillars managed to leave an ’Impact Mark’ on the body of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","But the ejection effect could not be immunized.","Moreover, the Heavenly Dao Pillars, augmented with the intent and Dao Traces of Tyrannical Song, had an even stronger impact on the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao was hit and sent flying repeatedly.","Each pillar’s impact sent its body soaring.","[Hum!] The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao was fuming in its heart, but even if it was infuriated, it had to restrain itself now.","However, on the other side, Song Shuhang’s tricky moves had just begun!","He was quickly familiarizing himself with the contents of ’Heavenly Dao Authority’, then applied the jumpy thinking developed by the members of the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ to the tricky operations of ’Heavenly Dao Authority’.","Heavenly Dao Authority is rigid... In different Heavenly Daos’ hands, it can exhibit different effects.","Therefore, the more Heavenly Daos one skillfully manipulates, the more one can unleash the power of ’Heavenly Dao Authority’.","This is also likely the reason why successive Heavenly Daos got trickier with their operations after taking office.","After pondering for a moment, Song Shuhang continued to drive the Heavenly Dao Authority.","[I decree: A circular, cyclic, infinite space shall be constructed around me, filled with heavenly tribulation.]","A circular infinite space appeared, engulfing both Song Shuhang and the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao—within this Heavenly Principle Dimensional Space, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao could be sent flying to its heart’s content without worrying about hitting the end of the space.","Moreover, no matter how it was hit, after being flung a certain distance, it would return to within the ’Heavenly Dao Pillar’s’ attack range, in an infinite loop.","At the same time, in this enclosed cyclic space, it was filled with the power of the heavenly tribulation, encompassing both Song Shuhang and the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","[Heavenly tribulation power?] A hint of puzzlement flashed through the heart of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","What was Tyrannical Song doing, bringing out heavenly tribulation at this time?","However...","\"It’s already over!\" The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao clenched its fist tightly.","Tyrannical Song had already been completely defeated in the ’Heavenly Dao Authority Struggle’, that segment of the authority operation had been thoroughly suppressed by it.","Just as it clenched its fist, suddenly... its consciousness felt a wave of disorientation.","Then, it felt as if some thing or state had experienced a loop.","This moment of disorientation flashed by.","When it recovered, it found that the battle over ’Heavenly Dao Authority’ operations with Tyrannical Song had returned to the starting point.","A giant question mark emerged in the mind of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","?"]},{"number":3129,"title":"Chapter 3129 - 3127: No Choice but to Work Harder (2nd Update)","paragraphs":["What happened?","I had surely completely suppressed Tyrannical Song and seized the related portion of the \"Heavenly Dao Authority\".","I had clearly seen the dawn of victory.","Why has everything suddenly returned to the starting point?","All my hard work for half a lifetime, gone in an instant, back to square one.","For a moment, the heart of Dark Heaven almost collapsed, feeling as though it was being rolled back and forth over glass gemstones.","What’s even more agonizing is that while Dark Heaven and Tyrannical Song’s struggle for the \"Heavenly Dao Authority\" has returned to the starting point, time has not reversed!","Its condition has not reset—during the struggle over the Heavenly Dao Authority control, it sacrificed three grains of \"Immortal Sand\"!","Within them, its intent was erased, turning into a Blank Nickname.","This loss is irreversible.","Tragically, it could weep.","\"What did you do?\" Dark Heaven asked.","Despite the difficulty, it didn’t give up, and once again began to suppress Tyrannical Song with its skilled experiences and operating techniques.","No matter how arduous, it was not beaten, not discouraged.","It’s not that it was enduring... it was because it had no choice.","It had no way out, only to grit its teeth and continue on.","Opposite, Song Shuhang answered the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao with actions.","The Heavenly Dao Pillar•Spherical Pillar collided with it, smearing directly onto the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’s face.","Then, that \"knocking away\" effect kicked in, blasting it away.","Before, Dark Heaven focused all its energy on suppressing Tyrannical Song’s authority, not even sparing a shred of focus to deal with this \"knocking away effect\". After all, to it, the collision would not harm it in the slightest.","As it was knocked away, its Gaze fixed on Tyrannical Song’s position.","Next to the \"Thirty-Three Beast Gatling Gun\", the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy Pillar had quietly exited from the \"cannon\" unnoticeably, standing beside Song Shuhang.","At this moment, the Heavenly Dao Pillar was sparkling.","Was everything Tyrannical Song set up, including the endless heavenly tribulations, just to cover this moment?","Coincidentally, Tyrannical Song’s gaze met its own.","Then, Song Shuhang added a narrative voice, \"The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy says, ’Let there be Reincarnation!’\"","—No one stipulated that you must shout out the name of the magical technique before releasing it.","So, whether you call out the name or not doesn’t affect the activation of the skill.","If you wish, you can even add the technique name afterwards—","Besides... Do you really think I, Tyrannical Song, fight alone against you?","Naive!","Since I debuted, I have always brought a bunch of cheats with me to every fight.","You think I’m fighting you one-on-one, but what you can’t see is that many ’Seniors’ are secretly supporting me!","Like now...","This \"Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy Pillar•Scallion Pillar•Temporarily Named No. 2\" is directly connected to the \"Reincarnation Seal\" of the main world.","Song Shuhang, who had officially ascended as a Heavenly Dao, was no longer the powerless figure during the trials; he now possessed the highest authority of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","Directly allowing the power of the Reincarnation Seal to permeate the \"Heavenly Principle Dimension\" without hindrance.","—Since the enemy is the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy is filled with motivation.","Without a fee, she volunteered to support Shuhang from afar, becoming a free high-grade fighter!","If Song Shuhang agrees, the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy might even offer him a tip to get the chance to confront the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao head-on!","The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy has compassion for all living beings—except for the ’Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’.","As merciful as she is to all beings in the myriad realms, she is equally cold towards the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","Just now, the effect on the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao was one of the billions of techniques she developed, specifically aimed at the ’Fourth Heavenly Dao’.","During the ancient era, when designing countermeasures for the ’Fourth Heavenly Dao’, she simulated many possibilities.","—This included the possibility of the ’Fourth Heavenly Dao temporarily restoring Heavenly Dao Authority’, which she also accounted for!","And for the hypothesis that ’temporary recovery of Heavenly Dao Authority is likely to come with a cost’, she developed the \"Let There Be Reincarnation\" strategy.","While maintaining the \"cost\" to the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, to cycle back and reverse what it was doing.","Allowing it to labor and pay costs, without gaining anything.","This Reincarnation effect carried a flavor of ’time-reversal’, yet it wasn’t a brute reversal of all states of time.","It required greater difficulty, more refined calculations.","The Reincarnation principles, so terrifying!","\"So, since this sentence is over now, it should be me saying this!\"","\"Darkness Big Shot, you have already failed!\"","\"And there’s only one reason for your failure, and that is encountering me, Tyrannical Song!\"","Song Shuhang struggled to maintain an ’expressionless’ face, so as not to give away his bluff to his opponent.","\"Over?\" asked the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, extending its hand in the vacuum and grabbing the ’Heavenly Dao Pillar’ as a flash of ’Dao Traces’ appeared in its hand... shredding Song Shuhang’s Dao Traces and intent added to the ’Heavenly Dao Pillar’.","These Dao Traces and intent were a setup!","They were the setup for releasing \"Let There Be Reincarnation\".","The massive enclosed Reincarnation world, the sky-filled lightning of tribulation, the Overlord God Pillar leaving stealthy remaining Dao Traces beside the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao on impact, all were part of the setup.","All of this, combined with the power transferred from the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy + Tyrannical Song’s Heavenly Dao Authority, constituted the \"Let There Be Reincarnation\" contingency.","\"You’re not the Fifth Heavenly Dao, and using her techniques requires a setup,\" said the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao while continuing to maintain the operation of \"suppressing Song Shuhang\", and it began to destroy Song Shuhang’s Dao Marks.","As long as Tyrannical Song is denied the opportunity to set up, the \"Let There Be Reincarnation\" technique can’t be reactivated.","The cost is that it must split its focus to stop the \"Overlord God Pillars\" Tyrannical Song keeps blasting over, unable to fully concentrate on suppressing Tyrannical Song’s \"Heavenly Dao Authority\" operation.","This invisibly extends the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’s time of \"Ultimate Sublimation, Manifesting as Temporary Heavenly Dao\", with each extra second causing irreparable damage and cost.","But if it doesn’t address the ’Overlord God Pillars’ and Song Shuhang’s Dao Traces, Tyrannical Song can reactivate the Fifth Heavenly Dao’s techniques.","So, however unwillingly, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao had no choice—facing Tyrannical Song and Bai Hou, its life gradually lost the right to choose.","\"It’s a pity. Against such an experienced big shot, a skill used once cannot be used again,\" Song Shuhang kept his face expressionless.","If he could keep repeating the process, without much effort, he could exhaust the ’Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’ into a pure Blank Nickname, an eternity body without a soul.","Now, it seemed more effort was required; new methods had to be utilized!","The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy left him with the \"A Billion Contingencies for Confronting the Fourth Heavenly Dao,\" filled with countless plans and methods.","If one method fails, simply switch to another.","Song Shuhang’s goal wasn’t just to defeat Dark Heaven... he had an even more thrilling plan.","He wanted to grind Dark Heaven into white.","To grind it into a state of pure white without consciousness."]},{"number":3130,"title":"Chapter 3130 - 3128: When Did You Start Having the Illusion That You Could Suppress Me? (3rd Update)","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang was aware of the physical state of the \"Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao\" before him... he even knew the method by which the other could \"re-prove its Dao\" in a short time, as well as the price it had to continuously pay!","These pieces of information, the moment the \"Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao\" arrived in the \"Heavenly Principle Dimension\" and appeared before Song Shuhang, were all displayed in his eyes without omission!","This might be related to the \"Heavenly Dao Authority\" that can perceive the essence of all things—however, logically, this perceptive authority should have been neutralized by the Dark Heavenly Dao, which had equally evolved to become the \"Flawless Heavenly Dao.\"","Even to prevent his greatest secrets from being captured by Tyrannical Song and Senior White and targeted by Tyrannical Song, before stepping into the \"Heavenly Principle Dimension,\" the Dark Heavenly Dao should have shielded or even altered its own information.","Being in the role of the current \"Heavenly Dao,\" theoretically, its secrets should not be easily captured by Song Shuhang.","But theory, before being tested, is always subject to change—thus, as soon as the Dark Heavenly Dao stepped into the \"Heavenly Principle Dimension,\" its bodily state had already been represented as a digitalized panel before Song Shuhang.","This function seemed like an ultimate evolved version of Tyrannical Song’s demonic technique, the \"secret appraisal technique,\" as well as the \"dreamland skill!\"","The secret appraisal technique allowed Tyrannical Song to obtain practical information from others through direct contact, at a certain cost. The greater the cost, the more information obtained.","The dreamland skill was even more of a bug—merely by satisfying a certain \"connection,\" Tyrannical Song could unreasonably access the \"past\" of others and obtain a wealth of intelligence.","And there were not a few such \"connections\" between the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao and Song Shuhang.","For example, the constant emission of the \"Heavenly Dao Pillar•Black Pillar.\"","And then there was the \"Domination Secret Method.\"","Additionally, there was the \"portion of existence\" that Song Shuhang and Senior White had snatched from the Dark Sun using the \"Confucian Saint Talent.\"","There were even instances like the \"Dark Heavenly Dao\" using an alternate account to register in the \"Cultivator Chat System,\" which ended up locking the real ID due to the system’s automatic tracking.","Song Shuhang had both direct and indirect contacts with the Dark Heavenly Dao, which provided grounds for using the \"dreamland technique.\"","These numerous deep connections, once the conditions were satisfied, turned into channels through which Tyrannical Song could grasp the data information of the \"Dark Heavenly Dao.\"","Moreover...","In the process of contesting the \"Heavenly Dao Management Authority\" with the Dark Heavenly Dao, a distracted part of Song Shuhang had personally experienced the Dark Heavenly Dao sacrificing the \"Dark Sun Avatar\" to greatly elevate itself and re-enter the seat of Heavenly Dao, in the form of a \"dreamland skill\".","Additionally, the \"Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy\" provided intelligence on the \"millions of contingencies of the Dark Heavenly Dao,\" including the predication results for various states of the Dark Heavenly Dao.","Therefore, at this point, there wasn’t a single spot, from outside to inside, that was unfamiliar to Song Shuhang in regard to the Dark Heavenly Dao!","It seemed utterly defenseless in Tyrannical Song’s eyes, without the slightest secret.","The confrontation between current Heavenly Dao wielders wasn’t just a comparison of crafty moves... Intelligence was also a crucial factor!","\"Song Shuhang, has something unexpected happened in the Heavenly Principle Dimension?\" At this time, Senior White’s voice rang out beside Song Shuhang’s ear.","\"There’s a slight problem, but I can handle it. Of course, if you, Senior White, could finish up quickly and then quietly come over to block the exit to prevent the ’Dark Heavenly Dao’ from escaping, that’d be even safer.\" Song Shuhang specifically emphasized to come and block the gate \"quietly\" to avoid startling the Dark Heavenly Dao, giving it no choice but to escape in despair.","\"Received, I will carefully make my way there.\" Senior White replied.","\"Hehehe.\" Song Shuhang sent back a mischievous smile emoji.","Time ticked away by the second.","On the opposite side.","The Dark Heavenly Dao no longer urgently sought to hurry.","This time, it was distracted in coping with Song Shuhang’s various crafty tactics—the deflecting effect of the Heavenly Dao Pillars was immune to it, Dao Traces left by Tyrannical Song were broken by it. Even to prevent Tyrannical Song from playing more tricks, it was also covertly divining the heavenly mechanism.","In this ’steady and solid’ pace, it took three times the usual duration... After sacrificing nine grains of \"Immortal Sand\" bodies to the sky, it suppressed Song Shuhang once again.","\"It’s over.\" The Dark Heavenly Dao voiced inwardly.","This time, it even refrained from showing any emotions, lest it be detected by Tyrannical Song.","It planned to seize the Heavenly Dao management authority by surprise and burst forth unexpectedly.","Bursting!","In an instant, the Dark Heavenly Dao drastically elevated its operation over the \"Heavenly Dao Authority.\"","Boom~","The related segment of \"Heavenly Dao Authority\" management was once again acquired by it.","The authority that Tyrannical Song had in this area was completely suppressed by it.","This time, Tyrannical Song could not use the method of \"bringing about Reincarnation\" to stop it.","\"Spread.\" The moment it obtained the authority, the Dark Heavenly Dao immediately employed its measures—countless \"Stellar Destruction Virus•Ultimate Heavenly Dao Reinforced Edition\" that had been prepared in advance were spread to all stars in the myriad worlds using the Heavenly Dao authority.","Almost in the instant when it completed its plan, the feedback from the \"Domination Secret Method\" used by the Immortal Daoist at that place came—it was contacting ’White Heavenly Dao’ face to face.","Under the effect of the reinforced \"Domination Secret Method,\" the Immortal Daoist, exerting his full strength, began to drag out ’White Heavenly Dao.’","\"Very good, just like that...\"","Use all your strength to pin down ’White Heavenly Dao,’ buying me time.","\"The world... shall end today.\"","\"On the path of transcendence, I will take a step ahead.\"","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao stretched out its hand and snapped its fingers lightly.","In an instant, all the ’stars’ across the myriad worlds were ignited.","The ultimate version of the Stellar Destruction Virus erupted.","Compared to that time during the Sixth Heavenly Dao Virtuous Daoist’s reign, this stellar destruction was even more exaggerated, more irreversible!","This time, even using the method of ’cutting off karmic ties’ couldn’t restart this myriad realms.","Stellar destruction, galaxy obliteration, space obliteration, plane annihilation, the scene of the destruction of the myriad worlds unfolded once again before Song Shuhang’s eyes.","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao stretched out its arms.","It had made preparations to exit the ’Flawless Heavenly Dao’ state and, if successful, step into the phase of ’Final Transcendence’ right after exiting the Heavenly Dao state.","Before exiting the ’Flawless Heavenly Dao’ mode, the Dark Heavenly Dao glanced at Tyrannical Song.","It wanted to see Tyrannical Song’s despair.","However, when it looked over, it discovered a vivid expression of ’pleasure’ on Tyrannical Song’s face.","Tyrannical Song’s originally expressionless face suddenly transformed into talking captions.","After a brief interpretation of Tyrannical Song’s facial expression, the following message could be understood.","Fool, did you think you really won? Did you really think everything was over?","\"Has it not ended yet?\"","Did you think from start to finish, that you suppressed me?","\"What does this mean?\"","When did you start having the illusion that I was under your suppression?","\"?\"","Then, in the next moment... the figure of the White Heavenly Dao appeared behind Song Shuhang.","\"Is it about time?\" White Heavenly Dao said with a smile.","\"Yep,\" Song Shuhang nodded."]},{"number":3131,"title":"Chapter 3131 - 3129: The Big Villain Who Got Whitewashed (4th Update)","paragraphs":["Senior White’s appearance marked that everything had already entered the ultimate stage and could come to an end.","\"Time for a redemption arc?\" Senior White asked again.","Before he arrived, he had already learned the details of the situation through Song Shuhang.","\"In some light-hearted movies, it’s normal for the main antagonist to be redeemed in the grand finale,\" replied Song Shuhang.","The ’Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’ before him was about to be redeemed.","Both spiritually and physically—a double redemption.","Across from him,","The moment the white-robed figure appeared, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao felt something was amiss.","From the viewpoint of ’Domination Secret Method • Immortal Daoist’, the Immortal Daoist was still struggling against ’Wielder of the Will White’.","Yet, ’Wielder of the Will White’ had already reached the Heavenly Dao Dimension World.","[Could it be that the one contending with the Immortal Daoist is not the ’Wielder of the Will White’, but the New Netherworld Ruler that the white-robed figure has become?]","Newly born Netherworld Rulers have a chance to enter the main world once + exercise Heavenly Dao Authority.","Or perhaps, did the Immortal Daoist become a pitfall?","[No matter what... Now that the white-robed figure has returned, I can no longer stay in the ’Heavenly Dao Dimension’.] This thought flashed through the mind of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","Whatever Tyrannical Song and the white-robed figure planned to do, it was no longer possible for them to affect it.","The world had already been obliterated.","This time, no one could save the world!","Next, it would transcend... Although it had paid a great price and was nearly leaving as ’disabled’, it sought transcendence and eternity.","But once successful, from a perspective of ’transcendence and eternity’, there would always be a way to compensate for its own deficiencies.","Thus, it no longer held any reason to stay in this world.","[Return, then exit the fully enriched ’Flawless Heaven Dao Mode’.]","No matter what you want to do, Tyrannical Song, I’m not playing with you anymore!","The next moment, the aura of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao began to fade.","\"Leaving in such a hurry, Mister Fourth Heavenly Dao?\" The white-robed figure across from it flashed the world’s most handsome smile: \"I’ve just come back, and if you’re leaving, wouldn’t that seem like we’ve been poor hosts?\"","So, Mister Fourth Heavenly Dao, won’t you stay a little longer—these were the subtitles on Tyrannical Song’s facial expression.","\"There is no need,\" said the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao slowly.","\"No, I think it’s very necessary.\" The smile of the white-robed figure became dangerous... or rather, it became forceful: \"I hope you stay here until I allow you to leave.\"","[Stay here and let you two gang up on me? Have I gone mad?] the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao scoffed.","It activated all its ’Heavenly Dao Authority’ abilities, preparing to forcibly transfer itself to the ’Heavenly Dao Dimension’ space.","However, it quickly discovered that the transfer had failed.","What’s going on?","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao finally felt uneasy—this unease wasn’t cowardice, but a genuine sense of crisis, as if some insurmountable calamity was imminent.","Perhaps the crisis had already arrived.","What’s the situation?","Why can’t I leave the ’Heavenly Dao Dimension’?","Even...","Why can’t I exit the ’fully enriched’ state?","\"Confused?\" Song Shuhang’s voice turned warm and dependable: \"If you’re confused, just look at me.\"","Come on, look at my face!","Let my face reveal the truth to you!","In fact, without needing a reminder from Song Shuhang... As soon as it sensed Tyrannical Song’s ’straightforward face with built-in subtitles’, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao immediately turned its gaze onto Tyrannical Song’s face the very moment something went wrong within itself.","This time, indeed, it gained sufficient information.","[Mister Fourth Heavenly Dao, do you still have an ample number of ’Immortal Sand Grains’ required for your ultimate sublimation?]","[!]","\"Why do you know about this?\" The Dark Heavenly Dao was shocked internally, but still tried to maintain composure, taking the initiative to inquire.","It had shielded this information and altered it during the moment of fully enriching sublimation, temporarily becoming the ’Flawless Heavenly Dao’.","\"[I understand you even better than you think I do!]\" Tyrannical Song’s face flashed a subtitle: \"[Are you feeling troubled because you can’t exit the ’Ultimate Sublimation’ state? I’ll ask once again, is your ’Immortal Sand’ quantity still sufficient?]\"","[Why is Tyrannical Song asking if my quantity is sufficient?] The Dark Heavenly Dao pondered for a moment and suddenly thought of a possibility...","Its Ultimate Sublimation was achieved by sacrificing ’Immortal Body Sand’ to maintain the ’Flawless Heavenly Dao’ state.","If its supply of ’Immortal Sand Body’ was insufficient, down to the last grain, then theoretically, it really wouldn’t be able to exit the ’Flawless Heavenly Dao’ state.","Because at that point, there would be no more ’Immortal Sand’ for it to fall back on. It would continue to burn as the final embers until the last grain of ’Immortal Sand’ was completely used up.","\"Impossible, my Immortal Sand Grain Number... should still be plentiful. Moreover, I’ve been keeping an eye on them,\" the Dark Heavenly Dao examined its own condition internally.","Even after paying half the price to ’return to the Heavenly Dao’, its Immortal Sand quantity had remained rather substantial. And during its confrontation with Tyrannical Song, it had depleted at most only a dozen or so grains of Immortal Sand, not even twenty.","How could they possibly be exhausted?","After looking inside,","\"The quantity, of course, remains plentiful,\" the Dark Heavenly Dao breathed a sigh of relief.","Opposite, Tyrannical Song’s facial barrage continued: \"[Are you sure your Immortal Sand is still plentiful?]\"","\"What do you mean?\" The Dark Heavenly Dao spoke while secretly opening a ’space gate’, not using its Heavenly Dao Authority to force a shift, preparing to use the ’main world’ as a stepping stone to first avoid Tyrannical Song.","\"[You have been keeping an eye on your ’Immortal Sand’ quantity... So when did you last feel that your ’Immortal Sand Grain Number’ was still plentiful?]\" Tyrannical Song’s facial subtitles became more enigmatic.","But this enigma had an irritating and vexing feel to it.","It felt like nitpicking.","And like... a strategic delay.","\"I get it now, from start to finish, you wanted to delay time,\" the Dark Heavenly Dao felt like it finally ’woke up’ to the reality.","Consequently, it no longer wasted time with Song Shuhang.","Boom~","It forced open a ’space gate’ with a punch.","Then, it turned around.","Ready to step into the ’space gate’.","This time, neither Tyrannical Song nor the white-robed figure tried to stop it.","In fact, both of their expressions were perfectly in sync.","Showing a look of amusement.","\"Pretending to be profound!\" The Dark Heavenly Dao didn’t hesitate to turn around and stepped into the space gate.","But just as it stepped in... it suddenly felt lighter.","A strange sensation washed over it.","Stepping into the space gate, it was as if it lost its body.","It was like its soul had entered the gate, but its flesh was left behind?","At the last moment, the Dark Heavenly Dao glanced at Tyrannical Song’s face.","\"[Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy says: ’The sky is originally colorless, it didn’t deceive you, it’s your own eyes and mind that deceived you.’]\"","\"Illusion? Impossible.\"","\"[Illusion? No, it’s real. Everything you see is real. It’s just you who is mistaken.]\"","Illusions should have no effect on the Flawless Heavenly Dao!","Across from it, the Dark Heavenly Dao failed to understand what Tyrannical Song’s final subtitle meant.","It no longer had the chance to understand.","All of the Immortal Sand had already been sacrificed, cleansed.","The Immortal Sands, which should have been able to burn for a long time and were plentiful in number, were suddenly exhausted in a short time.","\"[So, when walking in the martial world, one shouldn’t provoke a powerful woman. Why is it that people just don’t understand this?]\"","...","...","...","PS: Here’s something terrifying to tell: I left the Demon Capital on the subway with Otaku Pig and Really Troublesome at noon, took an afternoon train home, and due to extreme exhaustion, I closed my eyes to rest for a while, planning to rejuvenate. But then, something scary happened. When I opened my eyes, it was already 9:30 PM! And I, still had two more updates to write... Too scary!","P.S. again: Walking by the abyss in the dark night, one must stay alert and tread carefully!——Otaku Pig’s \"Cliff Walking\" starts its hot serial now!"]},{"number":3132,"title":"Chapter 3132 - 3130: Dance, Senior White!","paragraphs":["Splash~","With the consciousness of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao completely burned away, white sand-like substances fell from the sky of the Heavenly Principle Dimension, piling up in front of Song Shuhang and Senior White, forming heaps of sand.","These white sand grains shimmered with the glow of eternity, each grain appearing as if it were cast from white crystals, pleasing to the eye—this was the world’s most expensive, most beautiful treasure.","True•Whitewash.","Song Shuhang looked at the treasure loot dropped after the boss fight, nodding in satisfaction.","The virtuous lamia emerged from behind Song Shuhang, curiously floating over to the pile of white sand.","Then, she coiled her snake tail, her snake waist bending into an exaggerated curve, as she gently scooped up a small amount of white sand with both hands.","The fine white sand was lifted by her, brought up to her eyes, and then fell through the gaps of her fingers.","The moment was picturesque.","Song Shuhang quietly captured this scene.","—The virtuous lamia, nonchalant and elegant, had a truly wonderful aesthetic.","Sadly, this picturesque side of her was rarely revealed.","After all the fine sand had run out, the virtuous lamia carefully picked up a single grain of white sand with her index finger, lifting it to her eyes to inspect closely.","A moment later...","The virtuous lamia blinked her eyes, then opened her mouth—it looked like she wanted to taste the flavor of the white sand grains?","\"@#%¥, Fairy, stop, don’t!\" Behind her, Tyrannical Song hastily stopped her action, \"You can’t eat this!\"","Not everything should be tasted, you’re not the divine farmer Shennong.","These fine white sand grains were objects that carry the aura of eternity.","They were what remained after the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao paid all of its dues, its Immortal Body completely whitewashed.","Now, these Immortal Sand Grains held no ’intent’, completely blank.","Finally, they had become what Song Shuhang had wanted!","—If the Immortals knew of their existence, most of them would probably be willing to give up everything they owned to exchange for a single grain.","The virtuous lamia turned her head and looked at Song Shuhang.","Seeing his serious expression, she seemed somewhat regretful as she put the white sand grain from her fingertip back into the heap.","Looks like it really wasn’t edible.","Song Shuhang sighed in relief.","But just as he had relaxed, Senior White had somehow stealthily moved next to the virtuous lamia.","Then, just like the Fairy before, he touched a grain of the pure white sand, seemingly wanting to sneak a taste.","\"Senior White!\" Song Shuhang cried out, reaching to stop him.","\"I didn’t eat it,\" Senior White turned around, seriously said.","\"You really can’t eat it, and it’s useful,\" Song Shuhang seriously replied.","\"I know, I’m studying them,\" Senior White replied, holding the white sand grain in his hand, a thoughtful expression crossing his face.","Song Shuhang dared not lower his vigilance, keeping an eye on both Senior White and the virtuous lamia, while contacting the ’Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’.","—This time, the reason for being able to whitewash the ’Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’ so smoothly and easily was that the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy was one of the strongest supporters.","Her preparation of a myriad of contingencies for the ’Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’ really helped a lot.","\"Fairy, how is your ’Fourth Heavenly Dao Sand’ doing?\" Song Shuhang communicated with the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy through the Heavenly Dao Authority.","```","After transforming into reincarnation, the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy could sense the outside world, but communication with her became very troublesome. Even the Reincarnation Blade Fairy had to go through a lot of trouble to make contact with the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy.","However, now that Song Shuhang had proven his position in the Heavenly Dao, with the authority of the Heavenly Dao, he could directly converse with the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy.","[Pure, clean, end.] The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy sent back a few words.","She suppressed a batch of ’Dark Sun Avatar’ state Immortal Sand through the ’Reincarnation Seal’ formed by Song Shuhang and Su Clan’s Sixteen.","Now, these grains of sand had also turned pure white; the awareness of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao within them was sacrificed—in fact, the ’Immortal Sand’ that stayed with her was among the earliest to become pure white.","The ’half of the Immortal Body’ price paid by the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao when ’returning to the seat of the Heavenly Dao’ mostly consisted of the batch that was suppressed by the Reincarnation Seal.","Because this batch of Immortal Sand was suppressed by the Reincarnation Seal and was temporarily of no use, it was the most suitable for the sacrificial half.","[Received, I’ll trouble the Fairy next.] Song Shuhang replied.","As he spoke, through the authority of the Heavenly Dao, he opened the passageway to the ’Heavenly Principle Dimension’ for the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy.","Rustle rustle rustle~","Another wave of pure white crystal sand fell from the vacuum, landing in front of Song Shuhang and Senior White.","With this, the ’Body of Eternity’ of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao was now entirely here.","Not a single grain was missing!","However, to be on the safe side, after all the ’Immortal Sand’ had accumulated, Song Shuhang also repeatedly inspected and appraised them using the ’Heavenly Dao Authority’ to confirm that there was no more consciousness of the ’Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’ among the sand.","\"Senior White.\" After the inspection, Song Shuhang looked towards Senior White, hoping he could help him conduct another check.","A single spark can start a prairie fire.","To ensure the success of his next experiment, he could not even leave behind a spark.","He could not give the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao any chance of ’resurrection’.","\"Understood.\" Senior White nodded.","The soul link between him and Song Shuhang allowed him to directly understand Song Shuhang’s consciousness; not much speech was needed.","Senior White placed his hands on the two piles of ’Immortal Sand’ and began to check them one by one.","If under such a thorough examination, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao could still conceal a wisp of consciousness, then Song Shuhang would swallow that grain of sand raw!","While Senior White was inspecting the sand, Song Shuhang sent another message to the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy: [Thank you for your hard work, Fairy.]","[Joyful.] The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy replied with a word that expressed her mood at the time.","...","In that final moment, he used two of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s back-up plans to deal with the ’Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’.","One was the back-up plan that could be deployed under the premise of [Hypothesis: The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao is no longer complete + possession of a part of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’s body]: Past View.","The Heavenly Dao’s White had once said: The eyes of the divine look towards the future.","’Past View’ was the opposite, locking the vision onto a certain time period in the past.","The Heavenly Dao is nearly omnipotent, however, it has not completely transcended ’time.’ Thus, if one wants to impact the Heavenly Dao, it could be done through ’time.’","But this is not an easy task—due to the ’undying’ nature of the Heavenly Dao, time techniques often struggle to affect the immortal.","Luckily, the sacrifice made by the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao when ’returning to the Heavenly Dao’ made it less perfect—it was much like the fat ball, which had a part of itself swallowed by the Confucian Sage after it rejoined the Heavenly Dao.","Under such conditions + the Immortal Sand in the hands of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy as the ’casting medium’, and with Song Shuhang’s cooperation, they finally created an effect.","The observation of the ’Immortal Sand Grain Number’ by the Black Heaven was affected by ’Past View’—it was observing always a ’past’ state.","And the passage of this ’past’ was far slower than the flow of ’present’ time.","It kept seeing that it had an ample number of ’Immortal Sand grains’.","```","```","But in truth... what it saw was a ’past’ from long ago.","Illusion spells cannot influence the Will of the Heavens; what the Heavenly Dao sees is the truth—however, like the ’Future Vision’ of the white-robed figure, this truth can be either the ’future’ or the ’past.’","And the ’past’ seen by the Dark Heaven was from a full ten days ago!","The operation of its second ’Heavenly Dao Authority Struggle’ with Song Shuhang had, in fact, already lasted a full ten days.","Ten days of time in the main world, not due to any time-acceleration effects. In the main world, it was already February 15, 2020!","That is to say, it had actually already sacrificed its ’Immortal Sand Body,’ burning for a full ten days and nights, until it finally burned itself out.","And all this time, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao had not sensed anything.","What caused this effect was another contingency of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy—a \"Seclusion Reincarnation.\"","Coupled with Song Shuhang’s Heavenly Dao Authority, this contingency could create an effect similar to seclusion, where ’in the blink of an eye, ten thousand years pass.’ One exits seclusion and thousands or tens of thousands of years have gone by. Meanwhile, during seclusion, a cultivator feels almost no passage of time.","Overall, the effect of [Seclusion + Past View].","It’s like closing one’s eyes and feeling as if they had only a very short dream, thinking only two minutes had passed. But when they open their eyes, two hours have already gone by.","...","Ten days were enough for Song Shuhang to do far too many things.","Once the Heavenly Dao gets going, within its authority, it can do too many unimaginably amazing things.","And what’s more, Song Shuhang wasn’t alone; he proved his Dao together with Senior White.","A double act of clever maneuvers.","Thus, during these ten days, Senior White, within the ’Heavenly Dao space,’ used the shadow of ’Myriad Realms’ to construct a model of the ’Myriad Realms.’","This model included systems, stars, planets, and other shells that matched the main world 1:1.","Finally, with the authority of the Heavenly Dao and through joint efforts with Song Shuhang, the ’Myriad Realms Model’ was overlaid onto the Myriad Realms of the main world.","It was like a brief switch between shadow and substance.","The real Myriad Realms entered the shadow, while the model, which was like a shadow, took the place of the Myriad Realms.","—Such an elaborate effort, all to properly handle the batch of ultimate Stellar Destruction Virus that the Dark Heavenly Dao had concocted.","If not dealt with, this batch of virus could ultimately become a hidden danger.","Incidentally... creating a ’shell’ for the Myriad Realms was also a fun thing to do.","At the very least, Senior White had a lot of fun and wasn’t bored at all in these ten days.","When everything was ready...","Song Shuhang ’unresistingly’ got thoroughly suppressed by the Dark Heavenly Dao.","The ’Stellar Destruction Virus’ that destroys everything entered the ’Myriad Realms’ and the virus was detonated, destroying the world.","The script of world obliteration was complete.","Everything was arranged clearly and unmistakably.","...","The question is still the same—’What if.’","If the Dark Heavenly Dao had a bit more time to observe the world in detail before destroying the Myriad Realms, it might have discovered a flaw.","But sensing the potential return of the white-robed figure and under the pressure of being outnumbered, the Dark Heavenly Dao had no time to choose.","From beginning to end, Tyrannical Song and White never gave it any chance to choose.","With relentless pressure...","Finally, it was forced into the shape Song Shuhang wanted—a purely white Immortal Sand.","The most important point.","These ’Immortal Sand Grains’ were left behind by the Fourth Heavenly Dao before it ’exited Heavenly Dao mode.’","Its intent was completely erased, but it was still in a state of the ’Flawless Heavenly Dao.’","...","...","\"No problem at all,\" Senior White said as he withdrew his hands from the two piles of ’Immortal Sand,’ confirming.","Having said that, he turned his gaze toward Song Shuhang. \"Do you have plans for these ’Immortal Sand Grains’?\"","\"Specifically, it’s just a thought, but whether it will succeed or not, I cannot be sure yet,\" Song Shuhang said.","\"Leaving a blank Heavenly Dao... Then, the two of us can transcend one after another, right?\" Senior White looked at Song Shuhang, not only reading his face but also expressing his own previous idea.","\"Yes,\" Song Shuhang nodded. \"However, because the ’Immortal Sand’ did not prove the Dao with us ’simultaneously.’ Without this step, and due to its blank state with no consciousness, taking over our ’Heavenly Dao Authority’ is not so simple. Therefore, it is still just a thought.\"","The ’simultaneous proving of Dao’ proposed by the white-robed figure is a very important matter.","Only two individuals who proved their Dao simultaneously have the highest degree of compatibility, can fully take over the ’Heavenly Dao Bind’ from another individual, binding it onto themselves, allowing the other to achieve transcendence.","There’s this gap between the Immortal Sand and Song Shuhang, Senior White.","But its existence also represents a ’possible future.’","It’s a hope.","Perhaps in the future, it could become a proxy, an agent Heavenly Dao.","And then allow the Heavenly Dao that remains bound, to transfer all of its Heavenly Dao Authority to the ’Immortal Sand,’ achieving great liberation.","Time is still very long.","Song Shuhang, who just proved the Heavenly Dao, still has plenty of time.","\"But for now, let’s not think about that,\" Song Shuhang said as he clenched his fist.","Opposite him, Senior White also clenched his fist and gently touched his.","Both Heavenly Dao figures activated their ’Heavenly Dao Authority’ simultaneously.","The ’Myriad Realms Model,’ which was being mercilessly destroyed, was rolled up.","The apocalyptic end would continue in this model.","It would mercilessly destroy all these modeled stars.","But this virus would forever remain in this ’Myriad Realms Model.’","And the real Myriad Realms was safe and sound.","Its countless creatures did not even know that they had once again lived through a ’world’s end.’","The calamity of the ’present’ has ended.","The next step is to resolve the obsession of the ’past’ and bring hope to the ’future.’","\"Transcend, Senior White,\" Song Shuhang said to Senior White.","He, the salted fish, had no expectation for true ’transcendence’ and had no obsession.","But Senior White had a certain obsession with transcending...","Song Shuhang decided to become the hands that opened Senior White’s cage, to unlock the Heavenly Dao Bind from Senior White and bear it all himself.","Then, to grant Senior White true freedom, to soar through the past, present, and future.","```"]},{"number":3133,"title":"Chapter 3133 - 3131: Seniors of the Will of the Heavens Today","paragraphs":["\"Is this your final decision?\" Senior White smiled warmly as he looked at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang nodded slightly, just about to respond...","Suddenly, the virtuous lamia beside them covered her face with both hands, \"Ah~ Senior White~\"","Then her body slowly fell to the ground and rolled, abruptly dying.","Song Shuhang was baffled, \"???\"","The virtuous lamia died in a very dedicated manner this time; she slowly closed her eyes, not blinking them.","—She felt that her ’death’ this time was very considerate. To avoid interrupting the conversation between Senior White and Song Shuhang, it was appropriate for her wise ’body of virtue’ to die.","If it weren’t for the fact that she couldn’t move after ’dying,’ she would have planned to keep rolling, rolling away to a distant place.","After all, she had now become the body of virtue of the Heavenly Dao, and she needed to be more dedicated than ever.","\"Ahem.\" Song Shuhang coughed lightly and replied, \"Senior White, as you know, I’m not obsessed with ’detachment’. So... it’s better if you, Senior White, achieve detachment.\"","\"Do you have no regrets?\" Senior White still wore a smile—clearly, he was in a good mood.","\"There’s nothing to regret,\" Song Shuhang said earnestly. \"And besides, if we step back a million steps, haven’t we taken down the ’Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’? Its immortal body is still in a ’semi-in-office’ state. Just give me some time... If needed in the future, I might be able to devise a plan for detachment.\"","\"When is the future?\" Senior White leaned back slightly.","Cooperating, Song Shuhang stretched out a hand, and a dark lotus the size of a chair emerged from the void, supporting Senior White.","This was the black lotus from the Lotus Blossoming Walk.","Senior White leaned back against the black lotus and sat down comfortably.","\"As for the future, maybe after detachment, you, Senior White, might be able to see it? Anyway, I’ve just proved the position of the Immortal Heavenly Dao, and there should be plenty of time,\" Song Shuhang pondered and replied.","\"Indeed, we still have quite a bit of time, at least in the short term, we don’t have to worry about the influence of the laws of the Heavenly Dao,\" Senior White nodded slightly, his seemingly longer hair fluttering with the movement.","—Once someone holds the position of the Heavenly Dao for a long period, they will be influenced by the laws of the Heavenly Dao, in terms of their insights and thought processes becoming regularized.","The laws of the Heavenly Dao are necessary to maintain the operation of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","The ones who hold the laws of the Heavenly Dao, under subtle influences, will gradually be affected.","If it is a perfect Heavenly Dao, it can restrain these influences to some extent. But for a Heavenly Dao like the fat ball, by its end, it would quickly become an emotionless tool, adhering strictly to the programmed responsibilities of the Heavenly Dao.","\"So, do you have any idea about how to apply the ’Fourth Heavenly Dao Shell’?\" Senior White asked.","\"At the moment, I don’t really have any specific ideas. Anyway, the few tricks I know could be tried on the ’Fourth Heavenly Dao Shell’. Perhaps the most important thing is to first cultivate a tacit understanding with these ’Immortal Sand Grains’?\" Song Shuhang said, his right hand instinctively sliding in the void.","The false ’Saber-Nurturing Technique’ requires one to invest delicate polishing insights into the saber, communicate with the saber for an hour, and then spend a few minutes using the ’Saber-Nurturing Technique’. Afterwards, one still needs to mesh emotions with the saber.","The true ’Saber-Nurturing Technique’ involves crazily sliding one’s hand over the saber—a billion, ten billion, or even a hundred billion repetitions of ’Saber-Nurturing Technique’ per second, achieving one’s goals with Cheap Love—and not just with sabers, but applicable to everything.","After proving his Dao and becoming immortal, Tyrannical Song had clearly mastered the essence of ’Saber-Nurturing Technique’.","\"There seems to be some feasibility to it,\" Senior White also thought about the effects of Song Shuhang’s demonic technique.","This was, after all, a technique all Whites would consider a ’demonic technique’.","To tell the truth, throughout the ages, all Heavenly Daos have basically been anomalies, and geniuses and anomalies are sometimes equivalent.","And in the history of Heavenly Daos, Song Shuhang is an anomaly among anomalies.","Besides the ’Saber-Nurturing Technique’, Song Shuhang also possessed several other peculiar abilities, such as the secret appraisal technique and the dreamland skill.","These abilities might prove to be tremendously effective when dealing with ’Immortal Sand Grains’.","\"So, Senior White, you can rest assured about me,\" Song Shuhang said with a handsome tone. \"After all, I’m no longer the cultivation rookie I was a year ago.\"","\"Yes, you are now a Heavenly Dao,\" Senior White chuckled.","A year ago, those fellow friends who had beaten you or won over you in some aspects and were still alive could brag about it for a lifetime.","\"So, Senior White, you can detach yourself with peace of mind and not worry about me. If necessary in the future, I can also catch up quickly,\" Song Shuhang said.","He was trying to dispel Senior White’s concerns, allowing Senior White to fully detach with peace of mind.","Just as Song Shuhang finished speaking...","Suddenly, heaven and earth resonated.","The rules of the Heavenly Dao operated.","In the main world, at Earth’s location.","Senior Yellow Mountain, who was contemplating and deducing cultivation techniques for Doudou, suddenly shone brightly.","Between heaven and earth, a mighty power blessed him.","Senior Yellow Mountain was utterly bewildered: \"???\"","What happened?","What have I done?","This mighty power seemed like a blessing mark, and also... like a recognition title granted by the laws of the heavenly earth?","Venerable Yellow Mountain could feel that with this recognition title, the heavenly tribulation would show him sufficient respect when he faced his future tribulations.","\"What is this?\" Senior Yellow Mountain softly touched his own body.","Moments later, a realization surged in his heart.","The blessing he had received was named \"Heavenly Path of Tyrannical Song Respects Senior.\"","This blessing was automatically granted by the regulation of the Heavenly Dao after Song Shuhang, who had just proved his Dao, openly acknowledged and genuinely addressed them as ’seniors.’","The Heavenly Dao acknowledged them as ’seniors.’ Would any existence in the myriad practitioners in the universe dare not show them respect?","Not only heavenly tribulations, but even ’spiritual power’ during cultivation would also be particularly proactive and automatically converge towards their bodies.","Besides Venerable Yellow Mountain, other members in the group also received this blessing mark one by one.","Fairy Lychee, Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, True Monarch Rain Moon from Da Luo Sect, Cloud Gauze Three View Moon, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon, Su Clan’s Seven, Immortal Fortune Teller Copper Trigram, Fairy Dongfang Six, Medicine Master, Seven Lives Talisman... even Young Master Phoenix Slayer and Doudou had similar marks emerge.","After all, Young Master Phoenix Slayer and Doudou were once Tyrannical Song’s seniors, and this would not change.","Besides them, Su Clan’s Sixteen and Soft Feather, who had always been considered peers with Song Shuhang, also slightly shimmered, but their marks were not ’senior.’","\"Is this Song Shuhang distributing benefits after handling his responsibilities as Heavenly Dao?\" Senior Yellow Mountain couldn’t help but smile wryly.","However...","A newbie who had just joined the group last year was now the Heavenly Dao.","Thinking of this, Venerable Yellow Mountain silently took out two pills and with a tilt of his head, swallowed them stylishly.","Inside the Heavenly Principle Dimension.","Senior White curiously examined the changes in the myriad practitioners in the universe caused by a single sentence from Song Shuhang.","\"This is the regulation of the Heavenly Dao,\" said Senior White, his eyes twinkling.","Then.","\"One month, Shuhang,\" Senior White raised his index finger, deciding, \"Take ’detachment’ as another ascend story. At your usual pace of advancement, reach the critical point of ’detachment’ next month.\"","Song Shuhang: \"!!!\"","Senior White, this is really asking too much, detachment isn’t as simple as eating or drinking, how could it possibly be completed in a month!"]},{"number":3134,"title":"Chapter 3134 - 3132: One year later, when I come out, I will discuss immortality with Tyrannical Song!","paragraphs":["For myriad practitioners in the universe, the world had recently seen drastic upheavals.","From the time when Tyrannical Song repeatedly showed his divinity in front of the masses, starting with the Profound Sage Speech, the state of myriad practitioners in the universe began to run wild.","The Eighth Wielder of the Will, who felt like he could hold on for a few hundred or a thousand years more, suddenly collapsed.","Soon after, in a short period of time, Tyrannical Song, as a mortal, condensed the ruler of the Netherworld.","Then, seemingly out of nowhere, Daozi of the Ninth Heavenly Dao proved his pseudo-immortality, catching all the top Immortals off guard, their faces dumbfounded as they watched him succeed.","However, after proving his Dao, Daozi didn’t even last a month before he abruptly resigned, taking the achievement of the ’shortest reign in the Heavenly Dao’ and began the transition of the Heavenly Dao Authority.","—The practitioners wagered that no one could break the achievement of the ’shortest reign in the Heavenly Dao’!","Next up, logically considered the Tenth Heavenly Dao, Tyrannical Song and White both proved their Dao at the same time, a truly unprecedented feat.","[From the moment Tyrannical Song became active, a torrent of ’unprecedented’ events began to emerge... even their final proving of Dao had to be out of the ordinary. Tyrannical Song, a man who exists to break the rules.] This was the impression that Tyrannical Song left in the hearts of Immortals.","And this impression was formed without them knowing that ’Tyrannical Song’ had just started cultivation last year.","Otherwise, had Mama Yellow Mountain, who so coolly swallowed her pills, be the future of all Immortals in myriad practitioners in the universe.","...","...","At this moment, within the ’Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation.’","Divine Whale ’Senior Melon Eater’ was still desperately trying to overcome the Thousand Days Tribulation of the Ninth Stage.","Since Tyrannical Song and Senior White successively left the ’Thousand Days Tribulation’ space, the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation had stabilized and ceased to mutate or cause trouble.","A stable ’Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation’ was not difficult for Senior Melon Eater to resist.","At this rate, in just over a year, it should be able to come out of the ’Thousand Days Tribulation’ early—thanks to the mischief caused by Tyrannical Song and Senior White before, its tribulation time had been significantly reduced.","\"Puff~\" A column of water burst forth from Senior Melon Eater’s head, facing the Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation and dispersing it.","It leisurely swam around, contemplating in its heart: [Unknowingly, some time has passed since Tyrannical Song and Senior White left.]","[I was on tenterhooks every day when Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White were around, fearing that they would trigger even greater Heavenly Tribulation Mutations. With my limited strength, I couldn’t protect them properly.]","[I had even hoped that they wouldn’t get involved in my tribulation and that they could exit safely ahead of time.]","[Now that they really have left, I find myself missing the days when they were around.]","[This whale is just sentimental after all.]","It was an old-hand at ’principles of virtue’, representing law-abiding kindness.","A few months ago, when the still relatively weak Song Shuhang was swept into its tribulation, it risked injury to itself by working hard to set up a virtuous network to protect Song Shuhang.","However, as the Thousand Days Tribulation went on, Tyrannical Song and White successively departed.","[I wonder how Tyrannical Song and White are doing now. Ending the ’Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation’ early, could it possibly affect the Tribulation Transcender Realm?] Senior Melon Eater thought as it slapped its tail, once again shattering the Heavenly Tribulation.","Speaking of which, I’ll be able to go out in a year.","By then, I should meet Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White.","Perhaps at that time, I could discuss with them insights into the ’path to immortality.’","Senior Melon Eater had within the ’virtuous network,’ suspected to be left by the Will of the Heavens, a segment of the ’Virtuous Immortal Path,’ and during this tribulation time, it had also been contemplating that path to immortality with slight gains.","And it also believed that given the innate skill and luck of Song Shuhang and Senior White, in a year’s time, they would already have ventured into the path of immortality.","For other cultivators, the mention of a year venturing into the ’immortal path’ was beyond imagination.","But Senior Melon Eater had much faith in Tyrannical Song and Senior White.","Geniuses are always extraordinary.","Tyrannical Song and Senior White, especially Senior White, was the most special existence it had ever encountered.","Just as Senior Melon Eater was deep in thought...","Suddenly, a ’blessing’ marking dance descended from the vacuum, directly passing through the Heavenly Tribulation Realm and landing on its body.","Senior Melon Eater shuddered, leaping out of the water with a splash.","\"A Heavenly Tribulation Mutation?\"","It was primarily because of the frequent ’Heavenly Tribulation Mutations’ caused by Tyrannical Song and Senior White that Senior Melon Eater had become quite jumpy.","Any strange changes in the Heavenly Tribulation Realm would startle it.","The mark of blessing descended leisurely.","In the end, it split into two.","At the same time, the ’content’ within the mark slowly began to emerge.","Vaguely, there seemed to be traces of ’White’ and ’Tyrannical Song’.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater looked utterly baffled, \"???\"","Could it be that Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White are up to something again?","As it was distracted, the rhythm of its tribulation was affected.","More dangerously, at that moment, the heavenly tribulation had stored up a wave of spiritual energy, and a thick Ten Directions Extinction Tribulation fiercely slashed down towards it!","The Ten Directions Extinction Tribulation is a characteristic of the Thousand Days Tribulation, every ten days, as the level of the tribulation rises, it gathers strength for a Ten Directions Extinction Tribulation.","If this tribulation hit solidly, without proper defense, the consequences would be dire.","\"Hold firm for me!\" Sage Monarch Melon Eater instantly put up its defenses, steeling itself for the blow — at this time, it didn’t even have time to pay close attention to those two ’blessing seals’.","Boom!","The magnificent Ten Directions Extinction Tribulation was about to hit Sage Monarch Melon Eater...","But just at that moment, it hesitated slightly.","Then.","The Ten Directions Extinction Tribulation began to divide itself.","It cruelly split itself into ten parts, weakened to ’One Direction Extinction Tribulation’.","Then, these ten tiny heavenly tribulations lined up neatly and slowly headed towards Sage Monarch Melon Eater.","Boom!","The heavenly tribulation, weakened to one-tenth its strength, couldn’t even crack Sage Monarch Melon Eater’s shell.","A tremendous grievance!","At this moment, Sage Monarch Melon Eater actually felt a profound sense of grievance from the fearsome ’Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation’.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater was stunned for quite a long time.","[Did the heavenly tribulation take the wrong medicine?]","[No, the heavenly tribulation definitely wouldn’t make that mistake, so the problem must lie with me... the two marks on my body.]","Only then did Sage Monarch Melon Eater have the time to closely examine the blessing marks on its body.","[Tyrannical Song, recognized by the Heavenly Dao as a friend.]","[The white-robed figure also recognizes you – very tasty.]","Sage Monarch Melon Eater was dumbfounded for quite some time.","In his mind emerged a giant question mark the size of Huaxia.","?","Tyrannical Song, Heavenly Path?","White, Heavenly Path?","Blessings from the Heavenly Dao?","Two at the same time?","Am I still half-asleep?","\"Inner Demon Tribulation? Have I developed an Inner Demon?\"","\"That’s not right, I am currently a body of virtue, where would an Inner Demon come from?\"","\"Besides, the heavenly tribulation just now was giving me face.\"","\"To be precise, it was giving face to the blessing seal on me.\"","\"The only ones who could make the heavenly tribulation pay respects are from the Heavenly Dao, right?\"","To summarize...","Have Tyrannical Song and Fellow Daoist White become the Heavenly Dao?"]},{"number":3135,"title":"Chapter 3135 - 3133: This is the Will of the Heavens’ Daddy!","paragraphs":["Sage Monarch Melon Eater calmly thought for a moment.","Then, it condensed a claw of virtue and fiercely punched itself.","It hurt, it hurt immensely.","This was not an illusion.","\"The information is too overwhelming, I think I need some time to download, buffer, organize, and accept,\" Sage Monarch Melon Eater looked up at the sky, feeling like an ignorant melon-eating bystander.","Just a few months ago, Tyrannical Song was under its protection, barely enduring the ’Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation’.","In the blink of an eye, he became the Heavenly Dao?","\"When I was young, I fantasized about becoming the Heavenly Dao, but even my fantasies followed the basic law—cultivate for a thousand years, live for ten thousand years, then spend a few hundred to a thousand years competing for eternity with the immortals of myriad practitioners in the universe, step by step reaching the peak of the pyramid, and eventually proving the position of the Heavenly Dao.\"","Reality indeed was more unbelievable than fantasy.","While it was speaking, the ’heavenly tribulation’ in the sky seemed to be affected, starting to accelerate its pace and compress its process.","Mainly because Sage Monarch Melon Eater was a very special existence.","It not only had good relations with two Heavenly Daos, but more importantly, it had been eaten by two Heavenly Daos. There was a part of the cause and effect from Melon Eater in the ’virtue’ of both Heavenly Daos—this was crucial, resulting in a huge resonance with the heavenly tribulation.","Under this deep entanglement of karma and mutual sympathizing, the heavenly tribulation gave Melon Eater discount upon discount.","After crazy discounts, the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation thundered explosively. It appeared immensely powerful, yet the actual damage was pitifully small.","After the explosion process finished, following the discounts, Melon Eater passed the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation within a few minutes.","The last wisp of heavenly tribulation stubbornly blew itself up into smithereens, leaving no residue behind, denying anyone the chance to collect ingredients.","Immediately after, Sage Monarch Melon Eater was kicked out of the ’Ninth Stage Heavenly Tribulation Realm’. In a dazed state, it became the ’Tribulation Transcender’ it had longed to become.","And in doing so, it casually also achieved the title of ’First Tribulation Transcender of the New Heavenly Dao Era’.","Sage Monarch Melon Eater continued to look up at the sky, still in a semi-crashed state of mind.","Looking up at the sky, it vaguely saw Tyrannical Song and Senior White seemingly communicating and smiling at it.","After thinking for a long time, Sage Monarch Melon Eater took out a notebook and wrote down a title: \"The Autobiography of Melon Eater—My Fellow Friend Suddenly Became the Heavenly Dao, Taking Good Care of Me, and I’m Still Panicked.\"","After putting away the notebook, Sage Monarch Melon Eater continued to look up at the sky.","While looking up, it made another new discovery: \"I just went through a Ninth Stage heavenly tribulation, and I experienced three cycles of Heavenly Dao reincarnations?\"","Heavenly Dao resigned, Daozi ascended; Daozi stepped down, Tyrannical Song and White ascended; was there also a fleeting Heavenly Dao afterward?","So, it seems there might have been not just three cycles, perhaps even four?","This world is too insane.","The Chinese people really do themselves proud!","...","...","In the Heavenly Principle Dimension.","\"There are some things you are powerless to do before proving your Dao. After proving it, you can finally resolve them,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile, looking at the situation in the main world.","Senior White had set a time for him to attempt ’transcendence and eternity’ in a month.","Although Song Shuhang was not very confident, since Senior White had spoken, he had to prepare for ’post-future transcendence’.","After ’transcendence and eternity’, theoretically, he could gain great freedom... but it was uncertain whether he could still freely use the ’Heavenly Dao Authority’.","Therefore, before transcending, there were some matters in the main world he needed to lay the groundwork for, to take good advantage of the ’Heavenly Dao Authority’ without leaving any regrets.","\"Who’s next?\" Senior White was very interested in the newly acquired ’Heavenly Dao Authority’.","\"Indeed, the seniors from the Nine Provinces Number One Group bestow blessings, but shortly, each of the seniors should undergo reinforcement. At the least, let’s bring them all up to the Nine Dragons Pattern level,\" Song Shuhang suggested.","Initially, Senior White had reinforced him up to the Nine Dragons Pattern, laying the strongest foundation for his future cultivation.","Now that he had achieved the Heavenly Dao, it was natural he would not miss out on such an opportunity to reinforce the dragon patterns.","\"There are also your disciples,\" Senior White reminded.","\"Of course, I won’t forget them... As their mentor, I can’t teach them much, but I can at least strive to lay a solid foundation for them,\" Song Shuhang said.","As he spoke, he swiped his finger, bringing the image of the modern world - Earth, right before him and Senior White.","At this time, his disciples were still in Wenzhou City, keeping company with Tyrannical Song’s parents.","The monster bird Little Cai was cherishing the time, cultivating her saber techniques, with her saber intent being unfathomably profound.","Chuchu had already integrated her path with that of an ’immortal chef,’ making rapid progress in her cultivation.","Joseph was also there, holding a ’holy light blade’ of the Eighth Stage in a sealed state, currently sitting in meditation—the meditation technique was a ’Holy Light Meditation Method’ given casually by Senior White Crane when it was in a good mood a few days ago.","\"Actually, this little guy has quite remarkable innate talent for the holy light element... one could even say it’s stunning. It’s a pity he missed the prime age for cultivation by far, being almost fifty already,\" an immortal secretly behind the scenes watching over ’Tyrannical Song’ spoke out.","Tyrannical Song achieved an undying status, which meant that his ’residence’ in the modern world would soon transform into a new ’Holy Mountain.’","Thus, some immortal intentions across spaces were watching, waiting to see when this ’Holy Mountain’ would form.","Observing the formation of a Holy Mountain also greatly benefits top-tier immortals.","\"Being fifty years old yet still able to cultivate ’holy light’ in such a short period, it’s really too bad that such a seedling wasn’t discovered earlier... Are there any fellow friends from the holy light element paying attention to his child? With his talents, his child’s innate abilities shouldn’t be far behind,\" someone said.","\"People have already been contacting his daughter secretly; by the time you thought of it now, you were already too late.\"","\"By the way, what are you regretting... Don’t forget, this little guy is a disciple of Tyrannical Song. What does missing the best cultivation age matter? Now his master is the Heavenly Dao, a trivial matter like the missed opportunity for cultivation is nothing to the Heavenly Dao. We should be envious,\" finally, someone couldn’t hold back and reminded.","\"My master is Tyrannical Song,\" this statement, when spoken now, could break ten thousand laws with a single phrase.","As the immortals exchanged words.","In the vacuum, a will descended, and a mighty voice arose: \"Little Cai, Chuchu... Joseph.\"","\"Disciple here,\" Chuchu, setting down her kitchen knife, exclaimed with joy.","\"Disciple here,\" Little Cai and Joseph echoed, following Chuchu’s lead reverentially.","\"I and Senior White have proven our Dao to be immortal, and as my disciples, you three also receive blessings from myriad practitioners in the universe. Now, I will set up nine layers of trials for you... After you breach through the nine trials, I will be waiting for you at the end.\"","Song Shuhang chose not to brutally alter his disciples’ data directly, but instead, he opted for trials to maximize their potential gains.","Only through such trials could their will complement their innate talent.","The importance of will in cultivation was something Song Shuhang knew more than well—after all, he was the man who had endured the pain of myriad practitioners in the universe.","\"Yes, Master,\" Chuchu solemnly replied.","Being a disciple of the Heavenly Dao, this status was so immense it was suffocating.","And they could not disgrace this title.","Shortly after, a seven-colored radiance descended from the sky, showering upon the three of them.","This was the blessing given by Senior White.","Under the radiance, Chuchu’s body transformed back quickly, shifting to an alluring figure.","Little Cai’s monster bird body enlarged slightly.","Joseph was the most apparent; he reverted directly back to his youthful appearance. Although he didn’t exactly revert to ’the prime age for cultivation,’ it was sufficient for him to participate in the trials set by Song Shuhang.","Some of the surrounding cultivators couldn’t help but shed envious tears.","This is the power of the Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song!"]},{"number":3136,"title":"Chapter 3136 - 3134: I want the whole world to know that the Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group has been contracted by us!","paragraphs":["```","For practitioners in the myriad realms, this was the first time they saw up close just how immensely beneficial it could be to have the Will of the Heavens as their backing.","Previous Wielders of the Will might have had close associates too, but for some, the eras are so remote that verification is impossible.","The several generations of the ’Heavenly Dao’ that are closer in time are somewhat special; after proving their Dao and achieving immortality, there have hardly been any tales of them becoming someone’s backing and bringing them benefits.","Daozi Heavenly Dao is an exception, having a shorter term in office, so let’s set that aside for now.","The previous ’fat ball Heavenly Dao’ appeared out of thin air. Practitioners across the realms couldn’t even determine its origins, a real loner with naturally no one benefiting.","——If it had been a ’Confucian Sage’ who had achieved immortality at that time, perhaps a large group of Confucians would have benefited.","As for ’Heavenly Dao White’ before that, he seems to have cared for very few people in his lifetime, and was quite busy after proving his Dao.","Maybe White-robed Heavenly Dao did have people he ’cared’ about.","But White-robed Heavenly Dao experienced a long era, across two sessions of Heavenly Dao contention.","If the people he cared about did not step onto the ’immortal path’, by the time of his second proof of the Dao, those ’cared for’ would have vanished in the ruthless passage of time.","Mortals who are not Immortals have finite lifespans—after all, Immortals aren’t as common as cabbages, and a majority of worlds ’across the myriad realms’ have yet to see an Immortal emerge to this very day!","Going back one more generation to ’Daoist Priest Virtue’, there is even less need to mention.","By the time he became immortal due to a fortunate opportunity, he had already lived for an unknown number of years, and probably had very few people he cared about. Even if they did receive his care, they would not have caused a stir across all realms.","If we go back further from Daoist Priest Virtue... it’s almost impossible to verify due to the exceedingly distant era.","Therefore, the extent of the connection ’I have the Heavenly Dao as my backing’ can go to, is something cultivators across realms could only speculate about in the past, rarely witnessed by anyone.","However, this generation’s ’Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song’ is very special.","He rose to prominence and came into view a few months ago.","After emerging, he made many good friends, took on disciples, fathered a daughter, and even seems to have maintained a relationship akin to ’parents’.","Honestly, had we not seen Tyrannical Song beat up adversaries from all over and ultimately prove his Dao and achieve immortality... if you look at his network of relationships, it’s exactly like that of a cultivator who had just embarked on the path not long ago!","Everyone present, when young, had parents, dao companions, friends, disciples, children, and other close individuals like Tyrannical Song.","However, as time in cultivation prolonged, many friends and even descendants fell in the relentless river of time and disappeared without a trace.","Gradually, the network of relationships for Immortals became simpler and simpler.","...","[If only Tyrannical Song really were a special individual undergoing ’Reincarnation Cultivation’, or had just stepped into the path of cultivation, we could establish a good relationship with him in advance, and then benefit from having ’Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song’ as our backing once he proved his Dao.] A young Tribulation Transcender lamented.","[By the way, have you studied Tyrannical Song? Before he became famous worldwide with his ’Profound Sage Speech’, where was he cultivating? Which era’s expert was he?]","[Isn’t he the reincarnation of the Confucian Sage? I have some connections to Confucianism, and they have confirmed this news to be accurate.]","A group of top-notch cultivators exchanged information in secret.","Then, finally, one voice couldn’t help but say, [Actually, have you ever considered that Tyrannical Song might really just be a rookie cultivator who entered the world of cultivation last year, and then advanced one level almost every month, finally managing to achieve immortality by February?]","[???]","[Fellow friend, your fantasy is just too excessive.]","[Dreams should be had at night—dreaming during the day is just daydreaming.]","[How could there possibly be someone who advances one class a month in this world? The journey of cultivation is like rowing a boat against the current, one must proceed step by step. The higher the realm, the more difficult it is to advance. There might be unparalleled geniuses who manage to ascend a realm each month or in a few months during the early stages, but it’s absolutely impossible later on.]","No one was willing to believe what that voice said.","```","After all, this claim is too absurd; even if you think about it with your toes, it still seems impossible.","A promotion to the next stage every month is something one might only fantasize about when young.","Only a few astute top cultivators paid close attention to the voice that had just spoken.","’Is it the Almighty Merchant?’ the meditating cultivators thought with a start.","The ’Almighty Seller’ Senior is a famous existence throughout the myriad practitioners in the universe, and almost no one would be his enemy, after all, there’s hardly anything he can’t procure, and his network of relationships is widespread.","With the relationship network and intelligence of the Almighty Seller Senior... his words are worth pondering.","[If... if Tyrannical Song really did advance one stage per month as the senior said...]","[Then it seems, many mysteries can truly be answered. For instance, why he still has ’parents’ in the flesh, why he has made so many friends, and why his network of interpersonal relationships is so intricate.]","[But, advancing one stage every month is too ridiculous... perhaps there is some other karmic reason?]","While these meticulous cultivators were secretly communicating, a ’blessing’ suddenly fell from the vacuum.","In the end, it landed on the head of the ’Almighty Seller’ Senior.","Everyone was already quite familiar with this process.","It was recognition from Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song.","[Although you have blocked me, you are forever a great senior in my heart—Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song.]","This blessing title was especially long.","But it represented that Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song acknowledged the intimate relationship with the ’Almighty Seller’ Senior.","Doesn’t that indirectly suggest that what the Almighty Seller Senior said could very well be true?","[Should we go investigate it?]","[Tyrannical Song of the Heavenly Dao doesn’t seem to mind others probing into his past, nor has he stopped the Almighty Seller Senior from divulging his history. So, investigating Tyrannical Song’s past might be within the realm of what the Heavenly Dao permits?]","[As long as we don’t recklessly dig into Tyrannical Song’s private and dark history, but just plainly investigate his cultivation speed, it should be no problem, we can try it. If the Heavenly Dao shows any reaction, we’ll immediately stop.]","A group of curious cultivators stirred with eagerness, quietly communicating amongst themselves.","The Almighty Merchant looked up at the sky, his gaze landing on the ’Heavenly Dao Certification Mark’ that evoked complex feelings within him.","\"Hey, once you really investigate Tyrannical Song’s past and confirm what I’ve said... your hearts will be just as complicated as mine, and you might even need to take some pills.\"","This is the only thing I can do for you now~","It’s better to share the joy with others rather than enjoying it alone.","If I have to take medicine, others should join me, that’s only fair.","Having said his piece, the Almighty Merchant took out a bottle of pills—produced by the Yellow Mountain Family—and poured the whole bottle into his mouth in one breath.","...","...","Song Shuhang also acted on a whim, sensing the ’Almighty Merchant’ and the secret exchanges of the top cultivators in the universe, he subsequently sent a blessing to ’Almighty Seller Senior’ as well.","Regarding his past of ’advancing one stage per month,’ he didn’t intend to hide it deliberately.","After all, he was now the Heavenly Dao.","\"Who else is there to deal with next?\" Senior White asked while drawing ’Dragon Pattern Stickers.’","These Dragon Pattern Stickers are first drawn with ’dragon patterns,’ and later, every member of the Nine Provinces Number One Group would have one or two applied to them, striving to bring everyone’s dragon patterns up to the First Class level with nine dragon patterns.","\"Compared to drawing one by one on the spot, this is a bit simpler and more efficient.\"","\"Besides these three disciples of mine, I also have a preparatory disciple in the Black Dragon World... It just so happens that I can include him in the trial this time to fill in his basic data. There’s also the preparatory disciple Miruru who is now in the ’Dream Realm.’ I promised to take her as a disciple once she’s reborn with awakened sentience,\" Song Shuhang replied.","The monster tree Miruru was currently in the Dream Realm, brought there by Senior White to participate in the ’God Creation Plan.’ Now, she has a symbiotic relationship with the ’World Tree of the Dream Realm.’","Given enough time to grow, she could become the spokesperson of the Dream Realm, the daughter of the World Tree.","...","Dream Realm.","At the base of the World Tree, a tiny sapling struggled to reach immortality.","The little sapling only possessed a faint ’consciousness’ and was still years away from evolving into complete wisdom.","Under the World Tree of the Dream Realm’s protection, no creature in the Dream Realm dared to harm her.","Today’s Dream Realm was as harmonious as ever.","Suddenly, a finger materialized out of the void, slowly touching the little sapling.","When the creatures of the Dream Realm, the dream demons, and the Inner Demons sensed this finger, they all prostrated on the ground, not daring to stir.","\"In the name of Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song, I bless you. From this day forward, your name shall be Miruru, and you will inherit my once-held dao name ’Daoist Priest Wood,’ becoming a disciple under me,\" the finger gently touched the little sapling.","This was the Heavenly Dao personally awakening a tree monster.","From this day forward, even if Tyrannical Song abdicated his position as Heavenly Dao, the effect of this awakening blessing would not disappear—unless the next Wielder of the Will found Tyrannical Song disagreeable and chose to erase this blessing.","However, if the next Heavenly Dao bore grudges against Song Shuhang, he certainly would have arranged Miruru’s affairs properly before stepping down, not giving the succeeding Heavenly Dao any opportunity to exploit.","With this touch from Tyrannical Song, a cute illusory sprite appeared on the little sapling, resembling a miniaturized version of Miruru from bygone days.","\"Disciple Miruru greets Master,\" the tiny illusory sprite gently hugged the Heavenly Dao finger.","She had a vague memory of her past life.","But she still remembered that she liked Profound Sage Tyrannical Song the most, had once asked Tyrannical Song for a ’Sage Seal Signature,’ and eventually died under a heavenly tribulation.","Perhaps her greatest stroke of luck was meeting Tyrannical Song.","Otherwise, a monster willow like her, if dead under heavenly tribulation, would have no hope of living again.","And now, Tyrannical Song was proving his Dao and personally awakening her.","\"Grow well, I will always be watching over you,\" Song Shuhang said softly, and at the same time, he drew his hand across, and a small ’liquid metal’ droplet fell next to the monster tree Miruru.","It was the ’fat ball’ that had its consciousness erased and was reinforced by the authority of the Heavenly Dao. Although it was a small droplet, it could still transform into a cloak.","While it might not be as clever as the ’Song Fat Ball Windbreaker,’ it was still a powerful Companion Magic Device.","After doing all this,","Song Shuhang’s will descended upon the ’Black Dragon World.’","Inside the Black Dragon World,","Scarlet Pupil, after practicing hard, was lying on the bed, resting and meditating.","Suddenly, during his meditation, he opened his eyes and looked into the void.","\"Master?\" he sat up and called out.","\"Very good, you’ve been practicing diligently,\" Song Shuhang’s voice came softly, \"Prepare yourself. Tomorrow, I will open up the trial space for you. As long as you pass the trial, you can formally become my fifth disciple.\"","\"After the trial is over, can I go see my brother?\" Scarlet Pupil asked eagerly.","\"Your brother, Black Pupil... yes, after your trial is finished, I will take you to see him,\" Song Shuhang assured.","Black Pupil had been dead for quite a while, and being a creature of the Black Dragon World, even using Heavenly Dao authority to resurrect him would probably not be easy.","But... if one becomes detached, it’s possible to lock onto Black Pupil’s soul and let him be reborn with his memories through the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s ’Reincarnation Channel.’","At that time, it would not be difficult for Black Pupil and Scarlet Pupil to meet.","Song Shuhang, who previously did not dare to assure or promise things, now, as the Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song, dared to make commitments.","\"Thank you, Master,\" Scarlet Pupil rolled around happily on the bed.","Honestly, for the past few days, he had a bad feeling about his brother in his heart. He thought that might be the reason why his master had not taken him to see his brother yet.","But now, his master had given him a firm promise, which meant his brother was alright.","\"Master, it’s so good to meet you,\" Scarlet Pupil whispered softly.","In the void, a large hand materialized, gently pressing down on Scarlet Pupil’s little head, giving it a rub, \"Rest well, prepare for tomorrow’s battle.\"","After the hand disappeared, a blessing mark and a not-yet-activated dao name [Scholar Mountain of Books] appeared above Scarlet Pupil’s head.","This dao name wasn’t quite fitting for Scarlet Pupil, to be honest.","But of Song Shuhang’s seven dao names, that was the only one left.","Tyrannical Saber Song One was for personal use.","Virtuous Buddhist Sabersman was reserved for Little Cai.","Bijing Street’s Sabersman had been decided to be given to Joseph.","Daoist Priest Wood was inherited by the tree monster Miruru.","Path-seeking Scholar seemed more suitable for Chuchu... It was her heart set on seeking the Dao that decided her to faithfully become his disciple.","The last one, ’Scholar Kindheartedness,’ would depend on the fortune and karma of that little girl from the Beast Realm.","After sorting out his various disciples, Song Shuhang’s gaze fell on a regular person he had been fated with during the early stages of his cultivation.","Sima Jiang, the Fengshou Express Delivery man.","He and Song Shuhang were also connected by ’fate.’","The two boxes of medicinal materials sent by Soft Feather had been personally delivered by Sima Jiang.","Sima Jiang was positioned between the world of ordinary people and the world of cultivators, being a mortal himself but due to various reasons, had made contact with cultivators.","However, he had never crossed the threshold, failing to truly access the core of the cultivator’s world.","\"Then, as a causal connection, let me at least provide you with the opportunity to get an ’introduction to the world of cultivators,’\" Song Shuhang spoke softly.","Being the Heavenly Dao, arranging an opportunity for a mortal to ’make contact with the world of cultivators’ was not difficult.","Whether it’s a fortuitous encounter or an expert suddenly passing by and impulsively taking a disciple, anything could be arranged.","\"I’ve finished drawing here,\" at this time, Senior White nearby patted a thick stack of ’Dragon Pattern Stickers.’","\"Next, let’s give the members and seniors of the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ a surprise,\" Song Shuhang smiled.","This matter, he intended to do grandiosely.","He wanted every practitioner in the universe to know that the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ was under his and Senior White’s patronage!","After today, the entire ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ will become famous across the martial world."]},{"number":3137,"title":"Chapter 3137 - 3135: Do I, the Will of the Heavens Tyrannical Song, Have No Need for Face?","paragraphs":["Cultivators’ Fifth Stage Golden Core Realm is a very critical turning point—since ancient times, there has been the saying, \"A single Golden Core determines the Great Way.\"","And what determines the quality of the Golden Core is the number of draconic patterns on it.","Theoretically, the more dragon patterns a cultivator’s Golden Core has, the better. More dragon patterns signify greater potential for the future, meaning one can go further on the path of cultivation.","It’s precisely because the Demon Emperor Hezhi reached the Immortal Realm with \"eight dragon patterns\" that he’s an inspirational figure in the demonic sects!","However, in the myriad practitioners in the universe, there is one ’Golden Core’ that’s an exception... such as the extremely rare ’patternless golden core,’ Song Shuhang presently only knows that the past \"Seventh Heavenly Dao White\" and Spirit Butterfly Island’s Soft Feather have patternless golden cores.","\"In the Nine Provinces Number One Group, the seniors have at least the status of seven dragon patterns, and there are quite a few with eight dragon patterns. They are all top-notch in the world... This means that actually, every senior needs at most to stick on two more dragon patterns,\" Song Shuhang said as he reached out and took a small stack of dragon pattern stickers from Senior White’s hands.","——Converting the drawing of Golden Core Dragon Patterns into \"Dragon Pattern Stickers\" was proposed by Senior White.","Previously, Senior White used temporary Heavenly Dao Authority to draw dragon patterns for Song Shuhang.","Later, Senior White drew a stack of ’dragon pattern stickers’ to add dragon patterns for everyone.","At first glance, there seems to be no difference between the dragon pattern stickers for the Golden Core; the first one looked just like a ’dragon pattern.’","But if you examine them closely with ’consciousness and mental energy,’ you will discover that each Golden Core dragon pattern actually contains its own universe, made up of different patterns.","\"What’s the next step?\" Senior White asked.","\"First, I should notify the other seniors in the group,\" Song Shuhang replied, then took out his cell phone and opened the interface for the ’Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group.’","——Although he had also created the ’Nine Provinces Number Two Group’ in the ’Cultivator Chat System,’ and its communication features were more powerful than the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group,’ capable of being used in any corner of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","But people always have a sense of nostalgia.","Moreover, on this special occasion, it feels more meaningful to contact the seniors using the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group.’","Inside the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Members of the group were originally discussing the matter of \"Heavenly Dao Blessing Mark.\"","By now, just thinking about the group’s newbie from last year, Song Shuhang, suddenly becoming the Heavenly Dao, many people still felt like they were dreaming.","As members of the group were exchanging thoughts, suddenly a ’VIP entrance special effect’ flashed through.","[Tyrannical Saber Song One has logged in with his little train~]","\"Shuhang? You became the Heavenly Dao, and you’re still playing with your phone?\" Dharma King Creation couldn’t help but comment.","While they were speaking, the cultivators in the universe felt a movement in their hearts—images akin to ’Profound Sage Speech, showing their divinity in front of the masses’ started to condense in the vacuum.","Senior Yellow Mountain, who had just taken his medicine, suddenly felt a chill on his back and a bad premonition flashed through his mind.","He looked up...","And then he saw a familiar interface.","It was the chat interface of the Nine Provinces Number One Group he had established, but the group number was carefully censored.","On the chat interface, it displayed Tyrannical Song coming online and the question posed by Dharma King Creation.","A vague pain started throbbing in his liver.","Mama Yellow Mountain quickly took out her cell phone, flipped open the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group,’ and instinctively wanted to tap the option to ’disband the group.’","But at the last moment, due to the kindness and reluctance in her heart, her fingers ultimately didn’t tap it.","[I should never have established this damned group that was bound to go down eventually!] Senior Yellow Mountain sighed deeply.","Looking back, there was a time when he considered handing over the leadership of the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ to Song Shuhang.","—Because back then, Song Shuhang was charmingly naive, good-natured, patient, and had also done an excellent job with the task of handling True Monarch White. It felt like he was the perfect successor for the next ’group leader’.","Yet before he even started grooming Song Shuhang as the ’next group leader’, the guy had become the Heavenly Dao.","Moreover, even before becoming the Heavenly Dao, the once cute newbie had evolved into a member who, like Thrice Reckless Mad Saber and Immortal Fortune Teller Copper Trigram, caused him heartache.","\"This kid’s become the Heavenly Dao, is he still going to stir up trouble in the group?\" As Senior Yellow Mountain spoke, a smile of relief couldn’t help but appear on his face.","In fact, wasn’t this also a shining point of Song Shuhang’s character? Even after becoming the Heavenly Dao, he was still the same Song Shuhang, unchanged.","Not bad at all.","\"Hey, seniors, I’ve become the Heavenly Dao! From today on, I’ll let all the cultivators across myriad worlds know that this group is under the protection of Senior White and me!\" Tyrannical Saber Song One announced.","As he spoke, he changed his group title to ’Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song’.","\"Senior Song, are you finally going to rebel?\" Spirit Butterfly Island’s Soft Feather [Book-Slaying Immortal] asked, \"Are you planning to overthrow Senior Yellow Mountain and become the new group leader?\"","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly: \"...\"","\"Eh? Are you finally making your move on Senior Yellow Mountain?\" True Monarch Rain Moon replied, adding a ’shy’ emoji.","\"The few of you up there, stop messing around. Look up, this whole scene is being projected live by ’showing divinity in front of the masses’, don’t damage the group’s image,\" True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon said earnestly.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: \"Eh? Really, our chat interface is being projected by the ’showing divinity in front of the masses’. The Heavenly Dao really does whatever it wants. [Can’t afford to provoke.JPG]\"","When the members realized that the group’s chat records were being broadcasted live by ’showing divinity in front of the masses’, the group suddenly became a tad more restrained, at least slowing down their chatting pace.","\"Eh? Are the myriad worlds watching us right now?\" @Scholar Drunken Star eagerly said, \"Take a good look at me, folks, I’m Scholar Drunken Star!\"","\"Shuhang, what are you trying to do, projecting the group interface like this? This could leak many people’s dark histories—hello everyone, I’m Su Clan’s Seven! The shiniest in the Spirit River Su Clan.\" An ID called Su Clan’s Seven popped up and spoke.","But soon after, another Su Clan’s Seven came online, posting a string of question marks: \"????\"","\"Cough cough~ So, I logged in this time to send a surprise to the seniors,\" Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song interrupted, \"I also wanted to let everyone know that ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ is under my sponsorship. First off, the initial surprise is for our Mama Yellow Mountain, who has been looking after us and supporting us in the background all this time, allowing our ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ to stick together without disbanding. Here, Senior White and I have prepared a gift for Mama Yellow Mountain—now, please come on stage, Mama Yellow Mountain!\"","Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire: \"????\"","Then, he didn’t hesitate to click on Song Shuhang’s avatar.","With a swipe of his finger—he ’removed this member from the group’.","In the vacuum of space.","On the Xuan Nu Sect’s Sky-Speaking Stage projection.","The original ’Nine Provinces Number One Group chat interface’ turned into a group message notification.","[Respected Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song, you have been removed from the Nine Provinces Number One Group by ’Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire’]","Song Shuhang: \"????\"","Did Mama Yellow Mountain kick me out?","Practitioners in the universe: \"...\"","Heavenly Dao Daddy Tyrannical Song, got kicked?","Sexy Heavenly Dao, online and ejected.","Is my Heavenly Dao Daddy Tyrannical Song so lacking in dignity?"]},{"number":3138,"title":"Chapter 3138 - 3136: Deception, This is the Deception of the Heavenly Path of Tyrannical Song!","paragraphs":["At that moment, many cultivators across the myriad realms who did not know the truth gasped in shock.","Who is this \"Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire\"?","Actually showing no respect for Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song’s face?","Directly booting out the Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song, who was shouting about covering the Nine Provinces Number One Group, from the group without hesitation?","Acting without hesitation, totally disrespecting the Heavenly Dao.","Terrifying!","First, take note of this character.","Right, it seemed that before, Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song called this big shot \"Mama Yellow Mountain\"?","Could this terrifying figure be a fairy?","Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song’s mother?","That might make sense, if it’s his mother... what’s the big deal in kicking out Tyrannical Song?","Just as they were pondering, the \"show my divinity in front of the masses\" image on the myriad worlds screen changed back to the previous group chat box, but the account name had changed to \"white-robed figure.\"","[Hisss, is the white-robed figure also in this group?]","[What kind of monsters are in this group? Both the white-robed figure and Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song are in this group?]","[Moreover, Tyrannical Song keeps calling everyone ’Senior’ so affectionately... Are there only primordial-level beastly Seniors in this group?]","Next.","In the projection scene, the white-robed figure account used administrator authority to open the add friend option and re-added the just expelled \"Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song.\"","A very loving scene.","When the cultivators of the myriad realms saw this scene, they were torn inside and didn’t know what to say.","The mighty Heavenly Dao, after being kicked out of the group, actually had to rely on another Heavenly Dao’s \"administrator authority\" to add someone.","Suddenly feeling, a bit cute?","Soon, the \"group chat box\" projection changed back to \"Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song\"’s interface.","\"I was wrong, Senior Yellow Mountain... no more kicking, please.\" In front of the myriad practitioners in the universe, the strongest existence \"Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song\" caved in to the group leader Senior Yellow Mountain!","Keep in mind, Tyrannical Song was the formidable type to directly confront immortal existences before proving his Dao!","And now, he was openly admitting his mistake.","At the same time, after seeing this dialogue, some uninformed cultivators across the myriad realms stirred again—so it seemed that \"Mama Yellow Mountain\" was not a real mother, but a fairy Senior instead?","Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song’s previous title of \"Mama Yellow Mountain\" must have been a tease that annoyed the Yellow Mountain Fairy. Yep, that must be it!","...","Back in the main world.","Senior Yellow Mountain silently took out a new bottle of medicine and swallowed several pills to calm his exploding mindset.","He couldn’t very well kick out the white-robed figure too—he still wanted to live.","So, seeing White re-add Song Shuhang, he had to resort to self-medicating.","And to be honest, even if White hadn’t re-added Song Shuhang, after a little while... with the personality of Mama Yellow Mountain, he would probably still grit his teeth and re-add Song Shuhang.","This was the magnanimity of him as the \"group leader.\"","\"Let’s talk business, Senior Yellow Mountain. Please, make your appearance, and get ready,\" Song Shuhang said.","Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire: \"Get ready for what?\"","\"Get ready to show your divinity, make a dazzling display. [Thumbs Up Emoji]\" After saying that, Song Shuhang used his Heavenly Dao Authority to bring Senior Yellow Mountain into a scene.","On the side of the myriad realm’s \"show my divinity in front of the masses\" screen, an image of Senior Yellow Mountain was projected.","\"Ah, showing divinity in front of the masses!\" When the bright moon appears clenched his fists excitedly.","If Fellow Daoist Yellow Mountain has taken the stage, then could his turn be far behind?","After the fellow friends in the group went on stage one by one, wouldn’t it finally be his turn as well?","Even if later on, it’s a group appearance, he could at least show his face in the group photo, right?","\"Don’t forget about me!\" When the bright moon appears reminded everyone in the group.","Su Clan’s Seven: \"Daddy, come out quick, Mama Yellow Mountain is showing divinity!\"","[System Prompt: User Su Clan’s Seven has been muted by \"white-robed figure\" for 1 minute.]","[System Prompt: User Su Clan’s Seven group nickname has been replaced with \"Thrice Reckless Mad Saber\" by \"white-robed figure\".]","Su Clan’s Seven: \"Senior White is still shining brightly!\"","Fairy Lychee looked at the space where divinity was being shown: \"I actually really want to know what gift Shuhang is going to prepare in the end?\"","On the divine stage,","Senior Yellow Mountain felt a bit uncomfortable, probably because he had just taken his medicine.","\"Senior Yellow Mountain, this is the ’Dragon Pattern Sticker’ that Senior White and I have prepared for everyone in the group. It can supplement a Golden Core to the level of ’nine dragon patterns’! However, since you’re already at the Venerable Realm, in order to apply the dragon patterns, I need to ’reverse your realm’ temporarily, reverse it to Fifth Stage, and complete the dragon patterns supplementation. Then, I’ll restore your realm,\" Song Shuhang’s voice whispered in Senior Yellow Mountain’s ear—The Heavenly Dao really just does whatever it wants!","Venerable Yellow Mountain: \"...\"","\"By the way, Senior Yellow Mountain, how many golden dragon patterns do you have? How many do you need to supplement?\" Song Shuhang asked again.","Senior Yellow Mountain replied evenly: \"Nine patterns.\"","Song Shuhang: \"!!!\"","\"You didn’t know that Yellow Mountain has nine patterns?\" Senior White’s voice echoed in Song Shuhang’s ear.","Song Shuhang: \"...\"","How would I know!","When I joined the group, Senior Yellow Mountain was already in the True Monarch realm!","What should I do?","The ’gift’ that I had finally thought to prepare for Senior Yellow Mountain now couldn’t be used.","It’s so embarrassing.","Right now, the myriad practitioners in the universe are watching Senior Yellow Mountain through the ’Profound Sage Speech’ broadcast.","We can’t just let Senior Yellow Mountain show his face and then leave in embarrassment, can we?","I, Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song, need to save face.","Fortunately, the just now conversation was a private one and not broadcast to the myriad practitioners in the universe... Otherwise, I, Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song, would really lose face.","\"Cough, well then, Senior Yellow Mountain, is there anything you want?\" Song Shuhang bravely asked.","\"Making Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, Copper Trigram, Jing Xue, Young Master Phoenix Slayer... and a series of other members become more mature? Making Asian Six’s racing skills more kind-hearted?\" Senior Yellow Mountain earnestly pondered.","Song Shuhang: \"...\"","Sorry, although the Heavenly Dao can do such things, wouldn’t forcibly twisting the personalities of other seniors be a bit too cruel?","And moreover, without their Thrice Reckless Disease, would Thrice Reckless Mad Saber and Senior Copper Trigram still be themselves?","\"If it can’t be done, then forget it,\" Senior Yellow Mountain said considerately.","Song Shuhang earnestly replied: \"It’s not that it can’t be done, but that it shouldn’t be done.\"","Upon hearing this, Senior Yellow Mountain suddenly showed a relieved smile: \"Hmm, you have matured a bit after all, Shuhang.\"","The unexpected compliment made Shuhang feel a bit embarrassed.","\"In my life, I actually have no great regrets or special desires. Just being with the fellow friends in the group makes me feel very good,\" Senior Yellow Mountain said slowly: \"So, don’t worry about me,\"","This is why everyone calls him Mama Yellow Mountain.","Song Shuhang was so moved that he was lost for words.","Then, Senior White reached out his hand and handed two ’Dragon Pattern Stickers’ to Yellow Mountain: \"Yellow Mountain, you can’t use them, but in the future, your disciples or close ones might have use for them.\"","Song Shuhang also took the opportunity to hand over a drop of ’Fat Ball Big Bro’s Liquid Form’ to Senior Yellow Mountain.","Back in the Netherworld Realm, together with Daozi Senior, they cut off most of the fat ball’s body, enough to distribute a piece to each member of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","In the future, the ’Fat Ball Cloak’ would be one of the symbols shielded by the Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song.","\"Lastly, thank you Senior Yellow Mountain for pulling me into the group back then, and for not kicking me out... Although I don’t know which divinations you had done at that time, it was because you kept me that I am who I am today,\" Song Shuhang said, and then personally applied a more detailed ’blessing’ for Senior Yellow Mountain.","Next to the original mark that read [Tyrannical Song’s Heavenly Dao Respected Senior] another title was added [Eternal Group Leader].","This title contained the feelings of the Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song.","The cultivators of the myriad worlds were influenced by the ’Heavenly Dao Emotion’, and they were vaguely touched.","Moreover...","Senior Yellow Mountain isn’t a fairy?","Fraud, this is fraud by the Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song!",".",".","PS: Gun Kai has started a new book! I previously said to him that his last book, Nightmare , is probably the last one I would prop up before I finish my own, but unexpectedly, in the last few days of my completion, I can prop him up one last time—Gun Kai’s new book \"Myriad Hearts\". This book appeals to me more than Nightmare; the protagonist can obtain different ’identity backgrounds’ and use these backgrounds to solve his own problems while showing off a bit, it’s really exciting."]},{"number":3139,"title":"Chapter 3139 - 3137: Young Master Phoenix Slayer, hurry up and come down, if you’re late I might forget the lines!","paragraphs":["\"Not a fairy, so how can she be called ’Mama Yellow Mountain’?\"","As the Heavenly Dao, my word is law!","I strongly suggest that the Heavenly Dao of Tyrannical Song uses the boundless authority to transform Group Founder Yellow Mountain into Yellow Mountain Fairy!","Some cultivators of myriad practitioners in the universe, who are outsiders watching and enjoying the spectacle, feel touched by the title ’Eternal Group Leader’, while also quietly expressing their thoughts in their hearts.","As the Heavenly Dao, Song Shuhang now could receive some of the myriad world supplications that related to him—those who sing his praises could be sensed by him.","However, he dared not do so.","Mama Yellow Mountain held a very high position in his heart and was a senior worthy of respect. It was okay to occasionally cause Senior Yellow Mountain some liver pain, but absolutely not to cross the line—this was the unspoken agreement among him, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, Senior Copper Trigram, Doudou, Young Master Phoenix Slayer, and several other members of the group.","It was this understanding that allowed them to be reckless without dying, living on until now.","At that moment, when Senior Northern River received the title, ’Eternal Group Leader,’ he darkened in expression.","One should know that his group nickname within the Nine Provinces Number One Group was ’Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire’; he had been thinking about training a ’Group Leader No. 2’ to hand over the group leader’s authority!","Now, Song Shuhang giving him the ’Eternal Group Leader’ title, wasn’t this intending to make him sit in this liver-paining position forever?","How could this be acceptable?","\"Wait...\" Venerable Yellow Mountain couldn’t help but speak out.","But before he could finish, he was transferred out from the ’show my divinity in front of the masses’ segment, and his consciousness returned to the main world.","Immediately after.","Soft Feather’s figure appeared beside Song Shuhang, replacing Senior Northern River.","Aside from treating Group Leader Northern River specially, in the next sequence, Song Shuhang followed the order of his golden core composition ’Star Road.’","The order of the Star Road was also the order of the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, whom Song Shuhang had encountered upon entering the world of cultivation.","Soft Feather was the first group member he had encountered in this world, the initial figure in the Star Road, and also one of the ’guides’ of Song Shuhang’s cultivation journey.","\"Ah? Isn’t that the Millennium Ninth Sage, Ancient Sage Spirit Butterfly? Ancient Sage Spirit Butterfly?\"","Ancient Sage Spirit Butterfly is also a member of this group? How many big-shot level figures are hidden in this group?","\"Senior Song, congratulations on becoming the Heavenly Dao!\" Soft Feather’s eyes seemed a bit red, but her condition looked very good and she seemed quite happy.","\"Did you cry?\" Song Shuhang asked, puzzled.","Soft Feather shook her head repeatedly, \"It’s not really crying. Just that these few days, tears were inexplicably flowing. But I haven’t encountered anything sad, and the symptoms also disappeared the day before yesterday. You and Senior White don’t need to worry about me!\"","Song Shuhang thought and guessed the reason for Soft Feather’s sudden tears.","It was probably the influence left by the Future Child.","—But it no longer mattered because he and Senior White had already proven their Dao together! The next step was transcendence!","Song Shuhang showed a reassuring smile and said, \"Soft Feather, like Senior White, you have a patternless golden core. The Dragon Pattern Sticker is not needed for you. So, I have prepared a compensating spell for you.\"","Saying that, Song Shuhang reached out and touched Soft Feather’s forehead, leaving a flower diadem on her brow.","This was the cultivation technique of the Overlord God Pillar, which he and Senior White had calculated and improved using the authority of the Heavenly Dao.","Cultivating to the eighth level and above, one could, through Song Shuhang as a mediator, summon the ’Tribulation Transcender Pillar, Pillar of Longevity’.","Cultivating to the ninth level and above, one could even summon the ’Heavenly Dao Pillar’!","This fun secret technique would surely be liked by Soft Feather.","—The best way to prevent Soft Feather from being influenced by emotions like ’sadness’ was to let her find amusing things or activities.","Sure enough, upon receiving this secret technique, Soft Feather’s face broke into a brilliant smile.","This interesting secret technique piqued her interest.","She gently touched her forehead and giggled, \"Thank you, Senior Song, I truly love this gift.\"","Pear blossoms bathed in tears, she smiled radiantly.","\"You are the guide on my cultivation path, and I could enter the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ because of you. From the beginning to now, I am the one who should be thankful,\" Song Shuhang said as he handed her a ’Liquid Fat Ball.’","Each person got one; it was standard equipment, naturally not excluding Soft Feather.","\"So... no matter how despairing the future may seem, leave it to me. Senior White and I won’t keep Future Child waiting too long,\" Song Shuhang whispered to Soft Feather in the end.","\"What are you talking about, Senior Song?\" Soft Feather asked, slightly puzzled.","As she asked, tears once again uncontrollably fell from her reddened eyes.","They were tears of joy.","Each teardrop sparkled with delight.","\"In any case, leave everything to me,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile, extending his palm to Soft Feather.","Although Soft Feather didn’t fully understand, she still gently slapped his palm.","After the slap, her tears stopped instantly.","Even her initially reddened eyes returned to their naturally fair state.","Song Shuhang maintained his dependable smile and withdrew his hand.","—He had already received the wish of Future Child!","Rest assured and leave the future to Senior White and me!","No matter what kind of future it is, we will turn it around for you to see!","After the slap, Soft Feather’s figure gradually disappeared.","In the real world.","Saint Monarch Spirit Butterfly, who had been sharpening his sword and was ready to ascend to the Heavenly City with his mortal body to challenge the Heavenly Dao, silently put away his fifty-meter greatsword after seeing his daughter’s eye sockets return to normal.","In the scene where divinity is shown in front of the masses.","The spot where Soft Feather had been was replaced by Senior Medicine Master and Riverly Purple Mist.","\"Is it our turn?\" Medicine Master asked.","The ’Dragon Pattern Sticker,’ which neither Venerable Yellow Mountain nor Soft Feather needed, actually had its first use for them.","\"Congratulations, Senior Medicine Master, and Sister Purple Mist,\" Song Shuhang’s gaze swept over Riverly Purple Mist’s belly.","Senior Medicine Master and Riverly Purple Mist had worked hard day and night and had finally borne fruit.","The man without despair is truly enviable.","\"Thank you,\" Riverly Purple Mist gently touched her belly—the child she and Medicine Master were expecting was obviously lucky. Born not so long ago, it was about to receive the blessings of the Heavenly Dao.","\"How should we cooperate next?\" Medicine Master asked.","\"I’ll do it, let me do it,\" Senior White who had been restraining himself, finally found a use for his strength.","He pulled out a thick stack of ’Dragon Pattern Stickers’ and said to Medicine Master and Purple Mist, \"Pick whatever pattern you like. Choose it, and I will stick it on for you.\"","\"Can’t it be a bit more ceremonial?\" Senior Medicine Master asked seriously.","After all, it was a grand act that would shake the world with Heavenly Dao Authority to supplement the nine dragon patterns.","\"Ceremonial sense, I like that term,\" Song Shuhang abruptly gave a thumbs up, \"I accept that request—at the moment of applying the sticker, I’ll arrange a grand BGM for you, Senior Medicine Master. If you and Sister Purple Mist apply it together, I can even make a couple’s combination BGM.\"","Medicine Master: \"...\"","Did I just make a silly suggestion?","\"Do these dragon patterns differ?\" Riverly Purple Mist asked curiously while choosing.","\"There are.\" Song Shuhang proudly introduced to the seniors, \"Each ’dragon pattern’ appears to be ordinary at first glance. However, when scanned with spiritual consciousness, you will find that each dragon pattern conceals a universe within, each harboring a different design. Depending on the design, the effects of the dragon pattern also vary slightly.\"","Riverly Purple Mist gazed intently and indeed found different designs within these dragon patterns.","There were fruit designs, specifically one resembling lychees—perhaps prepared by Senior White for Fairy Lychee?","There were also designs of the Calabash Brothers, which is purely because Senior White used to paint Calabash Brothers for Song Shuhang so often that it became second nature.","There were designs of disposable flying swords—this was a specialty of Senior White.","There were also designs of divine and mythical beasts—however, since Senior White’s style leaned towards stream of consciousness, if his mood was right, he could depict them brilliantly, lifelike. But if his mood was off, the creatures he painted according to his fleeting thoughts would require closer inspection to barely make out the original form of the divine beasts.","Among the designs of divine and mythical beasts, recognizable at first glance were those of dogs, cats, creatures looking both like wolves and huskies, and designs of snakes or flood dragons.","These were likely prepared for the group’s Ah Cat, Ah Dog, Ah Wolf, and Ah Jiaojiao.","After much deliberation, Medicine Master and Riverly Purple Mist chose several designs that seemed to be ’induction cookers,’ and handed them to Senior White.","\"Your taste is quite exquisite; these mountain peaks hold memories of my cultivation scenes, bustling with spiritual qi. After applying the dragon pattern stickers, they could enhance the spiritual qi of your Golden Cores,\" praised Senior White with a nod.","Medicine Master: \"???\"","Mountains, mountain peaks?","Clearly, these designs were the brainchildren of Senior White’s stream of consciousness when his thoughts were distorted.","\"Let the BGM start!\" Beside them, Song Shuhang snapped his fingers.","A blast of music ensued, both exciting and suitable for lovers, sounds of the Great Way mixed together...","In previous times, their appearance was limited to transforming into sounds of bells, flowing water, or Buddhist and immortal melodies.","But now, under the guidance of Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song, various forms of ’Sounds of the Great Way’ intertwined, forcibly orchestrating a lovers’ BGM.","However, they were rather fortunate, at least they weren’t treated as Heavenly Tribulation’s meal like Big Brother.","When the sounds of the Great Way resonated, cultivators across myriad realms could benefit and attain enlightenment.","This also constituted a small benefit Song Shuhang sent out to the myriad practitioners in the universe—it wouldn’t be fair to have everyone just looking upward at the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ members receiving rewards and only being able to watch enviously.","If there weren’t some benefits, the audience’s time, which is also precious, might lead many to stop watching.","There had to be something enticing.","Amidst the BGM music, Senior White extended his hand toward the dantians of Medicine Master and Riverly Purple Mist, virtually pressing.","Two Golden Cores emerged.","The process was the same as when Senior White had painted golden dragon patterns for Song Shuhang.","Initially, Senior White used a brush.","Now, he used stickers.","The dragon pattern stickers adhered to the Golden Cores, completing Medicine Master and Riverly Purple Mist’s patterns to nine.","\"Thank you, Senior Medicine Master, for initially guiding me onto the path of cultivation, and laying the firmest foundation of my cultivation with the ❮Basic Buddhist Fist Technique❯ and True Self Meditation Scripture,\" Song Shuhang handed three ’Liquid Fat Balls’ to Senior Medicine Master.","The extra one was prepared for their unborn child.","\"In the name of Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song, I bless this unborn child, who will become a child that makes the seniors proud,\" Song Shuhang blessed Medicine Master and his wife and sent them off.","...","Following Senior Medicine Master, it was the turn of the last few good souls of the Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group, Senior Northern River’s Loose Cultivator.","Then came Great Master Profound Principle, who had yet to break his silent meditation.","One after another, seniors and members from the group started to appear.","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman, whose notebook of wishes hadn’t decreased but rather had increased a lot.","And from the current generation of Spirit River Su Clan, Su Clan’s Seven.","Doudou, troubled by splitting the cave dwelling with Venerable Yellow Mountain,","adored Senior White’s White Crane.","Little Guoguo’s senior, Senior Brother Three Realms,","and Yu Jiaojiao, who had finally transformed into a complete human figure using secret techniques, as beautiful as her mermaid mother.","And her father, True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon, who had yet to father a football team and was still striving.","Next... was Immortal Fortune Teller Copper Trigram, whose true face and real gender had yet to be revealed.","With Song Shuhang’s current \"Heavenly Dao\" identity, if he wished, he could have seen through the true form of Senior Copper Trigram and his gender in an instant.","At this moment, Copper Trigram, dressed in ancient attire as white as snow with black hair tied up, incarnated as a handsome youth with red lips and white teeth.","\"Senior Copper Trigram, can I ask you a question?\" Song Shuhang curiously asked.","\"If I say ’no,’ the next wave of heavenly tribulation might not spare me,\" Immortal Master Copper Trigram weakly replied.","\"Not only Shuhang, actually, I am also very curious. Or rather, everyone in the group should be curious,\" Senior White interjected from the side.","Copper Trigram’s real appearance might remain undisclosed, but what exactly is Copper Trigram’s gender?","Is it a fairy or a Daoist priest?","This actually decided how others should mentally approach befriending him.","\"Actually, I never really hid this issue. If you look at the information on my chat account, it’s marked as male. The truth has always been right before your eyes. It’s just that you chose not to believe it,\" the Immortal Master Copper Trigram replied in a melancholic voice.","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group,","\"I don’t believe you for a second, you devious black trigram,\" Senior Northern River’s Loose Cultivator couldn’t help saying, \"Last year, I saw your gender marked as female, did you think you could deceive me?\"","\"!!!\" Immortal Master Copper Trigram replied in shock, \"Old Northern River, what do you want from me? Have you been paying attention to my gender since last year?\"","Senior Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: \"If you don’t want others to know, don’t do it yourself.\"","Song Shuhang and Senior White exchanged a smile and let Senior Copper Trigram go back.","Just let Senior Copper Trigram and Senior Northern River continue their battle.","...","Following Copper Trigram came Young Master Phoenix Slayer.","As soon as Phoenix Slayer appeared, \"Hurry up, Phoenix Slayer, don’t waste time, receive your award and come down, then it’s my turn!\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber in the Nine Provinces Number One Group couldn’t help shouting.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: \"???\"","Today, I finally wanted to show my face in the myriad realms, yet Thrice Reckless is urging me to hurry, showing no respect for me. I, Phoenix Slayer, will remember this grudge!","\"After Thrice Reckless, it should be my turn.\" An audio message popped up in the group, the voice was pleasant, carrying a transcendent aura similar to a hermit in the mountains.","\"Fairy Lychee: \"After Thrice Reckless, it’s my turn according to the sequence, I’m going to have a photo with Shuhang and Senior White in a moment. I wonder if ’Heavenly Dao’ can be captured in it?\"","\"After Fairy Lychee, it’s my turn,\" Dharma King Creation secretly touched a small trumpet.","\"Where am I, which position am I in?\" Fairy Dongfang Six found herself a little nervous. Since her car sank to the bottom of the sea on the way to Mount Qiu Ming last time, she hadn’t driven for a while, and her mood was affected... She now felt especially uncomfortable.","\"It’s me, I’m after Thrice Reckless.\"","\"[Angry rubbing my own dog head emoji], I should be around the same position as Fairy Dongfang Six, right?\" Sun Splitting Halberd Guo Da said.","\"Hurry up, Phoenix Slayer,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber tagged Young Master Phoenix Slayer again in the group.","Thrice Reckless wasn’t intentionally rushing Phoenix Slayer.","He was to relay some whispers to Shuhang on someone’s behalf.","Those few words couldn’t be recorded in text, existing only in Thrice Reckless’s heart.","Once said, they might be forgotten.","Right now, Thrice Reckless was a bit afraid he might forget his words."]},{"number":3140,"title":"Chapter 3140 - 3138: So, Don’t Die!","paragraphs":["```","However, no matter how much Thrice Reckless Mad Saber urged, Young Master Phoenix Slayer had already stopped seeing.","He was no longer paying attention to the messages in the ’Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group’.","After entering the ’Divinity Platform’, Young Master Phoenix Slayer’s body instinctively sprang into action—he posed like a model under the camera’s lens, subconsciously adopting striking poses that showed off his most handsome angles to the camera!","Young Master Phoenix Slayer was considered quite the handsome man even among the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’, and had a small degree of fame within Earth’s cultivation world.","Centered around Earth, he even had a group of young admirer fairies.","How to display his ’handsomeness’ without any blind spots had become his instinct, second nature to him.","\"Senior Phoenix Slayer,\" Song Shuhang called out to him, \"Feeling nervous?\"","\"Do I look like someone who would get scared by such a small display?\" Young Master Phoenix Slayer lifted his head with a dashing tilt, reminiscent of a shampoo commercial, his hair flying about elegantly and stylishly.","\"But your palms are sweating,\" Song Shuhang said bluntly, \"As everyone knows, a cat’s sweat glands aren’t well-developed, and the only place they can sweat from is the pads on their feet.\"","Young Master Phoenix Slayer’s stylish movements froze slightly—he almost wanted to lick his palm to check if he was sweating from nervousness.","Fortunately, at the critical moment, he restrained the impulse to lick his palms.","This was in front of myriad practitioners in the universe, he couldn’t let Song Shuhang lead him into a pit and damage his image.","\"Aren’t you less nervous now?\" Song Shuhang laughed heartily from across him, \"Actually, once you get used to showing your divinity, you’ll get accustomed to it. Like me, after showing it seven or eight times, I can calmly face any stage setting.\"","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: \"...\"","Do you think everyone can show their divinity seven or eight times like you?","\"Should I choose dragon patterns, Senior White?\" Young Master Phoenix Slayer didn’t want to be led by Song Shuhang anymore, and turned to ask.","\"No need, no need, yours, Doudou’s, True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon’s, Cave Lord Snow Wolf’s, I’ve already prepared them for all of you,\" Senior White said, squinting as he took out the dragon patterns prepared for the group’s cats and dogs.","\"What kind of BGM do you want for your presentation, Senior Phoenix Slayer?\" Song Shuhang asked faintly, feeling somewhat left out by Young Master Phoenix Slayer’s cold shoulder.","\"I refuse!\" Young Master Phoenix Slayer waved his hands continuously.","The BGM idea that Medicine Master had brought up earlier was too foolish. Each fellow friend getting their dragon branding could even trigger different BGMs; one or two was fine...but after many, it felt a bit awkward.","Song Shuhang withdrew his hand regretfully.","A few breaths later.","Senior White personally branded Young Master Phoenix Slayer with the dragon pattern, gently pressed his hand on his head, and said, \"Cultivate well, Phoenix Slayer. I’ve experienced many farewells between life and death. In the past, every time I emerged from secluded meditation, I would always worry about hearing that a fellow friend had met a cruel death—but there was nothing I could do. Now, you all have the Nine Dragon Pattern... so, at the very least, aim for the Immortal Realm!\"","Young Master Phoenix Slayer replied solemnly with his head lowered, \"I will, Senior White.\"","Senior White revealed a satisfied smile.","Beside him, Song Shuhang recalled the scenes soon after he met Senior White.","At that time, Senior White had a premonition and seemed to want to enter an extended period of secluded meditation, which was estimated to be several hundred years. At that time, Senior White had also said something similar to him—hoping that the next time he emerged from secluded meditation, he would still see him alive.","Senior White had experienced farewell of life and death many times, yet he had never got accustomed to it.","\"So, don’t die, Senior Phoenix Slayer; you have to live longer than me!\" Song Shuhang passed a ’Liquid Fat Ball’ to Young Master Phoenix Slayer.","\"Don’t jinx me, you are now the Heavenly Dao,\" Young Master Phoenix Slayer responded coolly as he took the ’Liquid Fat Ball’.","Whoosh—","The Liquid Fat Ball transformed into a white windbreaker, draping over Young Master Phoenix Slayer.","He turned around and stylishly waved at Song Shuhang, \"Although you’ve surpassed me, as a former senior, We will not easily stop our forward march.\"","In the past, some members of the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ might have lacked a bit of ’potential’.","But now, after the Dao Foundation Dragon Pattern was supplemented to nine dragon patterns, their potential had been filled to the brim.","The Immortal Realm...","Will become the goal for every member of the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group.’","And this, this was also the fundamental reason why Senior White and Song Shuhang boosted the members of the ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ with additional dragon patterns.","Nine Dragon Patterns, Nine Stage prospects, pointing straight at the Immortal Realm!","```","When Young Master Phoenix Slayer stylishly donned the fat ball’s windbreaker and waved his hand nonchalantly, a BGM played.","This was a BGM with a touch of sentiment amid its vicissitudes of life.","Under the moving sound of the Great Way BGM, Young Master Phoenix Slayer’s figure gradually faded.","After Young Master Phoenix Slayer disappeared, the next silhouette did not show up right away.","Under the watchful eyes of all, the Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song seemed to be making some arrangements, ready to welcome the next member.","[Could the next fellow friend to enter be someone special? Or perhaps a very important person?] The audience from myriad practitioners in the universe wondered.","\"Who’s next?\" Senior White asked.","\"It’s Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber,\" Song Shuhang answered. \"To prevent him from turning into an African monkey and pretending to be Su Clan’s Seven, I have to be cautious.\"","Senior White stroked his chin and nodded in approval, \"If it’s Thrice Reckless, indeed, we should be on guard.\"","The private communication between Will of the Heavens White and Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song did not transmit outward.","However, in the main world, Thrice Reckless could no longer wait.","Within the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","\"It’s my turn, right? Shuhang?\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber asked.","Why haven’t you pulled me up yet?","\"After Thrice Reckless, it’s me.\"","Whoosh~","The figure of Thrice Reckless Mad Saber finally got pulled up to the ’show my divinity in front of the masses’ platform.","\"I finally came up. If it was any later, I might have forgotten what I had in mind,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said, tapping his temple lightly.","\"Senior White, does Senior Thrice Reckless Saber pick his own ’dragon patterns’?\" Song Shuhang turned his head and asked.","Senior White looked down, flipping through a stack of dragon pattern pictures, and replied, \"I’ve prepared the sea wave dragon pattern for him. Let’s proceed to the next step directly.\"","\"Hold on, Senior White. I have something to tell Shuhang, some private news,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber hurriedly interjected, \"Could you please block the projection effect for the myriad realms...\"","\"Need a private chat?\" Song Shuhang reached out to turn off the ’showing their divinity across the myriad realms’ projection and added, \"Private chatting gets you pregnant, you know.\"","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: \"!!!\"","He instinctively covered his belly.","Some things, it depends on who says them—when the exact same words are said by different individuals, the effect can widely differ.","An ordinary person saying, \"Come here, eat whatever you want,\" and a doctor saying, \"Eat whatever you want,\" have entirely different meanings.","The same goes for Tyrannical Song.","The word \"pregnant,\" when uttered from Song Shuhang’s mouth, carried a particular authoritative and daunting effect.","\"Alright, Senior Thrice Reckless. What sort of whisper do you want to share with us?\" Song Shuhang turned off the divinity showing effect across the myriad realms, put up a subtitle that read, \"Taking a short break, will return immediately after the advertisements,\" and asked.","The practitioners across the universe stared with wide eyes at the scrolling ’show my divinity in front of the masses’ subtitles, speechless.","Big Shot Tyrannical Song truly was an existence that trampled the rules of ’showing divinity in front of the masses’ underfoot.","Even after proving his Dao and achieving pseudo-immortality, he still wouldn’t spare this entertaining segment.","But—would you actually play an advertisement?","Don’t just talk the talk.","Will of the Heavens White seemed to have sensed the cultivators’ intentions from across the universe, and his heart moved slightly.","Then, he added a few small words beneath the subtitles written by Song Shuhang—[Golden advertisement spots for rent].","After some thought, he also included Venerable Yellow Mountain’s phone number.","In the main world.","Mama Yellow Mountain: \"...\"","\"Stupid, no more talking, take your medicine.\" Doudou tenderly offered the medicine bottle.","\"I won’t take it,\" Venerable Yellow Mountain obstinately refused.","He just couldn’t take any more.","...","Elsewhere.","\"Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber?\" Song Shuhang, seeing that Thrice Reckless Mad Saber remained silent, called out to him again.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s fingers gently circled at his temple, and then, like a robot without any enlightenment, he began to recite the ’words’ in his mind.","As soon as he spoke, what came out was the language of some unknown era.","To Song Shuhang, it was all gibberish.","\"Ancient language? Or perhaps a dialect from an ancient era’s world?\" Senior White curiously observed Thrice Reckless Mad Saber.","This was a family of languages even Senior White hadn’t heard of – quite normal considering there were so many languages in the myriad practitioners in the universe.","However, not understanding was no problem.","He and Song Shuhang were now embodying the Heavenly Dao, and no matter what language it was, even if they had never heard it before, they would automatically comprehend the meaning after Thrice Reckless Mad Saber finished speaking.","The Heavenly Dao is the ’cause’ and ’source’ of everything in the world.","Language is naturally included in this ’source and cause.’","\"It doesn’t feel like a language from ancient times; it could be a language from the Eternity era, or even more remote... like maybe the era of the Black Dragon World?\" Song Shuhang speculated.","He was genuinely envious of Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s tongue, able to articulate such complex language sounds.","Back in the day when he was learning the ancient language, he had wished he could have surgery on his own tongue!","Several breaths later.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber ceased the relay process, moving his finger away from his temple: \"That’s all, relay complete.\"","\"Thrice Reckless, who asked you to relay this whisper?\" Senior White asked.","\"Fairy Skylark, to be precise, her bone of eternity,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber sat down obediently and replied earnestly.","Song Shuhang was startled: \"Isn’t Fairy Skylark going to appear herself?\"","Fairy Skylark was also a member of the Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group and would be pulled onto the Divinity Platform sooner or later.","\"She will appear, but the her that will appear later might not remember the things she needs me to relay to you,\" today’s Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber wasn’t reckless at all.","Obedient to the point of being distressing.","Senior White instantly understood the implication in Thrice Reckless’s words and asked, \"Died again?\"","\"Mm-hmm,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber nodded.","Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark had died again... then the black-haired Skylark briefly appeared, asking Thrice Reckless to convey a few words to Song Shuhang and Senior White.","It probably wouldn’t be long before the blue-haired Skylark would recover.","The revived blue-haired Skylark might not remember the messages that her black-haired self wanted to be conveyed.","\"Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, although Fairy Skylark has an indestructible body, when you guys are fooling around, you still need to pay attention to safety and not add to the burden of the female giant turtle of disaster,\" Song Shuhang earnestly said.","\"You’re the last one who should be saying that,\" reminded Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber.","Song Shuhang: \"...\"","\"Translate.\" Senior White laughed and reached out his hand, drawing on the power of the Heavenly Dao Authority.","The speech delivered by Thrice Reckless Mad Saber began to be translated with the aid of the power of the Heavenly Dao Authority.","Meaningless syllables sounded out from the vacuum.","Chaotic and disjointed.","As if random words from a dictionary had been pulled out, scrambled, and combined.","\"What does this mean?\" The ’relayer’ Thrice Reckless Mad Saber himself was baffled.","\"Interesting,\" thought Song Shuhang.","His ’Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ activated.","All the words translated by Senior White were thrown into Song Shuhang’s ’Cultivation Chat Immortal Path.’","His ’Cultivation Chat Immortal Path’ was coded in the background by Lady Kunna of the Dragon Network.","As he had guessed.","The seemingly meaningless translated words, once thrown into the ’Cultivation Chat Immortal Path,’ started to form a projection and displayed an image.","Song Shuhang said, \"The black-haired Fairy Skylark is being very cautious; it seems she’s deliberately avoiding something?\"","\"Even the power of the Heavenly Dao Authority is within the range she’s avoiding,\" Senior White added on.","Every sentence relayed was encoded several layers deep.","The image in the projection showed a bustling world.","But not the ’myriad practitioners in the universe’ as it is now.","\"It’s the world corresponding to the era of the ’Black Dragon World,’\" Song Shuhang explained.","He had ’seen’ this world during his time in the Black Dragon World.","Different in form, but the feeling of the aura was similar.","Song Shuhang had once seen an entire world collapse and a giant black dragon, carrying the last life seed, streak across the sky.","\"The Ninth Wielder of the Will detached, and its era ended.\"","There was no sound in the image, but it conveyed information to both Song Shuhang and Senior White.","Then, the bustling world in the image suddenly began to collapse.","Without any signs of collapse.","However, after the Ninth Wielder of the Will detached, they did not engage in a new divine battle to elect a new ’Wielder of the Will’ as was usual.","The world simply couldn’t withstand it and was completely finished.","And this scene is precisely the message the ’black-haired Skylark’ wanted to deliver to Song Shuhang and Senior White.","Today’s ’myriad practitioners in the universe’ and the former ’Black Dragon World’ are not the same.","But there are huge similarities in some respects.","The Ninth Heavenly Dao must not detach lightly.","Once detached, it could lead to the collapse of the world.","\"If that’s true, then the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao really has... been working in vain,\" Song Shuhang said aloud.","In other words, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao doesn’t actually have to work behind the scenes on anything.","Just waiting silently would suffice.","Once the ’Ninth Heavenly Dao’ takes office and then detaches as usual, that would trigger the collapse of the world.","At that time, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao could re-emerge and implement its ’Transcendence Method’ and reap the benefits?","Too hasty.","After all, haste doesn’t bring success, does it?","\"But we are different,\" Song Shuhang said to Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: \"Senior White and I are two distinct entities proving our Dao.\"","Even if one entity ’steps down.’","There’s no need to worry that the myriad practitioners in the universe will collapse.","Another Heavenly Dao would continue to hold sway!","It’s just... the plan for both to transcend at the same time would have to be put on hold.","Before they could be certain that detachment of the ’Ninth Heavenly Dao’ would definitely lead to the collapse of the myriad practitioners in the universe, he had to stay and keep a steady hold on this world!"]},{"number":3141,"title":"Chapter 3141 - 3139: Eternal Eighth God Plan and Immortal Replacement Plan","paragraphs":["\"Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, please inform Senior Skylark... We have received the message she intended for me and Senior White,\" Song Shuhang spoke out, \"Moreover, we are not the same as the Ninth God of the Black Dragon World initially. It merely freed itself from the seat of heavenly authority, whereas Senior White and I aim to go even further, to transcend eternity!\"","The message that black-haired Skylark meant to convey to him and Senior White was likely advising them to act cautiously in their forthcoming endeavors, to avoid inadvertently causing the collapse of the myriad realms of the universe.","\"Yes, don’t worry,\" Senior White assured from beside him.","At that moment, Senior White had made the utmost decision in his heart.","—If the dissociation of the Ninth Heavenly Dao from its divine seat caused the world to collapse, then transcending even further might also likely induce cataclysmic changes to the heaven and earth.","So, he decided it would be best for him to stay.","Senior White was aware of his unique qualities in certain aspects.","If he were to transcend the Immortal Heavenly Dao first, leaving Song Shuhang behind, there was no guarantee that he could prevent a collapse of the ’myriad realms.’","But, if Song Shuhang transcended first, he could ensure the subsequent safety of all realms.","Because, as long as he was here, it would serve as the strongest testament to ’peace’!","This was something Senior White was very clear about in his heart.","He was humorously known as the human mascot of the Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group, a title he never took pride in.","So... it would be him to oversee the myriad realms.","And then, he would study a plan to let the cleaned-up ’Fourth Heavenly Dao Shell’ replace him.","\"With Senior White’s guarantee, I suddenly feel much relieved,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber obediently nodded his head.","His words carried an implied message—that the previous guarantees from Tyrannical Song hadn’t been entirely reassuring.","After all, Song Shuhang’s standing in the group was roughly at the same level as him, Copper Trigram, and Doudou.","Perhaps due to being fellow sufferers, Song Shuhang immediately picked up on the undertones in Thrice Reckless’s words, \"...\"","\"So, I’ll go back and relay this to Skylark,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber stood up.","\"Don’t rush, let me first apply the dragon pattern stickers of tsunami and waves to you,\" Senior White stopped Thrice Reckless Mad Saber.","\"There’s no need, Senior White, I’m quite alright as is,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber repeatedly waved his hands.","But who could resist the Heavenly Dao White?","Soon, two dragon patterns were added to his golden core.","And Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song also bestowed a ’Liquid Fat Ball’ on the side.","The whole process was like presenting a certificate plus a trophy.","After completing the procedure, Song Shuhang gently tapped and sent Thrice Reckless Mad Saber back to the main world—without giving Thrice Reckless any opportunity to showcase himself.","Some viruses are best left to spread within the Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group and not infect the myriad realms.","After seeing off Thrice Reckless Mad Saber.","\"Who’s next?\" Senior White asked.","\"Um... Who was it again?\" Song Shuhang also paused.","He entered an inner sight state, examining the star road map on his fat whale golden core.","At that moment, the message from black-haired Skylark, transmitted through the ’Cultivator Chat System,’ had some additional content.","This portion was clearly intended to ’avoid Thrice Reckless.’","It was content that black-haired Skylark did not want Thrice Reckless Mad Saber to see.","\"Shuhang,\" Senior White called.","\"I see it,\" Song Shuhang tacitly replied.","More content began to gradually emerge from the information left by black-haired Skylark:","[The departure of the Ninth ’God’ will cause the world to collapse, the heavens and earth to lose order, leading to a complete reboot.]","[The Second God, possessing the divine authority to ’divine the future,’ foresaw this possibility.]","[Subsequently, the plan to forge a pure ’Immortal Replacement’ began.]","[Simultaneously, the eternal ’Eighth God’ plan was laid out.]","[Eons passed.]","[The Immortal Replacement Plan continued until the world collapsed, yet it was still not perfected. The Immortal Replacement was not sufficient to bear the pressure of the Heavenly Dao role.]","[The eternal ’Eighth God’ plan also failed to prevent the ascent of the Ninth God. The originally supposed perfect Eighth God held significant flaws, thus becoming the shortest reigning among past gods.]","As Song Shuhang connected this information with the intelligence he had, assorted thoughts raced through his mind.","The Eternal Eighth God? If he recalled correctly... The Eighth God of the Black Dragon World, also appeared to be a sphere?","Was the spherical god of the Black Dragon World pushed into proving its Dao by behind-the-scenes forces?","According to this theory, originally, the Second God might have aimed to build an eternally online, devoid of emotions, Eighth God to firmly occupy the seat of the Eighth Heavenly Dao, blocking the path for the Ninth God.","—As long as I live long enough, not to mention my son, even my grandson wouldn’t have the chance to inherit my throne!","Unexpectedly, the Eighth Heavenly Dao itself had defects; the ’Eternal Eighth God’ plan did not succeed.","This scenario was somewhat similar to the experiences of the current Heavenly Dao in the main world.","Today’s fat ball and its corresponding heavenly authority also failed to perfectly prove its Dao due to its defects, and it didn’t stay in the heavenly seat for long.","\"So, could the current ’Sphere Heavenly Dao’ of the myriad realms also have been created to prevent our ascent as the Ninth Heavenly Dao?\" Song Shuhang speculated.","\"Hmm, possibly,\" Senior White added, \"But regardless, that’s all in the past now. We have already proved the Ninth Heavenly Dao, which is an unchangeable fact. Hence, we only need to look forward!\"","\"So, the other ’Immortal Replacement’ plan... It must be Senior Skylark herself then,\" Song Shuhang stated.","This answer was already quite clear.","Senior Skylark’s purpose of creation was to replace the Ninth God once it vacated the heavenly seat, becoming a ’Substitute Heavenly Dao’, ensuring the continued stability of the myriad realms.","Yet, even with the successful creation of the ’bone of eternity’, Senior Skylark alone wouldn’t suffice to act as Heavenly Dao.","—At the very least, she would need to achieve the state Song Shuhang had before proving his Dao, the ’Full Body Semi-Immortal plus Perfect Immortal Whale Golden Core,’ to tentatively hold the position of Heavenly Dao and withstand the pressure of eternal power.","\"Therefore, black-haired Senior Skylark conveyed this content to us... Is it because, with no choice left, she wants us to use her?\" Song Shuhang guessed, deducing that these revelations came after Thrice Reckless had left.","\"Skylark doesn’t know we possess a complete, pure ’Fourth Heavenly Dao Shell’, so she must be considering this,\" Senior White stated, \"However... the original ’Immortal Replacement’ plan is precisely what we need.\"","He and Song Shuhang had originally planned to conquer this topic within a month!","Unexpectedly, a perfected plan had quickly come knocking on their door."]},{"number":3142,"title":"Chapter 3142 - 3140: Live the Way You Like It","paragraphs":["\"It seems that I really have to meet Senior Skylark,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile.","That feeling of ’whatever you wish for will come to you’ can be addictive. Indeed, teaming up with Senior White was the right thing to do!","Especially under the premise that one has already become ’eternal and Fearless of any disaster’.","Even if Senior White’s ’seeking wealth amidst danger’ attribute was triggered, and getting what he wanted came with risks, it couldn’t possibly harm an everlasting being!","\"However, what we need to meet... is the black-haired Fairy Skylark,\" Senior White said, stroking his chin.","According to Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s previous description, Fairy Skylark had already returned to her blue-haired mode.","For the black-haired Fairy Skylark to appear again, the current blue-haired Skylark would need to accidentally cross the ’courting death’ limit and suffer a cruel death, entering resurrection mode.","Moreover, this ’courting death’ limit had to be a ’major death event’.","Ordinary ’minor deaths,’ like dying from poisoning, getting shot in the head, or dying from sheer shock, would not bring out the black-haired Fairy Skylark.","—In the tumultuous life of Fairy Skylark, these ways of dying were relatively peaceful.","The black-haired Fairy Skylark generally appeared when the blue-haired Skylark was crushed to bits, dying down to the cellular level or even smaller units, and only then, through the ’bone of eternity,’ entered the resurrection phase.","\"That means, we need to let Senior Skylark die once?\" Song Shuhang said, voicing a very cruel notion.","Senior White shook his head.","He couldn’t bring himself to act against a member of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Even if he knew that the other party had an eternal body, it was the same.","\"I can’t do it either,\" Song Shuhang said with a slight smile.","He could be harsh to himself, after all, a man has to be tough on himself. But he couldn’t bring himself to be cruel to a good friend who was also a senior.","\"The reason I shook my head is... we are the Heavenly Dao,\" Senior White said calmly.","This useful authority of Heavenly Dao should not always be overlooked.","As long as the Heavenly Dao is willing, there’s no need to let Fairy Skylark die even once, yet the black-haired Fairy Skylark could still appear.","Song Shuhang clapped his hands, \"I almost forgot, I am the Heavenly Dao.\"","He had just taken office; he was still not used to the reality that he had shifted from a ’cultivator’ to ’Heavenly Dao.’","\"Then that’s settled, we’ll meet with Senior Skylark later.\"","\"Keep the live broadcast screen on the advertising interface for now.\"","Senior White and Song Shuhang silently agreed.","...","...","Within the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","\"Fairy Lychee asked, \"Has Thrice Reckless come back?\"","\"Yes, Fairy Lychee, Brother Thrice Reckless has been back for a little while now,\" Thrice Reckless responded.","\"Has the next person already gone up? Isn’t it my turn? I remember I was scheduled after Thrice Reckless,\" Fairy Lychee said, puzzled.","Many fellow friends in the group had observed Song Shuhang’s Golden Core Star Road map.","She clearly remembered that it was her turn after Thrice Reckless.","That map was arranged based on the order of ’members’ Song Shuhang had encountered in this world.","\"It’s me... ’Sighing Emoticon’, but I didn’t go up either.\"","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator responded, \"Now that Fairy Lychee mentions this, I suddenly remembered something. On Shuhang’s ’Star Road’ diagram, behind Thrice Reckless Mad Saber and in front of Fairy Lychee, there indeed was a fellow friend.\"","\"Who? I don’t recall,\" asked Young Master Phoenix Slayer.","Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire: \"[Voice message]: It was Scholar Drunken Star. The scholar’s cultivation has strengthened again, which is troublesome.\"","\"It’s Senior Drunken Star, Senior Yellow Mountain, indeed it’s ’Star’.\"","Doudou added, \"Moreover, the reason Yellow Mountain and I suddenly thought of the scholar is because we remembered the scene at the Grievance Settling Platform. The order on Shuhang’s Star Road diagram is arranged according to the sequence in which the group members actually met Song Shuhang. At that time, Thrice Reckless arrived with someone else through Senior White’s ’disposable flying sword’. So, we confirm that behind Thrice Reckless and in front of Lychee, there definitely was another person.\"","\"The visual is back, I remember now... At that time Thrice Reckless was in a full-fruit state. It was eye-blinding,\" Fairy Dongfang Six suddenly realized.","\"It appears, without a doubt, the scholar was the one who went up... Worthy of Shuhang and Senior White, being able to remember the Scholar continuously,\" commented Northern River’s Loose Cultivator emotionally.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber had already returned, yet Fairy Lychee had not gone up.","The person who went up was without a doubt, the scholar.","\"I still haven’t gone up!\"","Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue remarked thoughtfully, \"I wonder what the original number of dragon patterns on the scholar’s Golden Core was? If his Golden Core is supplemented to nine dragon patterns, would the effect of his techniques become stronger?\"","\"!!!\"","\"Speaking of which, did you notice the divinity-revealing scene? Or the ’After the advertisement, even more exciting’ subtitle. Does that mean the scene of the scholar adding dragon patterns was forgotten by Senior White and Song Shuhang when they didn’t remove the ad?\" Fairy Dongfang Snow pointedly said.","\"That’s too sad, it was exactly the ’divinity-revealing’ scene that the scholar wanted the most. Even a few seconds would have been good... Heaven is too harsh on the scholar,\" mourned Northern River’s Loose Cultivator.","\"...\"","\"Eh, wait a second. Fairy Skylark is missing, did she go up?\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber suddenly said, \"The Scholar came back? But wasn’t Fairy Lychee supposed to be behind the Scholar?\"","\"So, there’s only one truth—the scholar never went up in the first place; he was forgotten by Song Shuhang,\" Immortal Master Copper Trigram came online and said, \"I’ve been spectating for so long and then carefully read the recent chat records. I noticed that after I returned from showing my divinity, there were 98 unread messages, but from the beginning to the end as I read, I only saw 94 chat messages.\"","Among them, four must have been neglected.","Those neglected four must have been the scholar’s messages.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: \"...\"","\"@Heavenly Path of Tyrannical Song, Senior Song, don’t forget the scholar senior,\" came the caring words from Soft Feather.","...","...","Behind the scenes of the divinity-revealing.","Song Shuhang brought Fairy Skylark before him.","With blue-haired Skylark’s consent, Senior White exercised the authority of the Heavenly Dao to show black-haired Skylark.","The thick blue hair and eyelashes of Skylark quickly turned pitch-black.","\"It looks like, my message, Fellow Daoist White and Song Shuhang, you already received,\" black-haired Skylark said softly.","\"Yes, Senior Skylark,\" Song Shuhang said, \"Senior White and I need the detailed original plan and operating steps of the ’Immortal Replacement’ scheme.\"","\"No problem, that’s precisely what I wanted to provide you,\" black-haired Skylark reminded again, \"But with my current state, there is still a lot lacking in order to fully take on the duties of replacing the Heavenly Dao. So, when it comes to that point, I hope you, Fellow Daoist White, and Song Shuhang will consider everything carefully before making a decision.\"","\"Don’t worry, Senior Skylark. We have better items to replace the heavenly authority in our hands,\" Song Shuhang slightly smiled.","\"Skylark, you don’t need to carry unnecessary pressure. You can live in the way you like, according to your own intent, and not as a part of the ’Immortal Replacement Plan’,\" Senior White said, and slightly showed the ’Fourth Heavenly Dao Shell’ to Skylark."]},{"number":3143,"title":"Chapter 3143 - 3141: Techniques that can Influence the Will of the Heavens!","paragraphs":["\"This is the spoils of war that Senior White and I, along with the Fourth Heavenly Dao, obtained after an unprecedented fierce battle. The Fourth Heavenly Dao is truly an incredibly powerful opponent, even capable of briefly reclaiming the Heavenly Dao Authority to confront us,\" Song Shuhang transformed into the ’black blower’ at this moment, extolling the strength of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","When the black-haired Skylark saw the complete, pure, and unconscious Heavenly Dao shell presented by Senior White, she stopped thinking for a moment, her mind went blank, and she couldn’t say anything.","How did the white-robed figure and Shuhang come up with something ’almost impossible to exist in the world’?","Normally, once the Heavenly Dao leave their ’Heavenly Dao seat,’ their ’existence’ becomes restricted, and they can no longer enter the main world—until now, people still have no idea where those ’retired’ Heavenly Dao have gone, or where they might be hiding, whether they continue to pay attention to the main world.","In other words, encountering a ’complete Heavenly Dao shell’ in the main world is almost an impossibility.","Moreover, the Heavenly Dao are eternal and indestructible.","Even the Heavenly Dao who have retired from their ’Heavenly Dao seat,’ as long as their immortal shells remain, their consciousness is protected by the power of ’eternity.’","Even the Heavenly Dao currently in office cannot erase the consciousness inside the retired Heavenly Dao shell!","Unless, the retired Heavenly Dao volunteered?","But how could there be such a ditsy, retired Heavenly Dao who would voluntarily erase their own will?","But the fact lay before her eyes.","What Senior White showed her was such a pure, unconscious Heavenly Dao shell. It was indeed a perfect ’Immortal Replacement.’","There would be no better Heavenly Dao substitute in the world—because it was the Heavenly Dao itself.","\"It’s fantastic, simply the most miraculous masterpiece,\" the black-haired Skylark remarked with emotion after coming back to her senses.","At the same time, in that instant, she felt the ’burden’ on her shoulder suddenly lifted.","It was as if she had become incredibly relaxed.","\"I and Senior White are ready to tackle the challenge of ’using the Heavenly Dao shell’ in lieu of the Heavenly Dao. Therefore, we need the detailed contents of the ’Heavenly Dao Replacement Plan’ that Senior Skylark has,\" said Song Shuhang.","\"No problem, I’ll send all the steps of the plan to you via the ’Cultivator Chat System.’ If you have any questions during the process, you can consult me at any time,\" nodded the black-haired Skylark.","She bundled all the detailed content of the plan and sent it to Shuhang and White.","Having done all this, Skylark’s black hair started to gradually return to blue from the tips up.","After today, even the last mission that could give her a sense of ’burden’ in this myriad practitioners in the universe was perfectly resolved.","She could live even more freely according to her heart’s desires.","—That said, she might be letting the giant turtle of disaster down; in the future, their workload would probably increase significantly.","After receiving the original draft of the ’Heavenly Dao Replacement Plan,’ Song Shuhang and Senior White began to deduce it together.","\"The one who conceived this plan, the Second God of the Black Dragon World, must have done more than just ’deduce the future,\" Senior White murmured.","\"Could it be like the once white-robed figure who reached near-transcendence and directly spied into the distant future, even being able to affect it?\" Song Shuhang speculated.","\"It’s indeed possible,\" Senior White nodded, \"Overall, this plan has a very high feasibility rate. However, because the rules of the Black Dragon World and our myriad practitioners in the universe have some small differences... We need to rededuce and modify some minor details in the plan.\"","\"I will send this plan to the ’Sage’s Eye Research Group’ so that the seniors can also assist in tackling it,\" said Song Shuhang.","This time it should be the last time to ask the seniors to tackle a problem.","Once this topic is overcome, Song Shuhang should be able to graduate from ’Heavenly Dao seat.’","Once successful, there would be no more topics for Tyrannical Song to delve deeply into in the myriad realms.","After all, other previous Heavenly Dao in this discipline could only be considered as dropouts.","Even Senior White could only be seen as ’failing and repeating’ the course.","\"Senior White and Shuhang, I wish you success,\" the black-haired Skylark, slowly returning to blue hair, blessed Song Shuhang and White.","\"Thank you for your kind words, Senior Skylark... We will definitely succeed,\" Song Shuhang said resolutely.","Black-haired Skylark: \"Since you’re all so confident, I can rest easy now.\"","\"Fairy Skylark... at the very end, I’d like to ask. When the ’Black Dragon World’ collapsed during the Ninth God’s departure, did anything unusual happen?\" Senior White suddenly brought up this question.","Previously, one could only see the Ninth God’s departure and the sudden collapse of the world... There were no signs of where the collapse originated.","\"As for the source of the world’s collapse, I really can’t be sure. But if I had to offer a clue, the last time I died in that era, I vaguely saw an entity lifting the Black Dragon, making it the final land of hope. However, I have a feeling that this entity is also related to the world’s collapse,\" the black-haired Skylark couldn’t be sure if what she saw last was real, and this was merely her speculation.","\"Who does Fairy Skylark think that entity could be?\" Song Shuhang thoughtfully asked.","An entity that both supported the Black Dragon and was the root of the world’s collapse was a very contradictory existence.","The black-haired Skylark shook her head: \"Sorry.\"","She couldn’t even confirm if her last vision was real or an illusion, let alone speculate the identity of that entity.","\"No, Senior Skylark, the information you’ve provided is already plentiful. We should be thanking you,\" Song Shuhang assured. \"We’ll take it from here.\"","The black-haired Skylark waved at Song Shuhang and Senior White, her form gradually disappearing.","\"Got any leads?\" Senior White inquired.","\"Mm, if that ’entity’ is not just an illusion of Senior Skylark, then its identity is quite deducible,\" Song Shuhang analyzed. \"Senior Skylark is a masterpiece of the Second God. That is, she has experienced all ’Gods’ from the Second to the Ninth. Yet, that ’entity’ is someone that Senior Skylark doesn’t recognize.\"","\"So, it’s the First God,\" Senior White nodded, his conjecture aligning with Song Shuhang’s.","Song Shuhang continued, \"If we were to compare it to our ’myriad practitioners in the universe’... it would be the First Heavenly Dao!\"","Compared to the Black Dragon World, their First Heavenly Dao was clearly more troublesome.","Because there were no records, data, or traces of the First Heavenly Dao.","Everything had been erased, completely wiped clean.","It was even uncertain whether the ’First Heavenly Dao’ had graduated from the seat of the Heavenly Dao.","\"Knowing this possibility, we just need to be a little more cautious. As long as we don’t give the other party a chance to show up, we’ll ensure the ’Ninth Heavenly Dao’ continues to exist,\" Senior White summarized. \"Besides, we have a two against one advantage.\"","The proposal put forth by white-robed figure—’two Heavenly Dao proving their Dao at the same time’—could almost perfectly face many challenges.","\"It’s not just two against one; it could be three against one, or even four against one,\" Song Shuhang chuckled.","The ’Imperial Dragon Robe’ cleansed by the white-robed figure.","The ’Immortal Shell’ in the main world.","If used well, each of them could play a role in a conflict at the ’Heavenly Axiom-level’.","...","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","\"Thrice Reckless, is Skylark back?\" Northern River’s Loose Cultivator asked.","They had just tagged Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark, but there was no response.","\"She’s back, just got back,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber replied, as he wistfully looked at his Golden Core being upgraded to ’nine dragon patterns’.","Nine dragon patterns were just too flashy.","Spirit Butterfly Island’s Soft Feather: \"Sword Sage, are you there? Did you make it up?\"","\"I reply, can you all see it?\"","Spirit Butterfly Island’s Soft Feather: \"I think Sword Sage Senior must have ascended since he hasn’t responded.\"","\"The advertisement of ’show my divinity in front of the masses’ has finally been removed... it looks like the gentleman is finally going to show his divinity. Shuhang, this time, has finally done humanly possible,\" Northern River’s Loose Cultivator remarked with emotion.","\"Scholar Daoist friend must be very moved, I’m gradually losing my impression of him, I hope this showing of divinity will let me remember him anew,\" Young Master Phoenix Slayer nodded.","\"How did you manage to each read a different wrong name, yet still carry on the conversation together?\"","\"Huh? The number of messages is off again; three messages have appeared out of thin air. Could it be that Daoist Sword Soldier hasn’t ascended yet?\" Immortal Fortune Teller Copper Trigram had been paying close attention to this detail.","Spirit Butterfly Island’s Soft Feather: \"@Tyrannical Song, Senior Song, Senior Song, don’t forget about Senior Soldier! (ง•̀_•́)ง\"","\"Don’t panic, I’m here!\" Song Shuhang replied, \"I was just deducing something with Senior White; we’ll pull up the scholar immediately.\"","The moment Song Shuhang gave a firm reply, the scholar’s eyes moistened.","A short while later.","Cultivators from myriad practitioners in the universe, once again witnessed the scene of \"showing their divinity in front of the masses.\"","This time, the one ascending the stage was a very handsome and charismatic mister.","This mister possessed an elegant aura, like that of a noble orchid in a secluded valley.","He’s the type that leaves a lasting impression on people.","\"Does anyone else feel this mister looks familiar, as if we get the chance to see him every month?\"","\"Is he a Confucian mister? Such a refined temperament, he must be a good choice for a dao companion, right?\"","\"For cultivators, outer beauty isn’t the true measure of beauty. What truly matters is the aura, and this mister has the elegance of a hermit in the deep mountains, truly worthy of being a friend of Tyrannical Song.\"","Then, they blinked.","During the blink, it seemed as though they forgot something.","And they started repeating the lines above.","But deep inside, that strange feeling of familiarity grew even stronger.","In the void.","The scholar took a deep breath.","At this moment, the gaze of everyone in thriving in the myriad realms was focused on him.","[Look at me, everyone is looking at me!]","How wonderful!","There are some things that you don’t cherish when you have them. But when you lose them, you realize their value.","Like sunlight...","Like presence...","The scholar, in his youth, didn’t care much about ’presence.’ Compared to the Cultivation Realm, what was presence worth?","Trading presence for powerful cultivation seemed like a worthwhile exchange to him.","But only after he truly began to lose presence bit by bit, did he experience the wonder of ’everyone looking at me.’","Just being watched made him feel content.","Sometimes, the happiness of cultivators is that simple~","\"Thank you, Shuhang.\" The scholar sincerely said.","Having a friend who’s a Heavenly Dao is really great.","It would be great if I could ’show my divinity’ every few days like this.","\"You don’t need to be polite, Senior Drunken Moon; you’ve taken care of me before too,\" Song Shuhang said with a slight smile—the scholar was a big spender who once frightened him, a newbie, with a huge phone bill that shook him to the core with its string of zeros.","The scholar stiffened slightly upon hearing Tyrannical Song’s thanks.","This stiffening of the muscles felt very much like ’network lag, character stuck in a game,’ very apparent.","\"Drunken Star.\" The scholar turned his head and said bitterly to Song Shuhang, \"I am Drunken Star, Shuhang.\"","Could it be that even the Heavenly Dao can’t remember his dao name?","Does my stupid cultivation technique even affect the Heavenly Dao?","What about my future?","What do I do when I cultivate to the Eighth Stage Profound Sage or even Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm?","\"Senior Drunken Moon, wake up,\" Song Shuhang reminded him, \"Others may have forgotten your dao name, but how can you forget your own dao name?\"","The scholar: \"???\"","\"In fact, not long ago, you corrected someone else, saying your name is Drunken Sun, you said it yourself, I saw it in the group,\" Senior White’s voice slowly rose.","The scholar: \"???\"","\"Sun, Moon, Star? Is it a cycle?\" Song Shuhang wondered.","Senior White said, \"I think the scholar has simply forgotten what his dao name is... I even suspect that Drunken Moon might not be the scholar’s original dao name at all.\"","The scholar looked up to the sky.","\"Why don’t we ’account reset and retrain’? With me and Senior White here, perfect cleansing of your cultivation to the initial state shouldn’t be a problem. Then, Senior, you can choose a new technique to cultivate. With everyone’s help and a foundation of the nine-dragon-patterned golden core, your Cultivation Realm will definitely skyrocket,\" Song Shuhang suggested.","\"Account reset and retrain, is it possible?\" The scholar looked up, his eyes full of hope.","\"Yes,\" Senior White replied affirmatively.","For the Heavenly Dao, a mere nine-dragon-patterned doodle was not a problem; what’s more an account reset and retraining?","The scholar’s heartbeat began to speed up.","Account reset and retraining.","Moreover, the support of the Heavenly Dao was behind him.","A safety net in the form of the Golden Core with nine dragon patterns.","Plus, he retained all his ’insights’ for breakthroughs, so there would practically be no bottlenecks in cultivation. With this, he could cultivate extremely rapidly; reaching the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm might only take a few decades...","The scholar couldn’t help but be moved.","He opened his mouth and was about to say \"yes.\"","But for some reason, the word just wouldn’t come out of his throat.","Because, at the last moment, he hesitated again.","After another long silence.","\"Never mind.\" The scholar sighed deeply, \"This is my path, my own choice.\"","As he made up his mind.","The next moment, his realm broke through the bottleneck of the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm and advanced to the Eighth Stage Profound Saint.","The heavenly tribulation descended.","With the permissions of Song Shuhang and White, the tribulation pulled the scholar into the space.","Senior White and Song Shuhang silently watched the Heavenly Tribulation Realm.","——Just now, Song Shuhang had an illusion. If he hadn’t brought the scholar to the position to show divinity, the heavenly tribulation might have ignored the scholar!","At the Eighth Stage, the scholar’s technique had an even greater effect.","As he was contemplating, suddenly, Song Shuhang was startled: \"Drunken... what, Scholar?\"","After the scholar advanced to the Eighth Stage... this time, even the Heavenly Dao was affected!","\"No, there’s something very wrong with the series of techniques practiced by the scholar,\" Song Shuhang said seriously."]},{"number":3144,"title":"Chapter 3144 - 3142: I Know the True Dao Name of the Scholar","paragraphs":["Before, he had not ascended to the position of the Heavenly Dao, which is why it was understandable for him to be influenced by the techniques of Scholar Drunken Something, even if only slightly.","But now, he was the incumbent Heavenly Dao, the ultimate authority dog of the myriad practitioners in the universe, the \"source and cause\" of the myriad realms!","There was no reason he should still be affected by the effects of Scholar Drunken Something’s techniques.","Yet reality was paradoxically bizarre.","Scholar Drunken Something, who was merely transitioning from the Seventh to the Eighth Stage, had affected him—the Heavenly Dao—to the extent that he couldn’t remember the Scholar’s dao name.","What level of defiance against the natural order would that technique reach if the Scholar were to ascend one more level and reach the Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender Realm?","Could even the \"Heavenly Dao\" forget this individual’s existence?","Perhaps even the entire \"myriad realms\" and \"Heavenly Dao Origin\" would forget this figure!","By then, the Scholar would truly become an \"audience.\"","An entity detached from the world, observing it in spectator mode?","A role that cannot be \"observed\" by others?","\"If we follow this line of reasoning, Scholar Drunken Something’s technique seems to hold a very high status,\" Song Shuhang murmured.","\"It’s Drunk Star,\" Senior White corrected as he neatly arranged a stack of \"Dragon Pattern Stickers\": \"Of course, it could also be other dao names.\"","\"Senior White, aren’t you affected?\" Song Shuhang asked, puzzled.","\"From the beginning, I was not affected by the Scholar’s techniques. I have always remembered his dao name... though he, himself, has changed it three times along the way,\" Senior White said as he found a place to sit.","[Indeed, Senior White is still that one exceptional existence.]","[While Scholar Drunken Moone’s technique may be unique, it still can’t override the exceptionalities of Senior White.]","Now, the few most special individuals in the world all stood within his own camp, which was the most reassuring thing.","\"Senior White, you mentioned Scholar Drunken Something earlier; what are the dao names he switched to?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Drunk Moon, then Drunk Sun, and now Drunk Star,\" Senior White patiently explained to Song Shuhang.","\"Drunk Sun, Drunk Moon, Drunk Star?\" Song Shuhang’s eyes suddenly lit up: \"Senior White, I get it, the true dao name of Scholar Drunken Something—Drunk Star!\"","\"Hmm... if you’re happy, then it’s fine.\" Senior White settled into his seat and took out his tea set, readying the secret tea blend provided by Cheng Goudan’s Father and began brewing tea.","\"Speaking of which, I have also cultivated Scholar Drunk Star’s techniques,\" Song Shuhang said as he sat down beside Senior White: \"But even if I pushed these techniques to the ’Ninth Stage Tribulation Immortal’ level, I haven’t achieved the effects of the Scholar’s Eighth Stage.\"","His Three Corpses•Self Corpse had cultivated Scholar Drunk Star’s techniques and had pushed them to their limits.","Currently, the Three Corpses roamed the myriad realms, becoming a part of Song Shuhang’s ’Cultivator Chat System’, enhancing the effects of the ’Chat and Path to Immortality’.","Song Shuhang had not retracted the Three Corpses. The Three Corpses were different from the light of virtue—once retracted after becoming the eternal Heavenly Dao, they would be utterly merged back by the ’eternal’ power into the main body, unable to manifest again.","Thus, the current state of the Three Corpses was quite favorable.","\"It may be a matter of constitution,\" Senior White said as he handed a cup of immortal to Song Shuhang: \"Some techniques require a specific constitution to be cultivated to the true extreme. If the constitution doesn’t match, even if one cultivates it, the effects will be greatly reduced.\"","Even if Song Shuhang elevated the techniques to the ’Tribulation Immortal Level’, the effects couldn’t compare to those of Scholar Drunk Moon’s Eighth Stage. This showed how perfectly the Scholar’s constitution matched his techniques.","\"I’ll divert a strand of mental energy to monitor Drunk Star’s tribulation to prevent any accidents... and to observe the Scholar’s state. Maybe I can gain some insights from him,\" Song Shuhang voiced his plan.","As he spoke, he willed it, and two strands of the Heavenly Dao’s intent descended on the ’Eighth Stage Profound Sage Heavenly Tribulation’ world, quietly observing Scholar Drunk Star’s act of overcoming tribulation.","Song Shuhang had an intuition... that the Scholar’s technique might prove useful in the future.","For example, if he could evolve the Scholar’s techniques to their ultimate form and apply them to himself while using Cloud Gauze Three View Moon’s ’Immortal Replacement Plan’.","Then, it might be even more beneficial for his ’Heavenly Dao Graduation Plan’!","This was his intuition as the ’Heavenly Dao’, not to be underestimated.","The intuition of the Heavenly Dao often foreshadows the future.","...","In the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation World,","Drunk Star Hermit was casually strolling through the heavenly tribulation.","He might be the most laid-back transcendee Song Shuhang had ever seen—well, aside from himself who had proven his Dao for immortality and Senior White.","The Eighth Stage heavenly tribulation was fiercely striking down.","Moreover, there were modern heavenly tribulation guided missiles performing a ground-sweeping bombardment on the space below.","However, the small space where Drunk Star Hermit was located always seemed to be ’forgotten’ by the heavenly tribulation.","Sometimes, Drunk Star Hermit would deliberately crash into the location of the heavenly tribulation.","But the heavenly tribulation seemed to have ’forgotten’ about that area, as if it were ’an Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation Space,’ stubbornly forgetting to drop tribulation bombs there.","The mere Eighth Stage level heavenly tribulation was completely influenced and distorted by the effects of Drunk Star Hermit’s technique.","If this continued, Drunk Star Hermit’s transcendence of the tribulation would be utterly effortless.","One of Song Shuhang’s Heavenly Dao intents nodded slightly, then began to deliberately record the energy fluctuations around Drunk Star Hermit.","So far, the effect of the Hermit’s technique could only influence Song Shuhang’s impression of the Hermit’s dao name; Song Shuhang could still ’observe’ the Hermit as an individual.","Then, another of his Heavenly Dao intents quietly dragged away one or two helpless lightning of tribulation from the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Tribulation, twisted them into a giant dough twist, and forcibly pulled them out of the ’Heavenly Tribulation Realm.’","Although drinking tea is not like drinking alcohol, it could still be paired with some seeds or peanuts... This heavenly tribulation dough twist, cut up, could also be make do with.","...","It seems Drunk Star Hermit’s heavenly tribulation would continue for a while longer—after he transcends it, he will truly ’show his divinity in front of the masses.’","It’s just that, even the ’Heavenly Dao’ would be affected and forget his dao name.","Song Shuhang could already envision the heart-wrenching scene of the Hermit ’showing his divinity in front of the masses.’","Taking advantage of the Hermit still being in the tribulation phase, Song Shuhang started to re-summon the remaining members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","On the star road, behind Drunk Star Hermit’s figure was Fairy Lychee.","Fairy Cheng Lin had a twin sister due to an ’accidental’ operation—Song Shuhang always held doubts regarding Fairy Cheng Lin’s ’accidents.’","Fairy Lychee’s figure appeared on the showing divinity interface.","\"Is it finally my turn?\" Fairy Lychee looked towards Song Shuhang.","\"I’ve made Fairy Lychee wait too long,\" Song Shuhang said, learning from previous experiences, he asked ahead, \"Fairy Lychee, how many dragon patterns do you have?\"","Since she was ’Cheng Lin’s little sister,’ Song Shuhang suspected that the Fairy’s qualifications should be at the level of ’nine dragon patterns.’","But Fairy Lychee’s response was somewhat unexpected for Song Shuhang, \"Eight dragon patterns.\"","Eight dragon patterns?","Not nine dragon patterns?","\"What’s with that strange expression, Shuhang? Eight dragon patterns are already pretty high, okay?\" Fairy Lychee reached out to lightly pat Song Shuhang’s head a total of four times—she had originally subconsciously wanted to spin Song Shuhang with a ’big windmill rotation.’","But midway through her motion, she suddenly remembered that Shuhang was now the ’Heavenly Dao.’","To give ’Heavenly Dao Shuhang’ some face, Fairy Lychee’s ’big windmill’ was temporarily switched to four pats on the head.","Every cultivator in the myriad realms who was watching the live stream saw this scene.","—In the eyes of cultivators across the myriad realms, ’Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song’ was just a vague figure, and the ’white-robed figure of the Heavenly Dao’ was the same.","This was a thoughtful consideration from Song Shuhang to avoid the impact of ’Heaven’s Will’ on the cultivators.","```","However, people could see that the vague figure was none other than \"Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song.\"","This Fairy Lychee, she actually dared to directly touch the tiger head of Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song!","\"Indeed, having eight dragon patterns is already very powerful,\" Song Shuhang said with a gentle smile.","Beside him, Senior White handed a cup of immortal tea to Fairy Lychee.","\"Thank you, Senior White,\" Fairy Lychee said, sitting down beside Senior White and holding the teacup with both hands.","As she savored the tea, Senior White used his Heavenly Dao Authority to restore her \"Fifth Stage Golden Core Realm,\" then took out the already-prepared \"Lychee Dragon Pattern\" to complete her set of nine dragon patterns.","After all was done, Senior White put the golden core back in place and restored Fairy Lychee’s realm to the Sixth Stage Realm.","During this process, Song Shuhang watched over Fairy Lychee’s aura change with great care.","The entire procedure seemed similar to the experience of Northern River’s Loose Cultivator and several other seniors who had their dragon patterns replenished.","However, if one were to follow the \"strings of karma,\" they would discover that another end of Fairy Lychee’s karmic strings was stirred as she completed her nine dragon patterns.","The other end of Fairy Lychee’s karmic strings branched out, connecting to two karmas.","One end connected to Cheng Lin, who had become fragmented and was still in the hands of Father Goudan.","The other end was connected to Senior Sister Ye Si, who, despite having pushed the \"Scholar\" techniques to their limits, could not hide her own information after Song Shuhang became the Heavenly Dao.","Sixteen and Senior Sister Ye Si were especially left for the last by Song Shuhang.","At this moment, as the strings of karma were stimulated, Senior Sister Ye Si opened her eyes slightly, looking somewhat baffled.","The response on Cheng Lin’s end of the karma, however, was more significant.","In the midst of violent tremors, the \"fragments of Cheng Lin\" held by Father Goudan began to merge piece by piece.","In the blink of an eye, they were restored to their original state.","\"What a headache,\" Cheng Lin muttered, massaging her brow after being restored.","Because she and Song Shuhang had not entirely separated.","Originally, according to the plan, she and Song Shuhang were to completely differentiate themselves by utilizing the karma of becoming \"shattered to pieces.\" Then, they would restore themselves as two individuals through \"rebirth.\"","That way, Cheng Lin would be Cheng Lin, and her karma could be distinguished from Song Shuhang’s.","But now, their plan had failed due to the triggering of the karma as \"Fairy Lychee\" was replenished with the nine dragon patterns.","Sensing that Cheng Lin’s state had been restored, Father Goudan tapped and cracked open the shell he held.","The freshly restored Fairy Cheng Lin had to face the person she dreaded most—Heavenly Emperor Da Da Zi.","At the moment, the Heavenly Emperor’s child looked at Cheng Lin with a smile that wasn’t quite a smile, making her scalp tingle.","Moreover, behind Heavenly Emperor Da Da Zi, there was karma belonging to \"Song Shuhang\" queuing up.","\"Fairy Cheng Lin,\" Fairy Cheng Lin looked up and addressed Father Goudan.","\"Cheng Goudan!\" Father Goudan responded to her enthusiastically.","\"I don’t want to be human anymore,\" Cheng Lin said earnestly.","Father Goudan: \"???\"","\"Come on, Heavenly Emperor’s child. It’s about time,\" said the newly-restored Fairy Cheng Lin, standing up without waiting to fully recover, forgoing treatment.","The Heavenly Emperor’s child did not immediately respond to Cheng Lin.","Instead, she sent a message to Song Shuhang, \"Senior Song... I’m going to settle some personal grievances with Cheng Lin— I’ll be back soon.\"","\"Don’t go too far; you are both Father Goudan’s eggs,\" Song Shuhang cheerfully replied.","Heavenly Emperor’s child: \"...\"","She stood up and gave Cheng Lin a slight nod.","—She, along with Cheng Lin and Song Shuhang, could be said to be the largest \"fragments of Ghost God Cheng Lin\" in the myriad practitioners in the universe.","Among them, the fragment that was Cheng Lin herself was the largest.","Furthermore, Cheng Lin possessed some information about the \"Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon\" that neither Song Shuhang nor the Heavenly Emperor’s child knew.","The Heavenly Emperor’s child stood up, and Cheng Lin opened a space passage ahead.","Both figures disappeared into the space passage one after another.","Behind them, Father Goudan gently poked his chin with dragon mustaches.","\"Father Goudan, just letting them go like this, is that really okay?\" the three-eyed young senior chuckled— your two eggs are about to explode.","\"No worries, they’re not kids; they know the limit,\" Father Goudan said softly.","With Cheng Lin and the Heavenly Emperor’s child left, Father Goudan vaguely sensed something.","\"Myopic Love, your Heavenly Dao is the creator of the ruler of the Netherworld... You created the ruler of the Netherworld to serve as a ’Dao Mark,’ right?\" Father Goudan asked.","\"Yes,\" the three-eyed young senior replied, not very eager to discuss this topic.","\"It might not be long before this function will come in handy,\" Father Goudan mused.","Hearing this, the projection of Senior White two turned his head slightly to look at the white horse, which was grazing like an ordinary horse.","Feeling the gaze of Senior White two, the white horse lifted its head and grinned.","\"Reincarnation is set for the Ninth Heavenly Dao, so... could the previous Heavenly Dao return?\" Senior White two queried.","Other Heavenly Dao could return.","But Senior White two had a faint feeling that Big White Heavenly Dao might no longer have the chance to ’return.’","...","...","In the live broadcast of showing their divinity before the masses.","Fairy Lychee, looking pleased, bid farewell to Song Shuhang and Senior White and disappeared from view.","Song Shuhang had a somewhat troubled look on his face.","Because... Song Shuhang had recovered ahead of time.","Headache.","Evidently, Fairy Lychee’s \"eight dragon patterns\" served as a trigger, likely intentionally left by Fairy Cheng Lin.","\"Fortunately, I have now become the Heavenly Dao,\" Song Shuhang mused to himself.","I’ve become the Immortal Heavenly Dao; am I still afraid of karma?","\"Who’s next?\" Senior White inquired.","\"It’s Dharma King Creation’s turn,\" Song Shuhang answered.","\"If we’re going to bring Dharma King Creation onto the live broadcast... it would be best to bring Fairy Creation along too,\" Senior White carefully suggested.","If they only brought Dharma King Creation onto the live broadcast, an accident might occur.","But with Fairy Creation there to assist, the rate of accidents could be minimized.","\"Mhm,\" Song Shuhang nodded.","Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia were different; she could not be brought into the ’Heavenly Principle Dimension.’","Now that he had proven his Dao, it was time to lend Fairy Creation a hand... to see what her wish was!","```"]},{"number":3145,"title":"Chapter 3145 - 3143: I Entrust Everything to You","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang had originally thought that as soon as Senior Creation arrived, he would start a concert—because he saw the small trumpet in Senior Creation’s hand.","Even Senior White thought so.","Therefore, the two new Wielders of the Will had even built a stage for Dharma King Creation and were planning to bring out Fairy Creation—the true Sound of Nature—in order to neutralize the impact of Dharma King Creation’s Deathly Music on the myriad practitioners in the universe.","However, could members from the Nine Provinces Number One Group ever behave predictably?","The small trumpet of Dharma King Creation was not for singing, but for playing music.","And it was a very delightful song performed by a woman’s voice.","A true self-contained BGM effect upon entrance.","With this series of pleasant singing, Dharma King Creation, dressed as an elegant cultivator, gracefully arrived.","Song Shuhang was somewhat baffled as to what exactly Dharma King Creation was planning to do.","—Originally, he had been wondering if Senior Creation was going to hold a ’concert’ on the spot, then he could assess the ’damage’ it would inflict on sentient beings.","Then consider adding ’Dharma King Creation’s Brain-penetrating Demon Sound’ to the Heavenly Tribulation Grand Banquet!","It wasn’t that Song Shuhang was heartless after becoming the Heavenly Dao; he was seeking to create benefits for practitioners in the universe.","He, Song Shuhang, had transcended so many heavenly tribulations, but the ’sound tribulations’ within it were quite weak and far less stimulating than Dharma King Creation’s music. Moreover, transcending the ’sound tribulation’ didn’t provide any benefits for cultivators themselves.","However, Dharma King Creation’s music, combined with ’Fairy Creation’s Sound of Nature’, could strengthen the will of practitioners and reduce their Inner Demons!","It offered greater training than a mere ’sound tribulation.’","It appeared more intense, but the overall danger was significantly reduced.","This was a hidden gift package that he, the ’Heavenly Dao’ who was often tormented by heavenly tribulations, was secretly providing to practitioners in the myriad realms.","However, Senior Creation didn’t seem to plan on singing.","As the BGM came to an end, Dharma King Creation smoothly made his entrance and happened to arrive right before Song Shuhang and Senior White.","Fairy Creation also emerged alongside him.","After appearing, Fairy Creation stretched gracefully and skillfully floated behind Song Shuhang, entering pendant mode.","\"Senior Creation, would you like to introduce yourself?\" Song Shuhang spoke up.","—He was creating an opportunity for Dharma King Creation.","\"That sounds good,\" Creation replied with a slight smile, like a Confucian cultivator, refined and elegant.","Then he faced the practitioners in the universe.","\"Fellow friends of the myriad realms, greetings. I am known as Dao Hua in the path of cultivation, and I’m pleased to meet all of you here.\" Dharma King Creation greeted with a stylish bow, then continued, \"I have a hobby in my life.\"","[Here it comes.] Song Shuhang’s heart stirred.","\"And that hobby is calligraphy!\" Dharma King Creation continued.","Song Shuhang: \"???\"","In Tyrannical Song’s puzzled face, Dharma King Creation took out the paper and brush he had prepared in advance and began to perform his not-too-shabby calligraphy.","Members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group felt tingles in their scalps.","\"What’s Dharma King Creation up to?\" Young Master Phoenix Slayer removed the earplugs from his four ears.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator wasn’t sure either: \"A change of hobby?\"","\"Impossible, Senior Creation was still looking for me a while ago, hoping that I would collaborate with him for a concert,\" Fairy Dongfang Six spoke up.","\"Then what’s he doing showing calligraphy on the Divinity Platform?\" Medicine Master voiced his confusion.","Fairy Lychee pondered and suggested: \"Why don’t we @ a few ’sick friends’ at this time, such as @Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, @Immortal Fortune Teller Copper Trigram, @Spirit Butterfly Island’s Soft Feather, @Doudou, @Young Master Phoenix Slayer.\"","\"Please don’t @ me, Fairy Lychee. By @ing me like this, you make me seem like a Thrice Reckless patient,\" Immortal Fortune Teller Copper Trigram seriously voiced: \"However, I think that Dharma King Creation probably just wants to ’set up a persona.’\"","Doudou followed up: \"Set up a ’skilled in calligraphy’ persona, concealing his true hobby. In the minds of fellow friends across the myriad realms who are unaware, leave a deep ’first impression’... and then, get ready for next time.\"","\"It might not just be for the next time, but also laying the groundwork for the time after next,\" Thrice Reckless Mad Saber spoke: \"Knowing the Dharma King’s character, he might only reveal his true self after the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Speech is over and after collecting the power of virtue.\"","True Monarch Yellow Mountain: \"...\"","Isn’t it good enough to just sing if you want to?","Why make it so complicated?","It’s precisely this kind of behavior that erodes trust between people, you know?","...","Inside the Divinity Show Space.","While Dharma King Creation was performing ’calligraphy’, Song Shuhang looked up again at Fairy Creation.","Fairy Creation tilted her head slightly, puzzledly looking back at Song Shuhang.","\"Fairy Creation, do you have any wishes? Now that I am the Heavenly Dao, perhaps I could assist you,\" Song Shuhang softly said.","Fairy Creation seemed to ponder for a moment, then she drew a circle with her hands: \"Big Dummy~ Dummy~\"","\"That makes sense, Senior Brother Daozi had also proven his Dao once, and the wishes that the Heavenly Dao could fulfill, Senior Brother Daozi also took care of,\" Song Shuhang replied.","Fairy Creation nodded rapidly like a pecking chicken.","\"What about your own state?\" Song Shuhang asked again.","Fairy Creation crossed her hands: \"Dumb Song~\"","\"Alright, it seems like you have your own plans,\" Song Shuhang said softly: \"In that case, the only thing I can help you with now is the last one.\"","\"Mhm, lustrous Dumb~\" Fairy Creation sang.","\"But, his matter... has already exceeded the Heavenly Dao Authority. However, what the Heavenly Dao can’t do, Senior White and I will. Leave it to us,\" Song Shuhang affirmed.","Another ’past obsession’ needing to be addressed was added to the list.","Pavilion Master Chu’s Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, the last of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders’ lustrous scholar of Fairy Creation, the older brother of Scarlet Pupil from the Black Dragon World, Black Pupil.","...","...","Dharma King Creation didn’t open his mouth to sing until the last moment.","He maintained his elegant and refined persona, letting Senior White perfect the nine dragon-patterned golden core.","He came with elegance and left with style.","Fairy Creation did not leave; she chose to enter the ’Sage Eye Golden Core.’","The immortal ’Scholarly Sage’s Eye’ did not isolate Fairy Creation—just like the relationship between the virtuous lamia and Song Shuhang’s main body.","The original Fairy Creation had a part to do with guarding the ’Sage’s Eye.’","...","```","...","Following Dharma King Creation, members of the Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group kept the rhythm, one after the other, revealing themselves before the cultivators of myriad practitioners in the universe.","The Eight-Armed True Monarch Ancient Lake Temple.","The increasingly charming but still unimproved-driving-skills Fairy Dongfang Six.","The ice-element authority of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, Cave Lord Snow Wolf.","A little dark-skinned and naturally having the effect of a dog-headed building, Sun Splitting Halberd Guo Da.","The scholarly system’s Senior Eternal Fire, who had recently become more at peace and felt much less pressure—originally, Senior Eternal Fire was one of only two in the group, like Senior Yellow Mountain, with the title \"Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire.\" Now, after letting go of his pressure, Senior Eternal Fire looked much younger.","There were also Island Master Tian Tiankong and Vice-Island Master Tian Tianwei who showed up together—Vice-Island Master Tian Tianwei’s soul injuries had been healed in a stroke by the effects of Song Shuhang’s Heavenly Dao Authority.","One of the most reliable members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, hand-in-hand with Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue... Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue!","After member by member made their appearance...","Song Shuhang even brought up several ’Nine Provinces Number One Group’ reserve members.","The young little Guoguo, Shi, and Zhu.","These little guys hadn’t reached the ’Fifth Stage’ realm yet, and the affixing of dragon patterns would also have to wait for the future.","Senior White had used a special method to store the ’dragon patterns’ inside their bodies in a reserved manner.","\"Senior Brother Song,\" little Guoguo suddenly grabbed Song Shuhang’s hand before leaving, \"Finally, can you give me a blessing?\"","He looked at Song Shuhang with hopeful eyes.","[This little fellow has a future! Knows to take advantage of his young age to obtain extra blessings from Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song?]Thought the practitioners in the universe.","[Seeing the degree of favoritism Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song shows them, he’s quite likely to agree to give a blessing. After all, what’s a precious ’Heavenly Dao’s blessing’ to us, is just a word for the Heavenly Dao.]","[But what kind of blessing would this little guy want?]","\"I understand.\" Song Shuhang laughed heartily and reached out to pat the young monk’s head, blessing him as he did so, \"By the authority of my name, Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song, I bless you, little Guoguo. From now on, in your cultivation journey, you shall no longer be troubled by hemorrhoids.\"","\"Thank you, Senior Brother Song, you’re the best,\" little Guoguo’s face brightened with joy.","Many of the cultivators from myriad practitioners in the universe subconsciously touched the area around their behinds.","In fact, among cultivators, before reaching a certain level of strength, a significant number were troubled by hemorrhoids.","...","...","After sending off little Guoguo and the other two, Song Shuhang and Senior White withdrew themselves and lifted the ’showing their divinity in front of the masses’ effect.","The event wherein Senior White and Song Shuhang announced to the myriad practitioners in the universe \"The Nine Provinces Number One Group is under our contract\" came to an end.","Following this.","The figure of Sixteen was transferred to the ’main world,’ then appeared by Song Shuhang’s side through the ’main world.’","The White Dragon wrapped herself around Sixteen’s neck, \"I thought you were going to forget about Sixteen, Shuhang.\"","\"Sixteen is part of my nine dragon patterns,\" Song Shuhang smiled.","He reached out to hold Sixteen’s slender hand, and at the same time, the other hand was held up flat, with the projection of a ’golden lotus’ phantom emerging in it.","\"Shuhang, are you and Senior White preparing to transcend?\" Sixteen turned her head to ask.","```","```","\"From what I can see, there will still be a little preparation time... If during this time, Senior White and I have not completed our graduation project, then let Senior White transcend first,\" Song Shuhang sincerely replied.","Senior White sipped some immortal tea at his side, revealing a tranquil smile and nodded slightly.","\"What will the state after transcendence be like?\" Sixteen voiced the curiosity and confusion in the hearts of the White Dragon sister as well as the pendants on Song Shuhang’s body.","\"No one has truly transcended before, but according to the descriptions from Big White, graduates of the Heavenly Path should possess great freedom, not confined by any time or space. They should be able to appear at any time node, anywhere, soaring above the river of time,\" Song Shuhang replied.","As he spoke, he reached out and handed the ’projection of the golden lotus’ towards Sixteen’s chest--there, Tyrannical Song’s lustrous heart was beating powerfully.","Due to Song Shuhang proving his Dao and becoming pseudo-immortal, this ’Tyrannical Song’s heart’ was subtly reinforced by the rules of the Heavenly Dao.","However, since it had left Tyrannical Song’s body before proving his Dao, it wasn’t considered part of ’Tyrannical Song’s individual’ by the rules of the Heavenly Dao.","Therefore, this lustrous heart had not become immortal.","But it already possessed the potential for ’infinite evolution.’","It was the prototype of the ’bone of eternity’ or ’undying fat whale golden core.’","As long as it’s nurtured, allowing it to evolve and perfect endlessly... In the future, Sixteen might also own an ’Immortal Heart.’","Song Shuhang inserted the ’projection of the golden lotus’ into the lustrous heart.","\"This is the key to the ’main world,’ with it you and Senior Sister Ye Si can open the main world anytime, coming and going freely. You can also use the method of the ’Branded Wooden Saber’ to leave coordinates, appearing wherever you wish throughout the myriad practitioners in the universe,\" Song Shuhang explained.","Sixteen paused slightly and softly pressed a hand to her chest.","The lustrous heart’s beating quickened slightly.","Inside the lustrous heart, it seemed as if another world had emerged--the main world, closely connected to Song Shuhang.","If one day all the myriad worlds were to be obliterated,","then the main world would most likely be one of the last refuges.","\"The main world is all I have, everything I own, treasures, assets, it’s all in there,\" Song Shuhang whispered to Sixteen, \"Now, its key is in your hands.\"","The White Dragon sister: \"!!!\"","The Tyrannical Song, after proving his Dao as pseudo-immortal, had truly opened up wonderfully.","Even she felt her heartbeat quicken at this flirtatious move.","\"With the main world, your safety will have the greatest protection,\" Song Shuhang whispered.","In the past, the main world could sometimes yield in the face of great enemies--not because it was weak, but because being affected by Song Shuhang’s rank, powerful beings could block and seal the space, preventing the main world from opening.","In truth, the main world was not weak; we must remember that at the Eighth Stage, it could forcefully open even under the seal of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender!","At Ninth Stage, it could even forcefully open under the sealing space of an enemy at the Immortal Realm!","In other words, it has always been forcefully opening spatial passages a level higher.","Weakness was simply an illusion!","It has actually been very strong!","And now, the main world’s master, Tyrannical Song, has proved his Dao to be pseudo-immortal, becoming one of the men with the most authority in all the worlds.","No one in this world could make the main world yield!","Even facing an immortal existence at the ’Heavenly Dao’ level,","the main world could still activate protective functions, guard people like Sixteen, and safely transfer them into the main world to protect them.","Even if the myriad worlds collapse and all things fall, the main world could also be protected by Song Shuhang’s ’immortal’ properties, ensuring complete safety!","```"]},{"number":3146,"title":"Chapter 3146 - 3144: Worldly Ties","paragraphs":["The next day, February 16th.","After the grand actions of the Heavenly Path of Tyrannical Song yesterday, cultivators from all heavens and worlds had come to know of a special group called \"Nine Provinces Number One Group\" and had become acquainted with all its members.","Now, in the myriad practitioners in the universe, even those cultivators who might be face blind to \"humans\" forced themselves to memorize all the members of the \"Nine Provinces Number One Group.\"","—These were the targets protected by the Will of the Heavens.","They were not to be trifled with!","Should the opportunity to meet them arise, one must not make enemies, but instead try to make connections, to see if one could perchance rub off some relationships or the like.","And if one dared to dream a little bigger, one might even try to see if there was a chance to join the \"Nine Provinces Number One Group\" through the relationship with the immortal known as \"Mama Yellow Mountain,\" and enjoy the benefits of being shielded by the Heavenly Path of Tyrannical Song?","All the members of the \"Nine Provinces Number One Group\" had become desired individuals in the myriad practitioners in the universe overnight.","And after the grand actions of Tyrannical Song had ended... the myriad practitioners in the universe had also entered a period of stable development.","The \"Battle for the Heavenly Dao\" had officially ended.","The laws of the Heavenly Dao began to operate in an orderly manner.","Due to the absence of the chaos when the \"Fat Ball\" was on the verge of collapse, coupled with the incoming tide of spiritual energy, this era could be considered a golden era for cultivation in the myriad practitioners in the universe.","Immortals and Tribulation Transcenders no longer remained in hiding and would occasionally make an appearance, leave behind inheritances, or take away talented disciples they fancied.","Song Shuhang, Senior White, and the members of the \"External Assistance Research Group\" began tackling the final subject—perfecting the \"Immortal Replacement\" plan.","They hoped to fully unleash the effects of the pure physical body of the Fourth Heavenly Dao and use it to replace the \"Tenth Heavenly Dao,\" thereby creating the ultimate tool-type Heavenly Dao.","The entire research process was in full swing.","Members of the External Assistance Group threw themselves into the project with unprecedented passion and effort.","As for Tyrannical Song, who was now one of the Heavenly Dao, he was slightly distracted—he was still working hard to digest the principles and knowledge of the laws of the \"Cause of the Fruits, and the Source of All Things,\" and didn’t have many opportunities to contribute to this final research topic.","He had indeed been working very hard!","It was just that he had far too little time to study.","Moreover, even though he was slightly distracted... his distraction was not simply a blank mind, but rather he was dispersing wisps of his \"Heavenly Dao consciousness,\" wandering in every corner of the mortal world.","Firstly, to completely exterminate the \"Stellar Destruction Virus\" laid out in the myriad practitioners in the universe by the \"Dark Big Shot,\" ensuring that the virus had no chance of resurgence.","Secondly, it was to meet some people and see some old friends.","...","All Heavens and Myriads of Worlds • Shadow Realm.","Here resided an unparalleled Immortal big shot, the Sector Lord Ruler of Shadows.","According to Song Shuhang’s previous estimates, the Ruler of Shadows, with the added \"sector lord authority,\" might also have reached the level of a Confucian Sage or the Heavenly Emperor, just like Mister Tian Zhi of the Mo family.","A wisp of Song Shuhang’s consciousness quietly descended here.","Senior Shadow, the Ruler of Shadows, became aware of his arrival instantly and awakened from his slumber.","\"It’s been a long time, Senior Shadow,\" the consciousness of Heavenly Dao Song Shuhang spoke.","\"A long time? Wasn’t it just a few months ago?\" the Ruler of Shadows replied with a smile. \"For us, it’s just a blink of an eye.\"","As he spoke, a humanoid form condensed out of the Ruler of Shadows’ enormous figure, facing Song Shuhang.","\"But for me, it was a grand and tempestuous half of my cultivating life,\" said Song Shuhang, extending his palm to reveal a somewhat cracked magical treasure bracelet.","The special Secret Artifact \"Shadow Sanctum.\"","\"I’ve come this time to repay the artifact owed to Senior,\" Song Shuhang said, as his right palm began to glow slightly—the effects of the Heavenly Axiom-level \"Saber-Nurturing Technique\" spread out.","Under the formidable power of the \"Saber-Nurturing Technique,\" all cracks in the Shadow Sanctum were healed. Moreover, the quality of the magical treasure was elevated to another level; deep within the bracelet, a wisp of \"aura of eternity\" emerged in the form of Dao Trace.","\"Unfortunately, even after ascending to the Heavenly Dao, I couldn’t gather all the spirit stones I owed to Senior. Now, I can only rely on some techniques and authorities to repair this magical treasure, as compensation to Senior,\" Song Shuhang handed over the artifact.","\"Compared to spirit stones, I prefer this upgraded ’Shadow Sanctum’ bracelet,\" said the Ruler of Shadows as he reached out to receive the \"Shadow Sanctum.\"","---","— But despite his seemingly steady exterior, his inner turmoil was so complex it defied description.","Waves overturning rivers, volcanic eruptions, tsunamis, doomsday meteorites... Essentially, any word related to disaster could describe the current state of the seemingly calm Ruler of Shadows’ inner world.","After all, to the Ruler of Shadows, the man before him had truly become the Will of the Heavens in the blink of an eye!","\"If Senior likes it, that would be great. After all, even if I wanted to compensate you with a pile of spirit stones right now, I wouldn’t be able to produce them in a short time,\" the will of Song Shuhang joked.","In truth, as the Will of the Heavens, he could certainly scan all the heavens and worlds at any time, find a ’Spirit Stone Source’, and then mine it.","He could even use the authority of the Heavenly Will to command the spiritual power of the world and condense it into a Spirit Stone Source beneath the guidance of the Wil of the Heavens.","But that no longer mattered.","...","At the same time, on Earth • Jiangnan College Town location.","Another wisp of Song Shuhang’s consciousness was strolling near the Jiangnan College Town.","As he walked, the spiritual power in his vicinity became more concentrated, the grass on the lawns revived, branches sprouted new growth, and flowers blossomed during the chill of winter.","\"Unknowingly, it’s been almost a year,\" Song Shuhang’s gaze swept the surroundings.","Even though he was living here just last year, when he looks back now, this area feels both familiar and foreign.","After a short walk, he saw from a distance the monster willow Light Dance, rooted within the college town.","Light Dance was a pet collected by Senior White.","Logically, her share of ’When one person attains Dao, their chickens and dogs ascend to heaven’ should have been given by Senior White.","But compared to Senior White’s ability to rear pets, his talent in pet care was seriously lacking. In Senior White’s heart, the presence of the monster willow Light Dance might be relegated to a ’corner’.","If it weren’t for Light Dance’s ability to fend for herself, White might have accidentally cared for her to death.","Thinking up to this point, Song Shuhang smiled slightly, and this wisp of consciousness floated over to Light Dance.","At this moment, Light Dance seemed to be happily browsing an online shopping mall, adding one item after another to her cart, eager to clear the cart as soon as the delivery companies resumed operations next year.","She was so engrossed in her shopping that she didn’t even notice Song Shuhang’s consciousness approach.","After Song Shuhang approached, he discovered that Light Dance would occasionally open a ’Dormitory Friends Group’.","Inside were Gao Moumou, Yang De, and Tubo... but there was no Song Shuhang.","In the group, Light Dance occasionally answered some of their questions, resolving their doubts about martial practice.","After the ’Evil Spirit Event’ ended, Song Shuhang devoted himself to cultivation, leaving the matters of the current world for Light Dance to resolve.","Light Dance must have disclosed her identity to her roommates, but she still hadn’t given up on her goal of nurturing Song Shuhang’s three roommates into ’homebody cultivators’.","\"Thank you for your hard work, Light Dance,\" Song Shuhang said softly.","The monster willow Light Dance, who was focused on shopping and nurturing her roommates, was startled and trembled: \"A sick man in his death-bed shakily rises, as a hidden wind brings rain through the cold window!\"","Song Shuhang: \"???\"","\"It’s the venerable Tyrannical Song,\" Light Dance said, relieved, and modestly added, \"All of this is what a small monster should do.\"","\"For my three roommates, I hope you will continue to take care of them in the future,\" said Song Shuhang. He took out four ’Dragon Pattern Stickers’ and applied them to the monster willow Light Dance, boosting her to the level of a Nine Dragon Patterns Demon Pill.","He then left a blessing mark on behalf of Senior White for Light Dance.","Finally, he passed on the perfected ’Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique’ cultivation method to Light Dance, for her to guide his roommates onto the path of cultivation in the future.","His three roommates had long passed the prime age for cultivation and were no longer child Daoists; achieving anything on the path of cultivation had been difficult.","— But that was in the past.","Now, Song Shuhang had proven his immortality.","His three roommates, who got along well with him and shared a compatible temperament, now followed the ’My roommate is the Heavenly Dao’ protagonist template.","Age and the state of being a child Daoist were no longer obstacles.","If the Heavenly Dao couldn’t even change these small issues, what would it be called?","---","Song Shuhang secretly bestowed his roommates with the talent for cultivation, tuning their bodies to the \"most suitable age to cultivate,\" and left them with a small blessing.","Furthermore, with the monster willow Light Dance quietly offering guidance, they wouldn’t lack early-stage elixirs...","He had already pushed open the gates of cultivation for his friends.","He had even mostly paved the way for their future in cultivation.","As for their future achievements, that would depend on their own efforts.","After all, Song Shuhang couldn’t play the mother hen, unable to care for everyone every minute of the day.","...","In the Confucian world of the golden lotus.","After celebrating the New Year, Papa Song and Mama Song returned to this Human World Fairyland aboard an immortal boat.","In the Confucian lineage, the couple received the highest standard of treatment.","Currently, the Confucian disciples believe that Tyrannical Song is the \"reincarnation of a Sage,\" and the parents of that Sage are the parents of all Confucians.","Moreover, since Tyrannical Song had proved his Dao and become \"Heavenly Axiom,\" as his parents, they would receive the highest treatment wherever they went.","At this moment, by the lake in the world of the golden lotus.","Mama Song was leaning against a tree by the lakeside, resting with her eyes closed.","She placed one hand on her belly—though she had just recently become pregnant, her abdomen had already begun to swell significantly.","This notable change occurred the moment Song Shuhang proved himself as \"Eternally Unchanging.\"","From that moment when Song Shuhang formally proved his Dao, his parents who were closely related to him and the ’sister’ in his mother’s womb were affected.","This little life, yet to be born, had already received blessings from all the practitioners in the universe.","She was Tyrannical Song’s sister.","Even before birth, she was one of the most revered and beloved beings in all the myriad worlds!","Far away, Papa Song, carrying the immortal fruits gifted by the Confucian lineage, approached with a smile, each step he took was elegant—\"Virtuous Man’s Ten Thousand Mile Walk.\"","As the biological parents of the \"current Heavenly Axiom,\" their physical constitution was no longer limited by age or vitality from the moment Song Shuhang proved his Dao.","The couple had begun to dabble in the pure Foundation Establishment cultivation techniques of Confucianism.","The Confucian Foundation Establishment cultivation method is one of the most suitable methods throughout all the myriad realms, especially the \"Virtuous Man’s Ten Thousand Mile Walk\" quick movement technique, which cultivates with every step taken.","As Papa Song was drawing near, Mama Song suddenly opened her eyes a crack.","\"Awake?\" Papa Song asked with a smile.","\"Mhm,\" Mama Song said softly, patting her belly: \"Just now, it seemed like I saw Shuhang appear by my side, quietly listening to his sister’s heartbeat.\"","\"Maybe Shuhang really did come,\" Papa Song said with a smile: \"According to what the several ’heads’ of Confucianism say, Shuhang has now proved ’Eternity,’ and with all the myriad realms under his gaze, he can be omnipresent.\"","Although he was still not entirely clear about the classifications of realms like ’Heavenly Axiom, Eternity,’ Papa Song had somehow accepted the fact that his eldest son had ’become a god.’","Just a few months prior, watching their son bring home one beautiful fairy after another, hearing about his pregnancy, and learning about his ’cultivation,’ the couple was shocked.","Now, however, he could calmly accept his son’s deification.","The ancestral great heart technique was indispensable!","\"The heads of Confucianism have all said that the child in your belly is invaluable,\" Papa Song said, sitting beside his wife and handing over an immortal fruit.","\"It’s a pity that Shuhang himself hasn’t left us with a child. I’ve heard that after reaching the Eighth Stage Profound Sage, one is almost sterile. Shuhang has now become an even higher ’Heavenly Axiom’... The chances of us having a grandchild are even slimmer,\" Mama Song lamented.","\"No matter, we are still young. After birthing a daughter, we’ll have another son for Shuhang,\" bragged Papa Song: \"Whether I’m a grandpa or an external grandfather, I want the title!\"","\"Furthermore, there might be a turning point, right? Before Shuhang cultivated to the ’Eighth Stage,’ didn’t he bring several fairies home? With so many fairies, we might have the chance to become grandparents in advance,\" added Papa Song.","Not far away, a wisp of Song Shuhang’s consciousness showed an embarrassed smile.","Feeling unable to jump into the conversation where his parents were showering affection on each other, there was a subtle feeling of being excluded.","After watching his parents from a distance for a while, the wisp of Song Shuhang’s will quietly left, heading deep into the Confucian golden lotus world.","In that place, an extremely important ceremony was being conducted.","The resurrection ceremony of \"Daozi,\" the senior of the 8.5 Heavenly Dao.","Daozi’s resurrection this time involved cutting away all ties with \"everything related to the Heavenly Dao\" and resurrecting as the immortal \"Daozi,\" instead of leaving his position like the previous Heavenly Daos.","Song Shuhang’s will descended to ensure the safe and smooth process of Daozi’s resurrection.","With him supporting from the sidelines, it wouldn’t be long before an energetic Daozi would return.","...","Besides this,","wisps of Song Shuhang’s will drifted through several places within the myriad worlds.","In the Earth of the main world, in a hospital in Wenzhou City, Zhao Yaya had become a qualified doctor. Song Shuhang, watching from afar, this cousin who once cared deeply for him, extended his hand to bless her, altering her aptitude, and having his three corpses—Tyrant Kindness—to secretly guide her onto the path of cultivation in the future.","Aside from Zhao Yaya, there were several relatives and friends closely related to Song Shuhang whom his will passed by one by one, presenting them with a ’chance’ for their future. Whether they could grasp the opportunity was up to their own choices. Even if they couldn’t, under the blessings of the Heavenly Dao, they would still lead a peaceful life.","Then there was a small tribe in the Beast Realm, where the will of Song Shuhang looked upon the kind young girl of the beast cultivators from afar. After a moment of thought, he decided to leave her with some ’possibilities,’ seeing if he could guide her to become his last disciple.","In the main world, within a place full of resentment, a bald Western monk with hands clasped, was chanting scriptures, soul-ferrying resentful spirits. As he soul-ferried through kindness, a gentle palm from the vacuum blessed him and left him with a precious elixir—a pill capable of healing his master’s injury and resolving the ’root cause’ of their ailment.","In a building in Jiangnan Town, two professors from Jiangnan College met for a meal. It was Professor Renshui and a seemingly stern Lecturer Smith who, unexpectedly, had become good friends. As Song Shuhang’s will passed by them, he lightly pointed and granted them a little blessing, ensuring they would live the rest of their lives free of disasters and diseases and slightly extending their lifespans.","Song Shuhang’s will wandered through the heavens, passing by one person after another.","Offering blessings, granting opportunities, or meeting face-to-face.","There were also those he merely glanced from afar before leaving—such as Demon Emperor Hezhi.","After a long while,","The wills of Tyrannical Song in the myriad worlds returned one after another.","The human affairs were over.","Song Shuhang opened his eyes, his gaze gentle.","\"Is it over?\" Senior White asked softly.","\"Yes, Senior White, you know already,\" Song Shuhang said somewhat embarrassedly as if caught daydreaming while everyone was working diligently.","\"I’m also the Heavenly Dao,\" Senior White said. The gaze of the Heavenly Dao spanned the myriad worlds, after all.","\"How is the progress on the final topic?\" Song Shuhang scratched his head and asked.","\"The deduction is almost complete. Next, we need to run a few small experiments according to the data obtained and make the final revisions,\" Senior White replied.","They had him, the last shred of consciousness of Daozi that was about to dissipate, and Lady Kunna of the Dragon Network, three ’Immortal Level’ entities leading the endeavor.","Supplemented by big shots like Big White two, Little White two, Dark Song, Father Goudan, the three-eyed young senior, and fat ball as rulers of the Netherworld.","And the aid of tools like Reincarnation Blade Fairy, who could occasionally communicate with the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy.","With the brilliant help of Immortal personages like the children of the Heavenly Emperor, Pavilion Master Chu, The White Dragon, Immortal Fairy White Bones, Great Northern Emperor, and so on.","Plus, a Heavenly Dao Song Shuhang to fill in the gaps!","This ’External Assistance Research Group’ was unprecedentedly powerful and extravagant, unlike any other in history.","With this ultra-luxury research team working together, there was hardly such a thing as an ’unsolvable problem’ left in the myriad worlds.","What Senior White initially gave Song Shuhang a month to research was now seeing significant breakthroughs in just one day!","\"It’s progressing this fast?\" The idling Heavenly Path of Tyrannical Song was somewhat ashamed.","Therefore, he decided, \"I’ll be the subject for the final experiment. I will cooperate with the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s shell to carry out the ’Immortal Replacement’ plan.\"","Song Shuhang volunteered himself. Although he couldn’t become a ’researcher,’ at least he could be an ’experiment subject’ or ’research subject,’ contributing to the final studies!","That way, in the future, he could proudly claim to be one of the members who perfected this ’grand scheme.’","After this plan’s experiment was complete.","The next step... it would be time to graduate from the Heavenly Dao seat!"]},{"number":3147,"title":"Chapter 3147 - 3145: Tyrannical Song and White, we are very enthusiastic about hospitality!","paragraphs":["Tyrannical Song’s time always seemed so urgent.","Moreover, he was always eager to break various records set by the \"myriad practitioners in the universe\" and to create new ones.","Currently, the rather special records he held included: the Xuan Nu Sect’s Saint with the most divine appearances throughout history, the Immortal who had achieved immortality in the shortest time, the existence that had changed the path to immortality the most number of times, the first big shot to possess the ruler of the Netherworld before becoming pseudo-immortal, the first instance of two Heavenly Daos proving their Dao simultaneously... among others.","Most of these records were unprecedented, and it would be very difficult for any successors to follow.","Now, Tyrannical Song and Senior White were probably going to challenge the \"8.5th Heavenly Dao\" Daozi’s record for \"the shortest-serving Heavenly Dao in history.\"","Such a meaningful record was worthy of their serious attention.","\"When can we start the experiment?\" Song Shuhang asked aloud.","Lady Kunna from the Dragon Network replied, \"If you’re willing, we can start now.\"","\"Is there something we need to prepare?\" Song Shuhang asked, glancing at what was placed in the \"Heavenly Principle Dimension,\" the most beautiful work of art in history—the Fourth Heavenly Dao Shell after being washed pure by the sand of transparent crystal.","\"There are a few things we should pay attention to,\" Father Goudan warned. \"For example, your Inner World, which is tightly bound to you. During the experiment, you’ll need to keep it tightly closed and not activate it, to prevent any data interference.\"","\"Received~ I will notify Sixteen, Senior Sister Ye Si, and Fairy @#%# to be careful,\" Song Shuhang nodded and replied.","\"Also, before you prove your Dao, you received the ’Overlord World’ sector lord authority. Just in case, you could choose a successor and temporarily transfer the authority of the ’Overlord World’ to them during the experiment,\" the three-eyed young senior also advised.","Song Shuhang’s \"Overlord World\" was special; it wasn’t one of the ’wild’ myriad of realms, but a new artificial world created by Song Shuhang himself. Hence, even after proving ’eternity,’ the authority of the Overlord World remained tied to him.","To avoid any possible interference, it was best to choose a successor to the Overlord World before the experiment.","\"I understand. Just give me a moment,\" Song Shuhang replied.","...","After a moment.","A thread of Song Shuhang’s will entered the ’Inner World,’ gently brought out his daughter ’little Lingxiao’ and Li Yinzhu, and took them into the ’Overlord World.’","When Song Shuhang’s ’Heavenly Dao will’ descended into the ’Overlord World,’ every inch of the Overlord World began to cheer, as if welcoming the arrival of Song Shuhang’s will.","Members of the ’original Limitless Demon Sect,’ who were developing the Overlord World, were moved and stopped what they were doing to welcome the arrival of Boss Song.","The disciples of the Limitless Demon Sect had mixed feelings at that time.","\"My boss is the Heavenly Dao, yet we’ve been working for him for free, originally just for a ten-year term, but should we consider working for him indefinitely?\"","Who would’ve thought that big shot Tyrannical Song would become the Heavenly Dao so soon!","The idea of working for the Heavenly Dao was something to be proud of.","Moreover, they became ’under the Heavenly Dao’s protection’ members in some way.","Perhaps establishing an ’Overlord Sect’ in the ’Overlord World’ would also be delightful?","After his will arrived, Song Shuhang’s will blew into the ’Overlord World’—suddenly, the spiritual qi surged, transforming into a holy land of cultivators, a human world fairyland.","A few members who were serious about their work received some rewards, entering into a state of ’enlightenment’ granted by Tyrannical Song, breaking through their bottlenecks!","After doing all of this, Song Shuhang’s will gently set his two daughters down.","\"Ah Song~\" little Li Yinzhu rubbed her eyes and sat in Song Shuhang’s arms.","Xiao Lingxiao, whose lower half was still a mechanical egg, lay on top of Song Shuhang’s head.","The young Tyrannical Song, at this moment, enjoyed the happiness of ’family happiness.’","\"Which of you two wants to inherit my ’Overlord World’ and become the second-generation lord of the Overlord World?\" Song Shuhang asked.","After some time, when his disciples returned from their ’trials,’ he planned to establish his own sect on the ’Overlord World’ and lay down his lineage.","In this way, it would be more reliable to leave the authority of the Overlord World in the hands of his daughter or disciples.","Little Lingxiao shook her head; she was the ’original Heavenly Dao successor,’ and her future progression would be very rapid, so the authority of the Overlord World was of little use to her.","Li Yinzhu looked at Song Shuhang and asked, \"Does Ah Song need us to succeed the Overlord World?\"","\"Yes, exactly,\" Song Shuhang replied indulgently.","\"Don’t you want to save it for Ah Song’s sisters or children?\" Li Yinzhu blinked.","\"They aren’t fully formed yet,\" Song Shuhang said. \"Besides, I will make other arrangements.\"","\"Alright, if that’s the case, then I’ll take over the position of ’lord of the Overlord World’ on behalf of Ah Song,\" Li Yinzhu stood up, hands behind her back, putting on an expression of a little adult.","Little Lingxiao clapped her hands vigorously, emitting a metallic clang in support of her sister.","Song Shuhang laughed heartily, stretched out his hand, and lightly brought out his ’Seal of the Sector Lord of the Overlord World.’","Under the control of Song Shuhang’s will, the seal split in two, forming two smaller seals.","One of the smaller seals merged into Li Yinzhu’s body.","After accepting the Seal of the Sector Lord, Li Yinzhu closed her eyes and went into a meditative state.","With the identity of the sector lord’s successor, the support of the power of an entire realm behind her, along with the identity of ’Heavenly Dao’s foster daughter,’ Li Yinzhu’s future was like a thoroughfare of ten lanes, clear and unobstructed.","Song Shuhang set aside a forbidden area in the core of the ’Overlord World,’ then took Li Yinzhu into it and left it under the protection of Three Corpses • Tyrant.","After all this, Song Shuhang’s will looked toward a certain area of the ’Overlord World.’","There was the site of a prison.","It was built in imitation of the ’Lock Immortal Prison’ from the Inner World—since ’outsiders’ would not be allowed in the Inner World in the coming plans, those imprisoned in the Lock Immortal Prison were relocated by Song Shuhang.","Among them was Young Master Hai, who held the title ’Tyrannical Song’s Life Enemy.’","But in the moment that Tyrannical Song proved his Dao, Young Master Hai had already given up on thinking.","...","...","Having determined the successor, Song Shuhang took little Lingxiao back to the ’Heavenly Principle Dimension.’","\"Seniors, the Inner World has been sealed, and the succession of the Overlord World has been determined. Is there anything else that needs to be prepared?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Wait a moment; I’ll also close the channel between your Inner World and the ’Sinful Black Lotus World,’\" Senior White Two said.","Everything was ready.","\"The formation is set up properly. For the next step, Shuhang, you stand in that other formation. I’ll place the Fourth Heavenly Dao Shell in the formation opposite,\" Senior White instructed.","\"When was the formation set up?\" Song Shuhang was startled.","Senior White chuckled, \"While you were away, transferring the Overlord World’s authority to little Li Yinzhu.\"","\"That quickly?\" The experimental body, Heavenly Dao Tyrannical Song, felt that all he had to do was lie down.","Indeed, proving his Dao with Senior White was the right thing to do.","There was hardly any difficult task that required his attention; he simply needed to lie down.","\"[Next step preparation.]\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy said, \"[I’m in charge of recording the experiment’s status and data, and will make fine adjustments to the plan according to the experimental data later. Shuhang, you and little Sixteen start coordinating to resonate and enter the primordial treasure mode.]\"","This task was one she had actively fought to take on—she wanted to watch with her own eyes as the ’Fourth Heavenly Dao Shell’ was experimented on time and again, turning it into an unwitting tool of the Heavenly Dao.","At the same time, it was also her fighting for ’benefits’ for her Su Clan’s fairy maidens.","As long as Sixteen became a ’primordial treasure’ and entered the observer mode to witness the experiments of the Heavenly Dao firsthand, the benefits would be indescribable!","\"Received.\" Song Shuhang responded.","He happily communicated with Sixteen, and a strand of his intent first resonated with Sixteen for the ’Divine Weapon Transformation’, then further resonated to enter ’Reincarnation Blade Mode’, bringing Sixteen into the Heavenly Dao dimension.","——The ability of the Heavenly Dao to appear instantly anywhere in the myriad realms is just terrific.","Having authority really allows one to do as they please.","\"[Shuhang, remember this during the experiment: this time you are just conducting an experiment, not actually transferring ’Heavenly Dao Authority’, so when you get to the last step, don’t truly pass on the ’Heavenly Dao Authority’ to the Fourth Heavenly Dao Shell.]\" Father Goudan reminded him again.","\"Got it, rest assured Father Goudan.\" Song Shuhang replied.","Synchronization and detachment were his and Senior White’s goals—if that wasn’t possible, he was prepared to reserve the first slot of detachment for Senior White.","\"[Everyone get ready, Reincarnation Blade Fairy will do a live broadcast and report the data to the group.]\" Lady Kunna said.","\"[Has Fairy Skylark entered?]\" Senior White Two asked.","\"[I am here.]\" Cloud Gauze Three View Moon replied.","\"[Are you in the black-haired Skylark state?]\" Senior White Two asked again.","\"[Yes, Lord White, rest assured, I won’t have any problems here, I’ll closely observe the progress of the plan.]\" Cloud Gauze Three View Moon replied.","Senior White Two: \"...\"","When I get back, I’m gonna have to take out Dark Song Shuhang—this title of Big White Two is really bothering him.","\"[The first experiment officially begins.]\" Heavenly Emperor’s child tapped in the command.","The Immortal Replacement Experiment was activated.","The experimental subject, Tyrannical Song of the Heavenly Dao, and the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s Immortal Shell enter the formation.","Immortal fat whale golden core was ’spat out’ by Song Shuhang first—Song Shuhang’s undying fat whale golden core has the same function as a ’demon cultivator’s inner core’, which can leave the body in critical moments.","The ’Immortal Replacement Plan’ from Cloud Gauze Three View Moon was based around the ’bone of eternity’, unfolding around it.","Thus, on Song Shuhang’s end, the plan was also started with the ’undying fat whale golden core’ at the center.","The White Heavenly Dao was in charge of overseeing the whole situation.","The laws of the Heavenly Dao, the data of the Cause of Myriad Fruits, enveloped Song Shuhang and the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s Immortal Shell.","Several breaths later...","The Fourth Heavenly Dao’s shell turned into an eternal Great Sun, radiating white brilliance.","On the opposite side, at Song Shuhang’s location, a massive vortex black hole formed, as if to swallow everything.","\"[The first phase of the experiment is progressing smoothly; Tyrannical Song’s black hole frequency data and the Fourth Heavenly Dao Shell’s Great Sun light data are stable.]\" The Reincarnation Blade Fairy was responsible for recording the data and broadcasting the live screen through Sixteen’s body directly to the ’External Assistance Research Group.’","\"[Does anyone see anything that needs to be changed in the first phase?]\" Father Goudan asked.","\"[No problems with the details; we can directly enter the second phase.]\" Fairy Skylark responded.","\"[I agree with Fairy Skylark’s opinion.]\" After repeated checks, Lady Kunna also expressed her opinion.","\"[White Heavenly Dao, how stable is the formation?]\" Father Goudan asked again.","Senior White confirmed, \"[It’s going very well, and... I feel it’s progressing smoothly.]\"","\"[Then proceed to the second stage, and try to transfer a portion of the ’Heavenly Dao Authority’ to the body of the Fourth Heavenly Dao.]\" Senior White Two stated with certainty.","In the experiment, Song Shuhang, following the hints from his seniors, began transferring a small amount of ’Heavenly Dao Authority’—such as the ’Divinity Sage Authority’ and ’Heavenly Tribulation Authority’ operations he was familiar with.","The process of transferring the authorities went exceptionally smoothly—mainly because, at the last moment of the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s self-sacrifice, it was still in the state of ’burning oneself and returning to the Heavenly Dao seat.’","That meant it maintained a connection with the Heavenly Dao Authority interface until its consciousness completely dissipated.","\"[There are no abnormalities in the second phase.]\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy communicated the data.","The entire experimental process brought her pleasure.","\"[The third phase is theoretically about transporting the ’Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’ into a black hole, and through this ritual, swapping its position with Tyrannical Song’s, achieving an ’Immortal Replacement’ effect. We’ll only simulate this process, don’t do it for real. Shuhang, pay attention to this yourself.]\" Senior White Two reminded him again.","\"[Additionally, Shuhang, you mentioned before... you can try to use that technique from the fish belly sword sage to reduce your presence. During the third phase, give it a try and see if it can make the ’Heavenly Dao Replacement Plan’ even more perfect.]\" The three-eyed young senior advised.","\"[O an’ K, I’ll activate Drunk Star Hermit’s technique.]\" Song Shuhang replied.","The third stage simulation began...","As the simulated experiment started, Song Shuhang vaguely felt as if he was about to leave the ’Heavenly Dao seat.’","It wasn’t graduation but more like dropping out, similar to previous Heavenly Daos.","This was not the outcome he desired.","\"[The third stage requires minor adjustments.]\" Senior White, who was continuously observing the changes in the formation, advised, \"[The desired experimental outcome we need is maintaining a ’both Heavenly Daos in office’ mode. We cannot let Shuhang truly leave his position, but rather, continue to retain the state of the Heavenly Dao.]\"","Lady Kunna of the Dragon Network ran through the procedure and answered, \"[For that to happen, there is a prerequisite—that is, before this experiment begins, White Heavenly Dao, you must graduate first. Place the ’Binds’ of both Heavenly Daos on Shuhang. That way, Shuhang can transfer a ’Bind’ to the body of the Fourth Heavenly Dao. Finally, follow the ’graduation’ channel of White Heavenly Dao and graduate again.]\"","\"[Hmm, with that, there shouldn’t be too much of a theoretical issue. We just need to adjust the third phase a bit.]\" Senior White Two nodded.","\"[Well then... let’s conclude the first trial.]\" Heavenly Emperor announced.","Senior White nodded and began to adjust the formation and Shuhang’s state.","Song Shuhang and the body of the Fourth Heavenly Dao gradually disengaged from the experimental state.","A few moments later.","While still gradually withdrawing from the experimental state, Song Shuhang, along with Senior White maintaining the experimental formation, simultaneously turned their heads.","The gazes of the two Heavenly Daos, through the dimension of Heavenly Principle, pierced deep into the myriad practitioners in the universe.","Deep within the myriad practitioners in the universe, a ’figure’ seemed to faintly appear.","This scene evoked in both Senior White and Song Shuhang the memory of the black-haired Skylark’s description of when the Black Dragon World was destroyed, where a mysterious figure had seemingly appeared.","The First Heavenly Dao?","\"Did our experiment just now trigger the prerequisite conditions for the ’Ninth Heavenly Dao’ to drop out?\" Song Shuhang was stunned.","\"It shouldn’t have... you are still in office.\" Senior White responded.","While they talked, the vaguely appearing figure seemed to start fading again.","\"[We can’t let him slip away!]\" The thought simultaneously arose in the hearts of Song Shuhang and Senior White.","Come and now trying to leave?","Wouldn’t that make people think that I, Tyrannical Song, and White, are not hospitable enough?"]},{"number":3148,"title":"Chapter 3148 - 3146: Return of the Will of the Heavens","paragraphs":["\"We can’t let this ’figure’ retreat!\"","This intuition was not only a \"Heavenly Intuition\" but also originated from the \"first response\" of Senior White’s body. This response was then fed back to Song Shuhang’s brain through the direct connection between Senior White and him.","If they allowed this ’vaguely flashing’ figure to retreat, it might affect their own and Senior White’s \"Heavenly Way graduation\" plan!","This was a dual warning of Heavenly Intuition and Senior White’s luck instinct.","Therefore, no matter who this guy was, whether or not he was the ’First Heavenly Dao’, Song Shuhang and Senior White, without any hesitation, took action at the same time.","With just a thought, the space around that figure began to distort—under the gaze of the Heavens, the myriad worlds are exposed, and distance is no limitation for the ’Heavenly Dao.’ With a mere thought, any corner of the myriad worlds could become the target of the ’Heavenly Dao’s’ wrath!","In an instant, within the means of Senior White, the vacuum of that world was silently replaced by a desert, made up of vast expanses of yellow sand.","Beside Song Shuhang, he reached out with a flick of his finger, and pillars infused and strengthened by the Heavenly Dao Authority — the ’Heavenly Dao Pillars’ — thunderously crashed down, nailing around the ’figure’, sealing it within.","The ’Dao’ and ’will’ of the past Heavenly Daos turned into Heavenly Dao Pillars + the methods of Song Shuhang and Senior White could be said to embody the might of all the Heavenly Daos from the 2nd to the 9th editions!","\"What’s happening?\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy, taking advantage of Sixteen, broadcasted every move of Song Shuhang and White Heavenly Dao back to the ’External Assistance Research Group.’","Therefore, this sudden action by Song Shuhang and White Heavenly Dao was also witnessed by all the group members.","The angle of Reincarnation Blade Fairy’s broadcast shifted, sweeping through the depth of the myriad worlds along the trajectory of Song Shuhang’s action.","—The next moment, a figure vaguely locked by the desert world and the Heavenly Dao Pillars appeared in the frame.","When Fairy Skylark saw this footage, she was spiritually shaken and posted a series of exclamation marks in the group: \"!!!\"","Just yesterday, she had mentioned the ’potential appearance of a figure’ to White Heavenly Dao and Shuhang, and today, Song Shuhang and White Heavenly Dao actually encountered this figure!","\"Who is this?\" Daoist Senior, the last grain of Heavenly Dao consciousness, wondered.","Once a Heavenly Dao himself, Daozi sensed a familiar formula from this figure.","Was it the scent of ’eternity’?","\"Strange, if my sight shifts slightly away from him... my brain immediately forgets his existence. Even if I keep staring at him, I always end up inadvertently ignoring him.\" The three-eyed young senior frowned, even though he had already activated his third divine eye.","But that strange ’transparency’ was still affecting him.","If it weren’t for Song Shuhang securing the figure with nine ’Heavenly Dao Pillars,’ they probably wouldn’t be able to set their gaze on him at all, and the eyes would likely subconsciously overlook this existence.","\"Does Fairy Skylark know the ins and outs?\" Big White Two asked aloud.","\"I’m not sure if this ’figure’ and the one that appeared in our Black Dragon World are the same. I only have a suspicion... This figure might be related to the ’First God’ or the ’First Heavenly Dao.’\" The black-haired Fairy Skylark replied: \"However, this is just my guess and should not be taken as fact.\"","\"Even if it’s not the First Heavenly Dao, it’s very likely still related to the First Heavenly Dao,\" the three-eyed young senior spoke up: \"This feeling as if ’he doesn’t really exist’ is clearly related to how the First Heavenly Dao completely erased its existence, leaving behind only scant marks.\"","\"Hey hey, it might also be related to the Second Heavenly Dao,\" Father Goudan chuckled: \"Mirrored Eye Addiction, don’t forget... your Heavenly Dao did things related to the First Heavenly Dao before it resigned. It also erased the majority of its existence, leaving behind only a few marks.\"","After pondering seriously for a moment, the three-eyed young senior replied: \"Indeed... it might also be related to the corresponding Heavenly Dao.\"","He didn’t refute Father Goudan because he was very aware of the unreliability of his own Heavenly Dao.","\"Whether it’s the first or the second Heavenly Dao, what I’m more concerned about is why he appeared, what is his purpose?\" Daozi, the last grain of Heavenly Dao consciousness, asked aloud.","\"Perhaps, it’s to bring an end to this world. Our experiment just now might have already touched on the conditions for the ’Ninth Heavenly Dao’s resignation.’\" Fairy Skylark responded: \"This was an experience of my world.\"","\"The Ninth Heavenly Dao is a turning point. Is it related to this matter?\" Big White Two inquired.","Several past Heavenly Daos or the rulers of the Netherworld who correspond to them had vaguely deduced that the ’Ninth Heavenly Dao is a turning point.’ But precisely how this ’turning point’ turns out remains unknown.","What is certain is that during the Ninth Heavenly Dao’s era, there will definitely be some significant changes that differ from those of past Heavenly Daos.","It could be a blessing, or a disaster.","\"The Fourth Heavenly Dao has spent this entire lifetime meddling around, pointlessly.\" Reincarnation Blade Fairy laughed.","If the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao did nothing and simply waited for the opportunity, biding its time until the Ninth Heavenly Dao stepped down before making its move, wouldn’t that be a favorable situation?","Yet, such an almost certain win was turned into a losing game through its own needless complications.","Isn’t it good to just lay low? Why stir up trouble?","\"If indeed the First Heavenly Dao is provoked and intends to end this world... can Song Shuhang and White Heavenly Dao keep it from happening?\" Lady Kunna slowly said.","\"With two current Heavenly Daos, 2 against 1, they should be confident. The Fourth Heavenly Dao could just be cleansed like this.\" The three-eyed young senior pondered, \"Moreover, there’s the main body of Reincarnation Blade Fairy, the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy, who could also lend a hand.\"","As they spoke, the scene within the mirror began to change.","The trapped ’figure’ suddenly prostrated, and from its body as the center, a pitch-black shadow began to emerge.","The shadow seemed to connect to another world.","In that world, a special existence familiar to Song Shuhang and others began to appear.","—Remains of a Wielder of the Will.","And not just a single one.","From the Second Wielder of the Will up to the Eighth, all the remains started to manifest, floating in and out of the shadows.","Each Heavenly Dao had hundreds, if not thousands, of varying sizes of ’Heavenly Dao remains.’","These remains were supposed to dissolve after a new Wielder of the Will took the position.","But now, it seemed they had not dissipated and were instead collected into another special world.","A vast number of Heavenly Dao remains materialized and merged into the shadow.","The area of the shadow began to expand limitlessly.","Everything within this shadow began to decay and perish.","Even the ’desert world’ created by Senior White was no exception.","\"Unsheathe!\" Song Shuhang commanded firmly.","Eight Heavenly Dao Roots emitted a clear ringing sound, and blades known as ’Heavenly Dao Blades’ unsheathed from the pillars, their blade light bursting forth to cut down all things.","Simultaneously, another pillar representing ’Lady Kunna’s Stardragon Pillar’ slammed down, also unsheathing and joining the eight below to complete a set of nine pillars!","On each ’Heavenly Dao Pillar,’ there was both ’Immortal Data’ and ’Heavenly Dao Marks,’ shielding them even from the power of ultimate death and decay.","The blade light of the Heavenly Dao Blades could cut through anything.","The initially expanding shadow halted under the suppression of the blade light.","\"Who would have thought that the ’Overlord God Pillar’ we deduced together would have such power,\" remarked a member of the External Assistance Research Group.","Indeed, the ’demon god pillars’ secret technique of the Demon Emperor Hezhi holds infinite potential.","When pushed to the limit and combined with sufficiently powerful ’raw materials,’ it can conjure up something as absurd as ’Heavenly Dao Pillars!’","Unfortunately, true ’eternity’ cannot be transmuted into ’Overlord God Pillars.’","Otherwise, if real ’Heavenly Dao Bodies’ could be used to form Overlord God Pillars, that would be the truly invincible pillar.","\"The innate skill in saber techniques that Tyrannical Song possesses,\" Senior Daozi added with his last bit of consciousness, \"is also why he is able to bring the ’Overlord God Pillar’ secret techniques to such a level.\"","\"Thank you, Brother Daozi, for the compliment,\" Dark Song shyly said.","One had to admit, Song Shuhang’s talent in saber techniques was indeed formidable.","Eight Heavenly Dao Blades combined with the Dragon Network Saber emerged, where saber intent and blade light seemed to fuse into one, firmly suppressing the shadow.","From the looks of it, Tyrannical Song and White Heavenly Dao might even have a chance of capturing the figure suspected to be the First Heavenly Dao alive.","\"Fairy of the Reincarnation Blade,\" White Heavenly Dao inquired, \"shall we cooperate with Shuhang to capture this individual and then figure out a way to study them?\"","\"White says, wait a moment,\" Little White Two spoke up.","Even responding was something Senior White needed Little White Two’s help for... Does that mean Senior White was preoccupied at the moment?","But wasn’t the figure, possibly the First Heavenly Dao, being suppressed by Song Shuhang?","Fairy of the Reincarnation Blade gave it some thought and, using Sixteen as an intermediary, activated a second ’camera’ and entered a dual-camera filming mode.","The second camera focused on Senior White’s position.","And then she saw Senior White, facing another direction in the ’myriad practitioners in the universe,’ reaching out his hand!","Following the trace of power left by Senior White, the camera moved along... and Fairy of the Reincarnation Blade saw another ’ethereal’ figure appearing at another location in the myriad practitioners in the universe.","This figure, too, was shrouded in a ’domain-like’ shadow, with remains of an Ancient Heavenly Dao floating in and out of visibility within the shadow.","More than one such figure?","Or could it be that all these figures are ’one’ but can act simultaneously from many locations in the myriad practitioners in the universe?","At that moment, as Senior White’s hand came down, a desert of sand bound the second figure.","But this desert was different from the previous one.","This time, each grain of sand was like a star... This desert was more like a galaxy!","And this galaxy exuded an ’eternity’ flavor.","This was the true form of Senior White’s desert world.","The huge galaxy world completely trapped the second figure.","This second figure appeared more distressed than the first, with an even smaller range of movement.","However, the members of the External Assistance Research Group, who were watching the live stream, all frowned.","If there were two... there very likely could be three!","No one could guarantee that other locations within the myriad practitioners in the universe wouldn’t reveal a third figure.","While contemplating, a splendid light of virtue materialized behind White Heavenly Dao.","A ’Heavenly Dao Body’ set foot.","It was the Sixth Heavenly Dao, Daoist Priest Virtue.","At this moment, Daoist Priest Virtue, his body’s ’karmic flames’ all but extinguished, transformed back into a radiant light of virtue. His features, enveloped in the light of virtue, seemed illusory.","\"Bright, too bright, change the camera!\" Father Goudan exclaimed.","\"Eye drops, eye drops,\" the three-eyed young senior fumbled in his embrace.","Luckily, the appearance of Daoist Priest Virtue’s body was fleeting.","Taking a step from behind White Heavenly Dao, he stepped out of the Heavenly Principle Dimension and headed for a certain location within the myriad practitioners in the universe—clearly, a ’third figure’ was manifesting there.","His Body of Eternity was required for suppression.","\"Fairy of the Reincarnation Blade, can you communicate with your main body? If possible, it would be best to have the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy prepare... I have a bad feeling,\" Senior White Two voiced out.","In this myriad practitioners in the universe, the third figure had already appeared... could the fourth, fifth, or even sixth figures emerge next?","At present, within the External Assistance Research Group, only the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy and Lady Kunna were capable of contributing in this high-level battle.","However, once Lady Kunna left the ’Black Dragon World’ to enter the main world, her combat effectiveness would be greatly reduced; it was unknown how much of a role she could play.","\"I understand; I’ve forwarded the message to my main body. But... unless absolutely necessary, my main body had best not move. Preferably, we should draw the enemy into the sphere of the ’Reincarnation Seal,’\" Fairy of the Reincarnation Blade replied.","Once the Reincarnation Seal moved, the newly established system of reincarnation would be severely affected.","It was best to lead the enemy into the range of the Reincarnation Seal so the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy could suppress them directly.","\"The fourth figure has appeared,\" Dark Song solemnly stated.","His words were, in effect, Song Shuhang speaking.","\"Can we lure it to the edge of the Reincarnation Seal?\" Fairy of the Reincarnation Blade spoke up.","\"Wait... Tyrannical Song is trying to see if he can mobilize the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s husk to suppress it,\" Dark Song responded.","\"At this time, there’s no need to panic,\" suddenly, Heavenly Emperor’s son came online.","Father Goudan: \"Dada Egg, has your session with Cheng Goudan ended?\"","Heavenly Emperor’s son: \"...\"","At this moment, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber hanging on Song Shuhang vibrated slightly.","It affectionately rubbed against Song Shuhang’s face, then broke through the Heavenly Principle Dimension and headed towards a location in the myriad practitioners in the universe.","In that place, Fairy Cheng Lin and Heavenly Emperor’s son stood side by side.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber landed between the two immortals.","Cheng Lin and Heavenly Emperor’s son, for the first time setting aside their prejudices, both reached out and grabbed the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","The Confucian Virtuous Golden Lotus, the Netherworld’s Sinful Black Lotus, and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber all resonated.","Under the combined efforts of the two worlds, the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, Heavenly Emperor’s son, and Cheng Lin, a pathway seemed to open.","Father Goudan: \"!!!\"","Because it realized that it had become the coordinate for this ’pathway.’","And the only possibility for an existence that used the ruler of the Netherworld as a ’Dao Mark’ was emerging.","A gigantic striped dragon, whose body was even more enormous than the stars, appeared from the channel.","With a missing leg, agile dragon mustaches, and a hopping, bouncing way of proceeding.","Another Father Goudan!","The moment the gigantic striped dragon appeared, it shrank in size and used its dragon mustaches to wrap around the ’Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber,’ striking out with a paw at the fourth figure!","Heavenly Dao Return!","Heavenly Dao Father Goudan was truly the first, the returning Heavenly Dao."]},{"number":3149,"title":"Chapter 3149 - 3147: You are Shuhang, You are a Free Squirrel","paragraphs":["The moment the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon returned, Father Goudan became irritable.","At some point in the past, Father Goudan’s temperament was the complete opposite of the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon. Back then, it was cold, indifferent, taciturn, and lacked empathy, a very qualified ruler of the Netherworld.","Until that year, the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon told Father Goudan that it was going to retire from the ’Heavenly Dao seat.’","Father Goudan always thought that once the striped dragon left the Heavenly Dao seat, it, as the ruler of the Netherworld, would disappear, become ’the past,’ and cease to exist completely.","But when it awoke, it found itself still alive, carefully preserved in a mysterious space in the main world—while the striped dragon had vanished without a trace.","At that moment, the previously cold Father Goudan was gone.","Later, gradually, Father Goudan began to take on the appearance of the striped dragon...","Perhaps deep inside, it always felt that the ’Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon’ was already dead.","The legendary ’return of the Heavenly Dao’ seemed to be so far out of reach.","But now.","The scene from its imagination, deemed ’unattainable,’ suddenly appeared in front of it.","The Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon hopped around, appearing before Father Goudan with a cute bouncing posture.","Without giving anyone time to mentally prepare.","For some reason, Father Goudan suddenly couldn’t control its emotions and erupted in fury.","It wanted to burst out at the striped dragon, to vent all its pent-up emotions onto the other party!","Father Goudan manifested its real body, its dragon-clawed feet scraping against the ground, wishing it could immediately open a space gate and appear beside the striped dragon to kick it!","\"Father Goudan, calm down! Control your emotions, don’t panic. Since your Heavenly Dao has already come back, there’s no rush to confront it later! For now, let it complete its mission of suppressing an ’image.’ Afterward, you can do whatever you want to it. Right now, you have to consider the bigger picture!\" the three-eyed young senior approached insincerely and did everything in his power to restrain the irate Father Goudan.","This act of standing on the ’side of righteousness’ and forcefully restraining Father Goudan, while happily watching it continue to be irate, was incredibly satisfying for the three-eyed young senior.","The more furious Father Goudan became, unable to vent, the happier the three-eyed young senior felt.","Sometimes, the happiness of the ruler of the Netherworld was just so simple and childish.","The overly deliberate behavior of the three-eyed young ruler was so much that even Senior White Two nearby found it difficult to watch.","But the three-eyed young ruler’s actions were correct.","Even though his intentions were twisted, his actions were right.","Doing the work of justice with a heart of darkness.","...","In the vacuum, with one foot, the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon stepped on the ’Fourth Shadow,’ while it swung its dragon mustaches, wrapping around the ’Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber,’ and delivered a powerful cut!","With its foot crushing its mighty enemy, it brazenly swung the saber.","The Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon made an imposing entrance unmatched by any!","And its saber strike was just as majestic.","Contained within that single strike were seemingly nine different kinds of intent, as if the striped dragon was experiencing nine different lives.","These intents layered upon each other seamlessly.","And within the final layer of intent, there was a hint of Song Shuhang’s breath, merged with the power of the striped dragon, transforming into an unparalleled slash.","The ’Fourth Shadow’ underfoot was continuously sliced apart, losing any strength to counterattack, struggling to resist, firmly suppressed by the striped dragon beneath its mighty foot!","Having suppressed the main ’Fourth Heavenly Dao Figure,’ the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon looked towards Fairy Cheng Lin and Heavenly Emperor with a vivid demonstration of ’evident joy and cheerfulness.’","Then, it raised its head, and toward the vacuum, opened its mouth, as if it was silently saying something.","\"What is Heavenly Dao Father Goudan saying?\" Daoist Senior uttered, barely sustaining his last bit of consciousness. The world now plunged into a massive crisis, and Daoist Senior, with this shred of consciousness, was not willing to close his eyes. He wanted to witness the world becoming ’safe and sound’ before he could take his last breath!","\"[It is saying that time is limited.]\" Father Goudan’s dragon body was silently suppressed on the ground by the three-eyed young senior, unable to move: \"[It relies on the power of the ’Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber,’ using me as a marking, temporarily returning. Before it can solve the restriction after ’breaking free,’ the time it can stay in the main world is limited, and it needs to continuously pay a price.]\"","This resembles the ’Dark Heaven.’","The Dark Heaven usually stirs trouble in the main world by using a part of its ’Immortal Shell + its own ruler of the Netherworld’ transformed into the Avatar of the Dark Sun.","The true ’Dark Fourth Heavenly Dao’s main body, every time it descends to the main world, is limited by time. After a while, it must return, falling into an endless slumber. To exercise the authority of the Heavenly Dao, it must burn the ’consciousness’ within its immortal shell as a price.","The ’price’ paid by the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon is the saber intent armor on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, which had finally transformed into ’Eighth Revolution,’ now has its seal saber intent armor gradually degrading.","\"[That is to say, the Heavenly Dao Father Goudan hastens Shuhang... or White Heavenly Dao, hoping they quickly come up with a countermeasure.]\" Lady Kunna guessed.","The words of the Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon were certainly meant for Song Shuhang or the white-robed figure.","Reincarnation Blade Fairy frowned, \"[Can Shuhang and Fellow Daoist White come up with a plan?]\"","One after another, materialized ’phantoms,’ each one needing an ’Immortal Level’ existence to suppress.","Shuhang and White Heavenly Dao, who had just proved their Dao immortality, could they come up with a solution?","\"[If we really talk about a plan... there is only one.]\" Senior White Two spoke softly.","\"[What I’m more worried about is that there might be more than four ’phantoms.]\" Daozi, with his last bit of consciousness, said bitterly.","In fact, just as he feared,","In another part of the myriad practitioners in the universe, the fifth ’phantom’ still manifested.","Even as everyone was unwelcome to its arrival, even as everyone rejected its emergence, it still had the audacity, amid communal loathing, to make its entrance.","Then, Dark Song spoke up, \"[Reincarnation Blade Fairy, please relay this to Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy, to get ready for suppression.]\"","\"[My main body is already prepared,]\" replied Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","Dark Song quickly added, \"[Lady Kunna, please lend me your power.]\"","\"[Call me Lady Fat Ball, what do you need me for?]\" Lady Kunna responded.","\"[Please assist me in controlling the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s body—Cultivation Chat Immortal Path 999%, activate!]\" Dark Song stepped out from the Netherworld Realm, taking over Tyrannical Song’s ’Cultivator Chat System’ power, and in one breath, pushed it to its current limit.","The ruler of the Netherworld, in its lifetime, has one chance to enter the main world, one chance to exercise the authority of the Heavenly Dao.","Without hesitation, Dark Song used these two chances all at once.","In the vacuum, the pure body of the Fourth Heavenly Dao descended from the ’Heavenly Principle Dimension,’ materializing in front of Dark Song.","Dark Song slapped the pure body of the ’Fourth Heavenly Dao,’ using the ’Cultivator Chat System’ to activate a newly completed feature—remote desktop control.","The Fourth Heavenly Dao had once sneakily registered an account in ’Cultivator Chat System’—although it quickly deleted its account, the ’root’ of it remained within Song Shuhang’s ’Cultivator Chat System.’","Now, Dark Song reactivated the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s account and connected it with Lady Kunna, allowing her to remotely control the Fourth Heavenly Dao’s pure shell by using the ’remote desktop control’ feature!","This function was developed by Song Shuhang while he was figuring out how to control the ’Fourth Heavenly Dao Shell,’ borrowing the idea from a modern chatting software.","Unexpectedly, it could be put to use at this time.","Lady Kunna, who was equally familiar with the ’Cultivation Chat System,’ quickly got the hang of it and took control of the ’Fourth Heavenly Dao’s’ shell.","\"[Should I suppress this fifth ’phantom?’]\" Lady Kunna replied.","\"No, Lady Fat Ball... first, we join hands to transfer it to where the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy is! You have other targets to deal with.]\" Dark Song started to exert Heavenly Dao authority, forcibly performed a space switch.","\"[Understood.]\" Lady Kunna nodded her head.","The sky full of Heavenly Dao debris picked up, wrapping around the ’fifth phantom,’ working in tandem with Dark Song’s space switching ability.","Heaven and earth change.","The ’fifth phantom’ was transferred by Dark Song and Lady Kunna next to the Reincarnation Seal of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy.","```","The fifth against the fifth.","The Fairy of the Fifth Heavenly Dao had long been prepared, and as soon as the Figure of the 5th appeared, it was pressed down by the Great Seal, the power of reincarnation wildly sweeping down and pulling it into the infinite cycle of reincarnation.","Lady Kunna took timely control of the ’Body of the Fourth Heavenly Dao’, detaching it from the ’Figure of the 5th’.","\"Who is my target?\" Lady Kunna asked.","\"Go!\" Dark Song pushed with his hand, and the Body of the Fourth Heavenly Dao shifted.","There, the Figure of the 6th was subtly bubbling up—unlike the previous five figures, the Figure of the 6th was moving stealthily.","But just as its head emerged, the Body of the Fourth Heavenly Dao remotely controlled by Lady Kunna already descended like a sky-covering blanket.","Each grain of sand fell like a star.","Moreover, the more they attacked, the more stars there would be. Slice one star, and it split into two stars.","The Figure of the 6th was suppressed.","At this point, Song Shuhang had exhausted all his methods.","Yet those ’figures’ seemed as if they hadn’t reached their end.","The 7th figure was also beginning to show signs of taking form...","\"Three-Eyed, can you summon your own Heavenly Dao back?\" Father Goudan asked.","\"How would I know? I don’t get along with it; I’m just a tortured experimental subject. Besides, even if that guy shows up, no one can guarantee which side it will take. It might very well stand against us.\" The three-eyed young senior spoke gravely.","\"Lord White, what about your Heavenly Dao?\" the last consciousness of Daozi asked.","Senior White Two gently shook his head: \"He might not be able to return, and perhaps, might not be able to appear again.\"","Not every Heavenly Dao can come back.","For instance...","Fat Ball.","The Heavenly Dao of the Fat Ball, the Eighth Heavenly Dao, is impossible to reappear.","Within the Heavenly Principle Dimension.","\"Senior White, we can’t keep dragging this out. Heavenly Dao Father Goudan’s return has a time limit... Lady Kunna is remotely controlling the Body of the Fourth Heavenly Dao, which is fine for a short time, but over a longer period, flaws are likely to emerge... The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy is also in charge of the ’Reincarnation System’, she can’t keep suppressing the other side indefinitely,\" Song Shuhang said.","At this moment, he had made up his mind.","Although he really wanted to wait a bit longer to perfect the ’Immortal Replacement’ plan and then transcend with Senior White as two separate individuals to avoid leaving any problems behind, it seemed like time waited for no one.","No matter how fast Tyrannical Song ’advanced,’ time always pressed him to keep moving forward, leaving him no time to stop and rest.","Therefore, Song Shuhang was prepared to let Senior White transcend first and become a graduate of the Heavenly Dao.","Now, it seemed that only by transcending, surpassing the Heavenly Dao, surpassing time, surpassing space, and surpassing the Heavenly Dao Authority, could the current dilemma be resolved.","\"Yes, we indeed cannot keep dragging this out,\" Senior White said softly.","So...","You are free, Shuhang.","Senior White didn’t say this out loud.","He merely whispered it in his heart.","He might have an obsession with ’detaching from the Heavenly Dao and graduating from it,’","But he didn’t have that much determination for what he wanted to do after detaching.","Whether it’s the ’past’ leftover obsessions or the ’distant future’ hopes, they were all entangled with Song Shuhang.","Isn’t it natural for matters belonging to Song Shuhang to be handled by himself?","Moreover, him staying behind is more important than Song Shuhang staying.","At least he can suppress the luck of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","With Senior White’s will and decision.","The time in the Heavenly Principle Dimension seemed to pause.","Two Heavenly Dao wills were activated, manifesting from Song Shuhang and Senior White.","These were not the wisps of Heavenly Dao will that Song Shuhang had previously differentiated into the main world, but a complete, unbroken, immortal will of the Heavenly Dao’s main body.","The two Heavenly Dao wills were activated, projecting from the Heavenly Principle Dimension all the way to the myriad realms, where their phantoms were vaguely observed by cultivators across all worlds!","This signified that the Heavenly Dao was about to do something big.","An event significant enough to shake the myriad realms would have such a projection.","\"Have you finally decided?\" Senior White Two whispered.","This was the best choice to resolve the current predicament.","Within the Myriad Realm Void.","The ’Heavenly Dao’s Will Projection’ belonging to Song Shuhang gradually became more distinct. Vaguely, one could see some principles and rules entwined on his body.","These rules and principles represented not only power but also Bind.","To have power is to have obligations and responsibilities!","\"Senior White?\" Song Shuhang’s Heavenly Dao will was still somewhat bewildered.","Opposite him, the Heavenly Dao will of Senior White gently bent over, reaching for the ’rules and principles’ on Song Shuhang’s body, tugging violently.","The constraints of these rules were pulled to the limit in Senior White’s hands, making a sound on the verge of snapping.","But just then...","Two ’figures’ materialized in the vacuum simultaneously.","The 7th and the 8th figures.","These two figures appeared in the vacuum, launching their attacks across space at that ’projection.’","Their attacks seemed to penetrate the ’projection,’ directly targeting the real bodies of Song Shuhang and Senior White.","\"Be careful!\" the last consciousness of Daoist Senior called out unwillingly.","He wished he could still summon his own ’Heavenly Dao Body’ to block the two attacks.","But he was the 8.5th Dao, different from a true Heavenly Dao; he didn’t have a ’Heavenly Dao Return’ feature!","At that moment...","A pair of bewildered eyeballs appeared in front of the 7th and 8th figures.","Boom boom~","The attacks of the two figures directly blasted the body of the bewildered eyeballs.","\"Ah~ I’m dead~\" the puzzled eyeballs let out a drawn-out cry.","The three-eyed young senior couldn’t help but post a huge question mark in the group chat: \"?\"","\"Is that not your butler?\" Father Goudan asked.","The suddenly appearing puzzled eyeballs were indeed the old butler of the three-eyed young senior, the one that always wanted to switch employers!","```"]},{"number":3150,"title":"Chapter 3150 - 3148: The Final Boost, Detached!","paragraphs":["Butler, butler, why are you here?","The three-eyed young senior pinned down Father Goudan but had an ominous premonition in his heart.","The eyeball butler appeared too abruptly.","The members of the External Assistance Research Group present were either top-tier Immortals or rulers of the Netherworld.","Yet, no one saw how the eyeball butler appeared in front of Song Shuhang and the White Heavenly Dao.","It was as if it had been guarding in front of Song Shuhang and White all along, waiting for the attack to come.","\"Is it okay to be blown up?\" Father Goudan asked.","—However, thanks to the eyeball butler taking the hit, the ceremony for Song Shuhang and the White Heavenly Dao had entered its final stage.","\"It’s fine; it’s just a matter of being blown up,\" the three-eyed young senior said softly.","But there was an indescribable complexity in his tone.","Normally, it wasn’t his first or second time blowing up the eyeball butler. The death history of the eyeball butler in the past year might not be less formidable than Song Shuhang’s.","But this time was somewhat different.","In the scene.","After blowing up the eyeball butler, the 7th and 8th figures continued to step forward, intending to strike against Song Shuhang and White again...","\"Hey~ Where are you looking?\" A magnetic young voice rang in the ears of the 7th and 8th figures.","Behind them, the flesh and blood of the previously blown-up eyeball butler formed an eyeball pattern formation.","In the center of the formation, a black-haired young man with delicate features appeared from the pattern.","Dressed in a blue robe adorned with eyeball patterns, he wore an unflustered smile, stepped out of the formation, reached out with both hands, and deftly hooked his arms around the necks of the 7th and 8th figures, resting on their shoulders.","\"While suppressing you both in one breath is slightly strenuous, fortunately, the transformation of the Ninth Heavenly Dao has already ended,\" the black-haired young man said, using a chokehold to pull the 7th and 8th figures toward himself and dragged them into the ’formation.’","The three-eyed young senior’s eyes widened: \"!!!\"","If there’s a possibility for something to go wrong, no matter how small that possibility is, it will always happen.","The person he least wanted to see had ultimately shown up.","That utterly detestable smile; those brazen, flirtatious actions of wrapping his arm around a stranger’s shoulder—this was his corresponding Heavenly Dao, the main body of the Second Heavenly Dao.","\"Father Goudan, knock me out,\" the three-eyed young senior said gravely.","If he wasn’t knocked out, he feared he wouldn’t be able to resist stepping forward to furiously rebuke his own main body.","\"Leave it to me!\" Father Goudan’s face revealed a delighted smile—what goes around comes around, what should come will eventually arrive.","Knocking out a ruler of the Netherworld was exceptionally difficult.","But knocking out the three-eyed young senior was, even if grueling, a task he would perform without charging a single fee.","...","Meanwhile.","As Senior White, the Wielder of the Will, reached out and tugged, all the ’rules and responsibilities’ bound to Song Shuhang were unravelled.","The ’Heavenly Dao responsibilities and rules’ that were released did not rebind themselves to Song Shuhang but instead coiled around Senior White’s arms.","At this point, Senior White alone was bearing the constraints of two Heavenly Daos.","\"Senior White?\" Song Shuhang asked in confusion. \"Wasn’t it agreed that you would transcend first?\"","Senior White was obsessed with ’graduating from the Heavenly Dao.’","Thus, he had already clearly conveyed that he wanted Senior White to transcend and graduate first.","\"Um...well, there are still many new experiences with the Heavenly Dao Authority that I find interesting. I feel like I could probably play around for another month or so?\" Senior White said with a smile.","Indeed, this was also one of the reasons why Senior White wanted to remain in the ’Heavenly Dao seat,’ but it probably accounted for only about one-tenth of the reason.","\"Don’t worry about me. The constraints of the Heavenly Dao Authority cannot bind me. If I want to detach...it can be done very quickly. So for now, go and resolve every issue. The past, present, and future—once everything is settled, come back,\" Senior White added.","\"But Senior White...I don’t know how to take the final step to detachment,\" Song Shuhang said anxiously.","Among the historical Heavenly Daos, only the Seventh Heavenly Dao White had once been ’near-transcendent.’","Senior White was a unique being, perhaps knowing how to take the final step toward \"detachment.\"","But Song Shuhang was truly a novice in the ways of the Heavenly Dao.","Even though the \"laws of the Heavenly Dao, Bind\" that restricted him had been lifted, he still didn’t know what to do next.","\"Don’t worry, someone will tell you what to do.\" Senior White reached out and gently pushed Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang’s figure detached from the \"Heavenly Principle Dimension\" and was pushed into the main world.","There, a handsome white horse, trotting on its hooves, proudly passed in front of him.","Song Shuhang hurriedly called out, \"Fellow Daoist Ma.\"","The white horse paused slightly, turned its head to look at Song Shuhang, and signaled him to follow.","Song Shuhang’s figure moved, closely following behind the white horse.","Man and horse began running through the vacuum.","Faintly, one could see that with every step the white horse took, it left a mark in the vacuum.","Stepping on these hoofprints, with each step Song Shuhang took, he felt as if his body were about to \"float up,\" as if to completely detach from this world.","Not knowing how long they had run...","As he ran, Song Shuhang gradually entered a state of near-transcendence, much like the \"white-robed figure\" had once experienced.","The white horse was not Wielder of the Will White, but a final gift and guide left by the white-robed figure for \"White.\"","But this final gift was now passed on by Senior White to Song Shuhang.","Bang~","The final step, the black horse landed on all fours on the ground, forcefully leapt in the vacuum, leaving behind four hoofprints.","Song Shuhang closely followed the horse’s tracks, leaping forth with all his might.","But this \"last leap\" seemed to lack some strength.","He always felt something was missing.","\"What’s missing?\" said Song Shuhang in a soft voice.","As he pondered, a ninth figure started showing their divinity below him.","A total of nine figures, each vaguely corresponding to the successive reigns of the Heavenly Dao.","But this time, there was no one left to assist Song Shuhang or suppress this ninth figure.","The Seventh Heavenly Dao, white-robed figure, left only the black horse to lead the way.","As for the Eighth Heavenly Dao, the fat ball, there was no possibility of \"return.\"","Now, the only one who could block this ninth figure was the \"Senior White Two\" born corresponding to Netherworld Realm’s ruler.","In the instant Song Shuhang’s thought flickered, that ninth figure below slowly stretched out a hand, supporting his feet, and forcefully lifted him upward.","This push gave Song Shuhang the last bit of assistance he needed.","Like a fish leaping through a dragon gate, Song Shuhang soared high, catching up with the white horse’s trail.","?","Song Shuhang looked down at the ninth figure with some confusion.","Why would it offer him the final push?","Below him, the ninth figure showed a kind smile toward Song Shuhang.","He looked somewhat familiar.","But at this moment, Song Shuhang had no time to think any further.","His form broke through the last Bind.","Finally, he entered a state of complete \"detachment.\"","And unlike the original \"Wielder of the Will White,\" he was no longer bound by the Heavenly Dao Authority!","The sea is wide for fish to leap across, and the sky is high for birds to soar!","At this moment, Tyrannical Song became the most free squirrel in the world!"]},{"number":3151,"title":"Chapter 3151 - 3149: I’m Here, Slow-Witted Song","paragraphs":["Unlike the grand event of achieving \"pseudo-immortal body,\" the graduation of Song Shuhang from the Will of the Heavens didn’t cause the slightest change in the myriad practitioners in the universe.","Because after his graduation, he had transcended above all these myriad realms and no longer solely belonged to them.","Thus, the myriad practitioners in the universe were quite pragmatic—since you’re no longer one of us, why should we celebrate for you? Why put on a grand show?","Grand shows aren’t free!","—This might also be the final stubbornness of the myriad practitioners in the universe towards Tyrannical Song.","Below.","The newly born ninth figure stood with his hands tucked in his sleeves, much like a veteran cadre.","His features were clearly handsome and charming, yet, like the other ’figures,’ people would forget him and his existence in the blink of an eye.","Those who lacked sufficient strength, even when looking directly at him, couldn’t focus their pupils on him.","And the face of this ninth figure resembled Fellow Daoist Drunk Star of the Nine Provinces Number One Group by a small portion.","These nine figures that appeared one after another indeed all related to the First Heavenly Dao.","But they were not the main body of the First Heavenly Dao.","Just like the final chapter of the Black Dragon World remembered by Cloud Gauze Three View Moon, after the end of the Ninth Heavenly Dao Reincarnation, these figures related to the ’First God’ would appear to end the world.","Yet at the same time, that figure upheld the ’Black Dragon World’ and sent it off, leaving behind hope.","And this ninth figure was the one who sent out ’hope.’","And also, it was somewhat of his personal sentiment.","\"Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, who embodies all hopes of the past, present, and future, soar.\" he said softly, watching the figure of Tyrannical Song move away.","...","Above the myriad practitioners in the universe.","At this moment, Song Shuhang was in a state of ’detachment.’","Senior Ma, the black horse, had led him here and then stopped.","The original Seventh Heavenly Dao, Big White, was also merely in a state of ’near-transcendence,’ and halted here.","Thus, it could only bring Song Shuhang this far.","The rest was up to Song Shuhang to proceed alone.","\"Thank you, Fellow Daoist Ma,\" said Song Shuhang as he stepped forward, gently caressing the mane of Senior Ma.","This was the place where Wielder of the Will White had once been.","Song Shuhang’s gaze had already transcended above the ’Time River’ and even... at this moment, he could directly project his consciousness into the ’future,’ to touch the people and things of the future.","For instance, the future world that Future Child belonged to.","However, Song Shuhang did not act immediately.","He took a deep breath and stepped beyond the position of Senior Ma.","At the original footprint of Heavenly Dao White, he took the final step forward.","After the last step.","Song Shuhang felt himself become ’infinitely large.’","And the myriad practitioners in the universe appeared ’infinitely small’ in his eyes.","Time, space, and rules, none of these could bind Tyrannical Song any longer.","Heavenly Dao is an existence that ’controls the rules,’ the cause of myriad consequences, and able to use all the rules.","And the detached Song Shuhang, none of these rules could bind him any longer.","He could overturn, shatter, and even whimsically set the rules, controlling everything.","\"Indeed, I feel like the opportunity of ’graduation’ should have been given to Senior White. This state would probably be very fun for him, right?\"","\"But, perhaps it’s also a good thing that I graduated first.\"","\"At least with me around, there’s no need to worry about Senior White messing up the world,\" Song Shuhang said softly.","Wait!","At this point, Song Shuhang suddenly thought of something.","He looked around, but he couldn’t find the presence of ’Detached White.’","If one were to say that in the myriad practitioners in the universe, the future \"Senior White\" would also go through transcendence... then at this moment, being no longer limited by time, one should be able to see a similarly unconstrained \"transcendent White,\" right?","Unless... has the future Senior White not transcended?","[Is there really only one spot for graduation from the Will of the Heavens?]","[Has Senior White already figured this out?]","\"There’s really no need for this, Senior White. I truly have no obsession with ’transcendence.’ It should be you who transcends at this time,\" Song Shuhang’s gaze fell on the node of the moment he had transcended in the \"Time River.\"","So fragile.","The myriad practitioners in the universe appeared incredibly fragile in the eyes of Song Shuhang at that moment; if he didn’t control his strength, they likely would shatter with one touch.","He could make rules as he wished, but he also needed to be cautious of the fragile limits the myriad practitioners in the universe could endure.","It was best to resolve all the problems in the most ingenious way without affecting the myriad practitioners in the universe.","\"However, there might still be a chance. Transcendence might require a ritual to truly enter that state...So there is still a possibility.\"","Song Shuhang reached out and gently touched the node in the \"Time River.\"","Since he could do as he pleased, it meant that even after transcending, it was not impossible to return.","It’s just that if one wanted to return for the experience, it would require creating a ’sub-account.’","Lest the myriad practitioners in the universe couldn’t bear it and would collapse.","As Song Shuhang lightly touched it with his hand.","The node of the ’present’ in the main world.","All the ’figures’ stopped moving.","From the moment Tyrannical Song had successfully graduated, the Ninth Heavenly Dao was no longer the end of reincarnation!","The world would continue.","As such, their mission had ended.","All the ’figures’ slowly retreated and disappeared. The ninth figure slightly smiled toward the vacuum, and its figure also dissipated.","\"Is it over?\" Father Goudan was straddling the three-eyed young man, violently hammering his head.","But the ruler’s body of the Netherworld was too strong; even though Father Goudan was hammering with all his strength, the three-eyed young man still did not become unconscious.","\"It seems it is over.\" Daoist Senior’s last wisp of consciousness finally breathed its last.","But before it scattered, a gentle force gently embraced it, preserving it—and leaving it for Daozi, who was undergoing the resurrection process.","In the vacuum.","Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon and Wielder of the Will Three-Eyed Young Man, having lost the ’enemy,’ began to confront each other.","It looked like they were about to fight at any moment.","\"Wielder of the Will Heavenly Dao Father Goudan, Wielder of the Will Senior Three Eyes... I will prepare the opportunity for you, to satisfy your wishes in the future,\"’s voice of Song Shuhang resonated.","Striped Dragon was baffled, \"Heavenly Dao Father Goudan?\"","Is he calling me?","What the heck is Father Goudan?","\"Hello there, Father Goudan, goodbye,\" said the lightly provoking Three-Eyed Young Man as he slowly retreated.","The giant eyeball pattern in the void dissipated.","The previously exploded eyeball butler bafflingly reappeared in the same spot.","Inside the Heavenly Dao Dimension Space.","\"Can we come back after graduation?\" Senior White looked behind him.","\"Yes, the feeling after graduation, I think you will definitely like it, Senior White,\" the figure of Song Shuhang appeared.","At the same time.","Another figure appeared beside Pavilion Master Chu.","This figure resembled the petty ghost spirit Song Shuhang.","\"I’ve come, Slow-Witted Song,\" he bent down, extending his hand toward Pavilion Master Chu, \"This time, I have come to return a real Crystal-clear Water Pavilion to you!\"","So, there’s no need to maintain the illusion of Crystal-clear Water Pavilion anymore.","In the living spring pool.","Slow-Witted Song gently blew a bubble... then rolled her eyes."]},{"number":3152,"title":"Chapter 3152 - 3150: Things the Will of the Heavens cannot accomplish, I will now go and do (Happy New Year)","paragraphs":["\"Shuhang,\" Pavilion Master Chu said as she burst a bubble, \"How long has my dazed hair been rooted on your head?\"","For many days and nights, her dazed hair had been growing atop Song Shuhang’s head, and she could even vaguely sense what Shuhang was thinking whenever the temperature of his head increased.","She had become so familiar with him that even now, when Song Shuhang appeared before her in the guise of ’Song Wood’, she could still recognize his true essence at a glance!","Although when they first met, Song Shuhang didn’t look like ’Song Wood’, she almost mistook him for ’Song Wood’.","And now, even though Song Shuhang had transformed into the appearance of ’Song Wood’, she could still recognize him at a glance.","This was transformation.","\"Ha ha ha,\" Song Shuhang let out a silly laugh.","Then, he sat down by the edge of the living spring and said, \"Actually, it hasn’t been too long, for an Immortal, a few months are just the blink of an eye, right?\"","At this moment, he felt he was still not enough like Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, unable to come up with the right saucy words to ease the current awkwardness.","Pavilion Master Chu continued to blow another bubble.","—These few months, I have experienced things that I couldn’t have experienced in thousands of years!","I’ve watched you go from a cultivation newbie to an Immortal, even proving your eternity, and now to graduating from the Heavenly Dao.","Song Shuhang crossed his legs and sat properly, softly saying, \"Anyway, according to our agreement, I’m here to resolve your obsession, Pavilion Master Chu.\"","\"No, that’s not my obsession,\" Pavilion Master Chu hovered up and stretched her arms, approaching the shore, \"That’s Chu Two’s obsession.\"","At the time of the splitting, all the obsessions belonging to the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion were given to Chu Two; she was just a bodiless, salty fish in the living spring blowing bubbles.","\"...\" Song Shuhang scratched his head, his head hurt—he could feel that the Pavilion Master Chu in front of him was no longer communicating with him as the dazed-haired pendant but as Chu Kangbo of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","Although Tyrannical Song had become the first being in all ages to detach from the Heaven’s Will, the biggest boss in all myriad practitioners in the universe, he still had no experience in facing this kind of situation.","He could awkwardly flirt with Su Clan’s Sixteen, because their relationship had reached a certain level.","Awkward flirting was a way to deepen relationships.","But obviously, this method was not suitable for Pavilion Master Chu.","So... time to be upfront!","\"Fairy Cheng Lin,\" Song Shuhang called out into the vacuum.","But in the vacuum, there was no response.","Fairy Cheng Lin showed no sign of appearing.","It seemed to be her way of expressing her dissatisfaction?","After all, her rebirth plans had been disrupted, and now her mood wasn’t great.","\"Fairy Cheng Goudan?\" Song Shuhang tried another title and called out again.","\"You’ve got it wrong... you are Cheng Goudan,\" the figure of Cheng Lin Fairy appeared.","Behind her was Heavenly Emperor’s Child.","Two arch enemies, yet traveling together, inseparable like shadows.","\"No, I’m Song Goudan,\" Song Shuhang chuckled—his acceptance ability was super strong, he embraced the title Goudan even earlier than Cheng Lin.","At the same time, the virtuous lamia emerged around him, with her long snake tail coiled around Cheng Lin, tyrannically pulling her in front of Song Shuhang!","Cheng Lin struggled fiercely, but how could she now resist the ’Heavenly Dao graduate virtuous transformation’ Fairy @#%×?","\"Stop, @#%× just stop,\" Cheng Lin Fairy screamed ’no’ while being dragged away.","\"Mister Song, congratulations ya,\" Heavenly Emperor’s Child, still in the appearance of Soft Feather, struck a pose with one hand on her hip, showing off her long legs.","Song Shuhang nodded and asked, \"Heavenly Emperor’s Child, what are your plans now? Want to rebuild a Heavenly City for fun?\"","\"Regarding matters of the Heavenly City, they have been entrusted to Gold Trigram. Next, I should probably look for Miss Soft Feather, right?\" the Heavenly Emperor said, looking at Song Shuhang’s shadow.","There, Black-skinned Soft Feather was also hidden.","When Song Shuhang ’proved his Dao to attain pseudo-immortality,’ Black-skinned Soft Feather was transferred to the main world.","But after Song Shuhang became ’detached,’ she was moved into Song Shuhang’s shadow—this was in preparation for a soon-to-be encounter with the ’Future Child’ world.","\"I will nurture Soft Feather into a top expert. In my eyes, she is quite special. Moreover, between her and me, there is still a contract made with the ghost spirit,\" the Heavenly Emperor said with a charming smile.","\"Okay,\" Song Shuhang nodded.","His nod was akin to an acknowledgment of the fact that ’Soft Feather is very special.’","Nearby,","Fairy Cheng Lin had finally managed to free her head from the entanglement of the virtuous lamia and asked, \"What did you want me to do?\"","\"It’s like this... I would like to bring back that part of Song Wood. Is that possible?\" Song Shuhang asked.","\"Can you do that?\" Fairy Cheng Lin countered.","\"Yes, I’m now capable of doing such things,\" Song Shuhang said.","In the living spring, Pavilion Master Chu’s playing slightly stiffened.","\"Then bring Song Wood back... However, it might undergo some changes, and you should prepare yourself mentally,\" Cheng Lin replied.","\"I understand,\" Song Shuhang responded.","He extended his hand and gently touched Fairy Cheng Lin, and with that brief touch, the Song Wood, which had been away from home for countless years, successfully returned home.","The residual ’contract made with the ghost spirit’ between him and the main body was also restored to its original form.","If Song Shuhang were still in the ’Heavenly Dao’ state at this moment, the ghost spirit would have been assimilated by the eternal attribute and become part of the main body in an instant as he retrieved it.","But now, having graduated from the position of Heavenly Dao, Song Shuhang did not have to worry about these restrictions.","After the first ghost spirit was restored to its position, Song Shuhang paused briefly and then extracted a tiny ’soul’—this ’soul’ was painstakingly protected deep within the soul by Song Wood, originating from the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders, the lustrous scholar.","The nature deep within Song Wood was, in fact, no different from Song Shuhang—in deepest parts of their heart, both harbored simple intentions of kindness. Within its capacity, if it wasn’t beyond its abilities, it chose to preserve this tiny ’soul.’","\"Fairy Creation, please go back to the scholarly system for me,\" Song Shuhang gently brushed his hand over the ’soul,’ and a glimmer of light similar to the ’Saber-Nurturing Technique’ flickered in his palm, nourishing the tiny ’soul body.’","By nourishing with his hands, followed by utilizing the ’resurrector formation’ of the scholarly system, the lustrous scholar could be brought back from history.","Fairy Creation emerged from ’Sage Eye Golden Core,’ gently clasping her hands together, and enclosed the tiny soul body: \"Dumby Dumby~ yiya~\"","\"Okay, don’t mention it. I’ll wait for you. After you send lustrous scholar back, come back here,\" Song Shuhang replied.","Fairy Creation, holding the soul body of the lustrous scholar, stepped out of the ’main world’ and headed to the world of the golden lotus of the scholarly system.","Another past karmic tie was resolved.","\"Next, Senior Chu,\" Song Shuhang knelt by the living spring and said to Pavilion Master Chu, \"Let’s go!\"","What the Heavenly Dao can do, we shall achieve... What the Heavenly Dao cannot do, we also shall achieve!","Once, Song Wood was too late.","When she needed him the most, he failed to arrive.","Nothing was changed, all that belonged to the past remained unchanged.","But now.","He would take a step ahead.","To be by her side when she needed him the most.","The past, he was determined to change.","If there are rules that say the past cannot be changed... then let those rules cease to exist."]},{"number":3153,"title":"Chapter 3153 - 3151: That Year, the Choice of the Petty Ghost Spirit","paragraphs":["Not long ago, Song Shuhang had posed a question to Future Child—how difficult is it for a consciousness, or a physical object, to travel through \"the past\"?","At the time, Future Child’s answer was: Under normal circumstances, it is almost impossible to physically travel through time and space!","To influence the past, Song Shuhang’s \"Dreamland\" skill; or Future Child’s use of the Time Principles to interfere with the \"past\" self, were the only feasible means under normal conditions.","However, even though \"Future Child’s\" actions had altered the \"past\" where Song Shuhang was, the future where \"Future Child\" resided remained unchanged.","It was just like the scenes Song Shuhang had seen in the \"river of time.\"","What could be affected was the past of a parallel world.","...","Now, Song Shuhang only needed a thought to freely switch between different points in the river of time.","For Song Shuhang, the river of time was like a game filled with \"save points\" everywhere.","His main body could directly appear in the distant past—such as at the most desperate moment of Pavilion Master Chu, when Crystal-clear Water Pavilion faced destruction, or even further back in the \"past.\"","Brought along with Song Shuhang was also Pavilion Master Chu’s \"consciousness\" and the thoughts of \"Chu Two\" from the Netherworld Gap.","The consciousness of the two different Slow-Witted Songs crossed the limits of time and space to reach the distant \"past.\"","Node switching in the river of time.","This was true \"time travel.\"","...","Song Shuhang did not directly appear at the destruction node of Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","Instead, he appeared in an even more ancient past.","At this point in time, Slow-Witted Song had just inherited the position of \"master\" and became the owner of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","The historical time of the world was approximately several hundred to a thousand years after the Confucian Sage and the fat ball fought over the Heavenly Dao seat.","The Confucian school received a devastating blow at this point in history.","The Heavenly Emperor’s daughter had also been brought into the main world, on the verge of starting her invincible life.","...","At this moment, in Song Shuhang’s sight, there was an unclaimed ghost spirit drifting aimlessly in the world.","Drifting and drifting, it finally wandered over to a grassland outside the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","This area was filled with birdsong and fragrant flowers, ancient trees reaching for the sky, akin to an Immortal Realm.","The defensive formation of Crystal-clear Water Pavilion protected it all.","\"Is this the past? The real past?\" Chu Two asked uneasily.","Reconstructing the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion was her obsession.","Now, seeing the Pavilion of her memories in the distance, she found it difficult to control herself.","\"Be patient, Pavilion Master Chu,\" Song Shuhang gently soothed Chu Two’s mass of \"consciousness,\" calming her down.","Meanwhile, Slow-Witted Song’s gaze slowly shifted from the distant Crystal-clear Water Pavilion and finally settled on the wandering unclaimed ghost spirit.","\"Song Shuhang?\" she frowned, yet unable to confirm.","In her memory, this was where she first encountered \"Song Shuhang.\"","But this drifting unclaimed ghost spirit bore no resemblance to Song Shuhang.","\"Just a moment,\" Song Shuhang said softly.","The unclaimed ghost spirit continued to drift lazily, unwittingly activating the guarding powers of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","A long-haired fairy was startled and swept towards this area.","It was Pavilion Master Chu in her youth.","The unclaimed ghost spirit floated awhile, then suddenly bent down to pick up something.","It was a soul grain so small that it was nearly worn away—it belonged to a member of the thirteen Tribulation Transcenders from the scholarly system, the \"Glazed Scholar,\" whose soul grain was somehow left behind in this area and almost dissipated after the Confucian school suffered a great catastrophe.","The ownerless petty ghost spirit instinctively protected the soul grain it had picked up—this soul grain was the very one that Song Shuhang had nurtured with the \"Saber-Nurturing Technique,\" submitted to Fairy Creation to send back to Confucianism.","Moreover, this was also a karmic cause that started later when Song Wood, lending a helping hand to the lustrous scholar, sealed him within the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion. It was only in Song Shuhang’s era that the lustrous scholar broke the seal to fulfill his wish.","At the same time,","the young Pavilion Master Chu kept getting closer.","Suddenly, atop the head of this unclaimed petty ghost spirit, a surge of \"space\" fluctuations emerged.","It seemed as if something fell from \"space\" and eventually fused with this \"petty ghost spirit\"!","\"Is it Song Wood who has traveled through time?\" Pavilion Master Chu’s eyes slightly darkened, already aware of Song Wood’s real identity, she naturally speculated this when she saw the scene.","\"To be precise, it’s the memories and individual information of the future Song Wood, as well as... a portion of my power,\" Song Shuhang said softly.","What truly crossed ’time’ wasn’t the body of the ghost spirit Song Wood.","But rather, its memories, some of its individual information, and the \"Unbroken Spirit Ghost Contract\" that was transmitted here by Song Shuhang’s dreamland skill.","The chance for the dreamland skill to activate was the \"Future Glazed Scholar\" and this grain of \"glazed scholar soul grain,\" meeting the conditions to activate the dream entry ability.","The fusion progressed extremely fast.","Within two breaths, the ownerless wandering petty ghost spirit, after receiving all this, finally turned into the form of ’Song Wood’ that Pavilion Master Chu recognized.","Song Wood’s crossing could be described as \"Soul Transfer.\"","At this time, ’Song Wood’ hadn’t realized that his body had changed.","The cross-temporal \"Incomplete Spirit Ghost Contract\" within it was still there.","The memories also weren’t problematic.","And the body... what significant difference could there be in a petty ghost spirit’s body? They were all originally fragments of the ghostly body Cheng Lin.","And so, what followed was that scene from Chu’s memories.","The young her, met this spirit that she ’recognized’, yet was meeting for the first time, calling itself \"Tyrannical Saber Song One... minus the Tyrannical Saber.\"","Out of curiosity, Chu eventually chose to take this ’Fellow Daoist Song One’ back to the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","Inheriting the future ’Song Wood’s memory,’ the newbie petty ghost spirit began his life in the ancient era, searching for a dao companion for ’Tyrannical Song’s main body’ and vowing to put an end to Tyrannical Song’s ’child Daoists’ life.","Regrettably, the newbie petty ghost spirit Song One’s wish ultimately went unfulfilled.","...","\"So, how should this be counted? What’s the relationship between Song One and you?\" Pavilion Master Chu’s consciousness focused on Song Shuhang.","Moreover, she clearly saw Song Shuhang separate ’Song Wood’s’ part of the petty ghost spirit’s body from Cheng Goudan and eventually recovered it back into his body.","\"Later... Song Wood, he must have guessed the possibility of his soul traveling. So he assisted the lustrous scholar to break the seal in my era, and come into the world,\" Song Shuhang said, gently pressing a hand to his chest.","\"Then after that, the lustrous scholar took my first ghost spirit to the Netherworld Realm, but an accident happened, and he failed to return my ghost spirit as promised. My first ghost spirit shattered in that accident.\"","\"I guess at that time, fragments of my first ghost spirit must have been secretly absorbed back by Song Wood... or should I say Cheng Lin + Song Wood.\"","From that moment on,","Song Wood and the first ghost spirit truly became one ’individual.’","This was his own last choice, to return triumphantly to Song Shuhang’s body in the form of a ’petty ghost spirit.’","But Song Wood was too strong at the time.","And Song Shuhang, too weak.","He couldn’t return to his main body immediately... otherwise, Song Shuhang simply couldn’t bear it.","Another small accident.","Because at that time Song Wood was in the ’Cheng Lin + Song Wood’ mode, the absorbed ’first ghost spirit fragment’ would definitely be affected.","This is also the reason why Cheng Lin finally told Song Shuhang that ’Song Wood’ might undergo some changes and to be mentally prepared for it.","\"The cause and effect have been understood,\" Song Shuhang slightly smiles, taking the two consciousnesses of Pavilion Master Chu to the next point in time.","It was the time node that pained Song Wood’s heart the most, filled with the most unwillingness—the moment of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’s destruction!"]},{"number":3154,"title":"Chapter 3154 - 3152: Then as you wish, Tyrannical Song descends upon this place!","paragraphs":["```","The second time node.","At this moment,","in the vacuum not far from the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","Members of the Limitless Demon Sect, Daoists, Buddhists, the monster race, and some powerful loose cultivators were engaged in a chaotic battle.","Compared to the formidable cultivators fighting in the vacuum, the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion seemed incredibly weak.","And it was this chaotic struggle that led to the Pavilion’s involvement and eventual obliteration.","As soon as Pavilion Master Chu Two’s consciousness reached this time node, her state could no longer stabilize—this was her greatest obsession, her Inner Demon and nightmare.","Slow-Witted Song also felt a tightness in his chest—the obsession with the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, in theory, had all been transferred to Chu Two. But, humans are not machines; they are emotional beings. Obsession cannot truly be transferred like stored data with a simple ’cut and paste’ to another individual.","\"What do you plan to do?\" Slow-Witted Song looked at Song Shuhang.","To be honest, the ’existence’ of Song Shuhang at this moment was somewhat complex for Slow-Witted Song.","Song Shuhang had returned to his main body.","Then theoretically, shouldn’t all the karmic consequences be shouldered by Song Shuhang, this ’main body’?","So...","In the distant future, would she continue to exist as a ’pendant,’ rooted to the head of Tyrannical Song?","\"What do you all want to do? How about causing a big commotion?\" Song Shuhang pointed at the powerful cultivators of various factions involved in the battle.","\"Those who once involved the ’Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’ in their fight and caused its destruction, whether from the righteous path or the Limitless Demon Sect, to us now... are merely at this level.\"","\"Even standing still, letting them attack, they wouldn’t be able to damage the cornea of my eye.\"","\"So, if you all wish, I could directly appear, thrash all the cultivators in this melee, and give them a ’spur of the moment’ trip, carrying them through space on Senior White’s disposable flying swords for a thousand years.\"","\"The monster hunters who appear later, the main culprits behind the destruction of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, I could also remove them one by one.\"","\"Then... I can ’dig’ out the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion from the flow of history at this ’time’ and safely bring it into the future, into the year 2020.\"","\"Such a feat may sound unbelievable, but it poses no difficulty for me.\"","For Song Shuhang, who had already ’graduated’ to the Will of the Heavens, nothing could restrain him.","He could forcibly extract the ’Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’ on the brink of extinction from the river of time... and it wouldn’t affect the past.","After he extracted the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, the history of the Pavilion being destroyed would still be recorded as usual.","But in the year 2020 in the future, a Crystal-clear Water Pavilion from the past would just appear out of nowhere.","\"Besides this violent approach, I have a gentler method... After returning to the year 2020, with my power, I can collect the ’souls’ of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion members, resurrect them one by one, or have them return through ’rebirth’.\"","\"Whether it’s the violent approach or the gentler one, there is no difference to me now. So, Pavilion Master Chu, you and your group can choose whichever method you prefer,\" Song Shuhang said with a smile.","His abilities now exceeded the imagination and understanding of humans.","In fact, he could twist all, countless ’pasts’. Then, he could allow the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion to have survived since ancient times, obliterating all those who brought calamity to it. And thus, he could shape the future—but in doing so, it would affect the current state of Pavilion Master Chu and Chu Two.","Life experiences and memories are also crucial parts of a person’s makeup.","If the past is changed, memories are altered, then would the Pavilion Master Chu of that time still be the Pavilion Master Chu we see now?","Therefore, Song Shuhang did not mention this third option.","\"Chu Two, you decide,\" Pavilion Master Chu said softly.","Pavilion Master Chu Two looked at the Pavilion Master Chu somewhat surprisedly.","After a moment, she asked, \"If we violently take away the ’Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’ from here, what about the Slow-Witted Song here?\"","\"After we leave, Slow-Witted Song will still be Slow-Witted Song, the only change... is that in the future, an additional Crystal-clear Water Pavilion will appear,\" Song Shuhang explained.","\"Can’t the past Slow-Witted Song be changed a bit?\" Chu Two lifted her head and earnestly asked, \"No painful experiences, Song Shuhang arrives in time, all enemies turn to ash... The Crystal-clear Water Pavilion is well preserved, and everything lives on happily!\"","```","Song Shuhang had not anticipated that Chu Two would actually deduce the third option he had intended to keep hidden.","After a moment of meditation,","Song Shuhang opened his eyes and said, \"I can change the ’past’ and evolve a parallel world, just like ’Future Child’ has influenced our world. There, everything can be as you wish, is that okay?\"","\"Yes!\" Chu Two said expectantly, \"And then... in the future, in the year 2020, can the original members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion be resurrected one by one? I don’t want rebirth, I want them resurrected.\"","\"Of course... no problem!\" Song Shuhang smiled.","It was just a simple gesture.","Having said that, he took the consciousness of the two Slow-Witted Songs with him, his body plummeting like a meteorite from space, directly crashing into the group of powerful cultivators engaged in fierce battle!","...","Below, at the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion during the ancient times.","The Pavilion Master Chu, dressed in a gown, was clenching her fists, standing upright.","Her temperament was much more youthful than that of the later Pavilion Master Chu.","At this moment, she had had her disciples reinforce the defensive barrier of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion to its limits... but the residual waves from the battle in the sky were still shaking the pavilion.","Sparks constantly erupted on the pavilion’s protective barrier.","Every slash of blade light and sword light resonated with the hearts of the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","Slow-Witted Song was extremely nervous, but she could not let her nervousness show.","She calmly issued orders to the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","Only when her face was out of sight from the members of the pavilion did she allow a hint of bewilderment to appear, her eyes looking towards the sky.","\"Will you come?\" Slow-Witted Song murmured softly.","At this time, she desperately wished that figure would descend from the sky and, just like in her fantasies, sweep everything away. It would be best if he could blow up all the combatants in the sky.","But...","Such a thing was impossible.","Song Shuhang’s realm was even lower than hers!","\"Master of the Pavilion, what is that?\" A Daoist holding an umbrella beside her suddenly called out.","Daoist Umbrella pointed a finger towards the sky.","There, an object like a meteor was falling rapidly.","As this meteor descended, its presence felt as though a massive star was arriving!","No one could withstand its edge.","Everything in its path would be crushed!","And the landing point of the meteor—was right where the groups of monsters, demons, Daoists, Buddhists, and loose cultivators were embroiled in chaos!","\"What is that?\" the young Slow-Witted Song’s heart began to race.","She strove to activate her Clairvoyance space spell.","In the next moment, she saw a very familiar figure!","Although the appearance seemed somewhat changed, the aura was unmistakable.","\"Tyrannical Saber Song One!\" the young Slow-Witted Song cried out loud.","Boom~~","Carrying an unmatched momentum, Tyrannical Song descended to the past, arriving at this location!","Chaos ensued.","The various forces engaged in battle in the sky fell like dumplings, tumbling from the heavens!"]},{"number":3155,"title":"Chapter 3155 - 3153: If they faint just by seeing the soles of feet, that would be letting them off too easy!","paragraphs":["Screams! Various panic-stricken screams blossomed and exploded in the vacuum!","Among these screams were the prolonged cries of human instinct;","the sinister screams of the Limitless Demon Sect;","the compassionate cries of the buddhist monks;","and the myriad cries of the monsters, including the noises of rats, horses, donkeys, chickens, sheep, and more.","The only commonality among these screams was their prolonged nature!","Cultivators capable of engaging in aerial battles were all at least from the Fifth Stage, each with an incredibly prolonged breath.","Ordinary people’s screams of ’Ahhhhhh!’ would soon require a breath.","However, these cultivators of the Fifth Stage and above could go from start to ’Ahhhhhh!’ to end without needing to breathe!","The screaming traveled from the distant vacuum and entered the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","\"Is it really you?\" Young Chu Two finally didn’t have to maintain her ’calm pavilion master’ demeanor in this moment, releasing her joy like a normal young girl.","In her most dire time.","Just as she was about to despair.","He had arrived!","In a way that surprised her and with an entrance that surpassed her imaginations, he appeared before her and the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion!","\"Hey? Pavilion master, look, why are these people suddenly falling from the sky?\" Next to her, the Daoist Umbrella, suddenly exclaimed excitedly.","\"It’s him! He has come!\" Young Chu Two replied.","\"Oh, it’s him, eh?\" Daoist Umbrella nodded.","A little while later.","\"Pavilion master, look, why are those guys falling from their homes now?\" Daoist Umbrella joyously pointed towards the vacuum.","\"It’s him! He has come!\" Young Chu Two patiently responded.","Only in this moment, only now.","Even if Daoist Umbrella asked her a thousand times, ten thousand times, she would reply with the same joy!","...","In the sky.","Song Shuhang stood confidently with his arms crossed, his stance commanding as he steadied himself in the heavens.","Below his feet,","were those from the factions of monsters, Daoists, loose cultivators, and buddhist monks who were like dumplings, dropping.","At this moment, no one but Song Shuhang could stand in the sky!","The cultivators from the disorderly fighting factions who were shaken from the sky couldn’t even stabilize their forms!","Moreover, they couldn’t even perform the action of ’lifting their heads’.","They didn’t even know who had blasted them out of the sky!","If it were just physical impact, these cultivators involved in the chaotic battles could stabilize their forms after falling using their Magical Techniques, riding on the flying sword, controlling Qi, or using the Ten Thousand Mile Flying Escape Technique.","However, the impact of being hit by the ’meteorite’ caused their bodies and their minds to simultaneously suffer a severe blow.","Their consciousness, as if facing a dragon as small mosquitoes, began to tremble violently.","As they fell, their minds were filled with the eerie word ’Daddy, daddy, daddy...’!","This term didn’t belong to any ’language system’ of the era, but it wholly occupied their minds.","All they could do was scream.","Aside from screaming, they were incapable of doing anything else.","Perhaps they could do one more thing, that is, to change their screams to that inexplicable syllable ’Daaa—’!","...","And these varied screams, to the consciousness of the two Pavilion Masters Chu beside Song Shuhang, sounded like the most beautiful choral symphony in the world!","The destruction of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion was not directly caused by this group involved in the battle. However, had they not chosen to fight near the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, it would never have been involved in this chaos!","For the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, none of these folks, whether good or evil, were innocent.","\"How I wish I could have heard these melodious tunes back then,\" Pavilion Master Chu said softly.","Chu Two had just wanted to say the same thing, but Slow-Witted Song beat her to it... Thus, when the words reached her lips, she could only forcefully switch to another sentence, \"However, Shuhang’s four screams sound even more pleasant!\"","Song Shuhang’s imposing posture was almost deflated by Chu Two’s words.","Fortunately, no one else could hear what Chu Two had just said.","Not even the current ’Will of the Heavens’!","After Song Shuhang appeared here and inserted himself into this node of the timeline, aside from the audience he wanted to show off to, no one could perceive his existence.","Boom boom boom boom~","After the long-lasting strange screams continued for a while, thumping sounds came from the ground below.","The various factions’ dumplings, shaken down from the sky, finally made contact with the ground.","Their strong constitutions forcefully created huge craters upon impact with the earth.","Some who were already injured or who had weaker constitutions were less fortunate and suffered even more upon hitting the ground, their consciousness beginning to blur.","However, most of the dumplings still maintained clarity of mind.","That height wasn’t enough to kill Fifth Stage, Sixth Stage, or even Seventh Stage cultivators.","As the dumplings fell to the ground, they immediately turned and looked up to the sky, towards Song Shuhang’s position.","Then, they finally saw what they wished for... Song Shuhang’s soles!","\"Who is it, why did they suddenly attack us?\"","Was it reinforcements from a faction?","No, if it were reinforcements from some faction, they would have come to aid a particular side.","What did it mean to sweep everyone in this high altitude into oblivion without discrimination?","\"Could it be that our melee accidentally crossed the seclusion place of an expert, disturbing him?\"","Some dumplings considered this possibility.","Such incidents did occasionally happen in this era.","After all... some experts were quite eccentric, randomly digging a pit in the wilderness to go into seclusion.","\"Should we explain ourselves to this expert?\" the leaders of the battling factions thought to themselves.","In the vacuum.","Song Shuhang was concealing all his ’aura, data’, and so forth, to prevent these folks below from going blind with just one glance at him, which would then plunge them directly into a deep slumber.","That would be letting these fellows off too easily.","This was also why those below could look at Song Shuhang’s soles without going blind.","\"Sage’s eye.\" Song Shuhang thought, moving the ’Sage Eye Golden Core’ into his eyes.","The next moment, Tyrannical Song’s eyes opened.","Gentle radiance poured down from the sky.","This radiance contained the power of ’love’.","It had the effect of healing hearts!","Even making one irresistibly want to be touched by this light!","What was this? Could it be some kind of ’healing spell’ cast by this great personage?","Before the battling forces below could react, they were bathed in this gentle light.","After a few moments.","Another wave of screaming in various styles erupted from the earth.","If the previous screams of dumplings were Earth Song.","Then the current various screams were Earth’s Song.","Motherly love’s power, and moreover a reinforced undying version by Tyrannical Song.","All the cultivators below twisted in pain, tears streaming down like rain..."]},{"number":3156,"title":"Chapter 3156 - 3154: These Are My Lines","paragraphs":["In the midst of such intense pain, a grand and authoritative voice echoed in their minds.","What is filial piety?","What is love?","Do you understand the greatness of maternal love?","As this voice continued to resound, the intense pain in their abdomen also escalated step by step!","\"No, no more! Please, I beg you, no more!\"","The dumplings involuntarily tried to resist that grand voice.","But even the tremendous pain could not resist the authoritative voice in their minds, could not distract their attention.","While enduring great pain, they also had to endure the teachings and explanations of the \"Discourse on Filial Piety: Gaze of Maternal Love\" in their heads.","Every sentence of the \"Discourse on Filial Piety: Gaze of Maternal Love\" would touch their pain nerves.","The pain was dancing!","Therefore, the screams became even more tragic.","Following the cruel \"Sky Song\" and its teachings on daddy’s love, came the \"Earth’s Song\" with the profound segment on maternal love.","From the sky to the earth, from daddy’s love to maternal love.","Song Shuhang had imparted everything he could teach to this group of chaotic cultivators!","...","The levels of these dumpling cultivators were still too low.","Otherwise, from the moment that gentle radiance appeared, they should have recognized it as the course on maternal love taught by a Confucian Sage thousands of years ago!","After thousands of years had passed, it also made the cultivators of insufficient grade forget that once invincible Sage — mainly because they had not yet touched that level.","High in the sky,","Song Shuhang quietly described the effects of his \"Enhanced Motherly Gaze\" to the two Pavilion Masters Chu.","\"The original Confucian Sage’s Gaze of Maternal Love will make the recipient experience the pain of ten-month pregnancy in ten seconds and endure the pain of childbirth for about an hour afterward.\"","\"And after being strengthened by my eternal attribute, this pain of pregnancy and childbirth can be adjusted by my intent for duration. Whether it’s one year, ten years, or a hundred years, it’s no problem,\" Song Shuhang said.","The only regret was that the \"Discourse on Filial Piety: Gaze of Maternal Love\" was limited in length, so if the pain of pregnancy and childbirth were to be extended, then that grand voice could only enter ’single loop’ mode.","Continuously repeating the \"Discourse on Filial Piety: Gaze of Maternal Love\" over and over, until the effects of the secret technique ended.","But on second thought, ten or eight hundred years in single loop mode seems quite good too?","\"I’ll leave the choice to you... How many years of pain these chaotic cultivators have to endure will be up to you to decide,\" Song Shuhang conveyed to the two Pavilion Masters Chu with his intent.","\"Ten years, a hundred years is no problem?\" Pavilion Master Chu asked.","Song Shuhang nodded, \"It can be even longer, a thousand years, ten thousand years are also possible... if their lifespans are long enough.\"","\"Then, can they truly give birth to a bloody new life? After ten years, a hundred years of pain, to carve out a new life from even greater pain?\" Chu Two suggested.","Sure enough, it was Chu Two who bore the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’s Obsession with Destruction.","\"Sorry, although it’s possible, I can’t accept it psychologically,\" Song Shuhang firmly refused.","That would not just be punishing and instructing the group of chaotic cultivators; it would also be torturing his own heart, Tyrannical Song.","\"What a pity,\" said Chu Two, \"Then... let’s go with a hundred years?\"","A hundred years was a lifetime for ordinary people, but not too long for Medicine Masters!","After the destruction of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, how many years was she tormented by pain?","Making these guys suffer for a hundred years was not too much.","\"Alright,\" Pavilion Master Chu agreed.","\"Don’t we need to prolong it a bit?\" Song Shuhang inquired.","\"After all, they were not the ones who destroyed the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, so a hundred years is enough. Guilt has its rightful owner,\" added Chu Two, \"But I request an installment plan.\"","Song Shuhang looked puzzled: \"?\"","\"Take a break every ten years, then suffer another ten years. Cycle like this, paying in ten installments. It would be best if the duration of each break could be randomly chosen between one to five years, is that possible?\" Chu Two proposed.","There’s a saying that a short pain is better than a long one.","```","A hundred years of pain, if endured in one breath, might have been bearable with gritted teeth.","But to give them one year of rest after every ten years... to then come back with another bout, it would be much more vigorous. More importantly, after ten cycles were over, the subjected ones wouldn’t know if the cycle had truly ended.","They would instinctively wait for the eleventh cycle.","With every day the eleventh cycle didn’t come, their hearts would grow more uneasy.","And since their rest years were random, they did not know when the eleventh wave would hit. They could only wait in fear...","\"Is that possible?\" Pavilion Master Chu also looked at Song Shuhang.","\"Naturally, it’s possible, as you wish,\" Song Shuhang smiled.","His eyes where the ’Sages Eye Golden Core’ was slowly rotating, began to automatically write the program for the ’Gaze of Maternal Love’.","According to Chu Two’s request, the hundred years of pregnancy time was divided into ten periods, with 1-5 years of random rest time inserted in between each.","The whole coding process was independently completed by the eternal Sage Eye Golden Core.","Song Shuhang only had to give one instruction, wait for the program to be written, and then with one glance over those who were subjected, it’d be done.","After the settings were completed, the gesture of Song Shuhang, who was holding his hands crossed, changed, and he stretched out a palm towards the pit below, where the wailing sufferers lay, and gently caressed.","Swoosh swoosh swoosh~","All those different forces’ sufferers sprang from the ground, wrapped in Song Shuhang’s mental power, embarking on a random journey.","Their bodies were flung to various places around the world.","Completely random, where they’d land was entirely up to luck!","...","After he had done all this.","Song Shuhang slowly turned, his profound gaze turned westward.","There, a young monster hunter with many Demon Eyes grafted onto his arms led three thousand monster hunters in setting traps of Sky and Earth.","These monster hunter’s eyes were blood-red, their bodies exuded a bloodthirsty aura.","They were the true culprits in the destruction of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","Song Shuhang looked at the two conscious forms of Pavilion Master Chu by his side.","At this moment, both of Chu’s conscious forms simultaneously closed their eyes.","These three thousand monster hunters, they were their true nightmare.","Every time they woke up from the nightmare of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’s destruction, they would remember these faces.","Initially, when explaining the ’history of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion’ to Song Shuhang, Pavilion Master Chu deliberately ’skipped’ this part... because for her, it was too cruel.","\"I understand... I’ll handle it directly,\" Song Shuhang said considerately.","Cruel methods and various vindictive forms of revenge were not suitable at this time.","Too time-consuming!","For the two Chu consciousnesses, for these three thousand people, the faster they died both in body and mind, the better!","Song Shuhang turned and faced westward, stretched out his hand, and slowly clenched it!","Pa pa pa pa~","Beginning with the young cultivator whose arm was covered in Demon Eyes, the bodies of the three thousand monster hunters burst into a bloody mist, their souls unable to escape and instantly shattered.","But the blood mist didn’t even reach the ground before it was erased midair, completely obliterated from the source!","From this moment on, no one could remember their existence.","Not even the Will of the Heavens!","The expressions between the brows of the two Pavilion Masters relaxed.","The obsession in their hearts was wiped away at this moment - the remaining slight obsession would be completely resolved after returning to the year 2020, when the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion resurrected one by one.","\"Thank you,\" said Pavilion Master Chu softly.","\"You’re welcome,\" replied Chu Two in place of Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang: \"...\"","That was my line.","```"]},{"number":3157,"title":"Chapter 3157 - 3155: Who is the Will of the Heavens when the Future Child exists?","paragraphs":["\"Occasionally, let me say a line too,\" Song Shuhang sighed. \"I am now an existence that has detached from the Heaven’s Will!\"","\"Why?\" Chu Two retorted.","Song Shuhang thought for a moment, then replied seriously, \"Because I can reverse time... and then go back to snatch back my lines.\"","\"Childish,\" Pavilion Master Chu couldn’t help laughing and crying. If it were the year 2020 in the main world, her dazed hair would have already whipped Song Shuhang on the head.","However.","\"Seeing this scene feels just like a dream,\" sighed Pavilion Master Chu.","A long time ago, she might have dreamed of a similar scene... but after waking from the dreams of the past, only sadness remained.","Now, it’s completely different.","\"Don’t mention it.\" This time, Song Shuhang took the opportunity to supplement his previous line.","Chu Two: \"...\"","\"This world’s Crystal-clear Water Pavilion will continue to exist safely, and the young Chu very much like you all wish, will live well along with the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion!\" Song Shuhang put away his ’Sage Eye Golden Core.’","He turned around to face the location of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion and locked onto the figure of the young Pavilion Master Chu in the crowd.","The young Chu, with an appearance between Chu Two and Pavilion Master Chu, was joyfully waving at Song Shuhang with all her strength.","Song Shuhang responded with a warm, mature, and reliable smile.","At the same time, he whispered to the two Pavilion Master Chus, \"Want to go down and see her? And maybe take a look at the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion at this time?\"","\"Can I?\" Pavilion Master Chu was obviously moved; the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion below were all living beings, not changed from ’illusory reality.’","Crossing countless years to be here, if possible, she wanted to meet these companions she’d longed for day and night, to see them up close.","\"No problem at all... with me here, nothing is an issue,\" replied Song Shuhang.","After speaking, he began to adjust the condition of his body, concealing his aura to the extent that even a normal cultivator wouldn’t be affected by spiritual pressure upon close contact.","Once the adjustments were complete, Song Shuhang stepped towards the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","The black lotus, which hadn’t made an appearance in a long time, took this opportunity to bloom beneath his feet with each step - Lotus Blossoming Walk.","—Ever since Song Shuhang had mastered the power of space, his method of travel had primarily been to lift his foot and step into the vacuum, kicking open a spatial passage for direct teleportation.","Walking in the air was something he hadn’t done in several months.","Once accustomed to traveling with spatial ability, one tends to become lazy, not even wanting to walk a few steps.","The black lotus might not seem as righteous as golden lotuses, but the Lotus Blossoming Walk still adds more than +10 to Song Shuhang’s image.","...","...","The Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’s defensive barrier did not stop Song Shuhang’s figure.","He passed directly through the barrier without causing it any harm.","After a few steps, he had already reached the young Chu.","\"Tyrannical Saber Song One!\" The young Chu picked up her skirt; her legs were slender, and after a few strides, she flung herself toward Song Shuhang.","He had come in her most desperate moment.","And he returned in a manner far beyond her imagination, solving all their problems!","At this moment, Chu had so, so many things she wanted to talk to Song One about.","She infused all her emotions, intense feelings, into this embrace.","One could say it was a rich body language.","On the other side.","Song Shuhang, with a smile on his face, reached out his arms.","Then—out of habit, just like catching Li Yinzhu, he deftly caught the young Chu, and unexpectedly gave her a lift in the air!","The moment Song Shuhang lifted Chu in the air, the entire Crystal-clear Water Pavilion fell silent.","The young Chu with a full face of question marks: \"???\"","Chu Two: \"...\"","Pavilion Master Chu: \"...\"","Song Shuhang himself also realized: \"...\"","But at this point, he had no choice but to go through with it.","He stiffened his scalp, went through two more lifts in the air to complete a triple lift sequence.","Then he tried to put the young girl Chu down in the most natural way and expression possible.","Relax!","Don’t panic!","Stay natural!","That’s how to avoid awkwardness.","After adjusting his emotions, Song Shuhang said in the most gentle voice, \"Don’t be afraid, it’s all over, it’s alright now, I’m here!\"","\"Mhm,\" nodded the young Chu.","She finally felt that something was off about the Song One before her.","Also...","She seemed to smell a scent that belonged to her on Song One.","Sniff sniff~","Indeed, her scent!","And it seemed to be coming from right beside Song One?","She looked around Song Shuhang with a puzzled expression.","But there was nothing.","Was it an illusion?","[Is it a ’familiar feeling’ between ’existences’? Even though it’s impossible for her to see the two Pavilion Masters Chu, can she still vaguely sense each other’s presence?] Song Shuhang had a thought.","\"Song One.\" The young Chu asked somewhat excitedly, \"What realm are you at now? When did you become so powerful?\"","\"As for realm, invincible under the heavens?\" Song Shuhang said with a bit of guilt.","—Theoretically, having graduated from the Heaven’s Will, he could indeed be called ’invincible under the heavens.’","But he was very clear about his own standing. Right now, he didn’t even count as a \"reliable senior,\" and he always felt a bit lacking on the inside.","Young Chu Kangkang: \"...\"","\"By the way, could you give me two strands of your hair?\" Song Shuhang asked.","Without much thought, young Chu Kangkang plucked two strands from her long hair and handed them over to Song Shuhang.","After receiving the hair, Song Shuhang lightly tapped his forefinger to the left and right of his body, transferring the consciousness of the two Pavilion Master Chus into the strands of hair, becoming Chu Dazed Hair one and Chu Dazed Hair two.","The two strands of Chu Dazed Hair, instilled with souls, became vividly alive.","Among them, Chu Dazed Hair one had abundant experience and adeptly rooted itself on top of Song Shuhang’s head, dancing with the wind, graceful and enchanting.","It could even actively adjust its length, becoming a moderately long piece of dazed hair sticking straight up from Shuhang’s head.","\"Is this... me?\" young Chu Kangkang asked subconsciously.","\"Correct, this is the Immortal’s Hair—Chu Dazed Hair! I once used it to pierce through the defenses of an immortal-level enemy,\" Song Shuhang proudly introduced to the young Chu Kangkang.","The young Chu Kangkang was completely bewildered.","\"But don’t be envious because the future you will be just as powerful... after all, they are the future you,\" Song Shuhang took the opportunity to reveal some information about himself to Chu Kangkang.","\"The future?\" Chu Kangkang pondered briefly, quickly connecting all the clues: \"The future, huh? Tyrannical Saber Song One, are you the same?\"","\"Yes,\" Song Shuhang said softly. \"I have come from the future, just so I could be by your side at this very moment.\"","While speaking, he casually gave young Chu Kangkang a pat on the head with spirit stones in sets of three.","——Actually, ever since Pavilion Master Chu’s head reached his main world’s living spring, he had wanted to do this.","But there had been no chance.","Now, he could finally satisfy that desire with the young Chu Kangkang.","The young Chu Kangkang wasn’t as mature as her future self.","Upon hearing Song Shuhang’s words, she was already deeply moved. Had it not been for the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion watching, she would have thrown herself into Tyrannical Saber Song One’s arms, crying with emotion.","Pah~ Pavilion Master Chu’s Dumb Hair fiercely flicked on the decaying husk on Song Shuhang’s head, but could do nothing to Shuhang’s head as it was now.","Song Shuhang reluctantly let go of Chu Kangkang’s head and said to Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair, \"There’s a little time left, go see the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion as it is now. I’ll wait for you here.\"","The two strands of Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair nodded slightly and utilized the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’s get-around method, shuttling through the familiar yet strange pavilion.","\"Will you be leaving soon?\" young Chu Kangkang asked.","\"We come from the future and in the ’past,’ we’re just passersby,\" Song Shuhang replied. \"So, I’ll wait for you in the future... until we meet again!\"","\"See you in the future,\" young Chu Kangkang said confidently. \"When we meet again, I will surely be an immortal!\"","\"I believe in you,\" Song Shuhang laughed heartily.","With Pavilion Master Chu’s talents, even if she didn’t walk the path of the ’Life and Death Dao,’ she could still find her own way to immortality. This much, Song Shuhang was certain of.","...","After Pavilion Master Chu and Chu Two had taken a tour of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion and returned, Song Shuhang took their consciousness and bid farewell to the pavilion’s members, his figure soaring high into the sky.","On the way up, Song Shuhang’s gaze swept over a literary girl of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","At this time, Senior Sister Ye Si looked much younger than she would be later.","It made sense.","Senior Sister Ye Si was actually reborn from Fairy Cheng Lin using her power of reincarnation.","The version Song Shuhang had later met was her having grown up.","\"We’re leaving,\" Song Shuhang said after copying all the members’ auras and soul marks of the ’Crystal-clear Water Pavilion,’ taking the two consciousnesses of Pavilion Master Chu, and crossing through time, returning to the year 2020.","The two ’Chu Dazed Hairs,’ throughout the process of crossing time and space, drifted from the vacuum.","The myriad practitioners in the universe • Overlord World, year 2020.","Song Shuhang landed here, bringing along the two Pavilion Master Chus.","The shell refined by Chu Two—the giant turtle of disaster—and the ’Illusion Crystal-clear Water Pavilion Ruins’ on it, were also moved here.","\"Song~ Stupid~\" Fairy Creation returned as well, having sent the scholar’s soul grain that had been spinning from ancient times back to the Confucianism.","Thus, the thirteen Tribulation Transcendents returned in full!","However... the thirteen Tribulation Transcendents returned in full circle, yet their most beloved little sister had run off again.","They couldn’t keep her if they tried.","The thirteen dazed scholars of Confucianism were in despair.","\"Fairy Creation, thank you for your hard work,\" Song Shuhang welcomed Fairy Creation back into the Sage Eye Golden Core.","Then.","\"Is this the Overlord World?\" Chu Two examined this world.","\"Yes, I plan to use resurrection methods to bring back the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion. Then, I can carve out a section of the Overlord World to rebuild the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion for you, how about that?\" Song Shuhang proposed.","The Overlord World still lacked powerful beings to oversee it.","Naturally, Song Shuhang didn’t want to let go of a two-bodied Pavilion Master Chu.","\"I have no objections,\" Pavilion Master Chu said.","The Crystal-clear Water Pavilion was not a place or a building; it was a group of people.","As long as the people were there, it was the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion anywhere!","\"Then, resurrect, members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion!\" Song Shuhang commanded handsomely.","As he waved, he quickly sent a message to Wielder of the Will White, \"Senior White, please remotely support me with a resurrection formation framework!\"","Senior White: [How big do you need it?]","\"It should be large enough to resurrect all the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion in one go,\" Song Shuhang replied.","The Heavens will is my support, you scared?","[Understood, it’s done.] Senior White replied.","A dazzling resurrection formation descended from the sky, landing beside Tyrannical Song.","However, just one look at the process and people would know—it wasn’t Tyrannical Song who put together this formation, it was a gift from the heaven!","[Is the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion matter settled?] Senior White asked. Experience new stories on empire","\"Yes, perfectly settled. The past obsession is over; now it’s time for the future’s hope,\" Song Shuhang replied, while inputting the ’Crystal-clear Water Pavilion members’ marks he had recorded into the formation.","Then he infused his own ’detached rules’ power, carrying out the most extensive resurrection in history, stretching from the ancient past.","A series of figures emerged from the resurrection formation.","[For the future... let’s go together.] Senior White suddenly said: [Now I am the Ninth Heavenly Dao with you, but who will be the Heavenly Dao in the era where ’Future Child’ exists? I’m very curious.]"]},{"number":3158,"title":"Chapter 3158 - 3156: This is the reason why I owe Senior White money and haven’t paid it back!","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang was moved when he heard these words.","Right, who would be the Ninth Heavenly Dao in the world where Future Child resides?","Normally, the Heavenly Dao is like a fixed coordinate node in the myriad rivers of time—from the ’past’ we see now, no matter which river of time one is in, the Heavenly Daos of all generations have never changed.","The Heavenly Dao is like the grand trend of time; many details in various worlds will change, and the accumulation of countless details will create significant differences, yet the Heavenly Dao stands firm as the pillar within the stream, never changing!","But the world in which Future Child resides is somewhat abnormal.","Currently, the Heavenly Dao at the 2020 time node is both Senior White and himself.","He has become detached... so the Ninth Heavenly Dao should be Senior White, rightly so.","However, in the world where Future Child resides, Senior White has already left, so the Heavenly Dao in the Future Child’s world definitely isn’t Senior White!","[It must be the reliable great Tyrannical Song, who didn’t owe enough money!] Song Shuhang silently concluded in his heart.","The last time he encountered the great Tyrannical Song of Future Child’s world in the ’sea urchin time river,’ he learned that this reliable great Tyrannical Song had managed to repay most of the spirit stones he owed to Senior White by himself!","At that time, Song Shuhang could hardly imagine it!","Was that even something a human could do?","Song Shuhang couldn’t imagine himself, before ascending to the Heavenly Dao, slowly saving money all by himself and then alone repaying the spirit stones owed to Senior White!","Do you think you just owe Senior White spirit stones?","No, that’s not spirit stones, that’s karmic ties!","It’s the profound karmic connection between you and Senior White!","The larger that karmic connection is, the less likely Senior White will leave!","And besides, as both are Tyrannical Song, why are you not only reliable but also able to save money?","Why are you so smooth at learning the ancient language?","Great Tyrannical Song was simply the ’complete form’ that Song Shuhang fantasized about—excellent, reliable, wealthy, and trusted by his companions.","But Song Shuhang didn’t envy the great Tyrannical Song—because he relied on all the seniors, and with all his pendants, he was equally delightful!","For instance, right now, even though he has become detached, creating his own ’resurrection formation’ actually wouldn’t be difficult, and learning would only take a minute.","Still, he could depend on Senior White, the Wielder of the Will.","That’s why he owed Senior White so much money yet didn’t try to repay it.","[Alright, Senior White. Then, when the time comes, let’s go together to the world where Future Child resides... I want to see for myself who’s playing tricks on the event of the Ninth Heavenly Dao.] Song Shuhang replied.","After making the arrangement with Senior White, he clapped his hands together lightly.","Snap~","The glow of the huge resurrection formation scattered.","One by one, familiar members of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion emerged from the resurrection formation.","Above Song Shuhang’s head, the original Slow-Witted Song’s dazed hair curled like a spring, indicating her inner emotional excitement.","Pavilion Master Chu, in a black dress, already had wet eyes, and precious tears of the ’Eternal Life’ continuously fell from her eyes, dripping down her delicate cheeks.","The happy tears fell to the ground of the Overlord World and instantly turned into a spiritual qi-filled pond—and with more of Pavilion Master Chu’s tears falling, the pond kept expanding, showing signs of growing into a lake.","Song Shuhang almost instinctively wanted to catch these ’Immortal Tears’—fortunately, he remembered in time that he was already a ’graduate detached from the Heaven’s Will.’ If he really wanted Immortal Tears, he could just get them by fighting Senior Devil Emperor.","He didn’t need to catch Pavilion Master Chu’s tears and spoil the mood at this moment.","That’s the change of heart that comes with a higher realm!","In some ways, it is also a sign of maturity.","In the resurrection formation, the resurrected members of the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion—men and women, old and young—slowly opened their eyes.","They were called back from the ancient times and had their souls reinfused.","And their memories were still stuck at the moment of despair when the ’Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion’ was destroyed.","\"Eh? Wasn’t I dead?\" A fairy in a floral dress stretched out her hands, looking at her pale palms with confusion: \"And what’s with this dress? I never wear dresses.\"","Beside her, a Medicine Master dressed in a suit was also bewilderedly looking at his own clothes, \"What kind of outfit is this?\"","Clearly, the clothing they were wearing was not their original attire.","— Members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion who were resurrected were supposed to be bald. After all, the resurrecting formation couldn’t possibly resurrect clothes as well.","These garments were meticulously created by Senior White using \"Heavenly Dao Authority\" as a temporary measure to cover them.","After all, resurrecting a group of bald Crystal-clear Water Pavilion members at this touching moment would have somewhat spoiled the atmosphere.","This was truly a dependable, mature, and meticulous senior.","\"Didn’t I die?\"","\"Where’s the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion? Where’s the master?\"","\"Where are those damned monster hunters?\"","\"Even if I die, I won’t let them off. Master, you go first!\"","\"The escape passage, send the young disciples into the escape passage!\"","The moment they opened their eyes, the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion made quite a ruckus, creating a scene of utter chaos.","\"It’s the master, the master!\" Dressed like Chinese dolls, the pair of male and female attendants spotted Chu Two crying from afar.","The attendants were always by Slow-Witted Song’s side, taking care of her daily life and were the closest to her.","\"Master, why are you crying?\" The attendants raced over the Spirit Lake water and reached Chu Two’s side, extending their little hands to wipe away her tears.","But they discovered that the master’s tears were so heavy that when they fell on their hands, their wrists were pressed down—the tears then dripped back into the lake.","The lake at their feet visibly grew larger at an astonishing rate!","Amazing!","The attendants’ eyes sparkled with excitement.","Your next read awaits at empire","The master has become so powerful; her tears could even create a lake!","This was something totally beyond their imagination.","Chu Two reached out, gently picking up the attendants.","\"Thank you.\" She spoke loudly this time, addressing Song Shuhang nearby.","With the return of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion members, the last bit of obsession in her heart finally dissipated completely.","\"Do you still want my head on your neck?\" Song Shuhang joked.","He remembered the several times Chu Two had silently crept up to his bed while he was fast asleep, gently patting his head as if to check whether his \"melon\" was ripe or not.","\"You, can’t you read the mood at all?\" Chu Two laughed through her tears.","A smile bloomed on her face, like pear blossoms bathed in tears.","\"Who are you?\" The attendants looked at the man standing beside the master with caution—a stranger!","Not a member of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion!","\"He is the most important person to me,\" Chu Two reassured the attendants with a pat.","But this only made the attendants more vigilant toward Song Shuhang—perhaps he was someone who might deceive their master, they must be more on guard!","\"Nice to meet you... no, actually, this shouldn’t be our first meeting, though you wouldn’t remember me anyway.\" Song Shuhang laughed heartily, \"Little guys, how about I perform a magic trick for you?\"","\"What magic trick?\" The attendants asked, puzzled.","Song Shuhang reached and grabbed the dazed hair on top of his head, pulling hard.","Then, the mature Slow-Witted Song, who was originally crouched by the \"living spring\", her head bowed in secret tears, was brought out by Song Shuhang and placed on top of his own head.","The scene was momentarily quite horrifying.","The attendants: (゚Д゚≡゚Д゚)","The two children were scared out of their wits."]},{"number":3159,"title":"Chapter 3159 - 3157: Future Child, your reliable Senior Song has arrived!","paragraphs":["Song Shuhang hadn’t intentionally meant to scare the pair of male and female attendants.","These two had taken good care of him back in the day—although that had only been part of Pavilion Master Chu’s \"illusory reality,\" Song Shuhang had developed a fondness for the little ones!","He had initially intended to bring out Chu Two, who had been silently weeping in the ’Inner World’s living spring’.","With the return of all members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, there was no need for her to hide and cry quietly in his Inner World; she ought to, like Chu Two, fully embrace the happiness that belonged to them.","However, midway through his action, he remembered something... Pavilion Master Chu was still soaking in his living spring, and her body wasn’t ready to come out yet, not ready in various senses.","At the very least, she still needed time to dress.","Therefore, it had resulted in this extremely horrifying scene.","[Should I reverse time a bit?]A thought crossed Song Shuhang’s mind, as the situation was admittedly a bit awkward.","\"Pavilion Master, what did he do to you?\"","\"Pavilion Master, Pavilion Master, this is also the Pavilion Master.\" The pair of attendants were terrified.","What had this man done to the Pavilion Master?","Why is our Pavilion Master’s head on him?","Chu Chu, atop Song Shuhang’s head, sighed, \"Really, couldn’t you have told me before taking action?\"","After speaking, her arm stretched out from atop Song Shuhang’s head and wiped the tears from the corner of her eyes.","\"Let go of me, I’ll come out by myself,\" Chu Chu said.","In fact, since Song Shuhang had attained his pseudo-immortal body and became the Heavenly Principle, she had almost fully recovered... The reason she had remained submerged in the living spring was firstly to fully stabilize her physical form; secondly, because her emotions were still very complex.","But this time, with all members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion resurrected, she had to come out.","It was a scene she could only dream about countless times.","She had no reason to miss this moment.","Song Shuhang released his hands.","Pavilion Master Chu emerged from the ’exit of the main world’ above Song Shuhang’s head, already dressed in her immortal clothing, complete with a shawl transformed from a ’Liquid Fat Ball’.","Two Pavilion Masters, one young girl and one mature.","\"Another Pavilion Master!\" The members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion behind him were stunned.","\"Pavilion Master, Pavilion Master, why are there two of you?\" The pair of attendants voiced the confusion of all members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","\"This matter, I’ll explain in a bit... For now, I’m back!\" Chu Chu, standing firmly on the ground, announced.","Simultaneously, she suddenly realized that she was somewhat unaccustomed to the feeling of standing on solid ground—habits are indeed a fearful thing. It had only been a few months, but it seemed she had gotten used to being submerged in water.","After pausing for a moment.","\"The Crystal-clear Water Pavilion has also returned,\" Chu Chu continued.","All members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion calmed down and looked at the two Pavilion Masters—neither of them conflicted, indicating there were no unresolved issues.","\"The ancient era had ended a long, long time ago... If, the destruction of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion had already spanned one Heavenly Principle reincarnation,\" said Chu Chu. \"The former Crystal-clear Water Pavilion was obliterated. But now, we will rebuild a new Crystal-clear Water Pavilion!\"","\"So it wasn’t an illusion, we really did die once?\"","\"Then are we, resurrected now?\"","\"Pavilion Master...\" The members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion quickly understood. Over these years, the Pavilion Master must have suffered immensely in her efforts to resurrect them and rebuild the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion?","\"Pavilion Master, it doesn’t matter if the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion is gone, we will just rebuild it! As long as we are still here, it doesn’t matter whether it’s the Golden Water Pavilion or the Silver Water Pavilion!\" The members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion were spirited.","Behind them, Song Shuhang slightly smiled.","Then he spoke, \"I decree: In this Overlord World, let there be the birth of trees abundant in years and filled with spiritual power.\"","As soon as the words were spoken, a large number of trees erupted from the ground not far from the members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion!","These trees grew wildly, swiftly reaching the skies, each filled with spiritual power, making them the best materials for rebuilding the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","\"I decree: In this Overlord World, let there be the birth of multiple precious ores and spirit veins to nourish all beings,\" Song Shuhang continued to speak.","As his words fell, everyone felt the earth beneath their feet transforming.","Spirit veins were born from the underground ex nihilo, and even if placed in the ancient era, these massive spirit veins would be extraordinary, qualifying only for major sects to command!","Not only that, but on the edge of the forest, many precious ores were born; the abundant mineral resources were directly exposed on the surface, sparkling brilliantly.","In Chu Two’s arms, the pair of male and female attendants’ mouths gaped open, staring dumbly at the man beside the Pavilion Master.","Words became reality?","Before, the Pavilion Master’s tears becoming a lake had already shocked the two little ones beyond imagination.","But this man made reality as he spoke.","He was like commanding the myriad practitioners in the universe, what he said, happened.","He was just like a god who could fulfill people’s wishes!","\"I say: Originating from this lake, twelve spiritual rivers and many tributaries will be born, surrounding this land, endlessly,\" Song Shuhang finally added.","From the lake that transformed from the tear drops of the two Pavilion Masters, spiritual rivers were born, filling this land—the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion was originally built beside a spiritual river.","This was Song Shuhang laying the foundation for rebuilding the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.","—In fact, he could have simply used a single sentence to bring back the original \"Crystal-clear Water Pavilion.\"","But that would not have been as beautiful.","The destroyed Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, rebuilt by its resurrected members, was more meaningful.","Moreover, the newly resurrected members of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion would still feel somewhat bewildered.","Rebuilding the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion would be a true process of them being brought back to life!","\"How amazing!\" the pair of male and female attendants exclaimed joyfully.","This was the real magic that delighted them.","The two little ones, favorability towards Tyrannical Song +100.","\"Thank you,\" Chu said softly.","\"You’re welcome!\" This time, both the virtuous lamia and Fairy Creation appeared, answering in unison.","Song Shuhang reached out and stuffed them back.","Then, he reached out and handed a ’return to the living spring’ mark to Chu, to facilitate her return to the Inner World’s living spring to recuperate whenever her body felt unwell.","He also took back the pendant ’Chu Pavilion Lord’s Dumb Hair’ and attached it to his own head.","\"Let’s rebuild the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, then make it even more beautiful. Let me know if you need anything!\" Song Shuhang declared generously.","\"Except for spirit stones,\" the virtuous lamia added.","Song Shuhang: \"...\"","\"We will rebuild the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion well, and then you can come to the real Crystal-clear Water Pavilion, not just an illusion,\" Chu Two said with a smile.","\"I’ll be waiting,\" Song Shuhang said lightly, waving his hand as his form gradually faded.","The pair of male and female attendants’ eyes shone brightly again.","This technique obviously broadened their horizons once more.","Experience new stories on empire","...","Inside the Heavenly Principle Dimension.","Senior White had been waiting for some time.","\"I’m here, Senior White,\" Song Shuhang’s figure emerged.","\"Then, let’s set off,\" Senior White nodded.","Next stop, the world of the Future Child.","Future Child, your reliable Mister Song is coming!"]},{"number":3160,"title":"Chapter 3160 - 3158: A Thousand Years of Waiting, At This Moment, Finally Gets a Response","paragraphs":["Chapter 3160: Chapter 3158: A Thousand Years of Waiting, At This Moment, Finally Gets a Response","The distant future.","This was a world dominated by shades of gray.","Lady Onion, with her short hair, walked confidently in high heels, hands stylishly tucked into her pockets, striding forward.","At this time, she appeared smart and capable, with a powerful aura, completely devoid of her previous cute and silly demeanor.","Not far behind Lady Onion, an enormous spirit butterfly gently fluttered its wings, maintaining low-altitude flight.","Sitting sideways on the giant spirit butterfly, Soft Feather, with her long hair covering half of her cheek, looked somewhat exhausted.","Her appearance had not changed much, still similar to how she looked thousands of years ago, but her temperament had changed tremendously.","— At this point in the future, Song Shuhang was not the only one who had changed.","Ahead, Lady Onion advised as she walked, “It’s not just me saying this, Soft Feather, you really shouldn’t use the power of ‘time’ anymore. You have been using the power of time so frequently lately, the cost is too great.”","“Mm,” Soft Feather replied weakly with her eyes closed, “I’m sorry, Lady Onion, but this is the last time.”","“...” Lady Onion’s brows slightly furrowed in dissatisfaction, “Every time I tell you this, you always respond the same way.”","She turned her head, determined to scold Soft Feather seriously this time, she couldn’t let her go on like this!","But as she turned back, seeing Soft Feather so fragile that she was almost about to fall off the giant spirit butterfly, Lady Onion’s heart softened.","“Forget it, no matter how many times I say it, you never listen. I’m not trying to stop you from using the power of time, but... at least you should pay attention to the rhythm and not harm your own body,” Lady Onion sighed.","She felt like she was almost becoming Soft Feather’s mother, worrying to pieces over her.","“It truly is the last time, I promise.” Soft Feather slightly opened her beautiful eyes, revealing a small smile, “This time, I saw Senior Song is close to achieving a pseudo-immortal body, it’s so fast, it was only a matter of months.”","Lady Onion’s steps involuntarily slowed, “Tch, after I disappeared, did Boss Song still maintain the pace of First Stage advancement every month?”","Such a distant memory.","The Song Shuhang of this era, although he is also Tyrannical Song, is more mature and reliable. Compared to the Song Shuhang in memory, he is much gentler, a true good boss candidate.","But this mature Tyrannical Song is too reliable, so reliable that it makes people reluctant to lose their temper at him.","Tyrannical Song is great, but Lady Onion still misses the time in 2019, that unreliable Boss Song. Or rather, she misses that era—because back then, she didn’t have to worry about anything and could live life like a salted fish.","In that era, Song Shuhang was there, Senior White was there, Senior White Two was there, and all the Seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were there.","In the main world, there were also Chu Beauty, the Inner World Assistant, and other Song Shuhang’s pendants to keep her company, and life was never boring.","If she could go back to the ‘past’ like Soft Feather, perhaps she too would find it hard to resist secretly returning to that time again and again, to see that era, right?","“At the end, I wanted to take one more look at the Seniors from that time, so I stayed in that era a little longer, that’s why I seem so exhausted,” said Soft Feather, lifting the hair from her face, revealing her stunning beauty, and softly assured Lady Onion, “But I swear to you, this time is absolutely, definitely the last time!”","“Swearing to me, and then if the oath has a problem, my green onion shoot falls off, right?” Lady Onion’s fingers smartly hooked through her short hair, “Haven’t you seen, to stop you from making pointless oaths, I even straightened out my green onion shoot?”","“I’m sorry,” Soft Feather promptly apologized.","But looking at her, it was uncertain whether she could change.","“Forget it, let’s go. Let’s see Boss Song, he has been in closed-door cultivation for almost a thousand years now, right? It’s about time he came out... and he owes me so much in salary, it’s time to settle it,” Lady Onion stepped forward with long strides.","In her mind, she thought about doing as before, knocking on the door of Tyrannical Song’s seclusion place every once in a while to see his reaction. If there was no response, she and Soft Feather would leave.","This process had already lasted for several centuries.","This time, inwardly, Lady Onion actually had no expectations for ‘Tyrannical Song’ coming out of seclusion.","Over these thousands of years, Tyrannical Song often closed up for cultivation.","I felt that I wouldn’t come out unless a thousand years had passed.","Boom—","Just as Lady Onion was about to knock on the door, the heavy gate of the Seclusion Place opened on its own.","Afterwards, that mature, dependable Tyrannical Song, with a gentle smile on his face, yet appearing slightly aged, stepped out from the Seclusion Place.","“Sorry to have worried you,” Tyrannical Song said in a gentle voice.","Handsome Lady Onion stood frozen in place, not knowing how to react to the sudden emergence of Tyrannical Song.","“Mister Song, you’ve finally come out?” Behind her, Future Child gently leapt down from the spirit butterfly.","“Yes, this seclusion was a bit longer than usual,” said Tyrannical Song with a gentle smile, as he looked up slightly. “I apologize, please forgive me for giving you all the pressure and burdens... By comparison, I have been somewhat useless.”","Lady Onion with short hair asked in confusion, “Who are you talking to?”","[You were the ultimate form in my dreams.] At that moment, a voice responded from the vacuum. It was Song Shuhang’s voice but younger and more dignified.","Gentle and dependable.","Capable of accumulating spirit stones.","Knows the ancient language.","And can undertake long closed-door cultivation!","The image of the ‘dependable senior’ from Song Shuhang’s fantasies was almost perfectly embodied in this Tyrannical Song.","If this is still considered useless, what then was the purpose of all my pursuits?","[From now on, leave it all to me.] The voice of Song Shuhang continued from the vacuum.","“I leave it to you, Shuhang,” Tyrannical Song said softly, closing his eyes.","As his words ended,","the demeanor of Gentle Tyrannical Song underwent a massive change.","He seemed to grow taller, and his whole presence appeared to straighten up—it was a transformation on a spiritual level. Previously, Tyrannical Song was nearly crushed by the burdens of reality, but now all those burdens were erased!","Furthermore, there was a faint spiritual pressure emanating from him.","His appearance hadn’t changed much, but he looked younger.","His mouth still wore that dependable smile.","The arc of the smile had not changed—yet strangely, that smile now gave off a ‘reckless’ vibe.","Without a doubt, this was a telltale sign of a severe case of Thrice Reckless Disease!","Tyrannical Song from the Seclusion Place opened his eyes.","At the moment his eyes opened, his facial expressions seemed to come ‘alive’.","His entire face became ‘readable’.","Lady Onion’s mouth hung open, staring dumbfounded at the transformed Song Shuhang, her face full of shock.","“It’s been a long time, Lady Onion.” Song Shuhang waved to Lady Onion and Soft Feather, then added, “I’m here, Future Child!”","The long hair of Future Child, having been blown about, fell down again: “Mister Song!”","A thousand years of waiting, at this moment, finally found its response."]},{"number":3161,"title":"Chapter 3161 - 3159: Dear, hello, I am the Tyrannical Song that you desire but cannot obtain","paragraphs":["Chapter 3161: Chapter 3159: Dear, hello, I am the Tyrannical Song that you desire but cannot obtain","“Um, that’s me.” Before Song Shuhang even opened his mouth, his facial expressions had already conveyed this message to everyone.","Soft Feather hung her head and her expression was unclear, “We just left Senior Song who was ‘about to achieve undying status,’ and now we’re seeing Senior Song again so soon, it feels kind of magical.”","Future Child was trying hard to control her emotions.","Her long hair fell, obscuring her face, allowing her to prepare herself properly.","Then, she could greet Senior Song, who came through time and space, with her loveliest smile!","“It’s not just me, Senior White is here too,” said Song Shuhang.","After transcending, he was able to bring the ‘consciousness’ of others along through time and space.","And Senior White was even more special.","Senior White was already the Immortal Heavenly Dao, and in addition, there was a deeper connection between him and Song Shuhang—they both possessed some of the other’s ‘existence.’","Under this unique nature, once Song Shuhang established the time node coordinates, Senior White could use Song Shuhang’s power to project an avatar with a physical body.","Song Shuhang began to manipulate the rules, preparing to bring out Senior White’s avatar.","“Shuhang, is it really you?” Lady Onion, with her short hair, seemed to finally react as she called out happily.","But after her happiness, Lady Onion suddenly hung her head. She even retreated a few steps, distancing herself from Song Shuhang!","Song Shuhang was puzzled by Lady Onion’s little retreat move; it was a bit hurtful.","What was she doing?","While he pondered, Lady Onion suddenly accelerated and leapt forcefully towards Song Shuhang—it looked like she was trying to throw herself into Song Shuhang’s arms?","That was it!","Was it because they hadn’t seen each other for so long that Lady Onion finally wanted to act like a normal monster pet and be coddled by her owner?","Song Shuhang understood and showed an ‘I get it’ expression.","Having had the experience with ‘young Slow-Witted Song’ before, this time Song Shuhang firmly suppressed his instinct to ‘lift high.’","He smiled and stretched out his arms toward Lady Onion, opening his embrace.","ლ(╹◡╹ლ), he was ready to give Lady Onion a warm hug and a chance to act spoiled.","“Eat my ‘green onion shoot cannon’, die!” Short-haired Lady Onion suddenly began to spin madly.","Like a drill, she stirred up the surrounding spiritual power.","Then, she crashed her head into Song Shuhang’s soft abdomen with great force!","Boom~","Lady Onion’s head hit the target accurately, and the terrible spiritual power even produced an explosive effect.","In the midst of the explosion, her head, pressing against Song Shuhang, spun forcefully, relentlessly!","Song Shuhang caught her with a smile and with a gentle press, stopped her spinning attack.","His own Lady Onion’s way of acting spoiled was completely different from that of ordinary monster pets!","However...","Due to Lady Onion’s crashing headbutt, an image of Senior White ’emerged’ out of Song Shuhang’s body.","Senior White calmly appeared, “We’ve arrived... Oops...”","Boom~~","A louder explosion ensued.","As soon as Senior White’s avatar appeared, a gentle collapse caused the entire seclusion place of Tyrannical Song to collapse.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","Lady Onion: “!!!” Shocked by Senior White’s fall, she even reverted to her true form, transforming into an ordinary green onion shoot.","“Why didn’t you tell me Senior White was beside you?” The green onion shoot turned and said petulantly to Song Shuhang.","“Didn’t I just say that Senior White came too? You already crashed into me. Is that my fault?” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and gently pinched Lady Onion’s small shoot.","Lady Onion: “...”","“After this is over, I’ll take your ‘consciousness’ back to the year 2020,” said Song Shuhang, understanding Lady Onion’s current state after squeezing her lightly.","This short-haired Lady Onion miss, her body belonged to the era of ‘Future Child’... but inside was the ‘intent’ from Lady Onion who had ‘separated’ from him in 2020.","No one but those who have achieved transcendence and eternity could physically cross through the time stream.","Lady Onion’s situation was somewhat similar to ‘Future Child,’ having crossed time by borrowing the body of her other self from a different time period.","However, the consciousness of ‘Lady Onion’ from this future era was not present in her body.","Nor was it here with Tyrannical Song.","Nevertheless, since the Lady Onion’s body from this future era was not dead, was her primordial soul captured by someone?","If it weren’t for the consciousness of Year 2020 Lady Onion taking possession, this era’s Lady Onion’s body would likely be in a vegetative state.","The era that Future Child was in... was full of twists and turns and many disasters.","“Back to 2020?” Lady Onion, upon hearing this, instinctively glanced behind her at Soft Feather.","She was somewhat anxious about this Future Child and the other members of this era.","“Don’t worry, with Senior White and me here, everything will be perfectly resolved. If you can’t bear to part with them, I can leave a ‘Cultivator Chat System’ mark here for you. Then, you’ll be able to have ‘cross-time’ video chats with the Future Child,” Song Shuhang said as he grabbed Lady Onion and placed her on his shoulder.","“Really? That’s possible?” Lady Onion asked, face filled with disbelief.","“I am an existence that has transcended the Heavenly Dao, after all,” Song Shuhang said.","After transcending immortality, Tyrannical Song seemed to be omnipotent.","Cross-dimensional video calls? Piece of cake!","Lady Onion nodded outwardly—[My boss has become an existence that transcends the Heavenly Dao, but for some reason, I still feel like he’s not reliable. What should I do?]","...","“Speaking of which, has the Ninth Heavenly Dao not proved its Dao in this era?” At that moment, the sound of rumbling construction came from behind.","The Seclusion Place, which had been flattended by Senior White, was being restored by a space spell.","Senior White stepped out from the Seclusion Place, not a speck of dust on him.","“Senior White~ We missed you so much~” Lady Onion leapt from Song Shuhang’s shoulder and threw herself into Senior White’s arms—it had been nearly a thousand years since she last saw him.","Without this big auspicious character covering her, Lady Onion felt she couldn’t eat or sleep well.","Senior White gently caught Lady Onion and indulged her with a head pat.","“But the Eighth Heavenly Dao, that fat ball, has already abdicated,” Song Shuhang said, after sensing the state of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","“Yes, the Ninth Heavenly Dao seat is still vacant. Actually, that is also the reason why Mister Song has been in seclusion for so long... After the Eighth Heavenly Dao Fat Ball stepped down, Mister Song proved his Dao with the ‘Life and Death Dao’ and achieved immortality. He was intending to occupy the Heavenly Dao seat. But, there was an accident,” Soft Feather said as she gathered her long hair.","At this moment, she looked much more lively.","Moreover, perhaps because she was facing the 2020 version of Song Shuhang, influenced by Song’s ‘aura’, Soft Feather seemed to have become more vivacious, a mood she hadn’t shown in a long time.","[Indeed, Soft Feather in this mood is better,] Lady Onion inwardly remarked in Senior White’s hand.","“The accident was the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao?” Song Shuhang inquired.","—The Fourth Heavenly Dao could be considered the biggest scapegoat among the Heavenly Daos; whenever chaos arose in the myriad realms and no culprit could be found, blaming the Fourth Heavenly Dao was never wrong!","“Yes,” Soft Feather nodded, then added: “Also, the body that the retired Eighth Heavenly Dao fat ball left behind may also be under the control of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, or they might be cooperating—Fat Ball’s goal seems to be to prevent the emergence of the Ninth Heavenly Dao.”","“To prevent the emergence of the Ninth Heavenly Dao? I see,” Song Shuhang expressed his understanding.","Lady Onion added, “Not only that, but in the battle for the Heavenly Dao... we couldn’t protect the Nine Transformations Phoenix Saber, and even the primordial soul of Eighth Cultivator of True Virtue, ‘Lady Onion,’ was detained. It was after this that I appeared in this era.”","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao had always been coveting the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, which held important information from Heavenly Dao Father Goudan. Heavenly Dao Father Goudan was a scholar among the Heavenly Daos, leaving behind many experimental items. It was very possible that the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber contained Father Goudan’s experimental records on ‘transcendence and eternity’.","“Many seniors in the Nine Provinces Number One Group... have disappeared as well. Senior White Two also lost his trace at the end. Before disappearing, he said he would fight to get us about a thousand years of development time.”","“During this period, we have been fighting against the manifestations and subordinates of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao,” Soft Feather and Lady Onion began to summarize some major events of this era.","“Even Senior White Two was affected,” Song Shuhang sighed and looked up into the vacuum.","A moment later.","Suddenly, Song Shuhang revealed a standard villainous smile: “Tsk tsk, Senior White, it seems we’ve come at just the right time!”","“It’s quite a coincidence, this is also the time that Big White Two fought to obtain for us,” Senior White pondered and added: “We’re quite lucky.”","“Or rather, the Fourth Heavenly Dao is just out of luck. But even if his luck was good... it’s useless because I am here!” Song Shuhang laughed more and more like a villain.","Lady Onion looked confused: “???”","In the observation of Senior White and Song Shuhang.","After the thousand years Big White Two fought for had ended, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao couldn’t wait to start his move.","—Still the same old ‘Myriad Worlds Destruction Plan’!","Not a bit of originality.","But now, without the constraints of the Ninth Heavenly Dao, no one was stepping out to interfere with its plan.","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, confident of success, was about to ignite the ‘destruction virus’ hidden within the stars of the myriad realms in a ceremonious manner!","The destruction virus had already spread to every corner of the myriad realms!","The end of the myriad realms was about to descend in the next second!","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao stretched its body: “Next, it’s my time.”","[Hi there, dear.] Suddenly, a voice appeared out of nowhere, right by its ear.","The Fourth Heavenly Dao’s body shook, and the Immortal Sand rattled.","Who?","At this time, who could affect it without it noticing at all?","Impossible!","All the myriad realms are under my control... There are no more variables!","“Is this a hallucination due to my excitement?” the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao murmured softly.","[Hi, I am the ‘transcendence and eternity’ that you desire but will never obtain—Tyrannical Song!] the voice continued.","Tyrannical Song?","That guy who once tried to compete for the Heavenly Dao?"]},{"number":3162,"title":"Chapter 3162 - 3160: I will return a hundredfold of the grievances you once suffered for them!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3162: Chapter 3160: I will return a hundredfold of the grievances you once suffered for them!","In the long memories of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, more than a thousand years ago during the battle for the “Ninth Heavenly Dao,” there was indeed a guy named Tyrannical Song who stood out and truly possessed the qualifications for “Immortality.”","If it weren’t for the interference from the remains of the undying shell of the Eighth Heavenly Dao and it, it’s possible that this guy called ‘Tyrannical Song’ might have actually proven himself as the Ninth Heavenly Dao.","However, with its covert interference, exerting force from behind the scenes, the position for the Ninth Heavenly Dao remains vacant to this day, with no one successfully proving their Dao.","Now, this Tyrannical Song is merely a top-notch ‘Immortal.’","Even after a thousand years, at most, the other party has reached the level of that man from Confucianism back then, suppressing the world, invincible under the heavens... but as for matters above the heavens, the other party should have no capacity to interfere.","Being invincible under heaven does not mean being invincible above heaven.","But now, the voice of this Tyrannical Song has directly reached its ears, directly interfering with the undying it!","And what did the other side just say?","The ‘transcendence and eternity’ that I desire but cannot attain?","Utterly preposterous!","Transcend immortality, how could you qualify?","“You’re hiding your real body, transmitting sound in secret, do you really think such laughable tricks can fool me?” The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao slowly said, “Transcendence and eternity? Do you comprehend what transcendence and eternity are?”","“A person who has never come into contact with the Immortal Heavenly Dao has what qualifications to discuss the topic of ‘transcendence and eternity’ with me?”","“I have experienced four Heavenly Dao reincarnations, and now my opportunity to prove my Dao is set. The seat of the Ninth Heavenly Dao is suspended in void; no one can stop me anymore!”","“I am the one who is about to transcend and achieve eternity!”","“What are you?”","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao spoke with hubris—but in truth, it was very cautious!","Unable to locate the source of the voice by its ear, and as a precaution, it was secretly mobilizing all its power while arrogantly conversing with the other party, accelerating the outbreak of the ‘Stellar Destruction Virus’ of the myriad practitioners in the universe.","The progress bar’s speed, with the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao sparing no expense in its effort, suddenly maxed out!","Throughout the myriad realms, countless stars exploded unusually bright, dazzling the eyes!","The heat and rays emitted from this wave of sudden intense stellar combustion alone were enough to kill many lives in the stellar systems!","And this was just the beginning. Within the next few brief seconds, the stars would live out billions, trillions, and even quadrillions of years that they should have traveled.","After this process concludes, the entire myriad realms would completely collapse and be obliterated!","Only the undying substances could cling to a precarious existence.","And this time, there was no Heavenly Dao to sacrifice itself and restart the cycle of cause and effect for the myriad worlds.","Every aspect of this world was under its surveillance.","This time, no one could stop it!","[No one can prevent me from proving immortality!]","[I will ascend the Throne of Wealth beyond immortality upon the remnants of the old world and become the first to transcend the Heavenly Dao!]","[The true great freedom and the true ease!]","“I am the only one in the Myriad Realm!” The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, seeing that the destruction process of the myriad realms was irreversible, finally allowed itself a slight moment of relaxation.","But it was only a slight moment—in no way would it relax completely until everything was truly finished.","Because it knew very well that the Ninth Heavenly Dao Reincarnation was the last chance!","“Clap clap clap~” At this moment, the sound of clapping echoed from behind the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","“Brilliant, truly an excellent speech and a spectacular performance,” the voice of Tyrannical Song also rang out simultaneously.","Two figures appeared out of thin air behind the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","The clapping was produced by one of these figures.","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao didn’t need to turn around—its body was made of sand, naturally allowing a 360-degree perspective.","It saw the two figures.","One was Tyrant Song, and the other also looked familiar... incredibly handsome, a real piece of work!","This handsome piece of work displayed that terrifyingly pleasant smile when he saw it—as if everything was under his control!","How did these two guys end up together?","What was even more bizarre was that although these two figures had appeared in its ‘vision,’ they remained undetectable within its ‘sensory range.’","Even when it utilized some Heavenly Dao Authority for surveillance, the feedback from the Heavenly Dao Authority still showed ‘no one present’ at that particular spot!","Such a state was too abnormal.","It had exceeded the understanding of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","“Since you know the phrase ‘The Only One in the Myriad Realm,’ what makes you think you are the one slated to ‘Transcend Heavenly Dao’ first?” Tyrant Song, with a carefree smile, asked from across.","The body of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao trembled slightly again. With Tyrant Song’s reminder thus far, it faintly guessed the truth.","But subconsciously, it resisted this truth.","[Impossible, if he really is a ‘Transcending Immortal’ existence, my actions couldn’t possibly have gone unaffected all this time. Moreover... the only one in the Myriad Realm, clearly, he hasn’t achieved that!] The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao subconsciously searched for ‘reasons’ to convince itself.","Upon achieving transcendence and eternity, they would no longer be affected by time, space, or any rules.","They could even set all the rules.","All ‘indestructible’ rules would be shattered.","In the eyes of a Transcending Immortal, as long as they wished, 1+1 could equal any number, time could flow backward, objects that have been erased in the past could directly emerge in the future... even the absolute attribute of undying would no longer be so absolute when facing a ‘Transcending Immortal.’","Furthermore, in theory, once they’ve ‘transcended,’ they become the ‘only’ existence.","Theoretically, the countless ‘thems’ could become one unique entity.","And yet, this ‘Tyrant Song’ didn’t seem to have reached that step.","So...","[He might just be ‘near-transcendence,’ hence he came to stop me, lest I transcend first and in turn affect him.] The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao finally found a ‘reasonable’ explanation in its mind.","But you can’t stop me!","“You can’t stop me!” echoed the Dark Heavenly Dao solemnly, as though piercing through the other party, also bolstering its momentum.","“Oh, are you referring to the destruction process of the myriad worlds?” Song Shuhang slightly smiles.","Then he stretched out his hand, thumb and middle finger touching.","Snap~","With a simple snap from Tyrant Song.","The ‘stars’ that were originally collapsing abruptly returned to normal.","Even the consequences brought by the star explosions disappeared just as abruptly... not a single creature within the stellar system was affected.","And the viruses it painstakingly placed within stars had also vanished, as if ‘they had never existed’ at all!","There wasn’t even a sequence, no such thing as a “process”!","Once, when the Sixth Heavenly Dao reversed causality, there was a process of “Time Reversal”—extinguished stars being reignited, and the obliterated universe began to heal.","Yet this scene before me lacked a “cause”, directly materializing a “result” out of thin air!","This defied all the rules of the world.","Something that completely violated the rules happened... it transcended the rules.","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao felt a chill in his heart.","At this moment, he felt immense despair, and an unwillingness to surrender.","The despair was due to the other’s methods, all of which proved that the opponent was a true “Transcending Immortal”.","The unwillingness stemmed from his own efforts, his excellence, being just one step shy of transcending immortality, only to see the victor’s fruit being plucked by someone else ahead of time.","Why did something like ‘Tyrannical Song’ have to exist in this world?","Countless thoughts and despair entwined, and in that instant, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’s thoughts were blocked, and he almost lashed out in fury!","And this... was exactly what Song Shuhang wanted to give to the Fourth Heavenly Dao.","The despair it once brought upon the people of the Future Child’s era, Song Shuhang would return it, with interest!","I, Tyrannical Song, might not be able to afford interest when repaying spirit stones, but when repaying despair, I can return it to you in spades!","“Feeling unwilling? Despairing?” Song Shuhang said slowly, “But your despair has only just begun!”","Beside him, Senior White slightly smiled.","He was in tacit understanding with Song Shuhang, no words needed. Senior White stretched out his hand and performed an “Image Printing Technique”.","A scene, already recorded by Senior White, was projected.","It was a collection of the most beautiful “crystals” in the world.","Pure white and flawless, they even radiated an “immortal” gleam!","Each crystal, if brought out, would be a priceless treasure.","“Look, what is this?” Song Shuhang asked.","Opposite...","When the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao saw this scene, he felt his “Immortal Body” tremble with rage.","Buzz!","That was him!","Or rather, it was most likely him from another “World”.","His originally dark shell would only turn pure white under one condition—that was, when his consciousness was completely erased, when his shell was left with only a “consciousness-less immortality”.","It could also be called his corpse.","Not the “remains of a Wielder of the Will” thing, but a true Heavenly Dao’s corpse.","Clearly, in that “world”, he had become the opponent’s spoils of war.","Following his anger, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao felt even clearer despair—because he saw his own end.","If nothing unexpected happened, would he not soon become one of those pure white and flawless immortal crystals, like his counterpart from another “world”?","Under these circumstances, did he have a way out?","Was there a plan that could save him?","“Isn’t it lonely, Tyrannical Song?” Suddenly, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao spoke out—he was trying to save himself!","Even though hope was slim, he had to give it a shot.","“Hm?” Song Shuhang cooperatively showed a puzzled expression.","“Being surpassing immortal, you alone among the myriad practitioners in the universe, never finding another ‘kind’ who could stand on the same level as you, must be very lonely, right?” the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao said gravely: “After transcending, time holds no meaning for you. Although you can switch freely within time, all people and things are bound by ‘time’, with only you above it. Such a you must be lonely. Therefore... you need a kind!”","Between the lines, if it transcended, it could become Tyrannical Song’s ‘kind’, ensuring Tyrannical Song wouldn’t be so alone.","This reason actually made some sense.","Loneliness, if pushed to its limit... Indeed, some invincible powerhouses might do the unthinkable.","Like creating a powerful rival for themselves to challenge or end themselves.","Or creating an existence at the same level to rid themselves of solitude.","Although Tyrannical Song had just transcended, he had already surpassed the limits of ‘time’... What if he had already tasted the flavor of solitude?","Perhaps, moved by thought, he might give him a chance to ‘transcend’—even if as an ‘opponent’, just to alleviate some loneliness.","“What you say does seem to have some merit. If there were only me at the ‘transcending’ state, with no one else at the same level, I might indeed develop such emotions,” the Tyrannical Song across actually agreed to his bluff!","“How worthy of one who has lived from the Fourth Era to now, to deduce such a theory of loneliness,” Song Shuhang said, clicking his tongue in admiration.","Even the handsome troublemaker beside him nodded in agreement.","[Could there really be a chance?] Deep inside, the Dark Heavenly Dao couldn’t help but harbor a faint ‘hope’.","“If, like you, I lived through several Heavenly Dao reincarnations, perhaps after reaching ‘Transcend Immortality’, losing my goals, I might indeed cultivate a ‘rival’.”","“If I lived for hundreds of millions of years, perhaps out of loneliness, I’d cultivate a peer ‘companion’ after transcending immortality to keep me company.”","“Unfortunately, I’m only 18 this year... after the New Year, roughly 19. I’m too young, yet to attend university, I have no idea what ‘prolonged life’s loneliness’ tastes like, so I can’t give you a chance,” Tyrannical Song told the Dark Heavenly Dao with a thumbs-up, flashing his white teeth.","Senior White couldn’t help but laugh out loud: “Pfft~”","With that laughter, it was as if the myriad worlds lost their color.","“That joke, Big White Two might really like it,” Senior White complimented.","Opposite, the Dark Heavenly Dao was too stunned to speak.","He stared blankly at Song Shuhang: “How old?”","“19,” Tyrannical Song modestly replied.","Buzz! The Dark Heavenly Dao couldn’t control his emotions.","“And... let me ask you a question. Why do you think I purified your ‘Body of Eternity’ and kept it in reserve?” Song Shuhang added.","A heart-shattering premonition surfaced again in the heart of the Dark Heavenly Dao.","“If I truly felt solitude, and was an unmatched expert needing to create a ‘companion at the same level’... it absolutely wouldn’t be you,” Song Shuhang said.","Look at the Senior White behind me.","In what way could you compare to our Senior White?","Are you more handsome than him? Wealthier than him? More popular? Or what?","You think you can compete with my Senior White head-on?","Ask yourself, do you even measure up?"]},{"number":3163,"title":"Chapter 3163 - 3161: Senior Song, You Have to Believe That You Are Exceptional!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3163: Chapter 3161: Senior Song, You Have to Believe That You Are Exceptional!","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao had already shut up.","It didn’t want to talk anymore—because it knew that no matter how eloquently it spoke, Tyrannical Song wouldn’t let it go.","The last bit of hope that had just emerged in its heart was completely shattered.","There was no hope left at all.","Loneliness, did the 19-year-old Tyrannical Song even understand what that was?","It didn’t doubt the fact that Tyrannical Song “just turned 19 this year,” because at Tyrannical Song’s level, such a lie served no purpose.","The current Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao actually had only one question in mind—how did Tyrannical Song manage to do it? At only 19, how did he become a pseudo-immortal and even transcended immortality?","Starting to cultivate from one’s mother’s womb wouldn’t be enough, right?","But it had no plans to ask.","What would be the point of asking?","It was already in complete despair; it was going to die anyway. Asking would only serve as a chance for the other party to show off before its own death.","Even if I’m dying, I won’t be your assist to show off!","“You’re not going to continue asking?” Song Shuhang looked at the silent Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao and counter-questioned, “I can tell that you still have doubts in your heart.”","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao didn’t want to speak: “...”","“Aren’t you curious how I did it? How I became a pseudo-immortal at the age of 19, and even transcended the Heaven’s Way? And my method for transcendence, aren’t you curious about that?” Song Shuhang asked again.","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao: “...”","It had underestimated Tyrannical Song’s realm. Even if it didn’t assist Tyrannical Song, even if it remained silent, Tyrannical Song would still intercept on his own, attack on his own, rebound on his own, and score all by himself.","To be honest, it was curious about Tyrannical Song’s ‘Transcendence Method.’","But it just wouldn’t ask.","“Actually, let me tell you something else. When you heard that I am 19 years old, did you think I had been cultivating for a full 19 years?” Song Shuhang talked to himself.","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao kept silent: “...”","Tyrannical Song, the chatterbox, felt like he could talk to himself all day, or even longer.","“You’re wrong. Actually, I only started serious cultivation last year... no, it’s a future time point now. So, I should say I started cultivating at the age of 18!” Song Shuhang explained.","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao showed a baffled expression: “???”","“You heard right, I’ve only been cultivating for one year, and I’ve already transcended immortality. You, on the other hand, prepared for four cycles of Heavenly Dao reincarnations to transcend, secretly undermining one Heavenly Dao after another. But despite your preparation spanning so many epochs, it wasn’t a match for my one year of effort,” Song Shuhang raised his index finger. “How does that feel?”","How could it feel? Upon hearing this, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao’s mindset was about to explode!","One year?","Are you kidding me?","Feelings of unwillingness, sorrow, helplessness, bursting anger, and regret were surging in its heart.","“Lastly, let me tell you one more thing.” Song Shuhang felt it was about time and decided to deliver the final blow to the Dark Heavenly Dao’s heart. “Do you know why I was desperate to advance, and why I strived so hard in my cultivation? It was because the pressure you gave me was too much... The ‘Myriad Realms’ Destruction Virus’ you staged in the shadows was my biggest motivation to become a pseudo-immortal within a year.”","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao had nothing to say: “...”","“But that’s not the point. The point is, if you hadn’t staged the ‘Myriad Realms’ Destruction Virus,’ when the Ninth Heavenly Dao took office, and after the Ninth Heavenly Dao’s term ended... A cycle of the myriad realms would have concluded. All things would enter a phase of annihilation, and a new ‘Myriad Realms’ would be born. That is to say, if you did nothing and only made a move at the last moment of cosmic oblivion, deploying your ‘Transcendence Method,’ perhaps you might have had a chance to win by doing nothing?” Song Shuhang slowly said.","The Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, at this moment, finally couldn’t hold back and sat up in shock, as if on its deathbed!","I, lying and winning?","A speechless regret, like a tide, flooded the heart of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","“But anyway, now, you no longer have a chance,” Song Shuhang stepped forward, blinking in front of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","Then he clenched his fist and hammered down at the Dark Heaven: “This punch is for the Seniors of my Nine Provinces Number One Group!”","Boom~","Intense pain afflicted the body and soul of the Dark Heaven— even the Immortal Body felt pain!","Although it wasn’t destroyed, this pain was real.","It hadn’t tasted such pain since it proved its Dao and became immortal in the Fourth Era. But today, after a long absence, it tasted the flavor of a brutal beating.","“Ah~” The scream of agony, unheard for four eras, was emitted from its mouth.","“And this punch is from Senior White two for you.”","“Ah~”","“There’s also a share for Soft Feather, and Lady Onion’s, Sixteen’s...”","“Ahhhhh~ Ah~”","Midway through the beating.","“Senior White, do you want to take a punch?” Song Shuhang turned his head and asked.","“I’ll pass, just hand over its ‘body’ to me later. Back in the year 2020, I was researching the ‘Immortal Body’ turned into pure sand and conducted several experiments, trying to convert it into the ‘bone of eternity’ mode like Cloud Gauze Three View Moon. Later we’ll put it into practice, and if successful, we can fit all companions at this time point with an ‘Immortal Sand’ insurance,” said Senior White.","“Senior White, good idea,” Song Shuhang gave a thumbs up.","“If you can bring some ‘Immortal Sand’ back to 2020, we could fit the chat group members of that time with an ‘Immortal Sand’... after all, we can’t touch the ‘Immortal Body’ of 2020, it needs to be kept intact. So, it’s best to take some back from here,” Senior White continued.","“No problem, I can do it as long as I prepare a little. After all, I am now a transcendence immortal. Plus, when we go back to the future, we should bring back some local specialties, understandable,” Song Shuhang confidently said.","[Me? A local specialty?] The Dark Heaven, rolling on the ground from the beating, wished it could ‘self-destruct’ at that moment and kill both Tyrannical Song and the rascal White.","But... it couldn’t.","The Immortal Heavenly Dao could not hurt itself.","Just thinking about being killed and then turned into a ‘Resurrection Tool’ made its feelings of despair pile up even higher.","“So the last punch, I am delivering for myself. This punch ends all the obsessions of the great Tyrannical Song!” Song Shuhang clenched his fist for the last time and fiercely pounded it onto the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao!","With the fall of the fist, rules were twisted and rewritten!","In the hands of a ‘Heavenly Dao graduate,’ it seemed that even the Attribute of ‘Indestructible’ was affected.","In the midst of intense pain, the Immortal Sand Body could no longer protect the ‘intent’ of the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao.","Just like the Fourth Heavenly Dao of 2020, its intent began to burn... but this time, its intent was forced to burn!","Gradually, it was burned into a pile of pure white sand crystals.","“What a pity,” Song Shuhang regretfully said.","He had wanted to hit the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao with a few more blows, for it to repay with high interest the despair it had brought to the Seniors.","Unfortunately, the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao did not cooperate.","“`","Halfway through the beating, this guy clammed up, completely lacking any sense of fun.","“Next time I get the chance, I’m going to suppress its ‘power of eternity’ and let the seniors from Nine Provinces Number One Group along with Future Child and others come over, add my strength, and give it a good thrashing to vent some frustration,” Song Shuhang said.","Senior White made a gesture with his hand and swept up a pile of the pure white sand crystals, “That’s enough. In the moment of its near success, we’ve dashed its hopes. This kind of despair is enough to compensate for the despair of Nine Provinces Number One Group and Future Child. Besides, its ‘Immortal Sand’ will ultimately serve as compensation.”","“That makes sense,” Song Shuhang nodded, “Should we stay in this era for a bit longer then?”","“There are some regrets left by the Future Child of this era that you need to address. Additionally, you need to look for the intent of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber and Lady Onion from this time... The timing should be just right,” returned Senior White.","He would be responsible for finding out how to integrate the ‘Immortal Sand’ with the members of Nine Provinces Number One Group, while Song Shuhang was responsible for summoning back the seniors who died in Future Child’s time.","They also needed to say farewell to Soft Feather and others in this era.","“Alright, that’s settled then,” Song Shuhang said, pushing forward with his hand, reopening the spatial gate right above where the great Tyrannical Song had been in seclusion.","...","...","At the front of the new Seclusion Place’s stone gate.","“The grayness in the sky has dispersed!” Short-haired Lady Onion looked up at the sky.","The gray aura of death, visible only to cultivators, had finally cleared completely from above, returning color to a world that had been ‘gray-scaled.’","Does that mean Song Shuhang was successful?","It was only about half an hour, right?","“Senior Song should be coming back now,” Future Child said while sitting on the spirit butterfly, gently kicking her slender legs back and forth.","This little girl’s demeanor hadn’t been seen on Future Child in a long time.","At this moment, Future Child was truly ‘alive’ again.","[Besides not paying a salary, Boss Song is still somewhat useful,] Lady Onion thought to herself.","While pondering, a spatial gate opened, and Tyrannical Song stepped out.","“Eh? Where’s Senior White?” Short-haired Lady Onion looked behind Song Shuhang with puzzlement, hope for the anticipated Senior White not materializing.","Without Senior White there, she felt a bit uneasy.","Especially with only disaster-relief device Boss Song there.","“Senior White is here; he’s currently researching ‘Immortal Sand.’ Before leaving, he wants to prepare a gift for you all,” Song Shuhang replied.","Lady Onion breathed a sigh of relief, then asked, “Is it resolved? That Dark Sun and its main body?”","“Of course,” Song Shuhang said. “Its Immortal Sand Body has already become our spoils of war.”","“We’ve been struggling with this for over a thousand years and couldn’t get it resolved. You come over and it’s settled in half an hour...” Lady Onion sighed, her emotions complex.","“After all, that’s what I came here for. The past, the present, the future, they’ve all forged me,” Song Shuhang lifted the sproutlike Lady Onion and placed her on his shoulder: “I’ve already locked onto the intent of Lady Onion and the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber of this era; I can bring them back at any time. Before I go back, I will restore the intent of Lady Onion from this era. There’s a bit of time left, so you can say goodbye to the seniors from the Nine Provinces Number One Group.”","“Got it, got it. Remember later to leave a ‘time-crossing video chat function’ for me and Soft Feather. After I go back to 2020, I still want to say goodbye to the fellow group members,” Lady Onion reminded.","After saying this, she lightly leaped to a spot in the Seclusion Place, tapped her arm, and a sci-fi glowing screen similar to a smartphone interface popped up; Lady Onion began to operate it...","“And then, Future Child,” Song Shuhang waved towards Soft Feather on the spirit butterfly, “Lastly, do you have any wishes?”","“Senior Song, in this era, to us, you are ‘Past Shuhang,’ and I am not Future Child,” Soft Feather giggled.","She lightly hopped down from the spirit butterfly and came to Song Shuhang’s side.","“`","After she took her place beside Song Shuhang, Tyrannical Song noticed that Future Child had grown even taller...","From a total height perspective, Future Child was about a head shorter than him.","But when they stood together, Future Child’s legs were still longer than his by a sizable margin.","At this moment, Tyrannical Song suddenly had the thought, “Could I possibly have short legs?”","Should I use the rule of “transcendence and eternity” later to elongate my own legs a bit?","“Finally, there are a few lingering obsessions left, let me take care of them for you in one breath,” Song Shuhang said, his gaze moving away from Future Child’s long legs.","Seniors from ‘Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group’ who disappeared due to accidents, members who were gravely injured beyond healing, fellow friends trapped due to their obsessions... and the whereabouts of Senior White two.","Now, with Song Shuhang’s methods, all could be brought back.","“Senior Song, after detaching, don’t you complete becoming ‘The Only One in Myriad Realms’?” Future Child asked.","“In fact, I already am,” Song Shuhang laughed heartily: “The ‘The Only One in Myriad Realms’ that I’ve chosen is different from what everyone assumes it to be. And, being unconstrained by all rules, there’s nothing that can limit me anymore.”","Future Child nodded—it was indeed a choice Senior Song would make.","“So, finally, please fulfill my wishes for me, Senior Song,” Future Child said with a pure smile—just like in 2019 when she first met Song Shuhang.","...","As Song Shuhang and Future Child continued to perform spatial jumps, the space around them shifted constantly.","The gravely injured members of ‘Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group’ were healed.","Inner Demons were dissolved... and pitifully enough, even those Inner Demons were taken away.","One by one, good news spread throughout the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group.’","In the end, even the members who had disappeared received resurrection within their former cave dwellings.","Senior Yellow Mountain awoke and once again began to oversee the big picture within ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group.’","Everything was just like the scene Future Child once dreamed of.","It was as if the entire world’s timeline had suddenly returned to the year 2019...","“Thank you, Senior Song,” Future Child said.","“The one who should be saying thanks is me,” Song Shuhang replied—now he knew that if it weren’t for Future Child, an accident could have happened to seniors like Copper Trigram, True Monarch Ancient Lake Temple, during that heavenly tribulation, which would have left him with lifelong regrets.","...","Time was about right.","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky, where Senior White’s experiment was also ready.","“Senior Song... how’s Soft Feather from 2020 doing?” Future Child, sensing that Song Shuhang might return, asked.","“Still doing very well, lively and cute, keeping the same as when I first met her,” Song Shuhang replied with a smile.","“However, Senior Song... that innocent and lively Soft Feather will eventually grow up,” Future Child said solemnly: “She can’t stay the same forever, even without experiencing various events like I did. But over time, she will indeed grow up.”","“Senior Song, have you ever considered... that you’re actually quite exceptional?” Future Child added.","“I am really just a salted fish hanging on the legs of the seniors,” Song Shuhang replied, feeling a little embarrassed by Future Child’s sudden praise.","“Senior Song, you have to believe in yourself, you are truly outstanding,” Future Child smiled."]},{"number":3164,"title":"Chapter 3164 - 3162: It’s really great to meet such a special group of seniors.","paragraphs":["Chapter 3164: Chapter 3162: It’s really great to meet such a special group of seniors.","As of today, Song Shuhang had not yet become that ‘reliable senior’ he envisioned in his own heart, and there was still much for him to learn on the path of becoming a true senior.","Therefore, even after achieving ‘transcendence and eternity’, he did not harbor any arrogance in his mentality.","However, in the eyes of others, Song Shuhang had already reached his own limits, and he did well—very well!","No one could have done better than Song Shuhang.","—Proving his Dao and becoming immortal, forcefully suppressing the Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao, and ultimately gathering the power of the Heavenly Daos throughout history to take the final step in proving his Dao.","And all this was accomplished within just one short year.","Song Shuhang had never truly considered how outstanding he appeared in the eyes of others.","...","Therefore, Future Child was very clear.","Soft Feather in the year 2020 would inevitably grow up—even with Senior Spirit Butterfly’s protection, she couldn’t possibly maintain the same lively, naïve, and romantic disposition hundreds of years later.","Once her mentality matured with time to the stage that a woman should realize, she would find that among her peers in the myriad practitioners in the universe, there would be no second ‘Senior Song’.","Having spent a long time with Song Shuhang, she could play joyfully, enjoying private VIP treatments like ‘secret realm adventures’ and ‘random map exploration games’ to her heart’s content.","Perhaps... it was possible that from the beginning, she never had a choice.","But these words, Future Child would not speak.","After all, the current Senior Song had truly transcended and become immortal, towering above the Will of the Heavens.","The various troubles of Soft Feather in the year 2020 should be left for the omnipotent Senior Song to deal with himself.","With great power comes great responsibility, right?","It wouldn’t be right to have her, a Soft Feather dwelling in ‘the future,’ to worry about Soft Feather from the year 2020, would it?","She herself still needed to work hard!","At present, she was determined to become the Ninth Heavenly Dao of this era!","“Let’s go, Mister Song. The seniors from the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ of this era have already made plans to gather, and they’re just waiting for you.” Future Child called forth the giant spirit butterfly, lightly hopped onto it, and waved to Song Shuhang.","“Be right there—I’m contacting Senior White. Right before we leave, I will distribute that gift for everyone.” Song Shuhang said with a smile, gracefully landing on the back of the giant spirit butterfly.","The spirit butterfly spread its wings and flew off into the distance.","“Oh, by the way, Mister Song. In this era, I rarely call you ‘Senior Song’ anymore,” said Soft Feather from atop the spirit butterfly. “Oh right... when I become the Ninth Heavenly Dao, occasionally, if I want to go to the year 2020, you can’t stop me, Mister Song.”","Song Shuhang: (☄⊙ω⊙)☄","I’m no longer ‘Senior Song’ then?","“Don’t worry, the moment I transcended and became immortal, the restrictions on you ‘tracing back’ to that era were lifted,” Song Shuhang replied with a smile.","“Hee~” Future Child beamed with a smile.","The giant spirit butterfly flapped its wings lightly, flying higher and higher.","Secretly, Song Shuhang turned his smiling face away from Future Child, rubbed his cheeks, and eased the tension in his facial nerves...","Future Child’s words hid too much information.","“`","The face that could talk made a myriad of reactions to these “messages” in an instant—and because too many facial expressions were needed, in that instant, his immortal facial nerves almost convulsed.","...","...","After finishing the banquet with the seniors from the “Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group,” it was already late at night.","Song Shuhang magnanimously got all the seniors drunk.","While the seniors were sound asleep, Senior White began to surgically implant grains of “Immortal Sand” into the bodies of various members of the “Nine Provinces Number One Group.”","When it was Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s turn, Song Shuhang suddenly became worried and said, “Senior White, do you think that after Thrice Reckless gets the ‘Immortal Sand,’ he might become even more terrifying than Senior Skylark? Will his mountain of spare parts in the future end up filling the entire world, or even clog up the myriad practitioners in the universe?”","The very thought of this made Song Shuhang tremble.","Imagine it—the whole Earth covered with layers upon layers of “Thrice Reckless’s spare parts.” And even if you flew into space, there would be countless “Thrice Reckless’s spare parts” floating around.","That would be more terrifying than the apocalypse!","The scarier thing is that Thrice Reckless might actually be able to pull it off!","He engaged in daily recklessness because he aimed to reach the degree of “recklessness without death.” But if he became someone who “could not be killed by recklessness,” who knows to what peak he might reach on his path of recklessness?","“Don’t worry,” Senior White comforted him. “My experiment has already taken into account the effects of Fairy Skylark’s ‘bone of eternity.’ So, every time before resurrecting, the leftover ‘Thrice Reckless spare parts’ will explode and turn into pure spiritual power, enriching the world. You don’t need to worry about polluting the world with ‘Thrice Reckless spare parts.’ On the contrary, the more Thrice Reckless dies, the more abundant the spiritual qi between heaven and earth will be.”","“That’s a relief,” Song Shuhang sighed in relief.","Otherwise, with folks like Fairy Skylark, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, Senior Copper Trigram, Doudou, and others in the “Nine Provinces Number One Group” unleashing their firepower, it would take only three days to cover the Earth!","At the same time that Song Shuhang breathed a sigh of relief, the female giant turtle of disaster and her companions, who were hidden in the shadows, were also moved to tears and heaved deep sighs of relief.","—Just a moment ago, when Song Shuhang hypothesized about “Thrice Reckless’s parts filling up the world,” the giant turtle of disaster nearly despaired.","She felt suffocated just thinking about that scene.","Fortunately, the white-robed figure is so reliable!","Such worries were completely resolved.","After all the members had their “bone of eternity” implanted, Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","“Are we leaving?” Senior Yellow Mountain suddenly opened his eyes and asked.","“Yeah, we’re leaving. But even though I’m leaving, in reality, I’m always with everyone, every moment. The me who has transcended is no longer limited by time or space—I am everywhere!” Song Shuhang declared handsomely.","Even if he took Senior White and left, his nature of being “everywhere” allowed him to remain with everyone in a way beyond the understanding of ordinary people.","When Senior Yellow Mountain heard this, far from being moved, he shakily pulled out a small medicine bottle from his coat pocket and, with a bit of unfamiliarity, poured out two pills and swallowed them.","Song Shuhang: ???","Senior Yellow Mountain’s reaction was not what he had imagined!","Could it be that to Senior Yellow Mountain, having the mighty Tyrannical Song around was fine, but Song Shuhang being “everywhere” was actually a headache?","“These are Hangover Medicine,” Senior Yellow Mountain explained at that moment, revealing a warm smile.","Then, Senior Yellow Mountain stood up and gave Song Shuhang a hug. “You’ve worked hard, Shuhang. It was supposed to be the responsibility of the future, but it was all placed on your shoulders in the past. I, as a senior, couldn’t even offer much help.”","“The one who should be grateful is me, Senior Yellow Mountain. Thank you for initially pulling me into the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’; thank you for not kicking me out right away; thank you to all the seniors in the chat group who have patiently and gently guided me in cultivation,” Song Shuhang said from the bottom of his heart. “It has been so wonderful to join the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group!'”","Meeting such a group of special seniors—it has been wonderful indeed.","“`"]},{"number":3165,"title":"Chapter 3165: Chapter 3165_End - 3163: Tyrannical Song Invites You to Join ’Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group’【Grand Finale】","paragraphs":["Chapter 3165: Chapter 3163: Tyrannical Song Invites You to Join ‘Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group’【Grand Finale】","Members of the “Nine Provinces Number One Chat Group” were vastly different from ordinary cultivators.","In this world, only these adorable members could have accepted Song Shuhang back in 2019, when he was merely a novice. They thoughtfully guided him onto the path of cultivation.","Had Song Shuhang encountered the opportunity to engage with “cultivation” through a different path, he might still have been a small cultivator of the First or Second Stage.","...","“Senior Yellow Mountain, when I return, I will strive to become a reliable senior,” Song Shuhang finally promised to the Mother Yellow Mountain of this era.","One day, he would also become like the future Tyrannical Song, a Song Shuhang who wouldn’t make Mama Yellow Mountain take medicine.","Now he had “transcended immortality” and could instantly master all the knowledge of the myriad practitioners in the universe... meaning, on the path to becoming a ‘reliable senior,’ what ultimately needed to change was only his mindset.","Senior Yellow Mountain thought briefly and said, “Since that’s the case, why don’t you try to...”","Before he could finish his sentence, Senior Yellow Mountain noticed that the Tyrannical Song he was embracing had undergone a transformation.","His playful smile turned into a reliable gentle smile.","His entire demeanor became steadier.","It was Tyrannical Song.","[Can’t you let me finish speaking?] Mama Yellow Mountain sighed inwardly and skillfully pulled out a medicine bottle, pouring out two pills—Song Shuhang in 2020, far from being a qualified senior, had a long road ahead of him.","Across from him, Tyrannical Song slightly smiled.","“It’s hangover medicine,” Mama Yellow Mountain explained.","“Yes, I understand, Senior Yellow Mountain,” Tyrannical Song replied in a reliably.","Mama Yellow Mountain looked up to the sky.","Then, she put the pills back into the bottle.","[If Song Shuhang of 2020 wants to become a ‘reliable senior,’ would he make the same choice, just like him?]","After all, he is still him.","Regrettably, after Song Shuhang left, Senior White also took his leave.","It was somewhat hard to let go.","This world, after all, didn’t have a ‘Future White.’","The “Nine Provinces Number One Group” felt somewhat incomplete without White.","I genuinely envy the fellow daoists of the 2020 era.","******","February 16, 2020","Myriad Realms, Overlord World.","Song Shuhang and Senior White quietly appeared.","Each had a ‘local product’ package slung over their shoulders.","Senior White brought back some leftover Fourth Heavenly Dao ‘Immortal Sand.’","Song Shuhang’s package, on the other hand, was filled with compressed ‘Thousand-Year Inner Demons,’ which had developed in the hearts of the Nine Provinces Number One Group members for at least a millennium, far superior in flavor to ordinary inner demons.","—And a green onion lady consciousness waiting for him to pay a ‘thousand years’ salary.’","The moment Song Shuhang reappeared, all his attachments transferred out from the ‘core world,’ fully equipping him.","“Back?” Pavilion Master Chu asked, then she looked at Song Shuhang and Senior White.","These two, currently the ‘strongest’ in all the myriad realms, carried large and small packages.","This image felt somewhat incongruous.","“These are ingredients... to celebrate past, present, and future trials we’ve overcome, we’ll hold a grand feast! Hmm, later I’ll sneak into Scholar Predecessor’s heavenly tribulation and mix in various attributes from the Ninth Stage heavenly tribulations,” Song Shuhang said, his mouth watering.","Pavilion Master Chu didn’t know how to respond to Tyrannical Song: “...”","“And this is Lady Onion’s consciousness, I still need to make a trip to the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy to bring back Lady Onion’s physical body,” Song Shuhang added, waving his small package and explaining.","“Lady Onion? Found in the future?” Pavilion Master Chu gently poked the small package.","“Yes, it’s been a long time, Pavilion Master Chu. How’s your body now?” Lady Onion’s voice rang out.","But this voice was different from the ‘cute’ voice Chu Pavilion Master remembered; this Lady Onion’s voice was crisp and somewhat dashing.","Pavilion Master Chu slowly curled into a question mark ‘?’ shape.","“Lady Onion has changed a lot. Don’t be shocked when she recovers,” Song Shuhang laughed.","Afterward, Song Shuhang and Senior White arrived at the most central location of the ‘Overlord World.’","Li Yinzhu was still in seclusion, inheriting the “Tyrannical Seal” authorization, and she would have to remain secluded for a significant period, possibly measured in ‘years’.","Another daughter, Xiao Lingxiao, lay on Li Yinzhu’s legs, soundly asleep—she was acting as a protector for her sister, little Li Yinzhu.","Song Shuhang quietly placed a ‘gift box’ next to Li Yinzhu.","This gift box would automatically open in a month.","It was the birthday gift Song Shuhang prepared for little Li Yinzhu—when the gift box opened, Li Tiansu would manifest as the “ghost spirit.”","Senior White skillfully transplanted a processed ‘Immortal Sand’ into ‘little Li Yinzhu.’","Seeing this, Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword was stunned, “Immortal Sand? The Fourth Heavenly Dao’s body?”","Pavilion Master Chu puzzled, “The body of the Fourth Heavenly Dao, weren’t you saving it to aid True Monarch White in transcending?”","“This is a local product brought back from the future,” explained Senior White. “Everyone gets a share.”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...” You call this a local product?","“Truly my master!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet praised Senior White—any form of ‘White’ was his master.","“Hmm, magical treasures also get a share. But how to transplant the ‘Immortal Sand’ into a magical treasure, I’ll have to experiment later,” chuckled Senior White.","“Thanks to the white-robed figure, I’ll volunteer as the experiment subject when the time comes,” volunteered Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword.","At that moment, Xiao Lingxiao slightly opened her eyes, groggily looking towards Senior White and Song Shuhang: “White, Papa Song.”","She still looked very sleepy.","“Xiao Lingxiao, continue sleeping, it’s still early.” Senior White fed Xiao Lingxiao a grain of ‘Immortal Sand.’","Xiao Lingxiao swallowed it, let out a string of soft laughter, then closed her eyes again, resting her head on little Li Yinzhu’s legs, going back to sleep—she, as a backup plan by Heavenly Dao, could merge with the ‘Immortal Sand’ in such a manner.","Song Shuhang affectionately gazed at his two daughters, then quietly retreated.","“Next, Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword will join me in an experiment... and along the way, we will harvest some ‘evil spirits’ to prepare food for the feast,” Senior White said.","“Then I will make a trip to the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy to retrieve Lady Onion’s body,” Song Shuhang nodded.","“Then tonight, let’s have a grand banquet,” Senior White, very fond of the atmosphere of feasts, remarked: “I’ll also ask Lady Dragon Network Fat Ball for some wine.”","“Meet in the evening,” Song Shuhang agreed.","...","The Reincarnation Land, the location of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy’s Reincarnation Seal.","Led by Reincarnation Blade Fairy, Song Shuhang revisited this place after several days.","“We have arrived,” said Reincarnation Blade Fairy, releasing Tyrannical Song’s hand—satisfied.","The giant Reincarnation Seal, having been physically cleansed of its dark aspects by the ‘Fourth Dark Heavenly Dao,’ dropped its remaining obsessions and became more transparent.","The new reincarnation system reached a stage of completion.","Song Shuhang faced the Reincarnation Seal and gently clasped his hands together in prayer.","This bow represented myriad practitioners in the universe paying respects.","The Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy, can be said to be the most considerate of living beings among all previous Heavenly Daos—almost the complete opposite of the Fourth Heavenly Dao.","She transformed into reincarnation, benefiting the living beings of myriad realms.","Pavilion Master Chu’s Dumb Hair, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, and black-skinned Soft Feather, all followed Song Shuhang and bowed towards the Reincarnation Seal.","“This time, being able to suppress the ‘Fourth Heavenly Dao’ and forcefully purifying it was also thanks to the contingency plans you left against the ‘billion backhands of the Fourth Heavenly Dao.’ Without the fairy, True Monarch White and I would have had to pay a great price to blow up the Fourth Heavenly Dao,” Song Shuhang sat by the Reincarnation Seal and recounted.","The Reincarnation Seal gently trembled, then Reincarnation Blade Fairy translated, “No need for thanks, in dealing with the Fourth Heavenly Dao, we were partners. If thanks are needed, we should be thanking you for helping us resolve our obsessions.”","Song Shuhang smiled and nodded, then took out Lady Onion’s ‘consciousness’ and said, “Also, I’ve brought back Lady Onion’s consciousness from the ‘future.'”","“Thank you, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” Reincarnation Blade Fairy stepped forward, gently catching Lady Onion’s ‘consciousness,’ bringing her beside the Reincarnation Seal.","“Eh? What is this for?” Lady Onion was puzzled.","“Lady Onion, you don’t need to worry, the reincarnation system is now complete, this is just a formality. Next, we’ll retrieve your physical body,” explained Reincarnation Blade Fairy.","Lady Onion’s ‘consciousness’ was ushered into the ‘Reincarnation Seal’, completing the final part of the reincarnation system.","Deep within the Reincarnation Seal, a long-haired version of Lady Onion was segregating.","It was expected that within a few minutes, a lively Lady Onion would be back...","“Lastly, I have a personal question to consult with the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy,” Song Shuhang politely sat down, seeking advice.","This obedient and understanding demeanor, rare since contracting the Thrice Reckless Disease, was extremely precious!","Reincarnation Blade Fairy translated, “Please ask, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song.”","“Fairy, could you quietly tell me if Sixteen’s condition is an exceptional ‘The Only One in Myriad Realm’? Are you also half a step on the path of ‘Transcendence’?” Song Shuhang inquired.","In the world of the future child, at the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ banquet, he also saw a Sixteen with cute dragon horns... but that Sixteen seemed like a ‘projection.’","The other members of the future ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ saw nothing unusual, but both Song Shuhang and Senior White noticed it—perhaps the ‘Future Child’ also realized this.","This characteristic has many similarities with ‘The Only One in Myriad Realm’...","The Fifth Reincarnation Fairy might also have taken half a step on the path of Transcendence.","“Would it be difficult for you to accept? Sixteen’s present state, with so many Sixteens inside her body?” The Reincarnation Blade Fairy asked, translating this conversation.","Without a second thought, Song Shuhang replied, “Of course not. How should I put it? It’s an adult’s hobby, after all.”","“Thank you.” A soft and light voice of a fairy emanated from the Reincarnation Seal, “You’re going to be a father.”","“I already am,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Indeed.” The voice of the fairy in the Reincarnation Seal emitted pleasant laughter, “I forgot you have a daughter of your own.”","After the laughter.","The voice of the fairy in the Reincarnation Seal continued, “Then, I formally entrust my most beloved child, Sixteen, to you.”","“Rest assured and leave it to me,” Song Shuhang said. “In ten months, I’ll bring your granddaughter over.”","“Be cautious with your words; they are inviolable,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy reminded.","In the meantime,","Lady Onion’s body completely separated from the ‘Reincarnation Seal.’","At the moment, Lady Onion was still dressed in the cheongsam she wore before ‘disappearing.’","She stepped out of the Reincarnation Seal.","“I’m a bit unaccustomed,” Lady Onion remarked, waving her hand, feeling unfamiliar with her outfit.","And her long hair.","With a swing of her hand, Lady Onion cut her long hair into a stylish short hairstyle, just like in the era of the future child.","“Welcome back, Lady Onion,” Song Shuhang stood up and greeted her.","“Wages,” Lady Onion said, seeing Boss Song and maintaining a stern face, she extended her pale fingers, “One thousand years’ worth of wages!”","The expression of Tyrannical Song visibly stiffened, and he guiltily retorted, “This is the year 2020.”","“I don’t care,” Lady Onion declared seriously. “I genuinely worked for a thousand years.”","“Let’s put it on tab!” Song Shuhang grandly declared. “I’ll borrow some from Senior White in a bit.”","Though he could spontaneously produce a mountain of spirit stones anytime now, such spirit stones lacked ‘soul’... better to borrow from Senior White!","It’s perfect to deepen the ‘karmic ties’ between him and Senior White.","As long as I borrow enough spirit stones, the karmic ties between Senior White and myself will never break.","“Alright, let it be on tab,” Lady Onion grandly tossed her short hair and leaped lightly, transforming into a sapling and landing on Song Shuhang’s shoulder.","“So, Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy, we’ll take our leave now,” Song Shuhang rose and addressed the Reincarnation Seal.","“Goodbye, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song,” the Reincarnation Blade Fairy replied.","Song Shuhang’s figure gradually faded and disappeared.","After he left.","The fairy inside the Reincarnation Seal spoke, “The contingency of the Eighth Heavenly Dao ‘Ball Sky Dao,’ became his biological daughter.”","“The Seventh Heavenly Dao goes without saying, the karmic ties between him and Song Shuhang are so deep, they’re almost bound together as one.”","“The Sixth Heavenly Dao’s ‘Virtuous Network’ along with that ‘virtuous lamia’ had already merged into the ‘Cultivation Chat Immortal Path.'”","“The Third Heavenly Dao created the spirit ghost ‘Fairy Cheng Lin’ and the main world are all bound to Song Shuhang. Even ‘Fairy Ye Si’ is now with Sixteen, forming a contract.”","“The Second Heavenly Dao even gave away the incredibly precious ‘Third Divine Eye,’ becoming a part of Tyrannical Song’s body...”","Apart from the enigmatic First Heavenly Dao.","Only the Fourth Heavenly Dao stubbornly refused, resulting in being forcibly purified.","“However, Sixteen is not my daughter,” the voice of the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy laughingly said, “So, I am rather looking forward to seeing how you will bring me a ‘granddaughter’ ten months later.”","...","Spirit River Su Clan.","The members of the Su Clan were busy as ever.","In the courtyard exclusive to Sixteen.","Su Clan’s Sixteen was crouching, making a ‘scary’ gesture at a small cat in front of her.","Half of Senior Sister Ye Si’s body emerged behind Sixteen, holding a “Pregnancy Care Manual” and selecting key points to read to Su Clan’s Sixteen.","“Senior Sister Ye Si, stop reading, it’s giving me a headache,” Su Clan’s Sixteen covered her ears, rolling on the bed. “Why can’t they let the demure Sixteen number 83 listen instead? Why do I have to do it?”","“Because she doesn’t need it, but you need to listen,” Ye Si said seriously. “You are too reckless.”","“I’m not Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, I’m just a bit more active than the other Sixteens,” Su Clan’s Sixteen said, stretching out her fingers, pinch a tiny distance between her index finger and thumb.","“In that tiny distance, there’s a ‘fingertip universe’ of difference,” Ye Si said, gently touching Sixteen and smiling tenderly. “If you won’t listen, then we will switch with another Sixteen.”","Su Clan’s Sixteen looked up at the ceiling in despair. “...”","As she looked at the ceiling, she noticed a figure floating above.","“Yo, restless Little Sixteen, and Senior Sister Ye Si,” Song Shuhang waved at them—of course, calling her ‘Senior Sister Ye Si’ was an adult’s prerogative.","“Is Future Child’s matter settled?” the restless Little Sixteen coughed lightly, sat down properly, and adjusted her skirt to prevent exposure.","“The past, present, and future affairs are basically sorted. With a few other matters across time, as long as I synchronize ‘The One in the Myriad Realm’ effect, all issues will be resolved step by step,” Song Shuhang nodded.","“So, are we having a party to celebrate?” Su Clan’s Sixteen’s eyes shone.","“Before the party, there’s one thing we need to do,” Song Shuhang raised his finger and said, “Let’s go on a date, Sixteen, Senior Sister.”","“Then, the question arises,” Ye Si spread her hands, and hundreds of virtual images of Su Clan’s Sixteen appeared: “Question, young Tyrannical Song, which one will you date, this golden Sixteen or this silver Sixteen, or one of the other hundreds of Sixteens?”","“Hahaha,” Tyrannical Song on the ceiling let out a complacent laugh: “I, who am detached and eternal, Tyrannical Song, will of course date them one by one.”","“Do you have the time?” Su Clan’s Sixteen asked.","“I’ve transcended time, what do you think?” Song Shuhang replied.","If he wished, he could toy with ‘time.’","He could reverse time after each date while retaining Sixteen’s memories; he could split time into hundreds of different branches and consolidate them after the dates; he could also stop time, perform hundreds of dates in a go, and then let time flow again.","*****","Night.","World of the Scholarly Golden Lotus.","Members of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ gathered together.","To be precise, since the day Song Shuhang and Senior White synchronized their paths and supplied all members with nine dragon patterns, most of the group’s members hadn’t dispersed.","After receiving the nine dragon patterns, there were too many insights and new understandings among the members, urgently demanding a ‘debate’ to digest them.","Over these few days, all the members debated during the day and assimilated the day’s gains at night, continuing until today.","Thus, Senior White decided to host a banquet, which didn’t require invitations since everyone was present.","This night, much like the banquet in the ‘Future Subworld.’","Song Shuhang grandly got all members of the group completely drunk.","Then, Senior White took action to embed ‘Immortal Sand’ into all members.","After completing this, Song Shuhang and Senior White sat by the lake at the banquet, brewed some immortal tea, each holding a bamboo cup, sipping gently.","The mist rising from the tea enshrouded them, presenting a scene akin to the immortal realm.","In the distance...","Su Clan’s Sixteen, groggily woke up, then followed the scent to Song Shuhang’s side, curling up next to him.","Black-skinned Soft Feather appeared, covering Su Clan’s Sixteen with a sheet.","Then she went to move her own body as well, covering it with a matching sheet from ‘Almighty Merchant.’","Moments later...","A fluctuation in the void, and Senior White Two’s projection incarnation arrived through the spatial passage.","He yawned, sat opposite Senior White and Song Shuhang, and expertly took a cup of immortal tea from Senior White’s hand.","“Where did Three-eyed Youth and Heavenly Dao Father Goudan go afterward?” Senior White Two asked—the question must have been commissioned by Father Goudan and the three-eyed young senior.","“The old Heavenly Dao that dropped out from the Heavenly Dao position cannot stay long in the main world nor in the Heavenly Principle Dimension, so he must create a world only accessible to drop-out Heavenly Daos. I’ve promised both senior Heavens that, in the coming time, I will create opportunities for them... at least enabling them to leave their true bodies in the main world like the Fifth Heavenly Dao Fairy,” Song Shuhang explained.","“What about Heavenly Dao Big White?” Senior White Two asked. “Can he return too?”","“Yes, but it will take some time...” Song Shuhang nodded,—waiting for Senior White to graduate to avoid entanglement and information interference during Senior White’s transcendence.","“That’s fine. I don’t mind how long it takes. That guy who experiments by cutting my leg, I wish he suffers a bit more,” Senior White Two said resentfully.","During the conversation, he saw Soft Feather nearby and his gaze softened.","Senior White Two reached out and tenderly stroked Soft Feather’s long hair.","“Take good care of her, just as I have taken care of you,” Senior White Two said.","“Of course,” Song Shuhang assured.","“I’ll head back first,” said Senior White Two as he finished his immortal tea in one gulp. “The Netherworld is currently missing one, and I squeezed this trip into my busy schedule.”","“Missing one? Dark Song, Little White Two, Father Goudan, and the three-eyed young senior are also returning? Doesn’t that make it four?” Song Shuhang was puzzled.","“Dark Song is too weak, we don’t include him in our games,” Senior White Two said dismissively with a wave of his hand.","Song Shuhang: ಥ_ಥ","As a co-ruler of the Netherworld, life is too bitter for Dark Song!","“Senior White, please take good care of Dark Song as well. The child is too pitiful,” said Song Shuhang sympathetically.","“No worries. Once he comes out of his isolation, we’ll play other games,” Senior White Two said as he waved his hand and sauntered off, leaving Song Shuhang with a view of his tall figure.","Song Shuhang: “...”","He was beaten into isolation?","What on earth happened to Dark Song these past few days?","After Senior White Two left, Song Shuhang heard some staggering footsteps approaching from behind.","He turned around and, sure enough, he saw the reliable Mama Yellow Mountain.","Mama Yellow Mountain was still a bit tipsy.","“Would you like a cup of tea?” Senior White asked.","“Thank you,” Mama Yellow Mountain sat down and took the cup of immortal tea.","After taking a sip, she said to Song Shuhang, “Shuhang, you really did well this time.”","“Yeah, although I have been praised by the future Senior Yellow Mountain, I really wanted to hear you praise me again,” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","Senior Yellow Mountain’s hand, holding the tea cup, stiffened.","“I know what you, Senior Yellow Mountain, want to say... But actually, it’s me who always wants to thank the seniors. I always think how great it is to have joined the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group,’ to have met the seniors, and to have welcomed Senior White out of seclusion,” Song Shuhang repeated this line again.","He felt that he could have the virtuous lamia record this line. If he ever felt mentally shattered in the future, he could come back and ask Senior Yellow Mountain to praise him again.","Then replay this line once more.","“You’ve matured a lot,” Senior Yellow Mountain remarked.","Compared to a year ago, Song Shuhang had grown by leaps and bounds.","However, he was still a little short of his goal of becoming a ‘reliable senior.’","Senior Yellow Mountain felt he could lend Song Shuhang a hand.","“How about trying to be the ‘group leader’ for a while, taking care of all the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group?” Mama Yellow Mountain proposed.","A person needs to accumulate experiences to mature.","Becoming the group leader of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group,’ dealing with a situation surrounded by powerhouses like Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, Immortal Fortune Teller Copper Trigram, Doudou, Young Master Phoenix Slayer, Fairy Dongfang Six, and Senior White, would certainly hasten one’s mental maturity.","And this—was also what the future Senior Yellow Mountain initially intended to propose to Song Shuhang.","There’s no need to always be the group leader.","Just serving a term as its leader would be enough for Song Shuhang to grow.","“Group leader?” Song Shuhang was startled.","Was Mama Yellow Mountain really giving him a chance to plot a coup?","“You might consider it because it sounds fun,” said Senior White, who sipped his tea. His devastatingly beautiful face, half-hidden in the mist, quickened one’s heartbeat.","“Okay, let me try for a while,” Song Shuhang nodded and agreed.","“It’s settled then,” Senior Yellow Mountain stood up, reached into his robe, and pulled out two bottles. He threw them forcefully into the lake.","Then, the skies above in the world of the golden lotus resounded with Mama Yellow Mountain’s delighted laughter.","*****","February 24, 2020, Monday.","The weather was still slightly chilly.","It was the kind of season where one could easily catch a cold if not careful about keeping warm.","Today, the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ was as lively as ever.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “I heard from Soft Feather that today the group leader is adding two new members? Have the newcomers arrived yet?”","“Two new people in one breath? What’s the background of these newcomers? Mainly because Tyrant Song’s cultivation level is quite high now, so do the newcomers he’s pulling in have significant backgrounds?” Su Clan’s Seven popped up.","“No matter how big their backgrounds, they can’t beat me! :complacent_smile:” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said, “So, once the new people join the group, I’ll take the lead to make them report their three sizes and post a fruit photo.”","“Thrice Reckless, although you won’t die now,” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator sighed before continuing, “but if you really annoy the fearsome senior, be careful of being caught and sacrificed. Don’t forget, once you die, the power of the immortal sand will burst your ‘corpse’ apart, turning your old body into a surge of spiritual power. You’ve become the perfect sacrifice now.”","“Northern River, are you spying on me? How did you know I was dragged off by Reincarnation Blade Fairy for a sacrifice last time?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber exclaimed in shock.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “...”","You were really dragged off for a sacrifice?","“By the way, where’s Group Leader Song Shuhang? Since we’re adding new members, shouldn’t he say something?” Young Master Phoenix Slayer curiously asked.","Seeking Spirit Fairy•Soft Feather: “Senior Song is with me and Sixteen, secretly mining the Spirit River Su Clan’s spirit vein mine... Senior Song owes Lady Onion a thousand years of salary, and he’s currently mining spirit stones to pay off the debt. Lady Onion is really angry this time; if he doesn’t pay her, she’s threatening to leave home. We three have been mining for an entire day now.”","Having said that, Soft Feather even sent a selfie.","Her face was covered in mud, wearing professional mining gear, and even had a miner’s light on her head.","Beside her were the similarly mud-covered Song Shuhang and Sixteen, all sneaking about.","Not only that, Song Shuhang had many hanging ornaments helping him.","Black-skinned Soft Feather, Virtuous Lamia, Fairy Creation, and Pavilion Master Chu’s Dumb Hair.","Behind Soft Feather stood Heavenly Emperor.","Beside Sixteen and Fairy Ye, there was the White Dragon sister.","This combination made the mining efficiency praiseworthy!","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “Hahaha~@Su Clan’s Seven.”","Fairy Lychee: “This mining combination is kind of terrifying.”","Immortal Fortune Teller Copper Trigram: “You should be thankful Senior White isn’t here... Otherwise, with him, this combination would be even more terrifying.”","Fairy Dongfang Six: “The problem is, how can you be so sure Senior White isn’t there? Maybe he is around! Anyway, @Su Clan’s Seven.”","Su Clan’s Seven: “[Shocked expression]!”","“Where are you three?” Moments later, Seven roared in an audio message.","“Soft Feather, you’ve exposed us. We were quietly mining the Spirit River Su Clan’s spirit vein mine, and now that you’ve mentioned it, Seven knows. Time to scoot.” Sixteen said.","“Hahaha, esteemed seniors, we’re taking off~ Senior Seven, don’t come after us; you won’t catch us.” Soft Feather sent a [Victory] expression.","Sixteen then sent a selfie of the three covertly opening a spatial gate and retreating from the Spirit River Su Clan’s spirit stone vein.","Seeking Spirit Fairy•Soft Feather: “Where should we mine next? Should we go to the meteoroid near Mars? I’ve been to Yellow Mountain’s spirit stone mine there before.”","“Makes sense~” Group Leader Tyrannical Song agreed.","“Hold on, this is the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group,’ not our private ‘Nine Provinces Sixteen Group’ chat. You’ve exposed us.” Sixteen reminded again.","“Sixteen’s previous exposure had a mole who told our secrets to Senior Yellow Mountain. It’s now the Seventeenth Number Nine Provinces Group,” Soft Feather reminded.","“No matter which number it is, switch to the private group, quick! Recall the message, don’t let Senior Yellow Mountain see it.” Song Shuhang quickly said.","A username called I’m Called Yellow Mountain came online: “...”","Moments later.","He silently changed his username to [Although Yellow Mountain is retired, my heart is still very tired].","Did I act too naively when I threw that medicine bottle into the lake?","Doudou: “Tiger petting, Yellow Mountain you stupid cu*t, don’t cry, stand firm through the decisions you made yourself.”","Sun Splitting Halberd Guo Da: “[Angry rubbing dog head expression•Doudou version]”","Doudou: “???”","Medicine Master: “@Tyrannical Song Heavenly Dao, what about the new member you’re adding? What’s their background?”","“There are two new members. One is a disciple accepted by ‘Fairy Anything Goes,’ a fairy and a cute newbie, at the Third Stage realm, with the dao name ‘Whatever Business There Is To Take’. I saw this little fairy when I was exchanging stuff at the fairy’s place for spirit stones the day before yesterday, and felt she was fated to be in our group... It’s good to refresh the group’s bloodline. We might be able to pull Fairy Anything Goes into the group through her. It would make buying stuff much easier,” Song Shuhang cleverly said.","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman: “Awesome!”","Great Master Profound Principle: “[Thumbs up expression]”","Even Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, a revered senior, nodded in approval: “Catching a line to ‘Almighty Merchant’ is indeed a good opportunity for the fellow friends in the group.”","“The other new member is a Daoist priest, a member of the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion... quite an interesting fellow friend. He’s representing the Crystal-clear Water Pavilion’s influence in joining our big group. This fellow friend is fun to tease,” Song Shuhang said with a laugh.","He was talking about Daoist Umbrella.","“Then go ahead and add them; since you’re online, just bring the new members in,” Cave Lord Snow Wolf said.","“Hang on, I’m going to pick up Yu Jiaojiao first, then I’ll add the new members right away,” Song Shuhang chuckled.","“Why are you picking up Yu Jiaojiao?” Tyrant Flood Dragon, wanting to father a football team, asked in confusion.","“We’re preparing to awaken the White Dragon sister; it’s a good opportunity to absorb some dragon qi while bringing Yu Jiaojiao along,” Song Shuhang sent a [Thumbs up] emoji.","Dongfang Six raised her eyebrows, “Why does it feel like Shuhang is really busy?”","In fact...","Song Shuhang was indeed a bit busy at the moment.","Apart from chatting in the group, mining with Sixteen and Soft Feather, in the “Heavenly Principle Dimension,” Song Shuhang’s will was making the final adjustments with Senior White.","Everything was ready... In the past few days, they had successfully positioned the “Pure White Fourth Heavenly Dao Body” as a Heaven’s Dao robot devoid of enlightenment.","Now came the final step.","Senior White was to transcend to eternity.","“Senior White, are you ready?” Song Shuhang’s will asked.","“Yes, I’ve actually been ready for a long time... just dragging it until today,” Senior White stood up slowly and said, “Right now, I’m a bit hesitant, my transcendence may go even further than your current state!”","Song Shuhang was still slowly progressing through being ‘The Only One Across All Worlds’.","And he chose to retain all of ‘Song Shuhang’, merely addressing regrets and obsessions, but not integrating all of ‘Tyrannical Song’ into ‘The Only One’.","But Senior White was different.","He had already achieved ‘The Only One Across All Worlds’ to some extent.","Apart from this realm, Senior White no longer existed in other worlds.","Therefore, his transcendence would be easier than Song Shuhang’s.","And it might even go further.","This was what Senior White was hesitant about.","If his transcendence went a step further, entering higher dimensions and realms... perhaps he wouldn’t be able to interact with this world again.","He could only watch, but not touch.","“Then, let’s not transcend,” Song Shuhang thought for a moment and decided, “If transcendence means we can’t return to this world, then it’s pointless!”","“No, let’s bet on it,” Senior White looked up, his face invincible, “I bet I can come back!”","He took a step forward.","The transcendence ceremony began.","“I believe in Senior White,” Song Shuhang said.","Since Senior White bet that he could come back... then he definitely would!","Song Shuhang extended his hand to activate his ‘Rule Modification’ power, moving the ‘Heavenly Dao’s Responsibility’ that bound Senior White, all onto the devoid-of-enlightenment pure white Fourth Heavenly Dao shell.","The pre-set level would ensure the smooth operation of the Fourth Heavenly Dao. Even if there were any issues, with the transcendent Song Shuhang watching, the Fourth Heavenly Dao could operate without worries.","After all heavenly responsibilities were lifted, Senior White’s figure ascended, completely free.","“Follow me, Senior White,” Song Shuhang said, “This time, it’s my turn to lead the way!”","The ‘White Horse Navigation’ function had been consumed when Song Shuhang transcended.","So this time, it was ‘Tyrannical Song’ branded navigation.","With Song Shuhang’s will running ahead, he led Senior White on the path to transcendence.","One step at a time.","Two figures advanced on the path of transcendence.","The last step...","Song Shuhang leaped bodily.","Yet after the leap and ending the navigation, his form reversed under the rule, and startlingly appeared right behind Senior White.","Senior White followed the ‘Tyrannical Song Navigation’ and leaped powerfully.","At the same time, Song Shuhang’s will reappeared under Senior White, like the ‘suspected first Heavenly Dao’ figure in the past, gently supporting Senior White.","Providing the last bit of help to Senior White, sending him into the realm of transcendence.","Senior White, graduation successful!","Unlike ‘Tyrannical Song’s transcendence’.","When Senior White transcended, the myriad practitioners in the universe faintly conveyed waves of ‘reluctance’.","The entire myriad realms were reluctant to let Senior White transcend.","But they didn’t try to forcibly keep him; instead, with reluctant feelings, they offered their final blessings for his transcendence.","Myriad realms, various phenomena continued.","—Such obvious differential treatment.","When Tyrannical Song transcended, the myriad realms didn’t even want to set off a ‘salute’, fearing it would cost them.","A moment later.","Song Shuhang’s will returned to that ‘transcendent’ dimension.","He waited for Senior White’s appearance.","But...","Just like initially, Senior White’s figure did not emerge.","“So, that’s how it is,” Song Shuhang looked down, gazing at the right hand that had just supported Senior White.","No wonder, when he transcended beyond the ‘Time’ limit and arrived in this transcendent dimensional realm, he didn’t see Senior White’s figure.","Once, he thought that it was because Senior White ‘did not succeed in transcending in the future’, that’s why Senior White didn’t appear here.","But now it seems...","Perhaps Senior White had advanced further.","Possibly at a higher level.","Thus, he couldn’t see Senior White here.","“Did I really lose the last bet?” Song Shuhang murmured softly.","He hovered in this dimension.","After a long while.","“Then, let’s set a new goal for myself,” Song Shuhang rubbed his face and laughed.","Since Senior White reached a farther level.","Then...","He would take all members of the ‘Nine Provinces Number One Group’ and everyone else to catch up to Senior White’s pace.","I am, after all, Tyrannical Song.","I can do this.","So, even if Senior White lost the bet, it’s fine.","I am destined to become a ‘reliable senior’.","Song Shuhang’s will repressed, then carefully returned to the ‘main world’ again.","“Now, let’s first add the two newcomers into the group.”","“The path to becoming a reliable senior starts with these two newcomers.”","“New goal, complete transcendence for everyone, catch up to Senior White!”","Song Shuhang slid open the interface, and even pressed ‘Time’ onto the ground to rub it, simultaneously starting to add two accounts as friends within the same time.","“Why are you following me?” Suddenly, Senior White’s puzzled voice came from behind Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang turned his head, only to find Senior White lying there secretly consuming heavenly tribulation.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","“I won the bet,” Senior White professed invincibly, “I indeed never lose a bet.”","Song Shuhang’s finger slipped...","Main World, Earth.","In two different places on Earth, a man and a woman were each scrolling through their phones, seemingly reading.","At that moment, they both received a message simultaneously.","[Tyrannical Song of the Heavens (*****) requests to add you as a friend.] Additional message: None","What the hell?","Tyrannical Song of the Heavens?","Who is joking with such a chuunibyo nickname?","Accept the friend request? Or reject?","A moment later.","Two different figures, almost simultaneously extended their hands, making his and her decisions...",".",".","(The end of the book)"]}]);
